#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"'Tis but a scratch?'  Bandage and disinfect it anyway to speed up healing."
msgstr ""
"¿'No es nada más que un rasguño'? Vendate y ponete desinfectante para "
"acelerar la curación."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "A door is not the only way in or out of most places."
msgstr "Una puerta nunca es la única entrada o salida de los lugares."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"A full stomach will not solve your starvation.  Give it time and eat "
"regularly."
msgstr ""
"Un estómago lleno no va a resolver tu problema de inanición. Dale tiempo y "
"comé regularmente."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "A pillow or stuffed animal will make it easier to fall asleep."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "A survivor saved is a friend earned.  Most of the time…"
msgstr "Un sobreviviente ayudado es un amigo ganado. Casi siempre…"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Adhesive bandages are much quicker to use, but not as effective.  Perfect "
"for minor wounds."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Afraid of wildlife?  Yell until it goes away.  But beware of what comes "
"instead."
msgstr ""
"¿Le tenés miedo a la fauna natural? Gritales hasta que se vayan. Pero tené "
"cuidado con la consecuencia de hacer ruido."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"An armored enemy?  Don't give up, maybe it has some weaknesses that can be "
"exploited."
msgstr ""
"¿Un enemigo blindado? No te rindas, tal vez tenga algunas debilidades que "
"podés aprovechar."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Animals and zombies are not friends.  You can take advantage of that."
msgstr ""
"Los animales y los zombis no son amigos entre ellos. Podés sacar ventaja de "
"eso."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Arterial bleeding from a gunshot?  A tourniquet can save you from death."
msgstr ""
"¿Estás perdiendo sangre de una arteria por un disparo? Un torniquete te "
"puede salvar la vida."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Athletics skill helps with swimming, climbing, and max stamina.  Don't "
"neglect it!"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Auto-pickup settings can save you time when you need it.  It's fully "
"customizable too."
msgstr ""
"La configuración de Auto agarrar te puede ahorrar tiempo cuando lo "
"necesités. Y es totalmente configurable."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Balance armor versus encumbrance, and try not to wear bags in combat"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Bare ground is hard to sleep on and will make you much colder.  Try "
"gathering a pile of leaves."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Be mindful of what, when, and how much you eat.  A balanced diet is crucial "
"in the long run."
msgstr ""
"Sé consciente de qué, cuándo y cuánto comés. Una dieta balanceada es crucial"
" a largo plazo."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Being skilled does not mean being proficient.  Gain proficiency to become a "
"master in specific areas."
msgstr ""
"Ser habilidoso no significa ser más apto. Conseguí aptitudes para "
"convertirte en un maestro en ciertas áreas."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Being wet makes the cold far worse.  Find some rainproof gear"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Binoculars make it easier to scout the terrain, gun scopes work too."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Blinded creatures can still detect you in melee, and will remember where "
"they last saw you."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Books carry knowledge and often recipes.  You need practical skills to "
"utilize them.  Practice."
msgstr ""
"Los libros tienen conocimiento y a veces recetas. Necesitás habilidades "
"prácticas para usarlos. Practicá."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Broken limb?  Improvised splints are ok, but hospitals might have better "
"tech for it."
msgstr ""
"¿Con una extremidad rota? Improvisar una tablilla está bien pero los "
"hospitales pueden tener mucha mejor tecnología para tratarla."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Cameras can blind enemies with their flash in melee.  Say cheese and die!"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Check what you can craft from time to time, even if you don't have "
"components right now."
msgstr ""
"Andá revisando de vez en cuando lo que podés fabricar, incluso aunque no "
"tengas los componentes en ese momento."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Cold food lasts longer.  Find a cool basement or make a root cellar."
msgstr ""
"La comida fría dura más. Buscá un sótano fresco o hacé una bodega de "
"alimentos."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Crafting is faster if you have an actual place for it, preferably a workshop"
" bench."
msgstr ""
"La fabricación es más rápida si tenés un buen lugar para trabajar, "
"preferiblemente, una mesa de trabajo."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Crouching is quieter than walking and will let you hide behind some "
"furniture."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Crouching or going prone make you harder to hit in ranged combat."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Did you *only* take everything not nailed down?  Go back for the nails!"
msgstr ""
"¿*Solamente* te llevaste todo lo que no estaba clavado al suelo? ¡Andá a "
"buscar los clavos, haceme el favor!"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Different characters, professions, hobbies, and scenarios can spice up your "
"game.  Roleplay!"
msgstr ""
"Diferentes personajes, profesiones, hobbies y escenarios pueden darle sabor "
"a tu juego. ¡Jugá los roles!"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Different enemies require different weapons.  Diversify your loadout, and "
"always have a backup"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Dissecting bodies will help in gaining knowledge about the weaknesses of the"
" opponents."
msgstr ""
"Si diseccionás los cadáveres vas a ganar conocimiento acerca de las "
"debilidades de los oponentes."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Don't be too greedy.  Loot doesn't matter if you're dead."
msgstr "No seas codicioso. Los objetos no sirven de nada si estás muerto."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Don't fight against the odds.  There's no shame in running to survive."
msgstr ""
"No vayas en contra de las probabilidades. No es vergonzoso salir rajando "
"para sobrevivir."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Don't get surrounded!  Always have an exit plan."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Don't smoke in bed!"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Don't wait until it's too late!  Run away and live to fight another day."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Drugs are great for quick morale boosts and more, but be aware of addiction "
"and overdose."
msgstr ""
"Las drogas son geniales para mejorar tu moral momentáneamente y algunas "
"otras cosas pero tené cuidado con las adicciones y las sobredosis."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Dying is part of the experience.  Try again with what you've learned."
msgstr ""
"Morirse es parte de la experiencia. Probá de nuevo con lo que aprendiste."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Eat well or your health might suffer.  Fast food is only good in a pinch."
msgstr ""
"Si no comés bien tu salud se verá afectada. La comida chatarra solo es buena"
" en emergencias."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Enemies can see you peeking, but they won't get a chance to shoot you."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Every sensei was once a student.  NPCs can teach you and vice versa."
msgstr ""
"Cada sensei alguna vez fue estudiante. Los PNJ te pueden enseñar a vos y "
"viceversa."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Excessive item counts in proximity to your character can cause slowdown.  "
"Don't be a hoarder!"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Exercising daily increases your cardio fitness and therefore your stamina "
"pool."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Famous last words:  Let's poke this electric zombie with a metal pipe."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Feeling bad after waking up?  Exercise and clean living are key to a healthy"
" lifestyle."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Feeling unwell?  Allow yourself to rest, even for a few days as needed.  "
"Heal now, explore later."
msgstr ""
"¿No te sentís bien? Permitite un buen descanso, incluso por varios días si "
"lo necesitás. Primero curate, después explorá."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Fight on your conditions whenever you can.  Use terrain, traps, and fire to "
"your advantage."
msgstr ""
"Luchá bajo tus condiciones siempre que puedas. Usá el terreno, las trampas y"
" el fuego en tu ventaja."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Fight smarter, not harder.  Even simple traps can turn the tide in your "
"favor."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Fires can spread easily, especially with an abundance of fuel."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Food from before the Cataclysm won't last forever.  Keep that in mind."
msgstr ""
"La comida de antes del Cataclismo no va a durar para siempre. Acordate de "
"eso."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"For free in the construction menu: a crafting spot, a firewood source, and a"
" practice target."
msgstr ""
"Familiarizate con el menú de construcción: un lugar de fabricación, una "
"fuente de leña y un objetivo de práctica."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Foraging isn't easy.  It takes survival skill, perception, and a lot of "
"luck."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Frozen food doesn't rot, but may be inedible if not defrosted."
msgstr ""
"La comida congelada no se pudre, pero no se puede comer si no se descongela."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Frozen food?  Put it by a fire or heat it up by activating a pan."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Going prone can make it harder for shrapnel to hit you."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Grabbed enemies can't dodge. If something won't sit still, try making it."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Grenades create very fine shrapnel which isn't great against armor.  "
"Pipebombs on the other hand…"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Handguns are powerful and easy to use even when you're badly wounded.  "
"Always keep one handy."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Holsters, quivers, sheaths, and ammo pouches can be much faster than using a"
" backpack."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Hope for the best but prepare for the worst.  A backup stash of necessities "
"can save the day."
msgstr ""
"Esperá lo mejor pero preparate para lo peor. Una reserva de respaldo para "
"tus necesidades básicas te puede salvar el día."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"If a wound gets dirty, find some antiseptic quick!  Infections can be "
"deadly."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"If it's too dark to see, you'll suffer penalties to dodge, melee, and "
"aiming."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "If the weather's too bad, you might just want to stay home."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "If you like archery but lack the strength, consider a crossbow."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "If you're breaking in, be sure you also know how to get back out."
msgstr ""
"Si estás irrumpiendo en una morada, asegurate de que tenés una forma de "
"salir."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"If you're stuck inside with a broken leg, read some books to pass the time."
msgstr ""
"Si estás encerrado adentro con una pierna rota, leete algunos libros para "
"pasar el tiempo."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Insecticide is really good at killing bugs, even the big ones."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"It can take days or even weeks to put on weight after you've lost too much."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"It's a good idea to keep books around the house.  You never know when you'll"
" be laid up."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Just because a place is dangerous doesn't mean it's worth looting."
msgstr ""
"Solo porque un lugar es peligroso no significa que tenga cosas interesantes "
"adentro."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Just because they're all monsters doesn't mean they're friends.  Take "
"advantage of infighting."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Keep a few spare weapons and pieces of armor around your base.  Switching is"
" easier than repairing."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Keep essentials in your clothing pockets in case you have to ditch your "
"backpack."
msgstr ""
"Guardá lo esencial en los bolsillos de tu ropa por si en algún momento tenés"
" que dejar la mochila."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Knowledge can't replace practical skill and experience, but it will help you"
" get them faster."
msgstr ""
"El conocimiento no puede reemplazar la habilidad y la experiencia prácticas "
"pero te ayuda a aprenderlas más rápidamente."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Large targets are easier to hit."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Learn to use zone sorting to sort your loot in one go.  Y to set up zones, O"
" to sort items."
msgstr ""
"Aprendé a usar las zonas de clasificación para ordenar tus objetos "
"rápidamente. La letra Y para configurar las zonas, la O para ordenar "
"objetos."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Learning how to play?  Visit the keybindings menu and learn your ropes."
msgstr ""
"¿Estás aprendiendo a jugar? Fijate los atajos de teclado y agarrales la "
"mano."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Length matters… at least when it comes to shoving a shovel in your backpack."
msgstr ""
"El tamaño importa… por lo menos en lo que concierne a meter una pala en tu "
"mochila."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Light itself doesn't draw zombies, it's the sight, noise, or smell of the "
"living."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Like to gamble?  Use mutagen!  Be a winner today!"
msgstr "¿Te gusta apostar? ¡Usá mutágeno! ¡Convertite en ganador hoy mismo!"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Long trip ahead?  Auto travel and auto drive to your desired destination."
msgstr ""
"¿Vas a hacer un viaje largo? Usá la opción de auto viaje y auto manejar para"
" hacerlo."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Major blood loss?  Drink plenty, supplement iron, and rest to regenerate "
"your red blood cells."
msgstr ""
"¿Perdiste mucha sangre? Tomá mucho líquido, suplementate con hierro y "
"descansá para regenerar tus glóbulos rojos."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Makeshift weapons can break easily, but they are weapons, and can be made "
"again."
msgstr ""
"Las armas improvisadas se pueden romper fácilmente pero son armas, y pueden "
"ser hechas de nuevo."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Many items have contextual uses.  Use the item action menu to find out what "
"you can do with them."
msgstr ""
"Muchos objetos tienen usos contextuales. Usá el menú de acción de objeto "
"para descubrir lo que podés hacer."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Many items have special actions.  Try to find out what they do."
msgstr ""
"Muchos objetos tienen acciones especiales. Tenés que descubrirlas probando."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Mark the items you carry as favorites so you can easily identify new items "
"and drop them in bulk."
msgstr ""
"Marcá como favoritos los objetos que tengas así podés identificar fácilmente"
" los objetos nuevos y tirarlos en grupo."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Moose may not be your friend."
msgstr "El alce no puede ser tu amigo."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Most adults are too heavy to climb drainpipes, so go find or make a "
"stepladder!"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Most medicine doesn't work instantly, so don't swallow a whole bottle of "
"pills."
msgstr ""
"La mayoría de los medicamentos no funcionan instantáneamente, así que no te "
"tragues una botella entera de pastillas."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Most zombies go through cars, not around them.  Remember that when running "
"away."
msgstr ""
"La mayoría de los zombis atraviesan los autos, no los esquivan. Acordate de "
"esto cuando tengas que escapar."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Murky water is unsafe to drink, water might be safe, clean water is always "
"safe."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Mutagen can dramatically improve your stats.  Bionics can help a little, "
"too."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Mutant meat is toxic, but surely a little bit would be OK."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Mutant meat isn't good for you, but if you're hungry, surely you can eat "
"just a little…"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"NSAIDs are all the same type of drug and their effects don't stack, but they"
" do with acetaminophen."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Need experience with crafting and such?  Use the training recipes to master "
"the ins and outs."
msgstr ""
"¿Necesitás experiencia con la fabricación y esas cosas? Usá las recetas de "
"entrenamiento para dominar los detalles."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"No bandages nearby?  Empty your hands and let the time pass to apply "
"pressure to the wound."
msgstr ""
"¿No tenés vendas a mano? Dejá tus manos libres y dejá que pase el tiempo. "
"Vas a aplicar presión sobre la herida para frenar el sangrado."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Nobody told the vending machines that the world ended.  Save those cash "
"cards!"
msgstr ""
"Nadie le avisó a las máquinas expendedoras que el mundo se terminó. ¡Así que"
" guardate las tarjetas de crédito!"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Not much survives a hit from a very fast car."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Out of resources?  Breaking or disassembling stuff can yield interesting "
"components."
msgstr ""
"¿Te quedaste sin materiales? Romper o desarmar cosas te puede dar algunas "
"cosas interesantes."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Over the counter pain medication is weak, but it's not habit forming. It may"
" keep you in the fight."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Overconfidence is a treacherous killer.  Leave yourself some leeway for "
"unforeseen circumstances."
msgstr ""
"La arrogancia es un asesino traidor. Dejate un margen por si aparece alguna "
"circunstancia inesperada."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Pain can drastically slow you down and reduces your stats.  Check your speed"
" in the character menu."
msgstr ""
"El dolor te puede hacer drásticamente más lento y además reduce tus "
"características. Revisá tu velocidad en el menú de personaje."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Pain medication doesn't reduce pain, it is a buffer against it for the "
"entirety of its duration."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Pick your fights and don't let them pick you.  Don't bite what you can't "
"chew."
msgstr ""
"Elegí tus batallas y no dejes que ellas te elijan a vos. No muerdas más de "
"lo que podés masticar."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Poison, radiation, and blood loss will negatively impact your lifestyle."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Power move.  You can take control and play as your NPC follower."
msgstr ""
"Movida importante. Podés controlar y jugar como uno de tus seguidores PNJ."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Priorities for survival: shelter, water, food, then everything else."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Prolonged physical exhaustion results in weariness.  Overworking causes loss"
" of productivity."
msgstr ""
"El agotamiento físico prolongado se convierte en fatiga. El sobretrabajo "
"causa un pérdida de productividad."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Put a funnel over a jug or barrel to collect rainwater over time."
msgstr ""
"Poné un embudo sobre una jarra o barril para recolectar el agua de la "
"lluvia."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Rain ponchos are lightweight, easy to store, and can keep you dry in a "
"storm."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Remember that the sidebar is customizable and widgets can be added and "
"removed from it."
msgstr ""
"Acordate que la barra lateral se puede personalizar a tu gusto y se pueden "
"agregar o sacar partes."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Routine kills.  Stay alert!  Don't let your guard down."
msgstr "Muertes de rutina. ¡Mantente alerta! No bajes la guardia."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Save time.  Instead of using a recipe, place water in a container on a fire "
"to boil it."
msgstr ""
"Ahorrá tiempo. En lugar de usar una receta, poné agua en un recipiente en el"
" fuego para hervirla."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Scared of melee?  Throw some things at enemies and use reach weapons like "
"spears."
msgstr ""
"¿Le tenés miedo al cuerpo a cuerpo? Tirale cosas al enemigo o usá armas de "
"largo alcance como lanzas."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Skillful management of your stamina is crucial for your survival.  Conserve "
"it when you can."
msgstr ""
"El manejo habilidoso de tu resistencia es crucial para tu supervivencia. "
"Conservala tanto como puedas."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Some animals can be tamed, especially when young.  Try finding some pet "
"food."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Some foods can be eaten frozen.  Some foods become mushy after defrosting."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Some mutations allow you to leap.  This makes it easy to get out of melee, "
"or up onto a roof."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Some negative traits have their upsides."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Sometimes you just can't run.  Always try to keep a handgun on you for "
"emergencies."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Spraypaint can be used to blind enemies, and is especially effective against"
" robots."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Stun guns will cause even zombies to release their grabs, but effectiveness "
"falls off with size."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Switching to a sidearm is often faster than reloading."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Tear gas stuns anything that breathes.  It blinds anything with eyes, except"
" robots and arthropods."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Terrain that slows you down will also slow down your enemies."
msgstr ""
"El terreno que te hace andar más lentamente, también lo hará con tus "
"enemigos."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"The Archer's Form proficiency lowers the strength requirement on bows by up "
"to 6."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"The action menu can help you determine what you can do.  There are also some"
" rare actions there."
msgstr ""
"El menú de acción te puede ayudar a determinar lo que podés hacer. También "
"incluye algunas acciones menos frecuentes."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "The best gun in the world is useless without ammo."
msgstr "La mejor arma del mundo no sirve si no tenés munición."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"The number of zombies in a city is large but finite.  You can (eventually) "
"kill them all."
msgstr ""
"La cantidad de zombis en una ciudad es grande pero finita. Podés "
"(eventualmente) matarlos a todos."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"The worse you're hurt, the slower you'll heal. Try not to push yourself too "
"far."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"The zone activity manager can make your life easier.  Do more in one go."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "There are a million ways to use a garbage bag."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"There are billions of them and one of you, but only you have a working "
"brain."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"There are fungi you want to eat, and those you want to burn.  You'll know "
"the difference."
msgstr ""
"Hay hongos que querés comer y hongos que querés quemar. Vas a aprender la "
"diferencia."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"There are some unbound keybindings that might prove useful for your needs.  "
"Check them out."
msgstr ""
"Hay algunos posibles atajos de teclado que no están configurados pero "
"podrían servirte. Revisalos."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"There's got to be some cool stuff in those top-secret underground labs, "
"right?"
msgstr ""
"Tiene que haber cosas geniales adentro de esos laboratorios subterráneos "
"supersecretos, ¿no?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"There's usually more than one way to do things.  Think outside the box."
msgstr ""
"Normalmente, hay más de una manera de hacer las cosas. Hay que ser creativo."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Thirsty on a long winter journey?  Take a thermos with you."
msgstr "¿Sediento en un largo viaje de invierno? Llevate un termo."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Too cold to sleep well at night?  A pile of clothes will make it better."
msgstr ""
"¿Hace demasiado frío para dormir bien a la noche? Una pila de ropa te puede "
"servir."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Trouble with sticky or slippery floors?  Try using them against your "
"enemies."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Turnout gear protects from fire but not from overheating."
msgstr ""
"El equipo de bombero te protege del fuego pero no del sobrecalentamiento."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Twohanded weapons are hard to use when things are grabbing you.  Keep "
"something smaller on hand too!"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Underground spaces like basements or caves stay cool year-round."
msgstr ""
"Los lugares subterráneos cono los sótanos o las cuevas están frescos todo el"
" año."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Use the fire, sludge, and acid some enemies spread to your advantage."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Use your map wisely.  Prioritize looting places that will get you what you "
"need."
msgstr ""
"Sé inteligente para usar el mapa. Priorizá los lugares que tienen lo que "
"necesitás."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Verticality is a thing.  If you can get to a roof somehow, it may save your "
"life."
msgstr ""
"La verticalidad existe. Poder subir a un techo, podría salvarte la vida."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Want less micro-management?  The zone manager can change your game."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Want to protect your gear from acid?  Try wearing a raincoat over it."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Weariness can be debilitating.  Don't go into combat if you're tired!"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Wet and angry?  A dry towel will bring your smile back."
msgstr "¿Mojado y enojado? Una toalla seca te devolverá la sonrisa."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"When looking around, use T to move to a destination or item automatically."
msgstr ""
"Cuando estás mirando con el comando Mirar alrededor, podés usar la letra T "
"para ir automáticamente hasta el objeto que estás mirando."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#. ~ Snippet in category "hint"
#: data/core/tips.json data/json/npcs/hints.json
msgid ""
"When the whole town is one big supermarket, a shopping cart becomes your "
"best friend."
msgstr ""
"Cuando todo el pueblo es un gran supermercado, el changuito se convierte en "
"tu mejor amigo."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "When you are prone, you use the bipod of a rifle for better accuracy."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Where applicable, use blacklists, whitelists, and filters for a better "
"quality of life."
msgstr ""
"Cuando puedas usá las listas de no permitidos, de permitidos y filtros para "
"facilitarte la vida."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Where did my lighter go again?  Manage your containers to store specific "
"items in them."
msgstr ""
"¿Adónde puse mi encendedor? Administrá tus contenedores para que guarden "
"objetos específicos."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Why walk when you can use a car?  Or a bike?  Or rollerblades?"
msgstr ""
"¿Para qué vas a caminar cuando podés usar un auto? ¿O una bicicleta? ¿O "
"rollers?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Winners don't do drugs.  They're too valuable.  Winners trade drugs for more"
" bullets."
msgstr ""
"Los ganadores no consumen drogas. Son demasiado valiosas. Los ganadores "
"cambian sus drogas por balas."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Wounds heal over time.  Bandages and antiseptic speed that up."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"You can automate repetitive tasks such as foraging, mining, or mopping for "
"your convenience."
msgstr ""
"Podés automatizar las tareas repetitivas para tu conveniencia: buscar "
"comida, hacer minas o limpiar."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"You can crouch or go prone to hide behind objects and reduce the sound you "
"make when you move."
msgstr ""
"Te podés agachar o tirar al piso para esconderte detrás de objetos y reducir"
" el sonido que hacés cuando te movés."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"You can make unusual things from usual stuff.  Go full MacGyver style if "
"needed."
msgstr ""
"Podés fabricar cosas extraordinarias a partir de cosas ordinarias. Onda "
"MacGyver."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "You can make your own safe mode rules in the pause menu."
msgstr ""
"Podés asignar tus propias reglas para el modo seguro en el menú de pausa."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "You can throw things while peeking around corners."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"You can use markers to rename items, making it easier to stay organized."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "You can use your mouse in your inventory and few other menus."
msgstr "Podés usar el mouse en tu inventario y en algunos otros menús."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "You can use your mouse to move to a destination by double-clicking it."
msgstr ""
"Podés usar el mouse para moverte hacia tu destino haciendo doble click."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"You can view local keybindings in most sub-menus by pressing the question "
"mark (?) key."
msgstr ""
"Podés ver los atajos de teclado en la mayoría de los sub-menús apretando la "
"tecla de signo de interrogación (?)."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "You don't have to sit right next to fire to use it."
msgstr "No necesitás sentarte al lado del fuego para usarlo."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"You don't need to grab every piece of loot you see.  There's always more to "
"find."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "You don't win, you just do a little better each time."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"You won't use mutated body parts like fangs and horns to attack if they're "
"covered up."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"You're on fire?  Stop and wait to put it out.  Better yet, go prone first."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Your enemy is often slower than you.  Walk to conserve stamina and run only "
"when you must."
msgstr ""
"A menudo, tu enemigo es más lento que vos. Caminá para conservar tu "
"resistencia y corré solo cuando no te quede otra opción."

#. ~ Weather type name
#: data/core/weather.json
msgid "Clear"
msgstr "Despejado"

#. ~ Weather type name
#: data/core/weather.json
msgid "NULL Weather - BUG"
msgstr "NULL Clima - BUG"

