#. ~ Help message in menu "<h|H>: Morale and learning"
#: data/help/texts.json
msgid ""
"You can disable a skill in the Player Info Menu (press <press_player_data>) "
"if you don't want to practice it, and it will prevent focus drain while "
"performing relevant actions, but you will not progress in that skill while "
"it's disabled."
msgstr ""
"Podés desactivar una habilidad en el Menú de Información del Jugador (apretá"
" <press_player_data>) si no querés practicarlo, lo que evitará usar tu "
"concentración mientras realizás las acciones relevantes, pero no vas a "
"progresar en esa habilidad mientras esté desactivada."

#. ~ Name of achievement
#: data/json/achievements.json
msgid "28 days later"
msgstr "28 días después"

#. ~ Description of achievement "Trapper"
#: data/json/achievements.json
msgid "A good trap doesn't discriminate between beavers and zombeavers."
msgstr "Una buena trampa no discrimina entre castores y castorombis."

#. ~ Description of achievement "Tailor"
#: data/json/achievements.json
msgid "A needle, a thread, and a dream."
msgstr "Una aguja, un hilo y un sueño."

#. ~ Name of achievement
#: data/json/achievements.json
msgid "A time to every purpose under heaven"
msgstr "Todo lo que se quiere debajo del cielo tiene su hora"

#. ~ Name of achievement
#: data/json/achievements.json
msgid "A veritable hunt unending"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Name of achievement
#: data/json/achievements.json
msgid "Accomplished Survivor"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Name of achievement
#: data/json/achievements.json
