"Whether it was for fun, innocent utility, or criminal intent, you learned "
"the basics of how to silently pick locks.  Now, being able to get into "
"secured places just got a lot more useful."
msgstr ""
"Ya sea por diversión, funcionalidad inocente o intensión criminal, "
"aprendiste lo básico de cómo abrir cerraduras de manera silenciosa. Ahora, "
"siendo capaz de ingresar a lugares cerrados se ha convertido en algo muy "
"útil."

#. ~ Description of profession "Lockpicking (Beginner)" for male
#: data/json/backgrounds.json
