msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You figured you could save money on ammo by learning to make your own.  Now "
"that the factories are shut down, your abilities just went from handy to "
"lifesaving."
msgstr ""
"Se te ocurrió que podías ahorrar plata en municiones aprendiendo cómo "
"hacerla vos misma. Ahora que las fábricas cerraron, tus habilidades pasar de"
" ser útiles a indispensables."

