#. ~ Description of terrain "dark pedestal"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-mechanisms.json
msgid ""
"A dark stone pedestal covered in ancient, unintelligible symbols.  Looks "
"ominous."
msgstr ""
"Es un pedestal oscuro de piedra cubierto con símbolos antiguos e "
"incomprensibles. Parece siniestro."

#. ~ Description of terrain "mechanical winch"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-mechanisms.json
msgid ""
"A gate control winch.  If it's functioning, it can be used to open or close "
"a nearby gate or door."
msgstr ""

