#. ~ Description of ".22 FMJ"
#: data/json/items/ammo/22.json
msgid ""
".22 Long Rifle ammunition with a 30gr FMJ bullet.  The .22LR round is "
"extremely weak, with short range and negligible recoil.  This type is "
"marginally better at piercing through targets, but deals even less damage as"
" a result."
msgstr ""
"Es munición .22 Long Rifle con una bala FMJ de 30gr. La .22LR es una bala "
"extremadamente débil con poco alcance y retroceso insignificante. Este tipo "
"es levemente mejor para atravesar objetivos pero por eso mismo causa menos "
"daño."

#. ~ Description of ".22 LR"
#: data/json/items/ammo/22.json
msgid ""
".22 Long Rifle ammunition with a 40gr unjacketed bullet.  The .22LR round is"
" extremely weak, with short range and negligible recoil.  It is most useful "
"for target practice and hunting small animals."
msgstr ""
"Es munición .22 Long Rifle con una bala de 40gr sin recubrir. La .22LR es "
"una bala extremadamente débil con poco alcance y retroceso insignificante. "
"Su mayor utilidad es para práctica de tiro y para caza de animales pequeños."

