msgid ""
".50 BMG ammunition with a lead-cored FMJ bullet.  The .50 BMG is a very "
"powerful rifle round designed for anti-aircraft use, later adapted to anti-"
"vehicular and anti-personnel roles.  Its stupendous energy and armor "
"piercing capabilities make it one of the most deadly rounds available, "
"offset only by its drastic recoil and noise."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of ".50 BMG M33 Ball"
#: data/json/items/ammo/50.json
msgid ""
".50 BMG ammunition with a mild steel cored 661gr FMJ bullet.  The .50 BMG is"
" a very powerful rifle round designed for anti-aircraft use, later adapted "
"to anti-vehicular and anti-personnel roles.  Its stupendous energy and armor"
" piercing capabilities make it one of the most deadly rounds available, "
"offset only by its drastic recoil and noise."
msgstr ""
"Es munición .50 BMG con bala FMJ de núcleo de acero de 661gr. Es una bala de"
" rifle muy poderosa diseñada para uso anti-aéreo y luego adaptada como anti-"
"vehicular y anti-personal. Su estupenda potencia y penetración de blindaje "
"la convierten en una de las balas más letales, con la desventaja de su "
"drástico retroceso y ruido."

