msgid ""
"The Rivtech 5x50mm flechette round is a fin-stabilized steel needle packed "
"into a plastic sabot which breaks apart shortly after the round clears the "
"chamber.  The resulting cartridge is far lighter and produces lower recoil "
"than a conventional round, while the projectile makes up for its low mass "
"with extreme velocity and long range."
msgstr ""

