"into a plastic sabot which breaks apart shortly after the round clears the "
"chamber.  The resulting cartridge is far lighter and produces lower recoil "
"than a conventional round, while the projectile makes up for its low mass "
"with extreme velocity and long range.  This one has been hand-reloaded by a "
"lucky survivor or perhaps a pre-Cataclysm corporate spy, leading to slightly"
" inferior performance compared to factory-produced ammo."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "RA119 5x50mm penetrator"
#: data/json/items/ammo/5x50.json
msgid ""
"The Rivtech 5x50mm penetrator round is a fin-stabilized armor-penetrating "
"tungsten needle packed into a plastic sabot which breaks apart shortly after"
" the round clears the chamber.  The resulting cartridge is far lighter and "
"produces lower recoil than a conventional round, while the projectile makes "
"up for its low mass with extreme velocity and long range."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "M720A1 60mm mortar shell"
#: data/json/items/ammo/60mm.json
msgid ""
"A high explosive cartridge with a tapered nose and fins at the base.  It is "
"designed to be fired from a mortar and used at long range against troops or "
"light vehicles."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "M768 60mm mortar shell"
#: data/json/items/ammo/60mm.json
msgid ""
"A high explosive cartridge with a tapered nose and fins at the base.  It is "
"designed to be fired from a mortar and used at long range against troops or "
"light vehicles.  The M768 is a modern update to the older, less effective "
"M720A1."
msgstr ""

