"An 8x40mm caseless cartridge with a rectangular shape, consisting of a "
"licensed 127gr solid copper expanding bullet housed inside of an advanced "
"propellant body.  Upon firing, the body will be consumed, leaving nothing "
"behind in the chamber.  The monometal construction of the bullet lends "
"itself to greater manufacturing precision, while also offering excellent "
"expansion and penetration.  Proprietary ammunition for Rivtech 8x40 caseless"
