#. ~ Description of "survivor suit"
#: data/json/items/armor/bespoke_armor/custom_bodysuits.json
msgid ""
"Body armor handmade from a durable coverall with quilted Kevlar lining and a"
" rubberized coating.  It provides good all-around protection from many of "
"the hazards of the Cataclysm."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "light survivor suit"
#: data/json/items/armor/bespoke_armor/custom_bodysuits.json
msgid ""
"Body armor handmade from a durable coverall with quilted Kevlar lining.  "
"It's tough and chemical-resistant, but not waterproofed and it likely won't "
"stand up to gunfire."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "survivor firesuit"
#: data/json/items/armor/bespoke_armor/custom_bodysuits.json
msgid ""
"Handcrafted armor made from a flame-resistant jumpsuit with additional "
"Kevlar padding and strategically placed butyl rubber coating.  It protects "
"from brief exposure to flames as well as many other Cataclysmic hazards, "
"though additional armor will be needed to stop bullets."
msgstr ""

