" looks like the kind of thing a warrior-monk might have worn in some far-"
"away galaxy."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "costume cloak"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid ""
"A cheap rayon cloak with a hood, the kind you'd see vampires and witches "
"wearing on halloween."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "costume cape"
