"A cheap rayon cloak, the kind you'd see vampires and witches wearing on "
"halloween."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "hologram cloak"
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid ""
"A cloak woven with metallic fibers and covered with hexagonal sheets of "
"reflective carbide.  When activated, it will create a holographic decoy of "
"its wearer."
msgstr ""
"Es una capa tejida con fibras metálicas y cubierta con planchas hexagonales "
"de carburo reflectivo. Cuando es activada, crea una imagen holográfica de "
"quien la tiene puesta para usarla de señuelo."

#. ~ Description of variant "Gambian flag" of item "national flag"
