#. ~ Description of "ballistic mandible guard"
#: data/json/items/armor/head_attachments.json
msgid ""
"A ballistic jaw guard designed to be attached on a military helmet, but "
"easily adjustable to helmets with any kind of rail system installed."
msgstr ""
"Es una protección balística para mandíbula diseñada para ser puesta en un "
"casco militar pero fácilmente ajustable a otros tipos de casco con ranuras "
"para equipamiento."

#. ~ Description of "mesh nape protector"
#: data/json/items/armor/head_attachments.json
msgid ""
"A common mesh nape protector intended to be attached on a hard hat or helmet"
" to protect against the sun while letting the cold wind refresh your nape."
msgstr ""
"Es un protector de malla común para nuca diseñado para ser puesto en un "
"casco de seguridad o yelmo como protección contra el sol, y que deja pasar "
"el viento fresco."

#. ~ Description of "nape protector"
#: data/json/items/armor/head_attachments.json
msgid ""
"A common nape protector intended to be attached on a hard hat or helmet to "
"protect against the sun and dust."
msgstr ""
"Es un protector de nuca común diseñado para ser puesto en un casco de "
"seguridad o yelmo como protección contra el sol y el polvo."

#. ~ Description of "plastic chin guard"
#: data/json/items/armor/head_attachments.json
msgid ""
"A common plastic chin guard designed to be attached to the straps of any "
"common hard hat or helmet."
msgstr ""
"Es una protección plástica común para el mentón diseñada para ser agregada a"
" las correas de cualquier casco de seguridad o yelmo."

#. ~ Description of "shield visor"
#: data/json/items/armor/head_attachments.json
msgid "A common shield visor intended to be attached on a hard hat or helmet."
msgstr ""
"Es un visor protector común diseñado para ser agregado a un casco de "
"seguridad o yelmo."

#. ~ Description of "sun shield"
#: data/json/items/armor/head_attachments.json
msgid ""
"A common sun shield intended to be put over a hard hat to protect the user "
"from the sun."
msgstr ""
"Es un parasol común diseñado para ser puesto sobre un casco de seguridad "
"para proteger al usuario del sol."

#. ~ Description of "counterweight pouch"
#: data/json/items/armor/head_attachments.json
msgid ""
"A counterweight pouch attachable to the back of a hard hat or helmet to "
"balance the weight on your head.  You can store batteries or some other very"
" small items in it."
msgstr ""
"Es una bolsa de contrapeso que se puede agregar a la parte trasera de un "
"casco de seguridad o yelmo para balancear el peso en tu cabeza. Podés poner "
"pilas o algunos otros objetos muy chicos."

#. ~ Description of "Kevlar nape protector"
#: data/json/items/armor/head_attachments.json
msgid ""
"A custom-made Kevlar strengthened nape protector intended to be attached on "
"a hard hat or helmet to protect your nape against cuts and slashing attacks."
msgstr ""
"Es un protector reforzado de kevlar para nuca diseñado para ser puesto en un"
" casco de seguridad o yelmo como protección contra ataques cortantes."

#. ~ Description of "enhanced night vision goggles"
#: data/json/items/armor/head_attachments.json
msgid ""
"A new and rare high-resolution thermal NVG device, designed to be mounted on"
" a compatible helmet.  Lets you see in the dark, and detects heat signatures"
" emitted by (un)living organisms.  Currently raised up and out of the way."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "enhanced night vision goggles (on)"
#: data/json/items/armor/head_attachments.json
msgid ""
"A new and rare high-resolution thermal NVG device, designed to be mounted on"
" a compatible helmet.  Lets you see in the dark, and detects heat signatures"
" emitted by (un)living organisms.  It is turned on, and continually draining"
" batteries.  Use it to turn it off."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "attachable ear muffs (on)"
#: data/json/items/armor/head_attachments.json
msgid ""
"A pair of ear muffs attachable to a hard hat or helmet to reduce noise "
"exposures to safe levels.  Activate to put ear muffs into a standby "
"position, letting you clearly hear again."
msgstr ""
"Es un par de orejeras que se pueden poner en un casco de seguridad o yelmo "
"para reducir la exposición a los ruidos. Podés colocar las orejeras hacia "
"atrás con el comando Activar, lo que dejará que escuches normalmente."

#. ~ Description of "attachable ear muffs"
#: data/json/items/armor/head_attachments.json
msgid ""
"A pair of ear muffs attachable to a hard hat or helmet to reduce noise "
"exposures to safe levels.  Activate to put ear muffs into a working "
"position, blocking most sounds."
msgstr ""
"Es un par de orejeras que se pueden poner en un casco de seguridad o yelmo "
"para reducir la exposición a los ruidos. Te podés colocar las orejeras con "
"el comando Activar, lo que bloqueará la mayoría de los sonidos."

#. ~ Description of "plastic face shield"
#: data/json/items/armor/head_attachments.json
msgid ""
"A plastic face shield with a mounting bracket intended to be attached over a"
" hard hat or helmet.  It doesn't protects you as much as one made from "
"thermoplastic, but it's cheaper and more common."
msgstr ""
"Es un protector facial de plástico con un soporte diseñado para ser puesto "
"sobre un casco de seguridad o yelmo. No te protege tanto como el de "
"termoplástico pero es más barato y más común."

#. ~ Description of "plastic mandible guard"
#: data/json/items/armor/head_attachments.json
msgid ""
"A plastic jaw guard designed to be strapped to any common hard hat or "
"helmet, it was probably part of some costume before the world ended."
msgstr ""
"Es una protección plástica para mandíbula diseñada para ser agregada a "
"cualquier casco de seguridad o yelmo. Es probable que haya sido parte de un "
"disfraz antes de que el mundo llegara a su fin."

#. ~ Description of "face shield"
#: data/json/items/armor/head_attachments.json
msgid ""
"A thermoplastic face shield with a mounting bracket intended to be attached "
"over a hard hat or helmet."
msgstr ""
"Es un protector facial de termoplástico con un soporte diseñado para ser "
"puesto sobre un casco de seguridad o yelmo."

#. ~ Description of "EOD face shield"
#: data/json/items/armor/head_attachments.json
msgid ""
"A thick polycarbonate and plexiglass face shield with a mounting bracket "
"intended to be attached to a ballistic helmet for protection from blast and "
"fragmentation in 'non-permissive environments'."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "panoramic night vision goggles"
#: data/json/items/armor/head_attachments.json
msgid ""
"Advanced GPNVG with four image intensifier tubes, allowing for a large field"
" of view at night, designed to be mounted on a compatible helmet.  Currently"
" raised up and out of the way."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "panoramic night vision goggles (on)"
#: data/json/items/armor/head_attachments.json
msgid ""
"Advanced GPNVG with four image intensifier tubes, allowing for a large field"
" of view at night, designed to be mounted on a compatible helmet.  It is "
"turned on, and continually draining batteries.  Use it to turn it off."
msgstr ""

