#. ~ Description of "western gun belt"
#: data/json/items/armor/holster.json
msgid ""
"A Western-style gun belt as worn by cowboys and gunfighters in the movies "
"and on TV. Has loops across the back to hold spare ammo.  Activate to "
"holster/draw a gun."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "large nylon holster"
#: data/json/items/armor/holster.json
msgid ""
"A belt holster consisting of a loop and strap intended for use with larger "
"firearms, but made with nylon instead of leather.  Activate to holster/draw "
"a gun"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "large holster"
#: data/json/items/armor/holster.json
msgid ""
"A belt holster consisting of a loop and strap intended for use with larger "
"firearms.  Slightly more cumbersome than a standard holster due to the "
"straps that hold it flat against your leg.  Activate to holster/draw a gun."
msgstr ""
"Es una funda de cinturón con una presilla y correa para llevar armas "
"grandes. Es un poco más incómoda que una funda normal debido a las correas "
"que la mantienen contra la pierna. Se puede enfundar o desenfundar el arma "
"con el comando Activar."

#. ~ Description of "shoulder holster"
#: data/json/items/armor/holster.json
msgid ""
"A comfortable quick-draw holster for larger pistols.  One side holsters a "
"gun, and the other side holds two magazines.  Activate to holster/draw a "
"gun."
msgstr ""
"Es una funda cómoda y de rápido acceso para pistolas grandes. De un lado se "
"puede guardar un arma y del otro lado, dos cargadores. Se puede enfundar o "
"desenfundar el arma con el comando Activar."

#. ~ Description of "fast draw holster"
#: data/json/items/armor/holster.json
msgid ""
"A comfortable quick-draw holster for small guns.  Activate to holster/draw a"
" gun."
msgstr ""
"Es una funda rápida y cómoda para armas pequeñas. Se puede enfundar o "
"desenfundar el arma con el comando Activar."

#. ~ Description of "single point sling"
#: data/json/items/armor/holster.json
msgid ""
"A harness going over your shoulder and across your chest.  Designed to "
"connect to a rifle at a single point with the rifle hanging off your front."
"  Great for fighting, not great for travel.  Activate to holster/draw your "
"weapon."
msgstr ""
"Es un arnés que pasa sobre tu hombro y cruza por el pecho. Diseñado para "
"engancharse a un rifle en un solo punto para tenerlo colgando adelante. Muy "
"bueno para la batalla pero no para trasladarse. Se puede enfundar o "
"desenfundar el arma con el comando Activar."

#. ~ Description of "baldric holsters"
#: data/json/items/armor/holster.json
msgid ""
"A leather harness which can hold up to six pistol-sized guns in total, "
"available for quick drawing.  Historically, similar harnesses were used by "
"pirates to carry multiple loaded flintlock pistols at once, as reloading "
"them is a lengthy process.  Activate to holster/draw a gun."
msgstr ""
"Es un arnés de cuero que puede contener hasta seis armas de un tamaño "
"similar a las pistolas, y tenerlas para desenfundar más rápidamente. "
"Históricamente, se han utilizado arneses similares por piratas para llevar "
"varias pistolas de chispa cargadas a la vez, ya que recargarlas era un "
"proceso lento. Se puede enfundar o desenfundar el arma con el comando "
"Activar."

#. ~ Description of "back holster"
#: data/json/items/armor/holster.json
msgid ""
"A leather holster, big enough for a rifle or other large gun.  Designed to "
"be strapped to the back.  Activate to holster/draw a gun."
msgstr ""
"Es una funda de cuero suficientemente grande como para poner un rifle u otra"
" arma grande. Diseñada para tener atada en la espalda. Se puede enfundar o "
"desenfundar el arma con el comando Activar."

#. ~ Description of "holster"
#: data/json/items/armor/holster.json
msgid ""
"A leather strap worn on the hip for holding pistol-sized guns.  Activate to "
"holster/draw a gun."
msgstr ""
"Es una correa de cuero que se usa en la cintura para llevar una pistola "
"grande. Se puede enfundar o desenfundar la pistola con el comando Activar."

#. ~ Description of "drone-tech harness"
#: data/json/items/armor/holster.json
msgid ""
"A modified army harness, repurposed to carry several small and a single "
"medium sized drone alongside the tools to maintain them."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of a pocket in item "drone-tech harness"
#: data/json/items/armor/holster.json
msgid ""
"A series of connectors meant to hold a medium sized drone on your back."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of a pocket in item "drone-tech harness"
#: data/json/items/armor/holster.json
msgid "A series of connectors meant to store a small drone."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "ankle holster"
#: data/json/items/armor/holster.json
msgid ""
"A small concealed holster worn on the ankle.  It is awkward to use without "
"practice.  Activate to holster/draw a small pistol."
msgstr ""
"Es una pequeña funda que se oculta en el tobillo. Es difícil usarla si no "
"estás acostumbrado. Se puede enfundar o desenfundar la pistola con el "
"comando Activar."

#. ~ Description of "bow sling"
#: data/json/items/armor/holster.json
msgid ""
"A somewhat complicated set of straps and fabric to keep your bow close to "
"hand and (mostly) out of harm's way.  Activate to holster/draw your bow."
msgstr ""
"Es un complicado conjunto de correas y tela que se usa para tener tu arco a "
"mano y (casi) a salvo de cualquier daño. Se puede enfundar o desenfundar el "
"arco con el comando Activar."

#. ~ Description of "belly band holster"
#: data/json/items/armor/holster.json
msgid ""
"A wide elastic belly belt with a built-in holster for a pistol and a spare "
"magazine.  It is very awkward to use without practice.  Activate to "
"holster/draw a gun."
msgstr ""
"Es una cinta elástica ancha que se usa en la zona abdominal con una funda "
"para pistola y para un cargador. Es muy incómoda de usar si no tenés "
"práctica. Se puede enfundar o desenfundar el arma con el comando Activar."

#. ~ Description of "deep concealment holster"
#: data/json/items/armor/holster.json
msgid ""
"An elastic band with numerous provisions for concealing a very small pistol "
"close to the body.  It is awkward to use without practice.  Activate to "
"holster/draw a gun."
msgstr ""
"Es una banda elástica con varios lugares para esconder una pistola chiquita "
"cerca del cuerpo. Es un poco incómoda de usar si no tenés práctica. Se puede"
" enfundar o desenfundar el arma con el comando Activar."

#. ~ Description of a pocket in item "drone-tech harness"
