msgid ""
"A combination of leather and a metal ring to hold an axe on your waist."
msgstr ""
"Es una combinación entre un pedazo de cuero y un aro de metal que sirve para"
" colgar un hacha a tu cintura."

#. ~ Description of "birchbark sheath"
#: data/json/items/armor/sheath.json
msgid ""
"A handcrafted knife sheath made from birch bark with a strap attached.  "
"Activate to sheathe/draw a weapon."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "birchbark ankle sheath"
#: data/json/items/armor/sheath.json
msgid ""
"A handcrafted small concealed knife sheath worn on the ankle, made from "
"birch bark.  It is awkward to use without practice.  Activate to "
"sheathe/draw a weapon."
msgstr ""
"Es una pequeña vaina hecha a mano para cuchillo que se oculta en el tobillo,"
" hecha con corteza de abedul. Es difícil usarla si no estás acostumbrado. Se"
" puede enfundar o desenfundar el arma con el comando Activar."

#. ~ Description of "baldric"
#: data/json/items/armor/sheath.json
msgid ""
"A heavy leather belt looped over one shoulder with an open scabbard at the "
"hip which can hold most reasonably-sized swords."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "leather bokken saya"
#: data/json/items/armor/sheath.json
msgid ""
"A large, adjustable leather sheath for holding a bokken.  Activate to "
"sheathe/draw a weapon."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "bokken saya"
#: data/json/items/armor/sheath.json
msgid ""
"A large, adjustable plastic sheath for holding a bokken.  Activate to "
"sheathe/draw a weapon."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "nylon scabbard"
#: data/json/items/armor/sheath.json
msgid ""
"A large, adjustable sheath for holding swords and other large blades, made "
"with nylon.  Activate to sheathe/draw a weapon."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "scabbard"
#: data/json/items/armor/sheath.json
msgid ""
"A large, adjustable sheath for holding swords and other large blades.  "
"Activate to sheathe/draw a weapon."
msgstr ""
"Es una funda larga y ajustable para espadas y otras armas blancas grandes. "
"Se puede enfundar o desenfundar el arma con el comando Activar."

#. ~ Description of "back scabbard"
#: data/json/items/armor/sheath.json
msgid ""
"A leather scabbard, big enough for almost any sword.  Designed to be "
"strapped to the back, it's very difficult to draw from without considerable "
"practice.  Activate to sheath/draw a sword."
msgstr ""
"Es una vaina de cuero lo suficientemente grande para poner cualquier espada."
" Diseñada para ser colgada en la espalda, es bastante difícil de usar sin "
"tener una práctica considerable. Se puede enfundar o desenfundar la espada "
"con el comando Activar."

#. ~ Description of "sheath"
#: data/json/items/armor/sheath.json
msgid ""
"A leather sheath for holding knives and other small blades.  Activate to "
"sheathe/draw a weapon."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "spear strap"
#: data/json/items/armor/sheath.json
msgid ""
"A leather strap tied around the torso for toting spears while keeping your "
"hands free.  You have to duck to get through doors while one's in it, "
"though.  Activate to holster/draw a weapon."
msgstr ""
"Es una correa de cuero que se ata al torso para envainar una lanza. Te vas a"
" tener que agachar para pasar por las puertas cuando tenés una lanza "
"envainada. Se puede enfundar o desenfundar el arma con el comando Activar."

#. ~ Description of "throwing knives leg sheath"
#: data/json/items/armor/sheath.json
msgid ""
"A nylon strap knife sheath worn on the thigh, made to hold 6 very thin "
"knives, such as throwing knives, close at hand.  Activate to sheathe/draw a "
"weapon."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "ankle sheath"
#: data/json/items/armor/sheath.json
msgid ""
"A small concealed knife sheath worn on the ankle.  It is awkward to use "
"without practice.  Activate to sheathe/draw a weapon."
msgstr ""
"Es una pequeña vaina para cuchillo que se oculta en el tobillo. Es difícil "
"usarla si no estás acostumbrado. Se puede enfundar o desenfundar el arma con"
" el comando Activar."

#. ~ Description of "garter sheath"
#: data/json/items/armor/sheath.json
msgid ""
"A small knife sheath meant to be worn under clothing, trading speed for "
"concealability.  Activate to sheathe/draw a weapon."
msgstr ""

