#. ~ Description of "riot armor suit"
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid ""
"A full suit of black plastic body armor plates used by riot police.  "
"Cleverly placed velcro straps secure each piece, resulting in slightly less "
"encumbrance then its constituent parts.  MOLLE webbing is attached to the "
"torso and the word POLICE is emblazoned across the front."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "suit of leather armor"
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid ""
"A full suit of thick leather armor.  It's fairly heavy, but could be "
"deconstructed into its constituent parts if desired."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "chainmail suit"
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid ""
"A full-body suit of medieval chain armor, complete with a hood, gloves, and "
"chausses."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "conductive NBC suit"
#. ~ Description of "conductive NBC suit (unzipped)"
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid ""
"A glossy boiler suit complete with rubber gloves and steel-toed boots, this "
"getup is the sort of thing you might see in a documentary about Chernobyl.  "
"It lacks any branding, but a label on the inside explains that the suit is "
"flame-resistant, chemical resistant, and when paired with a gas mask, could "
"provide protection from biological agents and radioactive particles.  A bold"
" warning mentions that suit only protects from electric shock while the "
"wearer is grounded and the suit is worn properly."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "cleansuit"
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid ""
"A hooded boiler suit, complete with bulky gloves and boots, that covers "
"everything but the face in impermeable rubber fabric.  Though not designed "
"to stand up to combat, it should protect from chemicals, radiation, and "
"other environmental hazards.  A tag advises the user to wear an activated "
"gas mask while working in these conditions."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "chainmail hauberk"
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid ""
"A knee-length long-sleeved tunic made of interlocking low-quality steel "
"rings.  It can be adjusted to be worn as outerwear."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "chainmail hauberk (loose)"
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid ""
"A knee-length long-sleeved tunic made of interlocking low-quality steel "
"rings.  It can be adjusted to fit closer to the body."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "chainmail hauberk"
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid ""
"A knee-length long-sleeved tunic made of interlocking steel rings.  It can "
"be adjusted to be worn as outerwear."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "chainmail hauberk (loose)"
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid ""
"A knee-length long-sleeved tunic made of interlocking steel rings.  It can "
"be adjusted to fit closer to the body."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "track touring suit"
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid ""
"A lightweight leather bodysuit with padding in high-impact areas, meant for "
"motorcyclists out on the track.  Though weaker than more modern Kevlar "
"motorcycle gear, it is lightweight and can be worn under other gear."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "military flight suit"
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid ""
"A long-sleeved jumpsuit worn by military pilots.  It's made of nomex, "
"rendering it fireproof."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "dress uniform"
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid ""
"A military officer's dress uniform from before the Cataclysm, complete with "
"rank and ribbons.  Just looking at it gives you an air of authority.  "
"Perhaps not the most practical military wear, but a very stylish option."
msgstr ""
"Es el uniforme de gala de un oficial militar de antes del Cataclismo, "
"completo con el rango y divisas. Solo mirarlo te da un aire de autoridad. "
"Tal vez no sea la ropa militar más práctica pero es una opción muy elegante."

#. ~ Description of "activity suit"
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid ""
"A single-piece brown and orange environmental suit, tailored in a way that "
"slightly recalls a military flight suit.  It requires a separate gas mask "
"for full protection."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "activity suit (unzipped)"
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid ""
"A single-piece brown and orange environmental suit, tailored in a way that "
"slightly recalls a military flight suit.  The upper portion has been tied "
"around the waist casually."
msgstr ""
"Es un traje ambiental de una sola pieza, marrón y naranja, fabricado de "
"manera que parece un traje de piloto militar. La parte de arriba ha sido "
"atada a la cintura de manera informal."

#. ~ Description of "flame-resistant suit"
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid ""
"A snug body suit made from thin and lightweight Nomex fire-resistant fabric."
"  Tough yet breathable, it is light and comfortable to wear under clothing."
msgstr ""
"Es un traje ajustado, liviano y fino, hecho de nomex, una tela ignífuga. "
"Fuerte, deja pasar el aire y es liviano y cómodo para usar debajo de otra "
"ropa."

#. ~ Description of "suit of boiled leather armor"
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid ""
"A suit of armor constructed in a similar fashion to plate mail, but made of "
"leather which has been boiled until stiff.  It's lighter and cooler than "
"standard leather, but less flexible, making it harder to move in."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "tire suit"
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid ""
"A suit of armor made from thick chunks of rubber tire secured by simple "
"strings; the loose collection of rubber plates provides decent but not the "
"most convenient protection."
msgstr ""
"Es una armadura hecha con pedazos gruesos de cubiertas de caucho sujetas con"
" cuerdas. Esa unión suelta de las placas brinda una protección decente pero "
"no la más conveniente."

#. ~ Description of "suit"
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid ""
"A suit of formal attire.  Makes the apocalypse a truly gentlemanly "
"experience."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "full plate armor"
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid ""
"A suit of medieval plate armor, covering everything but the head and neck.  "
"It's made of low-quality steel that doesn't look like it'll hold together "
"long.  This would likely be uncomfortable without something soft underneath."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "full plate armor"
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid ""
"A suit of medieval plate armor, covering everything but the head and neck.  "
"This would likely be uncomfortable without something soft underneath."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "beekeeping suit"
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid ""
"A white suit commonly worn by professional beekeepers with straps on your "
"ankles and wrists to prevent bees from flying in.  It's not a very tough "
"fabric, but it's lightweight and has plenty of storage thanks to a chest "
"pocket."
msgstr ""
"Es un traje blanco comúnmente utilizado por los apicultores profesionales, "
"con correas en los tobillos y muñecas para prevenir que las abejas se metan."
" No está hecho de una tela muy resistente, pero es ligero y tiene mucha "
"capacidad de almacenamiento gracias al bolsillo en el pecho."

#. ~ Description of "entry suit"
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid ""
"An aluminized whole-body garment worn by firefighters and foundry workers as"
" protection against flames."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "hazmat suit"
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid ""
"An impermeable full-body garment with a clear plastic face shield, rubber "
"gloves, and boots, looking like a soft, puffy space suit.  It looks fragile,"
" but a tag on the interior explains that it will provide excellent "
"protection from radiation, pathogens, chemicals, toxins, and even electrical"
" discharge, so long as it's in good condition."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "ō-yoroi"
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid "An ornamental suit of Japanese samurai armor."
msgstr "Es una armadura samurai japonesa."

#. ~ Description of "canine bite suit"
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid ""
"Designed to stop the injuries of dog bites, this thick, one piece suit is "
"often used in the rehabilitation of abused animals and in training dogs by "
"the police and military.  A base layer of aramid fabric has had strips of "
"soft body armor sewn into it to mimic quilting, and to soften the blunt of "
"animals jumping, slashing, or pouncing on the wearer."
msgstr ""

