#. ~ Description of "thick wetsuit"
#: data/json/items/armor/swimming.json
msgid ""
"A bulky wetsuit for colder water or more dangerous environments.  The "
"rubbery neoprene outer offers some protection from bumps and scrapes."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "wetsuit"
#: data/json/items/armor/swimming.json
msgid "A full-body wetsuit for swimming in temperate conditions."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "full-face diving mask"
#: data/json/items/armor/swimming.json
msgid ""
"A full-face diving mask that covers the face and eyes.  Can be equipped with"
" any common scuba regulator to protect from drowning and other dangers, "
"though the process needs some time and knowledge."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "modular full-face diving mask"
#: data/json/items/armor/swimming.json
msgid ""
"A high-end modular full-face diving mask that covers the face and eyes.  Can"
" be equipped with proprietary adapters for scuba tanks or rebreather "
"cartridges to protect from drowning and other dangers."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "wetsuit jacket"
#: data/json/items/armor/swimming.json
msgid ""
"A long-sleeved neoprene jacket.  Keeps you warm and protected from the "
"elements."
msgstr ""
"Es un chaleco de neopreno de mangas largas. Te mantiene abrigado y protegido"
" del ambiente."

#. ~ Description of "wetsuit long-sleeved shirt"
#: data/json/items/armor/swimming.json
msgid ""
"A long-sleeved neoprene shirt.  Good for surfing and other water sports."
msgstr ""
"Es una remera de neopreno de manga larga. Está buena para surfear y para "
"otros deportes acuáticos."

#. ~ Description of "rashguard shirt"
#: data/json/items/armor/swimming.json
msgid ""
"A long-sleeved rashguard shirt.  Commonly used to protect against rashes "
"from abrasion or sun exposure."
msgstr ""
"Es una remera de mangas largas denominada rashguard. Son utilizadas "
"comúnmente para protegerse contra sarpullidos por la abrasión o por la "
"exposición al sol."

#. ~ Description of "spring suit"
#: data/json/items/armor/swimming.json
msgid ""
"A long-sleeved spring wetsuit with pink color details and cleavage-"
"enhancing, hip-accentuating construction.  Not as protective as a full-body "
"suit, but also less restrictive."
msgstr ""
"Es un traje de neopreno corto con mangas largas y detalles en rosa, "
"entallado a la cadera y el escote. No protege tanto como el traje largo pero"
" es más cómodo."

#. ~ Description of "wetsuit hood"
#: data/json/items/armor/swimming.json
msgid "A neoprene hood commonly worn by divers."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "faraday sharksuit"
#: data/json/items/armor/swimming.json
msgid ""
"A one-piece chainmail suit used by SCUBA divers for protection against shark"
" bites.  It has been conductively interconnected, protecting against "
"electricity."
msgstr ""
"Es un traje entero de cota de malla que usan los buzos para protegerse "
"contra las mordidas de tiburón. Ha sido interconectado conductivamente, lo "
"que brinda protección contra la electricidad."

#. ~ Description of "diving gloves"
#: data/json/items/armor/swimming.json
msgid ""
"A pair of flexible neoprene-silicone rubber gloves, suitable for underwater "
"use."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "wetsuit pants"
#: data/json/items/armor/swimming.json
msgid ""
"A pair of light and stretchy neoprene pants.  Good for surfing and other "
"water sports."
msgstr ""
"Es un par de pantalones livianos y elastizados de neopreno. Está bueno para "
"surfear y para otros deportes acuáticos."

#. ~ Description of "wetsuit shorts"
#: data/json/items/armor/swimming.json
msgid ""
"A pair of light and stretchy neoprene shorts.  Good for use on the beach."
msgstr ""
"Es un par de pantalones cortos livianos y elastizados de neopreno. Está "
"bueno para usar en la playa."

#. ~ Description of "diving boots"
#: data/json/items/armor/swimming.json
msgid "A pair of neoprene diving boots with rubber soles."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "swim fins"
#: data/json/items/armor/swimming.json
msgid ""
"A pair of rubber flippers worn on the feet, which improve swimming speed "
"while greatly impeding the wearer's ability to walk."
msgstr ""
"Es un par de patas de rana de goma que se usan en los pies para incrementar "
"la velocidad al nadar pero caminar se hace imposible."

#. ~ Description of "swim briefs"
#: data/json/items/armor/swimming.json
msgid ""
"A pair of skin-tight swim shorts, also known as jammers.  Commonly used by "
"male competitive swimmers."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "diving socks"
#: data/json/items/armor/swimming.json
msgid "A pair of split-toe neoprene diving socks with thin rubber soles."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "wetsuit technical shorts (loose)"
#: data/json/items/armor/swimming.json
msgid ""
"A pair of stretchy neoprene shorts with large pockets.  Can be worn over a "
"wetsuit or adjusted to be worn alone."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "wetsuit technical shorts"
#: data/json/items/armor/swimming.json
msgid ""
"A pair of stretchy neoprene shorts with large pockets.  They can be worn "
"alone or adjusted to wear over a wetsuit."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "swimming trunks"
#: data/json/items/armor/swimming.json
msgid "A pair of swimming trunks, with netting."
msgstr "Es una malla con una pequeña red interior para mejor soporte."

#. ~ Description of "thick diving gloves"
#: data/json/items/armor/swimming.json
msgid ""
"A pair of thick neoprene-silicone rubber gloves, suitable for underwater "
"use."
msgstr ""
"Es un par de guantes gruesos de neopreno y goma de silicona. Perfectos para "
"usar debajo del agua."

#. ~ Description of "speedo"
#: data/json/items/armor/swimming.json
msgid ""
"A pair of very short swim briefs.  Commonly used by male competitive "
"swimmers and bodybuilders."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "wetsuit shirt"
#: data/json/items/armor/swimming.json
msgid "A short-sleeved neoprene shirt.  Good for use on the beach."
msgstr ""
"Es una remera de neopreno de manga corta. Está buena para usar en la playa."

#. ~ Description of "bikini top"
#: data/json/items/armor/swimming.json
msgid "A simple bikini top."
msgstr "Es una simple bikini."

#. ~ Description of "sleeveless spring suit"
#: data/json/items/armor/swimming.json
msgid ""
"A sleeveless spring wetsuit with an ocean blue color and cleavage-enhancing,"
" hip-accentuating construction.  Not as protective as a full-body suit, but "
"also less restrictive."
msgstr ""
"Es un traje de neopreno corto sin mangas de color azul marino y entallado a "
"la cadera y el escote. No protege tanto como el traje largo pero es más "
"cómodo."

#. ~ Description of "swim goggles"
#: data/json/items/armor/swimming.json
msgid "A small pair of goggles made for swimming."
msgstr "Es un par de antiparras pequeñas para nadar."

#. ~ Description of "thick wetsuit hood"
#: data/json/items/armor/swimming.json
msgid "A thick neoprene hood, commonly worn by divers in cold weather."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "swim cap"
#: data/json/items/armor/swimming.json
msgid ""
"A tightly fitted, skin-tight head garment made of spandex.  Commonly used by"
