#. ~ Description of "The Prop Builder's Molding and Casting Handbook"
#: data/json/items/book/fabrication.json
msgid ""
"The first book to contain, in one comprehensive volume, every molding and "
"casting procedure of use to the theater props builder of any skill level.  "
"The author demonstrates the techniques involved in over thirty materials "
"from papier-mache to breakaway glass."
msgstr ""
"Es el primer libro en contener, en un volumen abarcador, cada procedimiento "
"de moldeado y fundición para usar en construcción de utilería de todos los "
"niveles. El autor demuestra las técnicas involucradas en más de treinta "
"materiales, desde papel maché hasta vidrios falsos."

#. ~ Description of "Rivtech design binder"
#: data/json/items/book/fabrication.json
msgid ""
"This Rivtech binder warns that \"Unauthorized readers are our best test "
"subjects.\" With good reason: it contains complete design specs and "
"technical drawings for their entire line of products."
msgstr ""
"La carpeta Rivtech advierte que \"Los lectores no autorizados son nuestros "
"mejores sujetos de estudio.\" Con razón: contiene las especificaciones de "
"diseño completas y dibujos técnicos para la línea entera de productos."

#. ~ Description of "Machinery's Handbook"
#: data/json/items/book/fabrication.json
msgid ""
"This classic reference work contains extensive, dense chapters and tables on"
" materials, metrology, toolmaking, gears, threading and more.  This recent "
"edition includes extensive data on the latest techniques in additive "
"manufacturing.  If you need to know how best complete a certain machining "
"operation, the answer lies somewhere in these pages."
msgstr ""
"Este trabajo clásico de referencia contiene capítulos y cuadros densos y "
"extensivos sobre materiales, metrología, fabricación de herramientas, "
"engranajes y más cosas. Esta edición reciente incluye información extensiva "
"sobre las últimas técnicas en manufactura aditiva. Si necesitás saber cómo "
"completar cierta operación de maquinarias, la respuesta está en alguna parte"
" de estas páginas."

#. ~ Description of "Tools of Warfare in the Arabic World"
#: data/json/items/book/fabrication.json
msgid ""
"This exhaustive book details various forms of medieval period Middle Eastern"
" and South Asian weapons and armor.  It is incredibly detailed with diagrams"
" and pictures, but quite dry."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "The Bowyer's Buddy"
#: data/json/items/book/fabrication.json
msgid ""
"This hefty book is dedicated to craftsfolk and outdoors-y types looking to "
"make their own bows.  It recommends its companion volume \"The Fletcher's "
"Friend\" for instructions on producing their ammunition."
msgstr ""
"Este robusto libro está dedicado aquellas personas que gustan de fabricar "
"sus propios arcos. Se recomienda también leer su libro complementario \"El "
"Amigo del Flechero\" para las instrucciones sobre fabricación de munición."

#. ~ Description of "The Fletcher's Friend"
#: data/json/items/book/fabrication.json
msgid ""
"This hefty book is devoted to folks looking to handcraft their own arrows.  "
"It starts with a hip and snappy disclaimer about the risks, both physical "
"and legal, of using explosives and flammable materials.  Look for its "
"companion, \"The Bowyer's Buddy\"!"
msgstr ""
"Este robusto libro está dedicado a los que buscan fabricar sus propias "
"flechas. Empieza con un rápido descargo de responsabilidad acerca de los "
"riesgos, tanto físicos como legales, de usar materiales explosivos e "
"inflamables. ¡Buscá el libro complementario, \"El Compañero del Arquero\"!"

#. ~ Description of "A History of Firefighting"
#: data/json/items/book/fabrication.json
msgid ""
"This in-depth and technical text details the history of firefighting from "
"ancient times into the modern era, with a focus on the technology used to "
"save lives."
msgstr ""
"Este texto detallado y técnico, explica la historia de los bomberos desde "
"los tiempos antiguos hasta la era moderna, centrándose en la tecnología "
"utilizada para salvar vidas."

#. ~ Description of "Studies in Historic Armorsmithing"
#: data/json/items/book/fabrication.json
msgid ""
"This in-depth and technical text details various forms of ancient European "
"armor crafting, and is well illustrated with lots of photos."
msgstr ""
"Este texto técnico y detallado, explica varias formas de la fabricación de "
"armaduras en la Europa antigua, y está ilustrado con muchas fotos."

#. ~ Description of "The Historic Weaponsmith"
#: data/json/items/book/fabrication.json
msgid ""
"This in-depth and technical text details various forms of ancient European "
"weapon smithing, and is well illustrated with step by step photo "
"instructions."
msgstr ""
"Este texto técnico y detallado, explica varias formas de la fabricación de "
"armas en la Europa antigua, y las instrucciones están ilustradas con fotos "
"del paso a paso."

#. ~ Description of "The Art of Japanese Armormaking"
#: data/json/items/book/fabrication.json
msgid ""
"This in-depth and technical text details various forms of ancient Japanese "
"armor crafting, and is well illustrated with lots of photos."
msgstr ""
"Este texto técnico y detallado, explica varias formas de la fabricación de "
"armaduras en el antiguo Japón, y está ilustrado con muchas fotos."

#. ~ Description of "The Swords of the Samurai"
#: data/json/items/book/fabrication.json
msgid ""
"This in-depth and technical text details various forms of ancient Japanese "
"sword smithing, and is well illustrated with step by step photo "
"instructions."
msgstr ""
"Este texto técnico y detallado, explica varias formas de la fabricación de "
"espadas en el antiguo Japón, y las instrucciones están ilustradas con fotos "
"del paso a paso."

#. ~ Description of "The Art of Warfare in Precolumbian Mesoamericas"
#: data/json/items/book/fabrication.json
msgid ""
"This intricate history book details the history of Mesoamerican warfare from"
" the sources of the native codices, Spanish records and contemporary "
"historians.  It contains descriptive diagrams and information on few of the "
"weapons used, mainly of the Nahuatl speaking peoples.  You reckon you could "
"craft a few of them with steel instead of obsidian."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "Artillery of the Ancients"
#: data/json/items/book/fabrication.json
msgid ""
"This is a history book detailing the siege machines and field artillery of "
"some ancient civilizations.  It contains detailed diagrams that explain how "
"such devices were assembled and maintained."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "lab journal-Gustav"
#: data/json/items/book/fabrication.json
msgid ""
"This paper notebook is mostly full of boring logs, experimental observations"
" and notes.  Mixed in, however, are musings on how to use the lab's vapor "
"deposition machine to deposit amorphous carbon in a diamond-like form onto "
"common metals.  The author's intended goal was a better non-stick frying "
"pan, but you can think of a couple of better uses for it."
msgstr ""
"Este cuaderno con artículos está casi completamente lleno de entradas "
"aburridas, observaciones de experimentos y notas. Mezcladas entre eso, hay "
"reflexiones sobre cómo usar la máquina de deposición de vapor para depositar"
" carbono amorfo en forma de diamante en materiales comunes. El objetivo del "
"autor era una mejor sartén sin mango, pero vos podés pensar en un par de "
"usos más útiles."

#. ~ Description of "WX010 Living Armor Observations"
#: data/json/items/book/fabrication.json
msgid ""
"This sheaf of papers seems to describe maintenance on a new form of "
"ballistic armor.  \"the regenerative plates though promising for field use "
"do require maintenance or combat to stop from becoming overgrown\"."
msgstr ""
"Este manojo de papeles parece describir el mantenimiento de un nuevo tipo de"
" armadura de balística. \"Las placas regenerativas, aunque son prometedoras,"
" necesitan mantenimiento o combate para frenarla de que crezca demasiado.\""

#. ~ Description of "Arms and Armor of Imperial China"
#: data/json/items/book/fabrication.json
msgid ""
"This textbook details the military history of ancient China, with a "
"particular focus on the nature of historical arms and armor.  It also "
"details some of the equipment used by other cultures that came into conflict"
" with the empire over various dynasties."
msgstr ""
"Este manual detalla la historia militar de la antigua China, con un enfoque "
"especialmente en la naturaleza de las armas y armaduras históricas. También "
"detalla algo del equipo utilizado por otras culturas que estuvieron en "
"conflicto con el imperio a lo largo de varias dinastías."

