#. ~ Description of "unmarked notebook"
#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
msgid ""
"Chemical formulae and complex diagrams handwritten in blue ball-point pen "
"fill this notebook nearly cover to cover alongside uncomfortably detailed "
"drawings of dissected pigs and humans.  What little text there is seems to "
"describe steps in some sort of chemistry project, started and aborted again "
"and again until on one dog-eared page toward the end, the nameless author "
"outlines the collection of \"vital tissues\" and instructions for their use "
"in some sort of experiment."
msgstr ""

