"This is a hefty, hardcover print of William Shinderling's \"Vanity before "
"Justice\" with beautiful illustrations."
msgstr ""
"Es una copia pesada de tapa dura de \"Vanidad antes que justicia\" de "
"William Shinderling, con bellísimas ilustraciones."

#. ~ Snippet of item "collector's edition book"
#: data/json/items/book/misc.json
