#. ~ Description of "mutagenic infusion"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/mutagen.json
msgid ""
"A processed, purified, and condensed dose of mutagenic drugs.  This will "
"cause you to acquire random mutations over time."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "abstract mutagen flavor"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/mutagen.json
msgid "A rare substance of uncertain origins.  Causes you to mutate."
msgstr ""
"Es una sustancia extraña de origen desconocido. Si lo tomás, vas a mutar."

#. ~ Description of "batrachian mutagen"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/mutagen.json
msgid ""
"A shadowy mutagen that looks like it might be full of tiny swimming "
"tadpoles."
msgstr ""
"Es un mutágeno sombrío que parece como si estuviera lleno de pequeños "
"renacuajos."

#. ~ Description of "mutagen"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/mutagen.json
