msgstr "Es un puñado de frutos secos tostados del árbol del roble."

#. ~ Description of "cashews"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/nuts.json
msgid "A handful of salty cashews."
msgstr "Es un puñado de castañas de cajú saladas."

#. ~ Description of "pine nuts"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/nuts.json
msgid "A handful of tasty, crunchy nuts from a pinecone."
msgstr "Es un puñado de frutos secos sabrosos y crujientes de una piña."

#. ~ Description of "vegan butter"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/nuts.json
msgid ""
"A light brown butter substitute made from nuts.  Differs from other nut "
"butters in that the fats are removed from the meat and only the fats "
"retained."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "blanching acorns"
#. ~ Description of "blanching acorns (obsolete)"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/nuts.json
#: data/json/obsoletion_and_migration/obsoletion.json
msgid ""
"A mix of water and hulled acorns, slowly leaching the tannins.  It'll take "
"about a week before they're palatable."
msgstr ""
"Es una mezcla de agua y bellotas peladas blanqueando lentamente los taninos."
" Puede tardar una semana antes de volverse agradables para comer."

#. ~ Description of "cooked acorns"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/nuts.json
msgid ""
"A serving of acorns that have been hulled, chopped, and boiled in water "
"before being thoroughly toasted until dry.  Filling and nutritious."
msgstr ""
"Es una porción de bellotas que han sido peladas, picadas y hervidas en agua,"
" antes de ser tostadas hasta dejarlas secas. Rendidora y nutritiva."

#. ~ Description of "hickory nut ambrosia"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/nuts.json
msgid "Delicious hickory nut ambrosia.  A drink worthy of the gods."
msgstr ""
"Es una deliciosa ambrosía de nuez jicoria. Una bebida digna de los dioses."

#. ~ Description of "peanut butter spread"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/nuts.json
msgid "Processed peanut butter spread."
msgstr "Es crema de maní procesada para untar."

#. ~ Description of "almond pulp"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/nuts.json
msgid ""
"Pulp left over after making almond milk.  It's gritty and incredibly bland."
msgstr ""
"Es la pulpa que queda luego de hacer leche de almendra. Es arenosa e "
"insulsa."

#. ~ Description of "hazelnut pulp"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/nuts.json
