#. ~ Description of "fruit pie"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/wheat.json
msgid "A delicious baked pie with a sweet fruit filling."
msgstr "Es una deliciosa torta horneada con relleno de fruta."

#. ~ Description of "cheese pizza"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/wheat.json
msgid "A delicious pizza with molten cheese on top."
msgstr "Una deliciosa pizza con queso derretido arriba."

#. ~ Description of "deluxe cooked oatmeal"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/wheat.json
msgid ""
"A filling and nutritious New England classic that has been improved with the"
" addition of extra wholesome ingredients."
msgstr ""
"Es un clásico de New England, rendidor y nutritivo que ha sido mejorado con "
"la adición ingredientes saludables."

#. ~ Description of "cooked oatmeal"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/wheat.json
msgid ""
"A filling and nutritious New England classic that has sustained pioneers and"
" captains of industry alike."
msgstr ""
"Es un clásico de New England, rendidor y nutritivo que ha sido el sustento "
"tanto de los pioneros como de los reyes de los negocios."

#. ~ Description of "flour"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/wheat.json
msgid ""
"A fine powder made of ground wheat.  It's great for baking, not so good raw."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "raw lasagne pasta"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/wheat.json
msgid ""
"A pasta sheet used in making lasagne.  It could be eaten raw if you're "
"desperate, but is much better cooked."
msgstr ""
"Es un lámina de pasta que se usa para hacer lasaña. Se puede comer cruda si "
"estás medio desesperado, pero es mucho mejor cocinada."

#. ~ Description of "brownie"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/wheat.json
msgid "A rich chocolate brownie, just like how grandma used to bake them."
msgstr "Es un brownie con mucho chocolate, igualito al que hacía tu abuela."

#. ~ Description of "maple pie"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/wheat.json
msgid "A sweet and delicious baked pie with pure maple syrup."
msgstr "Es una dulce y deliciosa torta horneada con miel pura de maple."

#. ~ Description of "granola"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/wheat.json
msgid ""
"A tasty and nutritious mixture of oats, honey, and other ingredients that "
"has been baked until crisp."
msgstr ""
"Es una mezcla sabrosa y nutritiva de avena, miel y otros ingredientes que "
"han sido horneados hasta estar crujientes."

#. ~ Description of "raw spaghetti pasta"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/wheat.json
msgid ""
"A type of pasta usually used when preparing spaghetti.  It could be eaten "
"raw if you're desperate, but is much better cooked."
msgstr ""
"Es un tipo de pasta que usualmente se usa cuando preparás espagueti. Se "
"puede comer crudo si estás medio desesperado, pero es mucho mejor cocinado."

#. ~ Description of "blodplättar"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/wheat.json
msgid ""
"Blodplättar is not your average pancake.  It does not taste of blood at all "
"and it tastes like a crispier black pudding."
msgstr ""
"El Blodplättar no es un panqueque común. No tiene gusto a sangre y se parece"
" a un budín negro más crocante."

#. ~ Description of "cheese grits"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/wheat.json
msgid "Boiled cornmeal with cheese to add a little more flavor."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "grits"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/wheat.json
msgid "Boiled cornmeal, a simple type of porridge."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "fruit waffle"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/wheat.json
msgid ""
"Crunchy and delicious waffles with real maple syrup, made sweeter and "
"healthier with the addition of wholesome fruit."
msgstr ""
"Son wafles deliciosos y crujientes con verdadera miel de maple, agregándole "
"una fruta serán más dulces y saludables."

#. ~ Description of "cracker"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/wheat.json
msgid "Dry and salty, these crackers will leave you quite thirsty."
msgstr "Secas y saladas, estas galletitas te van a dejar bastante sediento."

#. ~ Description of "instant oatmeal"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/wheat.json
msgid ""
"Dry flakes of flattened grain.  Tasty and nutritious when cooked, they are "
"ideal for making porridge or granola."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "coarse oatmeal"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/wheat.json
msgid ""
"Dry oats, ground coarsely in preparation for making porridge.  Unlike "
"instant oats, these are not pre-steamed, meaning they aren't ready for human"
" consumption and will take quite some time to cook."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "brioche"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/wheat.json
msgid "Filling bread buns, taste good with tea on a Sunday morning breakfast."
msgstr ""
"Bollos sustanciosos de pan, están buenos con té para el desayuno de un "
"domingo a la mañana."

#. ~ Description of "fruit pancake"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/wheat.json
msgid ""
"Fluffy and delicious pancakes with real maple syrup, made sweeter and "
"healthier with the addition of wholesome fruit."
msgstr ""
"Son panqueques suaves y deliciosos con verdadera miel de maple, agregándole "
"una fruta serán más dulces y saludables."

#. ~ Description of "pancake"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/wheat.json
msgid "Fluffy and delicious pancakes with real maple syrup."
msgstr "Panqueques suaves y deliciosos con verdadera miel de maple."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/wheat.json
msgid "French toast"
msgid_plural "French toast"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description of "boiled noodles"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/wheat.json
msgid "Fresh wet noodles.  Fairly bland, but fills you up."
msgstr "Son fideos recién hervidos. Bastante insípidos pero te van a llenar."

#. ~ Description of "waffle"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/wheat.json
msgid ""
"Hey it's waffle time, it's waffle time.  Won't you have some waffles of "
"mine?"
msgstr ""
"También llamados gofre. Es una especie de torta con masa crujiente parecida "
"a una galleta."

#. ~ Description of "raw macaroni"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/wheat.json
msgid "It could be eaten raw if you're desperate, but is much better cooked."
msgstr ""
"Se puede comer crudo si estás medio desesperado, pero es mucho mejor si lo "
"cocinás."

#. ~ Description of "sponge cake"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/wheat.json
msgid "Plain, fluffy cake for the proletariat."
msgstr "Es una torta simple y esponjosa, típica del proletariado."

#. ~ Description of "French toast"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/wheat.json
msgid "Slices of bread dipped in a milk and egg mixture then fried."
msgstr ""
"Son rebanadas de pan mojadas en una mezcla de leche y huevo y luego fritas."

#. ~ Description of "fast noodles"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/wheat.json
msgid "So-called ramen noodles.  Can be eaten raw."
msgstr "Llamados fideos ramen. Se pueden comer crudos."

#. ~ Description of "oyster cracker"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/wheat.json
msgid ""
"These bite-sized crackers go well with soups, but will make you thirsty on "
"their own."
msgstr ""
"Son unas galletitas chiquitas que quedan muy bien en las sopas pero que te "
"dan mucha sed."

#. ~ Description of "space cake"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/wheat.json
msgid "This cake's destiny is to take you on a gnarly trip."
msgstr "El destino de esta torta es llevarte en un excelente viaje."

#. ~ Description of "'special' brownie"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/wheat.json
msgid "This is definitely not how grandma used to bake them."
msgstr "Definitivamente, no es la misma receta que hacía la abuela."

#. ~ Description of "cloutie dumplings"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/wheat.json
msgid ""
"This traditional Scottish treat is a sweet and filling little boiled cake "
"studded with dried fruit."
msgstr ""
"Esta golosina tradicional de Escocia es una pequeña torta hervida, dulce y "
"que te llena, adornada con frutas secas."

