"A very small electric motor like those used in RC cars or electric hair "
"trimmers."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "duct tape wallet"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A wallet made entirely out of duct tape."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "leather wallet"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid "A wallet made of leather."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "INCIDENT REPORT: IMMERSION-27A"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"A white piece of paper on official-looking stationary.  It seems to be an "
"internal report of some kind."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "cash card"
#: data/json/items/generic.json
msgid ""
"A yellow plastic card used to electronically store money.  It holds up to 2 "
"million dollars."
msgstr ""
"Es una tarjeta plástica amarilla que se usa para almacenar dinero "
"electrónicamente. Puede contener hasta 2 millones de dólares."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/generic.json
