#. ~ Description of "bedsheet"
#: data/json/items/generic/bedding.json
msgid ""
"A big rectangle of fabric.  It could be used as a curtain, worn for warmth, "
"placed somewhere for bedding, or cut up for a bunch of smaller sheets."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "quilt"
#: data/json/items/generic/bedding.json
msgid ""
"A big, comfy quilt made of thick wool in a triangle pattern.  Extremely "
"cozy!"
msgstr ""
"Es una colcha grande y cómoda hecha de lana gruesa, y con un estampado "
"triangular. ¡Extremadamente confortable!"

#. ~ Description of "emergency blanket"
#: data/json/items/generic/bedding.json
msgid ""
"A blanket made of reflective Mylar that covers your most important body "
"parts.  It folds into a very compact form when not in use."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "fur blanket"
#: data/json/items/generic/bedding.json
msgid "A heavy fur blanket that covers most of your body."
msgstr "Es una frazada pesada de piel que cubre casi todo tu cuerpo."

#. ~ Description of "patchwork quilt"
#: data/json/items/generic/bedding.json
msgid "A huge, patchwork wool quilt.  Very, very warm."
msgstr "Es una enorme colcha hecha de pedazos de lana. Muy, muy abrigada."

#. ~ Description of "net hammock"
#: data/json/items/generic/bedding.json
msgid ""
"A large net with ropes on two sides.  Could be tied to something and then "
"used as a sleeping place that is comfortable, but lacks warmth."
msgstr ""
"Es un gran pedazo de red con sogas en los dos costados. Puede ser atado a "
"algo y luego usarse para dormir ya que es cómoda pero no abriga nada."

#. ~ Description of "hammock"
#: data/json/items/generic/bedding.json
msgid ""
"A large sheet of cloth with ropes on two sides.  Could be tied to something "
"and then used as a sleeping place that is comfortable, but lacks warmth."
msgstr ""
"Es un gran pedazo de tela con sogas en los dos costados. Puede ser atado a "
"algo y luego usarse para dormir ya que es cómoda pero no abriga nada."

#. ~ Description of "sleeping bag"
#: data/json/items/generic/bedding.json
msgid ""
"A large sleeping bag that covers you head to toe, with a strap for carrying "
"it on your back when not in use.  This one is medium weight.  It is "
"currently unrolled; activate it to roll it up for easy storage."
msgstr ""
"Es una bolsa de dormir grande que te cubre de la cabeza hasta los pies, con "
"una correa para llevarla en la espalda cuando no la usás. Esta es de mediano"
" peso. En este momento está desenrollada. Se puede enrollar para guardarla "
"con el comando Activar."

#. ~ Description of "pillowcase"
#: data/json/items/generic/bedding.json
msgid "A simple cotton pillowcase."
msgstr "Es una simple funda de algodón para almohada."

#. ~ Description of "down-filled blanket"
#: data/json/items/generic/bedding.json
msgid ""
"Hiding under here will not protect you from the monsters, but it'll keep you"
" warm."
msgstr ""
"Aunque te escondas debajo de ella, no te protegerá de los monstruos pero te "
"mantendrá calentito."

#. ~ Description of "blanket"
#: data/json/items/generic/bedding.json
msgid "Hiding under here will not protect you from the monsters."
msgstr "Aunque te escondas debajo de ella, no te protegerá de los monstruos."

#. ~ Description of "grass blanket"
#: data/json/items/generic/bedding.json
msgid ""
"Some grass sheets sewn together. It's itchy, but water resistant and more "
"comfortable than the cold."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "grass sheet"
#: data/json/items/generic/bedding.json
msgid ""
"Some grass yarn woven into a crude sheet.  It's not enough to keep the rain "
"out, but it might be better than nothing."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "improvised sleeping bag"
#: data/json/items/generic/bedding.json
msgid ""
"You might think it is bizarre to sleep in a body bag stuffed with dead "
"plants.  However, the thought of sleeping in the cold is far more "
"uncomfortable."
msgstr ""
"Te puede parecer un poco raro dormir adentro de una bolsa de cadáver rellena"
" con plantas muertas. Sin embargo, pensar en dormir en el frío es mucho "
"peor."

#. ~ "msg" action message of item "sleeping bag"
#: data/json/items/generic/bedding.json
msgid "You roll up the sleeping bag, preparing it for transport."
msgstr ""
