#. ~ Description of "40x46mm M199 casing"
#: data/json/items/generic/casing.json
msgid ""
"A large casing from a spent 40x46mm cartridge, which used to hold a buckshot"
" load.  Suitable for reloading with buckshot, slug or flechette loads."
msgstr ""
"Es una vaina grande de un cartucho 40x46mm usado, que contenía una carga de "
"perdigones grandes. Adecuada para recargar con perdigones grandes, postas o "
"dardos perforantes."

#. ~ Description of "40x46mm M212 casing"
#: data/json/items/generic/casing.json
msgid ""
"A large casing from a spent 40x46mm cartridge, which used to hold a less-"
"lethal projectile."
msgstr ""
"Es una vaina grande de un cartucho 40x46mm usado, que contenía un proyectil "
"no muy letal."

#. ~ Description of "40x46mm M195 casing"
#: data/json/items/generic/casing.json
msgid ""
"A large casing from a spent 40x46mm cartridge, which used to hold a tear gas"
" canister."
msgstr ""
"Es una vaina grande de un cartucho 40x46mm usado, que contenía una carcasa "
"de gas lacrimógeno."

#. ~ Description of "40x46mm M118 casing"
#: data/json/items/generic/casing.json
msgid ""
"A large casing from a spent 40x46mm cartridge, which used to hold an HEDP "
"grenade.  Suitable for reloading with buckshot, slug or flechette loads."
msgstr ""
"Es una vaina grande de un cartucho 40x46mm usado, que contenía una granada "
"HEDP. Adecuada para recargar con perdigones grandes, postas o dardos "
"perforantes."

#. ~ Description of "40x53mm M169 casing"
