#. ~ Description of gun "10mm/.40 revolver"
#. ~ Description of "10mm/.40 revolver"
#: data/json/items/gun/10mm.json
msgid "A classic six-shooter revolver chambered for 10mm and .40 rounds."
msgstr ""
"Es un clásico revólver de seis tiros con calibre para balas 10mm y .40."

#. ~ Description of variant "Glock pistol" of gun "Glock 20 pistol"
#. ~ Description of variant "Glock 20 pistol" of item "Glock pistol"
#: data/json/items/gun/10mm.json
msgid ""
"A full-sized version of the highly successful Glock, chambered in hard-"
"hitting 10mm Auto.  The third model of Glock designed, all other full-sized,"
" large framed Glocks are adaptations of this one."
msgstr ""
"Es una versión de tamaño completo de la exitosa Glock, con calibre del "
"potente 10mm Auto. Es el tercer modelo diseñado por Glock, todas las otras "
"Glock de tamaño completo son adaptaciones de esta."

#. ~ Description of variant "hunter Glock pistol" of gun "Glock 40 pistol"
#. ~ Description of variant "Glock 40 pistol" of item "hunter Glock pistol"
#: data/json/items/gun/10mm.json
msgid ""
"A full-sized, long-slide version of the highly successful Glock, chambered "
"in hard-hitting 10mm Auto.  The extra barrel length makes for slightly more "
"accurate and powerful shots, and the extra slide length means the sights are"
" a little easier to use."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of gun "hunter Glock pistol"
#. ~ Description of "hunter Glock pistol"
#: data/json/items/gun/10mm.json
msgid ""
"A full-sized, long-slide version of the highly successful Glock, chambered "
"in hard-hitting 10mm Auto.  The extra barrel length makes for slightly more "
"accurate and powerful shots, and the extra slide length means the sights are"
" a little easier to use.  It also features Glock's Modular Optic System, "
"making aftermarket optics much easier to mount."
msgstr ""
"Es una versión de tamaño completo de corredera larga de la exitosa Glock, "
"con calibre del potente 10mm Auto. El tamaño más largo del cañón le da un "
"poco más de precisión y potencia a los disparos, y el mayor largo de la "
"corredera significa que las miras son un poco más fáciles de usar. También "
"posee el Sistema Óptico Modular de Glock, lo que hace que las ópticas de "
"mercados secundarios sean mucho más fáciles de montar."

#. ~ Description of variant "Colt Delta Elite pistol" of gun "Colt Delta Elite
#. pistol"
#. ~ Description of variant "Colt Delta Elite pistol" of item "Colt Delta
#. Elite pistol"
#: data/json/items/gun/10mm.json
msgid ""
"A modernized, match-grade variant of the venerable M1911 chambered in hard-"
"hitting 10mm Auto.  Early variants were known to crack frames; modern 1911s,"
" like this one, are slotted to prevent such crack formation."
msgstr ""
"Es una variante modernizada y de calidad de la venerable M1911 con calibre "
"del potente 10mm Auto. Las primeras variantes fueron conocidas por sus "
"estructuras resquebrajables; las modernas 1911, como esta, están encajadas "
"para prevenir la formación de rajaduras."

#. ~ Description of variant "compact Glock pistol" of gun "Glock 29 pistol"
#. ~ Description of variant "Glock 29 pistol" of item "compact Glock pistol"
#: data/json/items/gun/10mm.json
msgid ""
"A modestly sized version of the highly successful Glock, chambered in hard-"
"hitting 10mm Auto.  It is easy to carry because of its small size, but also "
"recoils fiercely."
msgstr ""
"Es una versión de tamaño modesto de la exitosa Glock, con calibre del "
"potente 10mm Auto. Es fácil de llevar por su tamaño pequeño pero tiene un "
"retroceso feroz."

#. ~ Description of variant "double-stack 10mm 1911 pistol" of gun "STI
#. Tactical 2011 DS pistol"
#. ~ Description of variant "STI Tactical 2011 DS pistol" of item "double-
#. stack 10mm 1911 pistol"
#: data/json/items/gun/10mm.json
msgid ""
"A next-gen model of the venerable 1911, ready to win World War Z.  "
"Modernized and manufactured by Staccato, sporting a double-stack magwell, "
"sleek solid-steel frame, and ergonomic grip; favored by certain dog-loving "
"assassins.  This model is chambered in 10mm Auto."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of gun "EAA Witness pistol"
#. ~ Description of "EAA Witness pistol"
#: data/json/items/gun/10mm.json
