"A semi-automatic pistol chambered in 10mm and accepting EAA Witness "
"magazines."
msgstr ""
"Es una pistola semiautomática con calibre 10mm que utiliza cargadores EAA "
"Witness."

#. ~ Description of gun "Glock pistol"
#. ~ Description of "Glock pistol"
#: data/json/items/gun/10mm.json
