#. ~ Description of variant "G36 assault rifle" of gun "H&K G36 rifle"
#. ~ Description of variant "H&K G36 rifle" of item "G36 assault rifle"
#: data/json/items/gun/223.json
msgid ""
"Designed as a replacement for the early H&K G3 battle rifle, the G36 is more"
" accurate, and uses the much lighter .223 round, allowing for a higher ammo "
"capacity."
msgstr ""
"Diseñado como reemplazo del rifle de combate H&K G3, el G36 es más preciso y"
" utiliza la bala .223 que es mucho más liviana, lo que le permite una mayor "
"capacidad para la munición."

#. ~ Description of gun "M27 assault rifle"
#. ~ Description of "M27 assault rifle"
#: data/json/items/gun/223.json
msgid ""
"Designed to replace the M4 Carbine, the M27 assault rifle features most of "
"the former's strengths, while being considerably more durable.  It is "
"chambered in 5.56x45mm and accepts STANAG magazines."
msgstr ""
"Diseñado para reemplazar la Carabina M4, el rifle de asalto M27 posee la "
"mayoría de los puntos fuertes de la anterior pero siendo considerablemente "
"más resistente. Tiene calibre 5.56x45mm y puede usar cargadores STANAG."

#. ~ Description of variant "M27 assault rifle" of gun "H&K416 A5 rifle"
#. ~ Description of variant "H&K416 A5 rifle" of item "M27 assault rifle"
#: data/json/items/gun/223.json
msgid ""
"Designed to replace the M4A1, the Heckler and Koch 416A5 features most of "
"the former's strengths, while being considerably more durable."
msgstr ""
"Diseñado para reemplazar el M4A1, el Heckler and Koch 416A5 mantiene la "
"mayoría de las ventajas de su predecesor, y es considerablemente más "
"resistente."

