#. ~ Description of gun "Franchi SPAS-12 shotgun"
#. ~ Description of "Franchi SPAS-12 shotgun"
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
msgid ""
"Mean and intimidating looking, the SPAS-12 has the dubious honor of being "
"declared a destructive device and being banned from import by name, adding "
"to its already considerable appeal.  It is a combination pump-action and "
"semi-automatic firearm, with an arm stabilizing hook for one handed "
"shooting."
msgstr ""
"De apariencia intimidatoria, la SPAS-12 tiene el dudoso honor de ser "
"declarada dispositivo de destrucción y ser prohibida su importación, además "
"de su considerable atractivo. Es una combinación de acción de bombeo y "
"semiautomática, con un brazo de estabilización para disparar con una mano."

