#. ~ Description of gun mod "collapsing wire stock"
#. ~ Description of "collapsing wire stock"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/stock.json
msgid ""
"A collapsing wire stock which folds closely against the body of the weapon, "
"reducing length and volume."
msgstr ""
"Es una culata colapsable de alambre que se pliega contra el cuerpo del arma "
"para reducir mucho el largo y el volumen."

#. ~ Description of gun mod "collapsing wire stock (collapsed)"
#. ~ Description of "collapsing wire stock (collapsed)"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/stock.json
msgid ""
"A collapsing wire stock which folds closely against the body of the weapon, "
"reducing length and volume.  Currently collapsed, making shooting difficult"
msgstr ""
"Es una culata colapsable de alambre que se pliega contra el cuerpo del arma "
"para reducir mucho el largo y el volumen. En este momento está colapsada lo "
"que dificulta su uso."

#. ~ Description of gun mod "tail hook stock"
#. ~ Description of "tail hook stock"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/stock.json
msgid ""
"A foldable add-on stock for handguns and submachine guns with a pivoting "
"hook that latches onto the forearm, allowing for greater stability."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of gun mod "folding stock"
#. ~ Description of "folding stock"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/stock.json
msgid ""
"A folding stock which reduces length when folded.  Currently unfolded and "
"ready to shoot."
msgstr ""
"Es una culata plegable que reduce el largo del arma cuando está doblada. En "
"este momento, está desplegada y lista para disparar."

#. ~ Description of gun mod "folding stock (folded)"
#. ~ Description of "folding stock (folded)"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/stock.json
msgid ""
"A folding stock which reduces length.  Currently folded, making shooting "
"this gun difficult."
msgstr ""
"Es una culata plegable que reduce el largo del arma. En este momento está "
"plegada lo que dificulta su uso."

#. ~ Description of gun mod "under-folding stock (folded)"
#. ~ Description of "under-folding stock (folded)"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/stock.json
msgid ""
"A light wire-framed stock with a push button release catch on the side  "
"which allows it to fold and be stored away under the weapon's receiver.  It "
"is currently folded underneath the weapon's chassis, making it more "
"difficult to control."
msgstr ""
"Es una culata liviana de alambre con un botón en el costado que te permite "
"plegarla y guardarla debajo del receptor del arma. En este momento está "
"plegada debajo de la armazón del arma lo que la hace más difícil de "
"controlar."

#. ~ Description of gun mod "under folding stock"
#. ~ Description of "under folding stock"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/stock.json
msgid ""
"A light wire-framed stock with a push button release catch on the side  "
"which allows it to fold and be stored away under the weapon's receiver.  The"
" wire construction means that it's less comfortable to shoulder than a "
"regular fixed attachment.  The stock is currently locked in the open "
"position."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of gun mod "modular folding stock (folded)"
#. ~ Description of "modular folding stock (folded)"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/stock.json
msgid ""
"A multi position, high-end folding stock which reduces length when folded.  "
"Currently folded, making shooting this gun hard."
msgstr ""
"Es una culata plegable de múltiple posición y alta gama que reduce el largo "
"del arma cuando está doblada. En este momento está plegada lo que dificulta "
"su uso."

#. ~ Description of gun mod "adjustable folding stock"
#. ~ Description of "adjustable folding stock"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/stock.json
msgid ""
"A multi position, high-end folding stock which reduces length when folded.  "
"Currently unfolded and ready to shoot."
msgstr ""
"Es una culata plegable de múltiple posición y alta gama que reduce el largo "
"del arma cuando está doblada. En este momento está desplegada y lista para "
"disparar."

#. ~ Description of gun mod "sawn-off stock"
#. ~ Description of "sawn-off stock"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/stock.json
msgid ""
"A quick saw cut removed the original stock from this weapon.  It is now much"
" harder to handle, but much smaller."
msgstr ""
"Una simple serruchada quitó la culata original de esta arma. Ahora es mucho "
"más difícil de manejar pero mucho más chica."

#. ~ Description of gun mod "recoil stock"
#. ~ Description of "recoil stock"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/stock.json
msgid "A replacement stock designed to absorb perceived recoil."
msgstr ""
"Es una culata de reemplazo diseñada para absorber el retroceso percibido."

#. ~ Description of gun mod "MASS compatible stock"
#. ~ Description of "MASS compatible stock"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/stock.json
msgid ""
"A specially designed adjustable stock with an integrated grip to convert the"
" M26-MASS to a standalone configuration."
msgstr ""
"Es una culata ajustable especialmente diseñada con mango integrado para "
"convertir la M26-MASS a su configuración independiente."

#. ~ Description of gun mod "cheek pad"
#. ~ Description of "cheek pad"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/stock.json
msgid ""
"A stock accessory for sniper rifles and DMRs, this considerably improves eye"
" relief efficiency, prevents slipping, and reduces recoil to the neck and "
"cheek."
msgstr ""
"Es un accesorio para la culata de los rifles de francotirador y para fusiles"
" de tirador designado. Mejora considerablemente la eficiencia, evita el "
"deslizamiento y reduce el retroceso desde el cuello hasta la mejilla."

#. ~ Description of gun mod "pistol stock"
#. ~ Description of "pistol stock"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/stock.json
msgid ""
"An add-on stock for handguns, this considerably improves control of recoil."
msgstr ""
"Es una culata para armas cortas que mejora considerablemente el control del "
"retroceso."

#. ~ Description of gun mod "adjustable stock"
#. ~ Description of "adjustable stock"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/stock.json
msgid "An adjustable replacement stock improving both recoil and accuracy."
msgstr ""
"Es una culata ajustable de reemplazo, que mejora tanto el retroceso como la "
"precisión."

#. ~ Description of gun mod "butt hook"
#. ~ Description of "butt hook"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/stock.json
msgid ""
"An attachment to the butt of the gun that is held under the armpit, "
"improving stability."
msgstr ""
"Es un accesorio para la culata de un arma que se sostiene debajo de la axila"
" mejorando la estabilidad."

#. ~ Description of gun mod "hollow polymer stock"
#. ~ Description of "hollow polymer stock"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/stock.json
msgid ""
"An extremely lightweight stock.  There's a hollow cavity at the bottom where"
" a spare magazine can be stored."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Gun mod name
#: data/json/items/gunmod/stock.json
msgid "MASS compatible stock"
msgid_plural "MASS compatible stocks"
msgstr[0] "culata compatible MASS"
msgstr[1] "culatas compatibles MASS"
msgstr[2] "culatas compatibles MASS"

#. ~ Description of gun mod "integral folding mechanism (folded))"
#. ~ Description of "integral folding mechanism (folded))"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/stock.json
msgid ""
"The integral series of hinges and pivots which allow the SUB-2000 to fold in"
" half and be stored for transport.  Shooting this firearm would be "
"particularly tricky given that the barrel assembly is folded and locked "
"backwards for storage, rendering the weapon inoperable."
msgstr ""
"Es un conjunto integral de bisagras y ejes que permiten que la SUB-2000 se "
"pliegue a la mitad y facilite su almacenamiento. Disparar esta arma va a ser"
" particularmente difícil dado que el cañón está plegado y trabado hacia "
"atrás para almacenamiento del arma, dejándola inoperable."

#. ~ Description of gun mod "integral folding mechanism"
#. ~ Description of "integral folding mechanism"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/stock.json
msgid ""
"The integral series of hinges and pivots which allow the SUB-2000 to fold in"
" half and be stored for transport.  The firearm is currently locked in the "
"unfolded position and is ready for use."
msgstr ""
"Es un conjunto integral de bisagras y ejes que permiten que la SUB-2000 se "
"pliegue a la mitad y facilite su almacenamiento. El arma está en este "
"momento desplegada y lista para ser usada."

#. ~ "msg" action message of item "folding stock"
#. ~ "msg" action message of item "adjustable folding stock"
