msgstr[2] "caños lanzadores 40mm"

#. ~ Description of gun mod "high end hand guard"
#. ~ Description of "high end hand guard"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/underbarrel.json
msgid ""
"A comfortable, high end hand guard with a set of optional mounts for "
"accessories and equipment.  When installed, this replaces the original "
"factory hand guard for the weapon, cutting down on excessive rails and "
"weight.  This allows for comfortable, controlled firing of the weapon while "
"keeping a sleek profile and avoiding bulky foregrips."
msgstr ""
"Es un cómodo guardamano de alta gama con un conjunto de monturas opcionales "
"para accesorios y equipamiento. Cuando está instalado, este reemplaza el "
"guardamanos original del arma, reduciendo las monturas excesivas y el peso. "
"Esto permite un disparo más cómodo y controlado mientras mantiene un perfil "
"elegante y evita mangos voluminosos."

#. ~ Description of gun mod "wire monopod, deployed"
#. ~ Description of "wire monopod, deployed"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/underbarrel.json
msgid ""
"A folding wire monopod designed to attach to a Type 99 Arisaka's front "
"barrel band, intended to give soldiers a stabler platform from which to "
"shoot while prone.  Less effective than an actual bipod and ungainly long, "
"it was largely cut from active issue relatively soon into the Second World "
"War.  This one is currently locked in the unfolded position and will provide"
" a measure of stability while firing."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of gun mod "wire monopod, collapsed"
#. ~ Description of "wire monopod, collapsed"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/underbarrel.json
msgid ""
"A folding wire monopod designed to attach to a Type 99 Arisaka's front "
"barrel band, intended to give soldiers a stabler platform from which to "
"shoot while prone.  Less effective than an actual bipod and ungainly long, "
"it was largely cut from active issue relatively soon into the Second World "
"War.  This one is currently stowed in the folded position and cannot aid you"
" while firing."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of gun mod "forward grip"
#. ~ Description of "forward grip"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/underbarrel.json
msgid ""
"A grip placed forward on the barrel allows for greater control.  Not as "
"effective as a bipod but usable under all conditions."
msgstr ""
"Es una empuñadura que se pone en el cañón del arma, lo que permite tener "
"mayor control. No es tan efectiva como un bípode pero se puede usar bajo "
"cualquier condición."

#. ~ Description of gun mod "modified forward grip"
#. ~ Description of "modified forward grip"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/underbarrel.json
msgid ""
"A grip placed forward on the barrel allows for greater control.  Not as "
"effective as a bipod but usable under all conditions.  This one was modified"
" and customized to mount on pretty much any weapon, if you so want."
msgstr ""
"Es una empuñadura que se pone en el cañón del arma, lo que permite tener "
"mayor control. No es tan efectivo como un bípode pero se puede usar bajo "
"cualquier condición. Esta fue modificada y personalizada para poner en casi "
"cualquier arma."

#. ~ Description of gun "40mm pipe launcher"
#. ~ Description of gun mod "40mm pipe launcher"
#. ~ Description of "40mm pipe launcher"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/underbarrel.json
msgid ""
"A home-built launcher tube that can be attached to almost any weapon except "
"handguns.  It allows a single 40mm grenade to be loaded and fired."
msgstr ""
"Es un tubo lanzador casero que puede ser adjuntado a casi cualquier arma, "
"excepto armas cortas. Permite cargar y disparar una granada 40mm."

#. ~ Description of gun "masterkey shotgun"
#. ~ Description of gun mod "masterkey shotgun"
#. ~ Description of "masterkey shotgun"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/underbarrel.json
msgid ""
"A minimalist pump-action shotgun, which can be mounted under the barrel of "
"many rifles.  It allows a total of four shotgun shells to be loaded and "
"fired."
msgstr ""
"Es una escopeta minimalista de acción de bombeo que puede ser montada debajo"
" del cañón de varios rifles. Permite cargar y disparar un total de cuatro "
"cartuchos de escopeta."

#. ~ Description of gun "modified masterkey shotgun"
#. ~ Description of gun mod "modified masterkey shotgun"
#. ~ Description of "modified masterkey shotgun"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/underbarrel.json
msgid ""
"A minimalist pump-action shotgun, which can be mounted under the barrel of "
"many rifles.  It allows a total of four shotgun shells to be loaded and "
"fired.  This one was modified and customized to mount on pretty much any "
"weapon other than pistols and pump-action guns, if you so want."
msgstr ""
"Es una escopeta minimalista de acción de bombeo, que puede ser puesta bajo "
"el cañón de varios rifles. Permite cargar y disparar un total de cuatro "
"cartuchos de escopeta. Este fue modificado y personalizado para poner en "
"casi cualquier arma excepto pistolas y armas de acción de bombeo."

#. ~ Description of gun mod "pistol bayonet"
#. ~ Description of "pistol bayonet"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/underbarrel.json
msgid ""
"A pistol bayonet is a stabbing weapon that can be attached to the front of a"
" handgun, allowing a melee attack to deal piercing damage."
msgstr ""
"Una bayoneta para pistola es un arma de apuñalamiento que puede ser "
"adjuntada en el frente de armas cortas, lo que le permite tener un ataque de"
" cuerpo a cuerpo para causar daño perforante."

#. ~ Description of gun mod "factory handguard"
#. ~ Description of "factory handguard"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/underbarrel.json
msgid ""
"A removable molded grip that comes standard on guns without rails.  It's not"
" as efficient as a proper forward grip or bipod at controlling recoil, but "
"it's better than nothing."
msgstr ""
"Es una empuñadura extraíble que se vuelve estándar en armas sin riel. No es "
"tan eficiente como una empuñadura delantera apropiada o un bípode para "
"controlar el retroceso, pero es mejor que nada."

#. ~ Description of gun "underslung shotgun"
#. ~ Description of gun mod "underslung shotgun"
#. ~ Description of "underslung shotgun"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/underbarrel.json
msgid ""
"A short shotgun with 2 barrels, which can be mounted under the barrel of "
"many rifles.  It allows two shotgun shells to be loaded and fired."
msgstr ""
"Es una escopeta corta con 2 cañones, que puede ser montada debajo del cañón "
"de varios rifles. Permite cargar y disparar dos cartuchos de escopeta."

#. ~ Description of gun "modified underslung shotgun"
#. ~ Description of gun mod "modified underslung shotgun"
#. ~ Description of "modified underslung shotgun"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/underbarrel.json
msgid ""
"A short shotgun with 2 barrels, which can be mounted under the barrel of "
"many rifles.  It allows two shotgun shells to be loaded and fired.  This one"
" was modified and customized to mount on pretty much any weapon other than "
"pistols, if you so want."
msgstr ""
"Es una escopeta corta con dos cañones que puede ser puesta bajo el cañón de "
"varios rifles. Permite cargar y disparar un total de dos cartuchos de "
"escopeta. Este fue modificado y personalizado para poner en casi cualquier "
"arma excepto pistolas."

#. ~ Description of gun mod "weapon light"
#. ~ Description of "weapon light"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/underbarrel.json
msgid ""
"A slim, lightweight flashlight designed to attach to the underside of a "
"firearm.  Its size makes it less efficient than a handheld model."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of gun mod "underbarrel laser sight"
#. ~ Description of "underbarrel laser sight"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/underbarrel.json
msgid ""
"A visible-light laser that mounts under a firearm's barrel to enhance ease "
"and speed of target acquisition.  Aside from increased weight, there are no "
"drawbacks."
msgstr ""
"Es una mira de láser visible que se monta debajo del cañón de un arma de "
"fuego para mejorar la facilidad y velocidad para apuntar. La única "
"desventaja que tiene es el incremento de peso."

#. ~ Description of gun mod "wood forward grip"
#. ~ Description of "wood forward grip"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/underbarrel.json
msgid ""
"A wooden grip placed forward on the barrel allows for greater control.  Not "
"as effective as a bipod but usable under all conditions.  This one was "
"cleverly handmade by a desperate survivor or miserly enthusiast, it cannot "
"be removed after installation."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of gun mod "bipod"
#. ~ Description of "bipod"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/underbarrel.json
msgid ""
"Bipods are commonly used on rifles and machine guns to provide a forward "
"rest and reduce motion.  Although they greatly improve handling of recoil, "
"they are usable only on certain surfaces (or from the prone position), and "
"are slow to equip."
msgstr ""
"Los bípodes son usados comúnmente en los rifles y ametralladoras, para "
"proveer de un apoyo adelante y reducir el movimiento. Aunque mejoran mucho "
"el manejo del retroceso, solo pueden usarse en ciertas superficies (o tirado"
" cuerpo a tierra) y son lentos para armar."

#. ~ Description of gun mod "modified bipod"
#. ~ Description of "modified bipod"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/underbarrel.json
msgid ""
"Bipods are commonly used on rifles and machine guns to provide a forward "
"rest and reduce motion.  Although they greatly improve handling of recoil, "
"they are usable only on certain surfaces (or from the prone position), and "
"are slow to equip.  This one was modified and customized to mount on pretty "
"much any weapon, if you so want."
msgstr ""
"Los bípodes son usados comúnmente en los rifles y ametralladoras, para "
"proveer de un apoyo adelante y reducir el movimiento. Aunque mejoran mucho "
"el manejo del retroceso, solo pueden usarse en ciertas superficies (o tirado"
" cuerpo a tierra) y son lentos para armar. Este ha sido modificado y "
"personalizado pra poner en casi cualquier arma."

#. ~ Description of gun mod "bipod hand guard (deployed)"
#. ~ Description of "bipod hand guard (deployed)"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/underbarrel.json
msgid ""
"Bipods are commonly used on rifles and machine guns to provide a forward "
"rest and reduce motion.  Although they greatly improve handling of recoil, "
"they are usable only on certain surfaces (or from the prone position).  This"
" one is integrated into a high end hand guard, replacing the factory hand "
"guard of your weapon, allowing for comfortable shooting with or without the "
"bipod deployed.  Currently the bipod legs are out and are ready for use."
msgstr ""
"Los bípodes son usados comúnmente en los rifles y ametralladoras, para "
"proveer de un apoyo adelante y reducir el movimiento. Aunque mejoran mucho "
"el manejo del retroceso, solo pueden usarse en ciertas superficies (o tirado"
" cuerpo a tierra). Este tiene un guardamano integrado que reemplaza el del "
"arma, lo que te permite un disparo cómodo con y sin el bípode desplegado. En"
" este momento, las patas del bípode están listas para ser usadas."

#. ~ Description of gun mod "bipod hand guard"
#. ~ Description of "bipod hand guard"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/underbarrel.json
msgid ""
"Bipods are commonly used on rifles and machine guns to provide a forward "
"rest and reduce motion.  Although they greatly improve handling of recoil, "
"they are usable only on certain surfaces (or from the prone position).  This"
" one is integrated into a high end hand guard, replacing the factory hand "
"guard of your weapon, allowing for comfortable shooting with or without the "
"bipod deployed.  Currently the bipod legs are stowed."
msgstr ""
"Los bípodes son usados comúnmente en los rifles y ametralladoras, para "
"proveer de un apoyo adelante y reducir el movimiento. Aunque mejoran mucho "
"el manejo del retroceso, solo pueden usarse en ciertas superficies (o tirado"
" cuerpo a tierra). Este tiene un guardamanos integrado que reemplaza el del "
"arma, lo que te permite un disparo cómodo con y sin el bípode desplegado. En"
" este momento, las patas del bípode están guardadas."

