#: data/json/items/melee/bludgeons.json
msgid "wooden war club"
msgid_plural "wooden war clubs"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description of "monomolecular blade"
#: data/json/items/melee/fake.json
msgid ""
"A foot-long blade made from high-tech alloy and edged with bonded "
"nanocrystals."
msgstr ""
"Una cuchilla de 30 centímetros de aleación de alta tecnología, y el borde "
"con nanocristales unidos."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/melee/fake.json
msgid "monomolecular blade"
msgid_plural "monomolecular blades"
msgstr[0] "cuchilla monomolecular"
msgstr[1] "cuchillas monomoleculares"
msgstr[2] "cuchillas monomoleculares"

#. ~ Description of "butterfly sword"
#: data/json/items/melee/long_blades.json
msgid ""
"A Shaolin butterfly sword, short, with a handguard and an unusually wide "
"blade.  These are traditionally used in pairs, but just one is more than "
"enough."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "kilij"
#: data/json/items/melee/long_blades.json
msgid ""
"A Turkish sabre, the kilij is quite a bit heavier than most Middle Eastern "
"sabres and has a distinctive wide tip called a yelman, which gives it "
"vicious cutting power but means it requires a special scabbard."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "cutlass"
#: data/json/items/melee/long_blades.json
msgid ""
"A broad saber known for its use by sailors and pirates, as its short blade "
"is easy to handle in close quarters."
msgstr ""
"Es un sable ancho conocido por ser usado por marineros y piratas, ya que su "
"corta cuchilla es fácil de manejar en el combate en espacios cerrados."

#. ~ Description of "xiphos"
#: data/json/items/melee/long_blades.json
msgid "A bronze sword of ancient Greek origin."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "hollow cane"
#: data/json/items/melee/long_blades.json
msgid ""
"A cane designed to conceal a blade.  This was a popular fashion accessory "
"for the wealthy during the 18th and 19th centuries."
msgstr ""
"Es un bastón diseñado para ocultar una cuchilla. Fue un accesorio popular de"
" los ricos durante los siglos XVIII y XIX."

#. ~ Description of "kirpan"
#: data/json/items/melee/long_blades.json
msgid ""
"A ceremonial dagger carried by Sikh men.  This one is sharp and could be an "
"effective weapon."
msgstr ""
"Es una daga de ceremonia usada por los sijes. Esta es filosa y puede "
"funcionar como arma."

#. ~ Description of "longsword"
#: data/json/items/melee/long_blades.json
msgid ""
"A classic medieval sword, in between the lighter arming sword and later two-"
"handed swords in size.  It's well-balanced and surprisingly easy to use due "
"to its two-handed grip, but requires a larger baldric or scabbard compared "
"to smaller swords."
msgstr ""
"Es una clásica espada medieval de un tamaño medio entre la espada de "
"caballero que es más liviana, y la espada de dos manos. Está bien balanceada"
" y es sorprendentemente fácil de usar debido a su empuñadura de dos manos "
"pero necesita un gran tahalí o vaina, a diferencia de otras espadas más "
"chicas."

#. ~ Description of "arming sword"
#: data/json/items/melee/long_blades.json
msgid "A classic medieval sword, just the right size to use one-handed."
msgstr ""
"Es una clásica espada medieval del tamaño justo para ser usada con una sola "
"mano."

#. ~ Description of "wakizashi"
#: data/json/items/melee/long_blades.json
msgid ""
"A comparatively-common Japanese short sword.  Smaller and lighter than a "
"katana, but still effective in combat."
msgstr ""
"Es una espada corta japonesa bastante común. Más chica y liviana que una "
"katana pero es eficaz en combate."

#. ~ Description of "cavalry saber"
#: data/json/items/melee/long_blades.json
msgid ""
"A curved sword associated with cavalry from the Early Modern period onward."
"  Lightweight, but a deadly slashing weapon."
msgstr ""
"Es una espada curvada asociada a las caballerías de la Era Moderna y "
"períodos siguientes. Es un arma liviana pero con daño cortante mortal."

#. ~ Description of "scimitar"
#: data/json/items/melee/long_blades.json
msgid ""
"A curved sword associated with various Middle Eastern and Central Asian "
"countries.  Designed for slashing, and quite deadly against unarmored "
"targets."
msgstr ""
"Es una espada curvada, que se la asocia con varios países de Medio Oriente y"
" de Asia Central. Diseñada para hacer daño cortante, y bastante letal contra"
" los objetivos sin armadura."

#. ~ Description of "talwar"
#: data/json/items/melee/long_blades.json
msgid ""
"A curved sword used by the Raj of India in the 16th century, a talwar is "
"usually impeccably decorated and able to take off a limb with a single "
"swipe."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "falx"
#: data/json/items/melee/long_blades.json
msgid ""
"A distinct Dacian sword that curves forward, allowing you to bypass shields "
"or hook and pull enemies, while delivering decent chopping damage."
msgstr ""
"Es una distintiva espada dacia que se curva hacia adelante permitiéndote "
"superar escudos o enganchar al enemigo, y a la vez posee un daño de corte "
"decente."

#. ~ Description of "glass shiv"
#: data/json/items/melee/long_blades.json
msgid "A glass shard with wrapping at one end so it can be safely wielded."
msgstr ""
"Es un fragmento de vidrio con una punta envuelta con un trapo para que pueda"
" ser empuñado fácilmente."

#. ~ Description of "crude sword"
#: data/json/items/melee/long_blades.json
msgid ""
"A hand-forged approximation of a medieval weapon.  It's certainly sharp "
"enough to get the job done, but the simplistic design is clearly inferior to"
" the real thing."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "zweihänder"
#: data/json/items/melee/long_blades.json
msgid "A huge two-handed sword from Germany.  It packs a real wallop."
msgstr ""
"Es una enorme espada de dos manos alemana. Es capaz de golpear muy fuerte."

#. ~ Description of "makeshift machete"
#: data/json/items/melee/long_blades.json
msgid ""
"A large blade with one end wrapped in duct tape to make a crude handle, "
"making it easier to wield as a rough machete."
msgstr ""
"Es una gran cuchilla con una punta envuelta con cinta adhesiva para "
"funcionar como mango rudimentario, haciéndola más fácil de empuñar que un "
"machete irregular."

#. ~ Description of "crude greatsword"
#: data/json/items/melee/long_blades.json
msgid ""
"A large, crudely-forged blade.  It's too big to be called a sword.  Too "
"massive, too thick, too heavy, and far too rough."
msgstr ""
"Es una cuchilla grande forjada y rudimentaria. Es demasiado grande como para"
" decirle espada. Demasiado enorme, gruesa, pesada y muy irregular."

#. ~ Description of gun mod "sword bayonet"
#. ~ Description of "sword bayonet"
#: data/json/items/melee/long_blades.json
msgid ""
"A long, knife bladed bayonet that can be attached to the front of a rifle, "
"converting it into a pike.  It is long enough to be used as a short sword "
"when unmounted."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "welded greatsword"
#: data/json/items/melee/long_blades.json
msgid ""
"A long-handled single-edged sword made out of sheet metal layered thrice "
"over itself then welded together.  The extra length and weight makes it a "
"tad awkward, but gives it a lot of slashing power."
msgstr ""
"Es una espada larga de simple filo hecha con tres láminas de metal soldadas "
"juntas. La mayor longitud y peso la hace un poco incómoda pero le da mucha "
"potencia de corte."

#. ~ Description of "wooden greatsword"
#: data/json/items/melee/long_blades.json
msgid ""
"A plank with a handle and a whittled-down point, left large enough to "
"require two hands.  It's only a facsimile of a sword, but might serve for "
"training or just knocking heads."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "wooden sword"
#: data/json/items/melee/long_blades.json
msgid ""
"A plank with a handle and a whittled-down point.  It's only a facsimile of a"
" sword, but might serve for training or just knocking heads."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "punch dagger"
#: data/json/items/melee/long_blades.json
msgid ""
"A short, sharp double-edged dagger made to be gripped in the palm, with the "
"blade protruding between the fingers."
msgstr ""
"Es una daga corta y de doble filo hecha para ser agarrada con la palma para "
"que la cuchilla quede sobresaliendo entre los dedos."

#. ~ Description of "bronze sword"
#: data/json/items/melee/long_blades.json
msgid "A simple short sword made of bronze."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "kriegsmesser"
#: data/json/items/melee/long_blades.json
msgid ""
"A single-edged two-handed sword of German design, with a long, curved blade."
"  It became popular across Europe due to its low cost while maintaining "
"strong cutting power in comparison to the more sophisticated longsword."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "katana"
#: data/json/items/melee/long_blades.json
msgid ""
"A slightly curved sword from Japan, world-famous for its artistic design and"
" association with the age of the samurai."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "broadsword"
#: data/json/items/melee/long_blades.json
msgid ""
"A straight sword that was ubiquitous during the Early Modern era, with a "
"wide blade suitable for slashing or stabbing.  These were called \"broad\" "
"to contrast with the slimmer rapiers of the day."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "sword cane"
#: data/json/items/melee/long_blades.json
msgid "A sword with a thin blade designed to be hidden inside a hollow cane."
msgstr ""
"Es una espada de cuchilla fina diseñada para estar ocultada dentro de un "
"bastón hueco."

#. ~ Description of "rapier"
#: data/json/items/melee/long_blades.json
msgid ""
"A thin, straight sword of the type once preferred by musketeers, masked "
"gentlemen, and swashbucklers of all sorts."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "machete multitool"
#: data/json/items/melee/long_blades.json
msgid ""
"A thin, wobbly steel blade with sawteeth on one side and a flat chisel tip "
"for digging.  More of a jackass of all trades than a jack of them."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "karambit"
#: data/json/items/melee/long_blades.json
msgid ""
"A traditional Indonesian knife.  The blade is very short, but its curved "
"design is perfect for precision attacks."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "nodachi"
#: data/json/items/melee/long_blades.json
msgid "A two-handed sword from Japan resembling an extremely long katana."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "welded sword"
#: data/json/items/melee/long_blades.json
msgid ""
"A vicious single-edged sword made out of sheet metal layered twice over "
"itself then welded together.  It's not as robust as a proper forged sword, "
"but the edge is wickedly sharp."
msgstr ""
"Es una espada despiadada de filo simple hecha con dos láminas de metal "
"soldadas juntas. No es tan robusta como una espada forjada pero es "
"maliciosamente filosa."

#. ~ Description of "fencing foil"
#: data/json/items/melee/long_blades.json
msgid ""
"A weapon used for fencing, the most noble of all sports.  Unfortunately, a "
"fencing foil is rather useless as a weapon due to its flexible shaft and "
"dull tip."
msgstr ""
"Es un arma utilizada en el esgrima, el más noble de todos los deportes. "
"Lamentablemente, un florete de esgrima es bastante inútil como arma debido a"
" su hoja flexible y punta sin filo."

#. ~ Description of "fencing épée"
#: data/json/items/melee/long_blades.json
msgid ""
"A weapon used for fencing, the most noble of all sports.  While not designed"
" for combat the épée is the heaviest and stiffest of the fencing weapons, "
"and therefore perhaps still useful in your situation."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "estoc"
#: data/json/items/melee/long_blades.json
msgid ""
"Also called a tuck, the estoc is a very long thrusting sword designed for "
"piercing armor on the battlefield."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "jian"
#: data/json/items/melee/long_blades.json
msgid ""
"An ancient Chinese doubled-edged straight sword, with an ornate guard and a "
"tassel attached to the pommel.  One of the four major weapons in folklore, "
"alongside the dao sabre, qiang spear, and gun staff."
msgstr ""
"Es una antigua espada china recta de doble filo, con la guarda ornamentada y"
" una borla unida al pomo. Una de las cuatro armas principales de su "
"tradición, junto con el sable dao, la lanza qiang y el bastón gun."

#. ~ Description of "dao"
#: data/json/items/melee/long_blades.json
msgid ""
"An ancient Chinese saber consisting of a curved blade and a guard with a "
"cupped design.  This one is made of bronze."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of gun mod "Type 30 bayonet"
#. ~ Description of "Type 30 bayonet"
#: data/json/items/melee/long_blades.json
msgid ""
"An essential tool within any 20th-century Japanese soldier's toolbox, the "
"Type 30 is a massive, single-edged sword-style bayonet intended for use with"
" Arisaka rifles and even light machineguns.  Possessing a J-shaped quillon "
"guard for hooking an opponent's weapon during combat, the bayonet, when "
"dismounted, acts like a particularly sizable machete."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "tanto"
#: data/json/items/melee/long_blades.json
msgid ""
"An ornate knife that dates back to the Heian period in Japan.  Originally a "
"backup weapon for samurai, these blades took on a ceremonial purpose, "
"becoming the instrument used for seppuku."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Gun mod name
#: data/json/items/melee/long_blades.json
msgid "Enfield No. 4 bayonet"
msgid_plural "Enfield No. 4 bayonets"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description of "razorbar katar"
#: data/json/items/melee/long_blades.json
msgid ""
"Five pieces of rebar sharpened to cruel points and strapped to a brace "
"fastened at the wrist and forearm on both arms.  The next bub better watch "
"out."
msgstr ""
"Son cinco pedazos de varilla corrugada afilados y unidos a brazales que se "
"ajustan a la muñeca y el antebrazo de los dos brazos. El próximo chabón se "
"va a tener que cuidar mucho."

#. ~ Description of "electrified foil"
#: data/json/items/melee/long_blades.json
msgid ""
"The modifications made to this fencing foil may not be sporting, but they "
"might give you an edge in this final competition.  Extra effort has been "
"made to insulate the grip and a high voltage stun gun has been attached to "
"the guard, wired through the electronic scoring circuit to the tip.  "
"Thrusting the sharpened tip into a foe and activating the momentary switch "
"will deliver a painful electric shock."
msgstr ""
"Las modificaciones hechas en este florete de esgrima pueden no hacerla "
"adecuada para el deporte, pero te dan ventaja en esta competición final. Se "
"le ha aislado la empuñadura y se le ha agregado un arma de alto voltaje a la"
" guarda, conectado a través de un circuito electrónico a la punta. Al tocar "
"a un enemigo con la punta se activará momentáneamente el interruptor para "
"causar un doloroso choque eléctrico."

#. ~ Description of "electrified saber"
#: data/json/items/melee/long_blades.json
msgid ""
"The modifications made to this fencing saber may not be sporting, but they "
"might give you an edge in this final competition.  Extra effort has been "
"made to insulate the grip and a high voltage stun gun has been attached to "
"the guard, wired to the tip along the saber's groove.  Thrusting the "
"sharpened tip into a foe and activating the momentary switch will deliver a "
"painful electric shock."
msgstr ""
"Las modificaciones hechas en este sable de esgrima pueden no hacerla "
"adecuada para el deporte, pero te dan ventaja en esta competición final. Se "
"le ha aislado la empuñadura y se le ha agregado un arma de alto voltaje a la"
" guarda, conectado a la punta y al canal del sable. Al tocar a un enemigo "
"con la punta se activará momentáneamente el interruptor para causar un "
"doloroso choque eléctrico."

#. ~ Description of "electrified épée"
#: data/json/items/melee/long_blades.json
msgid ""
"The modifications made to this fencing épée may not be sporting, but they "
"might give you an edge in this final competition.  Extra effort has been "
"made to insulate the grip and a high voltage stun gun has been attached to "
"the guard, wired through the electronic scoring circuit to the tip.  "
"Thrusting the sharpened tip into a foe and activating the momentary switch "
"will deliver a painful electric shock."
msgstr ""
"Las modificaciones hechas en este épée de esgrima pueden no hacerla adecuada"
" para el deporte, pero te dan ventaja en esta competición final. Se le ha "
"aislado la empuñadura y se le ha agregado un arma de alto voltaje a la "
"guarda, conectado a través de un circuito electrónico a la punta. Al tocar a"
" un enemigo con la punta se activará momentáneamente el interruptor para "
"causar un doloroso choque eléctrico."

#. ~ Description of "khopesh"
#: data/json/items/melee/long_blades.json
msgid ""
"This ancient bronze weapon features a curved, sickle-like blade sharpened on"
" the outside edge.  Associated with the New Kingdom period of Ancient Egypt,"
" it was designed mainly to hack through the light armor common to the "
"region."
msgstr ""
"Esta antigua arma de bronce posee una cuchilla curva, como una hoz, afilada "
"en su parte externa. Se la asocia con el período del Nuevo Reino del Antiguo"
" Egipto, fue diseñada principalmente para penetrar la armadura ligera, común"
" en esa región."

#. ~ Description of "machete"
#: data/json/items/melee/long_blades.json
msgid ""
"This intimidating blade makes an excellent tool for chopping through "
"vegetation, or anything else you don't want in your yard."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of gun mod "Enfield No. 4 bayonet"
#. ~ Description of "Enfield No. 4 bayonet"
#: data/json/items/melee/long_blades.json
msgid ""
"This is a vintage spike bayonet for the British Lee Enfield No. 4 rifle, "
"featuring a distinct cruciform blade and socket-based mounting system."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Gun mod name
#: data/json/items/melee/long_blades.json
msgid "Type 30 bayonet"
msgid_plural "Type 30 bayonets"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description of "fencing saber"
#: data/json/items/melee/long_blades.json
msgid ""
"Unlike most cavalry sabers, the fencing saber is straight, and stouter than "
"the foil or épée.  Designed for sport rather than real combat, it has a "
"rounded tip and dull edges."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "sharpened foil"
#: data/json/items/melee/long_blades.json
msgid ""
"What was once a mostly-harmless fencing foil has had its electrical plunger "
"assembly removed and has been crudely sharpened to a point.  Though it still"
" lacks a cutting edge, it is now somewhat more lethal, yet still familiar to"
" the practiced fencer."
msgstr ""
"A esto que alguna vez fue un inofensivo florete de esgrima, le han quitado "
"el émbolo eléctrico y le afilaron la punta. Aunque no tiene un filo "
"cortante, es de alguna manera más letal, aunque igual será más útil para un "
"esgrimista experimentado."

#. ~ Description of "sharpened saber"
#: data/json/items/melee/long_blades.json
msgid ""
"What was once a mostly-harmless fencing saber has had its rounded tip "
"snapped off and has been crudely sharpened to a point.  Though it still "
"lacks a cutting edge, it is now considerably more lethal, yet still familiar"
" to the practiced fencer."
msgstr ""
"A esto que alguna vez fue un inofensivo sable de esgrima, le han quitado la "
"punta redonda y le afilaron la punta. Aunque no tiene un filo cortante, es "
"bastante más letal pero igual será más útil para un esgrimista "
"experimentado."

#. ~ Description of "sharpened épée"
#: data/json/items/melee/long_blades.json
msgid ""
"What was once a mostly-harmless fencing épée has had its electrical plunger "
"assembly removed and has been crudely sharpened to a point.  Though it still"
" lacks a cutting edge, it is now considerably more lethal, yet still "
"familiar to the practiced fencer."
msgstr ""
"A esto que alguna vez fue un inofensivo épée de esgrima, le han quitado el "
"émbolo eléctrico y le afilaron la punta. Aunque no tiene un filo cortante, "
"es bastante más letal pero igual será más útil para un esgrimista "
"experimentado."

