#. ~ Description of variant "AK bayonet"of gun mod "Bayonet"
#. ~ Description of variant "AK bayonet" of item "Bayonet"
#: data/json/items/melee/short_blades.json
msgid ""
"A 6H4 bayonet for Kalashnikov pattern rifles, usually imported military "
"surplus from eastern bloc countries.  The blade is made of stainless steel "
"and the handle of a lightweight and durable plastic.  It features a middling"
" metal saw on the spine of the blade, and can function as a wire cutter as "
"well.  Though it is quite sturdy, it can't hold an edge very well."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of gun mod "National Guard bayonet"
#. ~ Description of "National Guard bayonet"
#: data/json/items/melee/short_blades.json
msgid ""
"A Cold War era Army bayonet that has only partially been replaced by newer "
"models.  It has an apocalypse-proof full-tang, double-edged high steel blade"
" terminating in a spear point.  The no-frills design makes for both a good "
"fighting knife and bayonet, a fact that was appreciated when reserve stocks "
"of these were issued out to National Guardsmen."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "bronze knife"
#: data/json/items/melee/short_blades.json
msgid ""
"A cast bronze knife with a full tang, with a handle wrapped in cord and "
"leather, work-hardened and sharpened to a fine edge."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "bone shiv"
#: data/json/items/melee/short_blades.json
msgid ""
"A femur or other bone, about 20 cm long, which has been broken at one end "
"and sharpened into a cutting tool.  Its jagged edge is wicked but fragile."
msgstr ""
"Es un fémur o un hueso similar de unos 20 cm de largo, que ha sido partido "
"en la punta y afilado. Si filo dentado parece malvado pero frágil."

#. ~ Description of a pocket in item "survival knife"
#: data/json/items/melee/short_blades.json
msgid "A hidden handle compartment.  Unscrew the compass to access."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "makeshift knife"
#: data/json/items/melee/short_blades.json
msgid ""
"A knife consisting of a long, somewhat sharpened spike and a tightly-wrapped"
" rag as a handle.  Not as good as a real knife, but it'll do in a pinch."
msgstr ""
"Es un cuchillo que consiste en una punta larga y más o menos filosa, y un "
"trapo fuertemente enrollado que funciona de empuñadura. No es como un "
"cuchillo de en serio pero zafa."

#. ~ Description of "copper knife"
#: data/json/items/melee/short_blades.json
msgid ""
"A knife made of crudely-worked copper with a simple handle.  Primitive, but "
"a step above stone-age."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "switchblade"
#: data/json/items/melee/short_blades.json
msgid ""
"A long, thin knife with a spring-loaded blade that rests inside the handle "
"while not in use."
msgstr ""
"Es un cuchillo largo y fino con una hoja que se oculta dentro de la "
"empuñadura cuando no está en uso y sale por la acción de un resorte."

#. ~ Description of "carving knife"
#: data/json/items/melee/short_blades.json
msgid ""
"A long-bladed kitchen knife with a thin, slightly curved blade for deftly "
"slicing meat either in flat sheets or around the bone.  It makes a decent "
"melee weapon, and is excellent for butchery."
msgstr ""
"Es un cuchillo de cocina de hoja larga, fina y curva para poder cortar carne"
" en fetas o para deshuesar. Es un arma decente para el cuerpo a cuerpo pero "
"es excelente para carnear."

#. ~ Description of "chef knife"
#: data/json/items/melee/short_blades.json
msgid ""
"A long-bladed kitchen knife.  The blade is wider than the handle, giving "
"room for the wielder's knuckles, and it has a characteristic curve for a "
"fast rocking action for chopping vegetables.  It makes an acceptable melee "
"weapon, but the wide blade is unwieldy for butchering."
msgstr ""
"Es un cuchillo de cocina con una hoja larga. La hoja es más ancha que la "
"empuñadura, tiene espacio para los nudillos y una curva característica que "
"permite cortar verduras a gran velocidad. Como arma de cuerpo a cuerpo "
"funciona aceptablemente pero la cuchilla ancha es un poco incómoda para "
"carnear."

#. ~ Description of "baselard"
#: data/json/items/melee/short_blades.json
msgid ""
"A medieval dagger forged from rough iron.  It is not the sharpest tool in "
"the shed, but it is certainly one of the largest."
msgstr ""
"Es una daga medieval frojada de hierro forjado. No es la herramienta más "
"filosa de todas pero es una de las más grandes."

#. ~ Description of "vegetable cleaver"
#: data/json/items/melee/short_blades.json
msgid ""
"A menacing-looking knife with a broad, square shaped blade, curved for fast "
"vegetable chopping.  Its heft and sharpness make it a decent weapon as well,"
" although not as good as a meat cleaver."
msgstr ""
"Es un cuchillo de aspecto amenazante con una hoja ancha, medio cuadrada y "
"curva para cortar verduras de manera rápida. Su peso y filo la convierten en"
" una decente arma de cuerpo a cuerpo aunque no tan buena como una cuchilla "
"de carnicero."

#. ~ Description of "meat cleaver"
#: data/json/items/melee/short_blades.json
msgid ""
"A menacing-looking knife with a broad, square-shaped blade.  Its heft and "
"sharpness would make it a very effective melee weapon and an excellent "
"butchering tool."
msgstr ""
"Es un cuchillo de aspecto amenazante con una hoja ancha, medio cuadrada y "
"curva. Su peso y filo la convierten en un arma de cuerpo a cuerpo muy "
"efectivo, y una excelente herramienta para carnear."

#. ~ Description of gun mod "USMC bayonet"
#. ~ Description of "USMC bayonet"
#: data/json/items/melee/short_blades.json
msgid ""
"A modern bayonet in use with the US Marine Corps, adopted in an effort to "
"improve USMC hand-to-hand fighting capabilities.  The bayonet is optimized "
"to function as a fighting knife, sporting an ergonomic handle that will "
"minimize hand fatigue during combat.  The blade tip is sharper in profile "
"than other bayonets to assist in penetrating body armor, and also features a"
" small serrated section to provide for some utility."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "stone chopper"
#: data/json/items/melee/short_blades.json
msgid ""
"A rock with sharpened edges, produced by knapping.  Works as a crude cutting"
" and butchering tool, if nothing else is available."
msgstr ""
"Es una piedra con los bordes filosos, producida mediante tallado. Funciona "
"como una herramienta primitiva para cortar y carnear, si no hay nada mejor "
"disponible."

#. ~ Description of "steak knife"
#: data/json/items/melee/short_blades.json
msgid ""
"A sharp knife designed for cutting meat.  It makes a poor melee weapon, but "
"is decent at butchering corpses."
msgstr ""
"Es un cuchillo filoso diseñado para cortar carne. No sirve mucho como arma "
"de cuerpo a cuerpo pero es decente para carnear cadáveres."

#. ~ Description of "butcher knife"
#: data/json/items/melee/short_blades.json
msgid ""
"A sharp, heavy knife.  It makes a good melee weapon, and is an ideal item "
"for butchering corpses."
msgstr ""
"Es un cuchillo grande y filoso. Sirve bien como arma de cuerpo a cuerpo y es"
" ideal para carnear cadáveres."

#. ~ Description of "honey scraper"
#: data/json/items/melee/short_blades.json
msgid ""
"A sharp, knife-like tool used for harvesting honey from beehives.  Makes a "
"passable melee weapon."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "stone knife"
#: data/json/items/melee/short_blades.json
msgid ""
"A sharpened stone set into a hollowed handle.  Not nearly as usable as a "
"proper knife, but it's better than nothing."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "dive knife"
#: data/json/items/melee/short_blades.json
msgid ""
"A short, sturdy knife with a serrated edge for cutting lines and straps, and"
" a blunt tip for prying.  Used primarily by divers, this knife has been "
"fitted with cork to slow its descent if dropped underwater, so it takes up "
"more space than usual."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "paring knife"
#: data/json/items/melee/short_blades.json
msgid ""
"A short-bladed knife with a sharp blade, made for fine controlled cuts to "
"vegetables without using a cutting board."
msgstr ""
"Es un cuchillo con una hoja corta y filosa, hecha para cortes finos y "
"controlados de vegetales sin necesidad de una tabla de cortar."

#. ~ Description of "folding knife"
#: data/json/items/melee/short_blades.json
msgid ""
"A small folding knife with a locking blade and a pocket clip.  Not as good a"
" weapon as a solid fixed-blade knife, but better than a penknife."
msgstr ""
"Es un pequeño cuchillo plegable, con traba para la hoja y gancho para "
"colgarlo del cinto. No es tan buena arma como los que tienen cuchilla fija "
"pero es mejor que una navaja."

#. ~ Description of "boxcutter knife"
#: data/json/items/melee/short_blades.json
msgid ""
"A small knife designed for opening boxes.  It could cause some damage, but "
"it really should be used against inanimate objects.  It is too small to "
"effectively butcher corpses with."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "pocket knife"
#: data/json/items/melee/short_blades.json
msgid ""
"A small pocket knife.  It isn't great for combat, but it's better than "
"nothing.  It's sharp enough to butcher with."
msgstr ""

