#. ~ Description of "oil-powered manual oil press"
#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
msgid ""
"A barrel with a large screw press for creating vegetable oil.  A kerosene "
"cooker heats the raw material to increase extraction efficiency."
msgstr ""
"Es un tanque con una prensa de tornillo grande para fabricar aceite vegetal."
" Una cocina de querosén calienta el material crudo para incrementar la "
"extracción."

#. ~ Description of "water purifier"
#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
msgid ""
"A battery-powered device designed to purify drinking water.  Using this item"
" on a container full of water will purify the contents.  It could be useful "
"for water taken from uncertain sources like a river, as it may be non-"
"potable."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "heat pack"
#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
msgid ""
"A chemical heat pack, used to treat sports injuries and heat food.  It is "
"usable only once."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "used heat pack"
#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
msgid ""
"A chemical heat pack, used to treat sports injuries and heat food.  This one"
" has been used up and is chemically inert, rendering it useless."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "clay teapot"
#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
msgid "A clay teapot.  Now all you need is tea and water."
msgstr ""
"Es una tetera de arcilla. Ahora lo único que necesitás es té y agua, porque "
"mate no creo que encontrés."

#. ~ Description of "clay pot"
#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
msgid "A crude clay pot with a lid, used for cooking."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "can sealer"
#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
msgid ""
"A hand-crank-powered cast steel machine designed to automatically seal tin "
"cans."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "manual oil press"
#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
msgid ""
"A hand-cranked press for creating vegetable oil.  A hotplate heats the raw "
"material to increase extraction efficiency."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "coffeemaker"
#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
msgid ""
"A heating element with a pot and a frame for holding coffee or other "
"powders.  You can use it to make coffee, or other drinks if you so choose."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "induction hotplate"
#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
msgid ""
"A high end hotplate that utilizes magnetic induction coils to heat ferrous "
"cookware directly.  It is far more efficient than a standard hotplate."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "microwave"
#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
msgid "A home microwave, has probably seen its share of baked beans."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "makeshift vacuum sealer"
#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
msgid ""
"A homemade heat sealer unit with an air pump.  It's used for vacuum packing "
"food to preserve it."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "survivor mess kit"
#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
msgid ""
"A homemade mess kit containing everything you might need for creating post-"
"apocalyptic cuisine.  Powered by a kerosene burner, it is composed of simple"
" yet durable tools and materials."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "butchering kit"
#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
msgid ""
"A kit containing all the specialized knives you need to debone, skin, and "
"prepare cuts of meat from an animal."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "food processor"
#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
msgid ""
"A kitchen appliance capable of slicing, chopping, shredding, grinding, "
"pureeing, and mixing."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "makeshift pressure cooker"
#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
msgid ""
"A large pot with 20 gauge walls and a thick aluminum bottom, modified to "
"serve as a bulky but passable pressure cooker."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "still"
#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
msgid ""
"A large still, useful for creating distillations of alcohol and other, more "
"curious substances.  Features a slot for a thermometer."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "hexamine stove"
#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
msgid ""
"A lightweight, folding stove designed to use small hexamine tablets for "
"cooking.  Also known as an Esbit stove."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "coal/charcoal cooker"
#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
msgid ""
"A little metal tank for holding coal or charcoal, with a pilot light "
"attached and a pipe to vent toxic coal fumes.  You could use it for cooking "
"food."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "pasta extruder"
#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
msgid ""
"A pasta extruder powered by a hand crank.  Useful in making pasta.  It comes"
" with various heads to make various kinds of pasta."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "charcoal smoker"
#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
msgid ""
"A portable charcoal smoker.  Good for weekend barbecuing and preserving meat"
" with smoke.  Cannot be used with coal; the toxic fumes would ruin the meat."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "vacuum sealer"
#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
msgid ""
"A portable heat sealer unit with an air pump.  It's used for vacuum packing "
"food to preserve it."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "wicker sieve"
#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
msgid ""
"A primitive sieve constructed from woven strips of plant material.  Early "
"sieves like this were used to sift grain, though the openings on this one "
"are too small for that."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "pressure cooker"
#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
msgid ""
"A sealable pot, designed to cook food at higher pressures and temperatures."
"  Useful for all kinds of cooking, and it can also be used for pressure-"
"sensitive chemical reactions."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "sealed yeast culture"
#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
#: data/json/obsoletion_and_migration/obsoletion.json
msgid ""
"A sealed jar holding sanitized yeast wort.  You may harvest the yeast inside"
" when it's done culturing."
msgstr ""
"Es una jarra sellada que tiene mosto desinfectado de levadura. Podés "
"recolectar la levadura de su interior cuando esté lista para cosechar."

#. ~ Description of "mess kit"
#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
msgid ""
"A self-contained camping mess kit, containing everything you might need for "
"wilderness cooking."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "mortar and pestle"
#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
msgid ""
"A simple combination of a small grindstone and a bowl-shaped stone.  Used "
"for grinding grain, but time-consuming compared to more complex methods."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "stone quern"
#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
msgid ""
"A simple hand-powered stone quern with a wooden handle, for grinding grain."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "acetylene cooker"
#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
msgid ""
"A simple heater powered by acetylene welding gas.  It is designed for "
"cooking food."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "biogas cooker"
#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
msgid "A simple heater powered by biogas.  It is designed for cooking food."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "gasoline cooker"
#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
msgid "A simple heater powered by gasoline.  It is designed for cooking food."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "kerosene cooker"
#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
msgid "A simple heater powered by kerosene.  It is designed for cooking food."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "propane cooker"
#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
msgid "A simple heater powered by propane.  It is designed for cooking food."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "hotplate"
#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
msgid ""
"A small heating element on a stand, powered by your electric grid.  It is "
"indispensable for cooking and chemistry.  Try not to burn yourself."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "teapot"
#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
msgid "A small metal teapot.  Teatime wouldn't be complete without one."
msgstr ""
"Es una pequeña tetera de metal. Si te querés tomar un té, la vas a "
"necesitar. Mate no creo que encontrés. Yerba sí, pero de otra clase."

#. ~ Description of "toaster"
#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
msgid ""
"A small two-slice toaster, can be used to toast toast and few other things."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "waffle iron"
#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
msgid "A waffle iron, generally used for making waffles."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "food dehydrator"
#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
msgid ""
"An electric food dehydrator, invaluable in preserving food.  Can be "
"connected to the electric grid using cord."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "electric carver (off)"
#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
msgid ""
"An electric meat carver powered by a cable.  It has two serrated blades that"
" vibrate together to slice just about anything from turkey to ham."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "slow-sand water filter"
#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"An improvised water filter made from a plastic bucket filled with a layer of"
" sand and a layer of gravel.  It can be used to remove particulates and some"
" pathogens from water, but it is not 100% effective."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "soda can stove kit"
#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
msgid ""
"An ultra-light alcohol-burning stove with a simmer ring, crafted by hand "
"from a couple of aluminum soda cans.  It comes with a 500 mL plastic bottle "
"to hold concentrated alcohol fuel."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "makeshift sieve"
#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
msgid ""
"Some fine steel mesh attached to a length of thicker steel wire, forming a "
"rigid frame.  Useful for sieving."
msgstr ""

#. ~ value of variable 'sound_message' in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_toolweapon_running__carver" in use action of item "electric carver
#. (on)"
#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
msgid "The electric carver buzzes."
msgstr ""

#. ~ value of variable 'success_message' in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_toolweapon_activate__carver" in use action of item "electric carver
#. (off)"
#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
msgid "The electric carver's serrated blades start buzzing!"
msgstr "¡Las cuchillas dentadas del cuchillo eléctrico empiezan a zumbar!"

#. ~ Description of "electric carver (on)"
#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
msgid "This carver is on and the blades are buzzing.  Use it to turn it off."
msgstr ""
"Este cuchillo está encendido y las cuchillas están vibrando. Se puede apagar"
" con el comando Usar."

#. ~ Description of "atomic coffeemaker"
#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
msgid ""
"This is a Curie-G coffeemaker, by CuppaTech.  It famously uses a radioactive"
" generator to heat water for coffee, reducing the amount of total "
"electricity it consumes.  Consumer safety concerns led to it being banned in"
" the EU as well as many other countries, but don't let that stop you from "
"brewing your morning Joe with the power of the atom™!"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "screw press"
#. ~ Description of "nearby warp obelisk"
#. ~ Description of "nearby infinity tree"
#. ~ Description of "nearby infinity stone"
#. ~ Description of "nearby infinity ore"
#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/furniture_and_terrain.json
msgid "This is a crafting_pseudo_item if you have it something is wrong."
msgstr "Esto es un crafting_pseudo_item si te aparece algo anduvo mal."

#. ~ Description of "sieve"
#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
msgid ""
"This is no mere strainer for noodles; it's a laboratory-grade sieve used to "
"separate particles of certain sizes.  You could use this to do a really good"
" job sifting flour, remove dust and soil from grain, or perhaps conduct "
"gradation tests for any civil engineers you might know.  This one has been "
"constructed from steel mesh."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "fermenting eggs jar"
#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
#: data/json/obsoletion_and_migration/obsoletion.json
msgid ""
"This jar contains a batch of eggs in a pickling solution.  You can seal up "
"the jar once the process is completed."
msgstr ""
"Este frasco contiene una tanda de huevos en escabeche. Podés sellar el jarro"
" una vez que se complete el proceso de fermentación."

#. ~ Description of "fermenting pickle jar"
#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
#: data/json/obsoletion_and_migration/obsoletion.json
msgid ""
"This jar contains a batch of pickles set to ferment.  You can seal up the "
"jar once the process is completed."
msgstr ""
"Este frasco contiene una tanda de pickles preparados para fermentar. Podés "
"sellar la jarra una vez que el proceso termine."

#. ~ Description of "fermenting sauerkraut jar"
#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
#: data/json/obsoletion_and_migration/obsoletion.json
msgid ""
"This jar contains a batch of sauerkraut set to ferment.  You can seal up the"
" jar once the process is completed."
msgstr ""
"Este frasco contiene una tanda de chucrut preparada para fermentar. Podés "
"sellar la jarra una vez que el proceso termine."

#. ~ Description of "milk cream jar"
#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
msgid ""
"This jar contains raw milk separated into cream.  It is sealed until you are"
" ready to use it."
msgstr ""
"Este frasco contiene leche cruda hecha crema. Está sellado hasta que lo "
"quieras usar."

#. ~ Description of "rising cream jar"
#. ~ Description of "rising cream jar (obsolete)"
#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
#: data/json/obsoletion_and_migration/obsoletion.json
msgid ""
"This jar contains raw milk separating into cream.  You can seal up the jar "
"once the process is completed."
msgstr ""
"Este frasco contiene leche cruda haciéndose crema. Podés sellar el jarro una"
" vez que el proceso esté terminado."

#. ~ Description of "charcoal water purifier"
#. ~ Description of "large charcoal water purifier"
#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
msgid ""
"Using this item on a container full of water will purify the water using "
"layered charcoal.  Once the charcoal has purified enough water, it will "
"become unusable and can be disassembled and recycled.  Water taken from "
"uncertain sources like a river may be dirty."
msgstr ""
"Al usar este objeto en un recipiente lleno de agua, vas a potabilizar el "
"agua usando capas de carbón. Una vez que el carbón purificó suficiente agua,"
" empezará a volverse inutilizable y puede ser desarmado y reciclado. El agua"
" recogida de fuentes inseguras como los ríos, puede estar sucia."

#. ~ value of variable 'failure_message' in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_toolweapon_activate__carver" in use action of item "electric carver
#. (off)"
#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
msgid "You pull the trigger, but nothing happens."
msgstr "Apretás el gatillo, pero no pasa nada."

