"By disregarding offense in favor of defense, you are better at protecting yourself.\n"
"\n"
"Effects lost if downed, stunned, or staggered.\n"
"Blocked damage reduced by 100% of Dexterity, +2 blocking effectiveness, +1 Dodge ability."
