#. ~ Description of monster "flying bird abstract"
#: data/json/monsters/bird.json
msgid ""
"This is an abstract monsters for other wild flying birds to copy from, so "
"that we have some common foundation to work with.  If it appears in the game"
" that's a bug."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of monster "bloated corvid"
#: data/json/monsters/bird.json
msgid ""
"This may have once been a crow or a raven, but now it's a deformed "
"monstrosity nearly the size of a man.  It heaves its sable bulk awkwardly "
"along the ground, too overfed on carrion to fly."
msgstr ""
"Esto puede haber sido alguna vez un cuervo pero ahora es una monstruosidad "
"deformada casi del tamaño de un humano. Va arrastrando torpemente de su "
"corpulencia negra azabache por el suelo, demasiado alimentado en carroña "
"como para volar."

