msgid ""
"A small quadcopter drone, it has a camera and speaker visible.  It patrols "
"the surrounding area in a regular manner, continuously scanning individuals "
"it encounters even if there is hardly anything left of them."
msgstr ""
"Es un pequeño dron cuadrirrotor con una cámara y un parlante visible. "
"Patrulla el área de una manera regular, escaneando constantemente a los "
"individuos que encuentra incluso aunque solo quedara algo de ellos."

