#. ~ Description of monster "dog"
#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
msgid ""
"A (usually) four-legged omnivorous mammal, man's best friend since time "
"immemorial.  This specimen is of average size, like a labrador or a pit "
"bull."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of monster "llama calf"
#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
msgid ""
"A baby llama.  Unlike their parents, the calves tend to be more friendly in "
"demeanor."
msgstr ""
"Es la cría de una llama. A diferencia de sus padres, tienden a tener un "
"comportamiento más amistoso."

#. ~ Description of monster "wild bunny"
#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
msgid ""
"A baby rabbit with a cute wiggling nose and long ears.  It is extremely "
"skittish."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of monster "bunny"
#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
msgid ""
"A baby rabbit with a cute wiggling nose and long ears.  This one is of the "
"domesticated variety, commonly kept as a pet, a research subject, or a "
"source of food."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of monster "llama"
#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
msgid ""
"A big and wooly herbivore domesticated by the Andean cultures of South "
"America.  Llamas and their kin are distant relatives to camels and are "
"adapted to mountain environments."
msgstr ""
"Es un herbívoro grande y lanudo domesticado por las culturas andinas de "
"América del Sur. Las llamas son parientes lejanas de los camellos y están "
"adaptados a las montañas."

#. ~ Description of monster "kitten"
#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
msgid "A cuddly kitten scampering amid the ruins of human civilization."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of monster "wolf"
#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
msgid ""
"A cunning pack predator, once extinct in the New England area, the wolf was "
"successfully reintroduced and their numbers reached record highs in the "
"decade before the Cataclysm.  Lucky you."
msgstr ""
"Es un astuto depredador de manada, alguna vez extinto en el área de New "
"England. El lobo fue reintroducido exitosamente y su población alcanzó "
"números récord en la década previa al Cataclismo. Qué bueno..."

#. ~ Description of monster "guard dog"
#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
msgid ""
"A dog of intimidating size and bearing, it looks like it's had some training"
" and could be fairly dangerous."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of monster "fancy rat"
#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
msgid ""
"A domesticated Norway rat, bred by rat fanciers to be far less skittish than"
" the wild type.  These clever animals were omnipresent in modern biomedical "
"research, and were commonly kept as pets."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of monster "pig"
#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
msgid ""
"A domesticated omnivore descended from the wild boar, intelligent and "
"inquisitive.  Left to its own devices, it has gone feral."
msgstr ""
"Es un omnívoro domesticado que desciende del jabalí salvaje. Es inteligente "
"y curioso. Dejado a su propio cuidado, se ha vuelto salvaje."

#. ~ Description of monster "piglet"
#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
msgid ""
"A domesticated omnivore descended from the wild boar, intelligent and "
"inquisitive.  Left to its own devices, it has gone feral.  Unlike the fully "
"grown version, this juvenile can be tamed."
msgstr ""
"Es un omnívoro domesticado que desciende del jabalí salvaje. Es inteligente "
"y curioso. Dejado a su propio cuidado, se ha vuelto salvaje. A diferencia de"
" su familiar adulto, esta cría puede ser amaestrado."

#. ~ Description of monster "great tusked moose"
#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
msgid ""
"A gargantuan ungulate sporting a huge rack of antlers and a pair of curving "
"tusks.  It tosses its head as it stampedes across the landscape, spattering "
"foam from its quivering jaw."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of monster "goat"
#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
msgid ""
"A hooved browsing mammal known for climbing and eating just about anything."
"  Either gender can have horns."
msgstr ""
"Es un mamífero folívoro y con pezuñas conocido por trepar y comer casi "
"cualquier cosa. Cualquiera de los dos géneros puede tener cuernos."

#. ~ Description of monster "kid"
#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
msgid ""
"A hooved browsing mammal known for climbing and eating just about anything."
"  The young are famously cute and cuddly."
msgstr ""
"Es un mamífero folívoro y con pezuñas conocido por trepar y comer casi "
"cualquier cosa. Los más jóvenes son lindos y adorables."

#. ~ Description of monster "horse"
#. ~ Description of monster "Scott's horse"
#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_domestic.json
msgid ""
"A hooved grazing mammal with a mane of hair, a sweeping tail, and powerful-"
"looking muscles.  A stalwart companion to humans for longer than recorded "
"history, with some effort you should be able to get this one to trust you "
"enough to ride it."
msgstr ""
"Es un mamífero de pastoreo con pezuñas con melena, una cola larga y músculos"
" muy potentes. Un compañero leal de los humanos por casi toda la historia, "
"con algo de esfuerzo podrías hacer que confíe en vos lo suficiente como para"
" que se deje montar."

#. ~ Description of monster "mon_horse_police"
#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
msgid ""
"A hooved grazing mammal with a mane of hair, a sweeping tail, and powerful-"
"looking muscles.  This one has been trained to have less of a fear reaction "
"in order to assist with riot control and standard police work.  With some "
"effort, you should be able to get this one to trust you enough to ride it."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of monster "foal"
#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
msgid ""
"A hooved grazing mammal with a mane of hair, a sweeping tail, and powerful-"
"looking muscles.  This one is still a juvenile; it'll take a while before it"
" can be ridden."
msgstr ""
"Es un mamífero de pastoreo con pezuñas con melena, una cola larga y músculos"
" muy potentes. Este todavía es joven, tiene que crecer antes de poder ser "
"montado."

#. ~ Description of monster "black bear cub"
#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
msgid ""
"A juvenile American black bear.  This one isn't much of a threat, but be "
"wary of its parent; black bears are known for their protectiveness."
msgstr ""
"Es un joven oso negro americano. No es una amenaza, pero cuidate de los "
"padres. Los osos negros son conocidos por su protección."

#. ~ Description of monster "reindeer fawn"
#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
msgid ""
"A juvenile caribou, it is smaller than its adult counterparts, as well as "
"having shorter antlers."
msgstr ""
"Es un caribú joven, es más pequeño que los adultos y tiene cuernos más "
"cortos."

#. ~ Description of monster "fawn"
#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
msgid ""
"A juvenile northern woodland white-tailed deer, a quick and strong grazing "
"animal.  Favored prey of coyotes, wolves, and giant spider mutants."
msgstr ""
"Es un joven ciervo de cola blanca de los bosques del norte, un animal de "
"pastoreo rápido y fuerte. Es la presa favorita de los coyotes, lobos y "
"arañas mutantes gigantes."

#. ~ Description of monster "muskrat"
#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
msgid ""
"A large omnivorous rodent with a thick furry pelt, found in wetlands across "
"the Northern Hemisphere.  It marks its territory with a musky odor for which"
" it is named."
msgstr ""
"Un gran roedor omnívoro con una gruesa piel peluda. Se lo encuentra en zonas"
" húmedas a lo largo del hemisferio norte. Marca su territorio con con un "
"aroma a almizcle, y de ahí viene su nombre."

#. ~ Description of monster "big dog"
#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
msgid ""
"A particularly big dog, weighing as much as some adult humans.  It looks "
"formidable, though no more aggressive than any other breed."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "skunk"
#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
msgid "A skunk raises its tail and squirts!"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of monster "squirrel"
#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
msgid ""
"A small granivorous rodent with a long bushy tail, often seen darting amid "
"the branches of trees.  A skittish varmint with an expression of unwavering "
"austerity, it is the mortal enemy of cat and dog alike."
msgstr ""
"Es un pequeño roedor granívoro con una cola larga y tupida, a menudo se la "
"ve corriendo a toda velocidad entre las ramas de los árboles. Una alimaña "
"asustadiza con expresión de austeridad inquebrantable. Es el enemigo mortal "
"de los gatos y los perros."

#. ~ Description of monster "raccoon"
#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
msgid ""
"A small mammal native to North America, distinctive for its dexterous paws "
"and facial markings.  It is resourceful and agile enough to open sealed "
"containers in search of food."
msgstr ""
"Es un pequeño mamífero nativo de América del Norte, conocido por la destreza"
" de sus garras y las marcas en su cara. Es lo suficientemente ingenioso y "
"ágil como para abrir recipientes sellados buscando comida."

#. ~ Description of monster "wild rabbit"
#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
msgid ""
"A small mammal with a cute wiggling nose and long ears.  It is extremely "
"skittish."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of monster "rabbit"
#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
msgid ""
"A small mammal with a cute wiggling nose and long ears.  This one is of the "
"domesticated variety, commonly kept as a pet, a research subject, or a "
"source of food."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of monster "fox"
#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
msgid ""
"A small, omnivorous canine with almost cat-like mannerisms.  It is a "
"solitary hunter, and one of the only canids able to climb trees."
msgstr ""
"Es un pequeño canino omnívoro con maneras casi de gato. Es un cazador "
"solitario y uno de los únicos cánidos capaz de trepar árboles."

#. ~ Description of monster "bobcat"
#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_predators.json
msgid ""
"A spotted wild cat living across much of North America.  It is not a serious"
" threat to humans, but it can be aggressive when threatened."
msgstr ""
"Es un felino salvaje con manchas que vive a lo largo de todo Norte América. "
"No es una verdadera amenaza para los humanos, pero puede ser agresivo cuando"
" se siente amenazado."

#. ~ Description of monster "sheep"
#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
msgid ""
"A timid, hooved grazing mammal, and one of the first animals ever "
"domesticated.  Its body is covered in a thick layer of wool, and the males "
"have long, spiraling horns."
msgstr ""
"Es un mamífero de pastoreo con pezuñas y tímido, y uno de los primeros "
"animales que se ha domesticado. Su cuerpo está cubierto de una capa gruesa "
"de lana, y los machos tiene cuernos largos y espiralados."

#. ~ Description of monster "lamb"
#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
msgid ""
"A timid, hooved grazing mammal, and one of the first animals ever "
"domesticated.  Its body is covered in a thick layer of wool."
msgstr ""
"Es un mamífero de pastoreo tímido y con pezuñas, y uno de los primeros "
"animales en haber sido domesticado. Su cuerpo está cubierto de una capa "
"gruesa de lana."

#. ~ Description of monster "little dog"
#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
msgid "A tiny dog, surviving the cataclysm against all odds."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of monster "ferret kit"
#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
msgid "A young domesticated ferret, known as a kit."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of monster "reindeer"
#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
msgid ""
"Also known as the caribou, this deer is native to North America and parts of"
" Eurasia.  Although usually friendly, they can be aggressive during the "
"autumn and winter mating season as well as when hungry."
msgstr ""
"También conocido como caribú, este ciervo es nativo de América del Norte y "
"partes de Eurasia. Aunque es usualmente amistoso, puede ser agresivo durante"
" el celo en otoño e invierno y también cuando tiene hambre."

#. ~ Description of monster "groundhog"
#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
msgid ""
"Also known as the woodchuck, this ground squirrel has no actual talent for "
"chucking wood."
msgstr ""
"La marmota es una ardilla menos ágil, no la vas a ver trepando los árboles."

#. ~ Description of monster "little puppy"
#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
msgid ""
"An adorable, defenseless puppy.  It's tiny now, and it doesn't seem like "
"it's going to get much bigger."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of monster "big puppy"
#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
msgid ""
"An adorable, defenseless puppy.  It's tiny now, but it looks like it could "
"grow up to be pretty big."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of monster "puppy"
#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
msgid "An adorable, defenseless puppy.  Much safer to tame than an adult dog."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of monster "wolf puppy"
#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
msgid ""
"An adorable, defenseless wolf pup that will, in time, grow into a not-so-"
"defenseless and debatably-adorable wolf.  Be careful of its parents, who are"
" sure to be around nearby!"
msgstr ""
"Es un lobo cachorrito adorable e indefenso que, con el tiempo, crecerá en un"
" lobo no tan indefenso y debatiblemente adorable. ¡Tené cuidado con los "
"padres que generalmente andan cerca!"

#. ~ Description of monster "rat"
#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
msgid ""
"Considered vermin by many, maybe even harbingers of the Cataclysm, this "
"diminutive rodent looks pretty harmless up close."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of monster "ferret"
#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
msgid ""
"Domesticated from the European polecat, this sleek and energetic mammal was "
"commonly kept as a pet before the Cataclysm."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of monster "cat"
#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
msgid ""
"In the absence of human stewardship, this tiny domesticated predator has "
"grown wary of humans.  Harried by the rigors of survival, it has become very"
" skittish but is still motivated by food."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of monster "bat"
#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
msgid ""
"One of the vesper bats, a family of winged insect-eating mammals.  It roosts"
" in caves and other hollows, and uses a form of echolocation to aerially "
"navigate through tricky terrain at rapid speeds."
msgstr ""
"Un vespertiliónido de la familia de los mamíferos alados que comen insectos."
" Habita en cuevas y otros lugares huecos y utiliza una forma de ecolocación "
"para orientarse por el aire a gran velocidad a través de terreno complicado."

#. ~ Description of monster "wild boar"
#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
msgid ""
"Originally not native in the U.S., this wild omnivore is a crossbreed "
"between the Eurasian wild boar escaped from hunting reserves and the "
"domesticated pig gone feral in the wilderness.  Its population has "
"skyrocketed during the last few decades."
msgstr ""
"No es originalmente nativo de Estados Unidos, este omnívoro salvaje es una "
"cruza de raza entre el jabalí de Eurasia que escapó de las cacerías, y el "
"chancho domesticado que se volvió salvaje en la naturaleza. Su población "
"aumentó mucho en las últimas décadas."

#. ~ Description of monster "wild boar piglet"
#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
msgid ""
"Originally not native in the U.S., this wild omnivore is a crossbreed "
"between the Eurasian wild boar escaped from hunting reserves and the "
"domesticated pig gone feral in the wilderness.  This one is just a baby, and"
" is surprisingly cute."
msgstr ""
"No es originalmente nativo de Estados Unidos, este omnívoro salvaje es una "
"cruza de raza entre el jabalí de Eurasia que escapó de las cacerías, y el "
"chancho domesticado que se volvió salvaje en la naturaleza. Este es un "
"cachorro y es sorprendentemente lindo."

#. ~ Description of monster "sick deer"
#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
msgid ""
"Patchy fur stretches over this animal's ribs.  Its legs wobble and it "
"continually tosses its head as it plods on, seemingly unaware that it's "
"dying."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of monster "charred human"
#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
msgid "Placeholder for charred human corpses.  If you see this, it's a bug."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of monster "child"
#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
msgid "Placeholder for children corpses.  If you see this, it's a bug."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of monster "human"
#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
msgid "Placeholder for human corpses.  If you see this, it's a bug."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of monster "tusked moose calf"
#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
msgid ""
"Standing taller than a fully grown deer, this mutated moose calf has a pair "
"of curved tusks that look quite out of place."
msgstr ""

