#: data/json/monsters/yrax.json
msgid ""
"A kite shaped blade of metal, darting through air and foes by indiscernible "
"means."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of monster "Yrax apeirohedron"
#: data/json/monsters/yrax.json
msgid ""
"Its uncountable surfaces flow against each other in a dazzling sea of gold."
msgstr ""
"Sus incontables superficies fluyen entre ellas en un deslumbrante mar de "
"oro."

#. ~ Death message of monster "Yrax apeirohedron"
#: data/json/monsters/yrax.json
#, c-format
msgid "The %s folds away."
msgstr "El %s se pliega."

#. ~ Description of monster "Yrax trifacet"
#: data/json/monsters/yrax.json
msgid ""
"Three dual leg modules join with each lower vertex of a pyramidal body, in a"
" abstract configuration that vaguely recalls an alien arthropod.  Devoid of "
"any exterior signs that betray its artificial origin, it looks like it could"
" fold itself into a perfectly featureless quartz pyramid.  It crawls with a "
"gait like none you've seen before, its minute movements too fast for your "
"eyes to track."
msgstr ""
"Tres módulos de patas dobles se unen a cada vértice inferior del cuerpo "
"piramidal, en una configuración abstracta que recuerda vagamente a un "
"artrópodo extraterrestre. Desprovisto de cualquier signo exterior que "
"traicione su origen artificial, parece que podría plegarse y hacerse una "
"perfecta pirámide uniforme de cuarzo. Se arrastra de una manera que nunca "
"viste antes, sus ínfimos movimientos son muy rápidos como para que los "
"puedas seguir con la vista."

