msgstr "Empezás a correr."

#. ~ Successfully switched to movement mode "walk" with no steed
#: data/json/move_modes.json
msgid "You start walking."
msgstr "Empezás a caminar."

#. ~ Successfully switched to movement mode "prone" with animal steed
#: data/json/move_modes.json
msgid "You stop your steed."
msgstr "Hacés frenar a tu corcel."

#. ~ Successfully switched to movement mode "prone" with mechanical steed
#: data/json/move_modes.json
msgid "You turn off your mech's leg servos."
msgstr "Apagás los servos en las patas de tu mecha."

#. ~ Failed to switched to movement mode "run" with no steed
#: data/json/move_modes.json
msgid "You're too tired or injured to run."
msgstr "Estás muy cansado o muy lastimado como para correr."

#. ~ Failed to switched to movement mode "run" with mechanical steed
#: data/json/move_modes.json
msgid "Your mech's leg servos are unable to operate faster."
