#. ~ Description of mutation "Raptor Tail"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Formed from a network of interlocking bones, a long tail has mutated from "
"the base of your spine, with ossified tendons assisting in keeping the limb "
"stiff and rigid.  A plume of lengthy feathers sprouts from the reptilian "
"flesh along your new tail, drawing the eye.  While it is useless in combat "
"and prevents you from wearing non-fabric pants, you find it's pretty handy "
"for maintaining your balance."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Spider Legs"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Four spidery limbs sprout from your body.  They're not yet strong or "
"coordinated enough to support your weight, and mostly just get in the way of"
" your arms and legs."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Eight Legged"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Four strong, spidery limbs sprout from your body.  By crouching or running "
"with your hands free, you can use these in concert with your other arms and "
"legs to move more quickly and quietly, and to easily climb walls and other "
"obstacles."
msgstr ""

