#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/criminal_2.json
msgid "Got any tips about the boss zombie?"
msgstr "¿Tenés algún consejo acerca de ese zombi jefe?"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-
