msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I was just in a warehouse, not in Zambonia.  I had the internet.  Watched "
"those crazy videos on YouTube in real time, scared the shit out of me.  I "
"had it pretty good though, I'd lifted a bunch of canned food and shit, and I"
" had a pretty sweet little squat in that warehouse.  I'd been planning on "
"spending a long time there after all, while I figured out how to get in good"
" with my crew."
msgstr ""
"Estaba en un depósito, no en Zambonia. Tenía internet. Miré esos extraños "
"videos en YouTube en tiempo real, me pegué un cagazo grande. Igual estaba "
"bien, me pude llevar muchas latas de comida y esas cosas, y estaba bastante "
"tranquilo metido en ese depósito. Mi plan era quedarme mucho tiempo ahí, "
"mientras pensaba como arreglar las cosas con mi banda."

