#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-
#. TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/evacuee_2.json
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Well, I assume you know about the riots and the military and police and the "
"freakin' nightmare monsters walking the earth beside zombies, right?  If "
"you're asking what I think caused it all, well, I dunno.  My best guess it "
"was some huge government overreach, maybe some kind of experimental "
"bioweapon that got away.  They tried to lie so much at the start about "
"everything that was going on, I don't think the whole 'Chinese attack' shit "
"measures up.  They were trying to cover something up.  As for the real end "
"times, maybe the rest of the world tried to contain it.  I heard there were "
"honest-to-god nukes going off here on American soil.  To me that seems like "
"somewhere else, maybe Europe, trying to get whatever is going on here "
"contained.  Maybe it even worked.  It's bad now but it's not like it was."
msgstr ""
"Bueno, supongo que ya sabés lo de los disturbios y el ejército y la policía "
"y los monstruos de pesadillas caminando por la tierra además de los zombis, "
"¿no? Si me preguntás qué me parece que causó todo eso, bueno, no sé. Se me "
"ocurre que fue una extralimitación del gobierno, tal voz alguna clase de "
"bioarma experimental que se escapó. Intentaron mentir tanto al principio "
"sobre lo que estaba pasando, no creo que eso del 'ataque chino' tuviera "
"sentido. Estaban intentando ocultar algo. Y tal vez el resto del mundo "
"estaba intentando contener el verdadero fin del mundo. Escuché que habían "
"estallado verdaderos misiles nucleares en suelo estadounidense. Para mí, eso"
" parecía en otro lado, tal vez en Europa, estaban intentando contener lo que"
" sea que estuviera sucediendo acá. Hasta capaz que funcionó. Está complicado"
" ahora pero no tanto como antes."

