msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Well, excuse me if I didn't stop to <swear> ask what kind of killer bugs "
"they were."
msgstr ""
"Bueno, disculpame si no me detuve a preguntar qué clase de insectos asesinos"
" eran, <swear>."

