#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/gung_ho_1.json
msgid ""
"Okay, y'know, I'm honestly gonna stop ya there.  Who gives a rat's ass?  I "
"won't waste a second of time on thinkin' about that."
msgstr ""
"Okey, viste, honestamente te voy a frenar ahí. ¿A quién carajos le importa? "
"No voy a gastar ni un segundo de mi tiempo pensando en eso."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/gung_ho_1.json
msgid "Seriously?  You must have some idea."
msgstr "¿En serio? Debés tener alguna idea."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-
#. TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
