#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/left_for_dead_3.json
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I knew the city pretty well.  I went for an abandoned building I knew about,"
" headed through a broken window, and holed up in there for a few days.  I "
"had a fair bit of stolen food and I just kept to myself.  When things "
"started to quiet down, I headed out, and here I am."
msgstr ""
"Conocía la ciudad bastante bien. Me fui hasta un edificio abandonado que "
"conocía, pasé por una ventana rota y me escondí ahí por unos días. Tenía un "
"poco de comida robada y me quedé ahí solo. Cuando las cosas se empezaron a "
"calmar, salí y acá estoy."

