#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
msgid ""
"I'm sorry.  I guess I just didn't know how to tell you I needed what was in "
"it."
msgstr ""
"Lo siento. Pero no sabía cómo decirte que necesitaba lo que había adentro."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
msgid ""
"I'm sorry.  I'm sure we can find lots of stuff to replace whatever I took."
msgstr ""
"Lo siento. Estoy seguro que vamos a encontrar cosas para reemplazar lo que "
"me llevé."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
msgid ""
"I'm tired of talking.  Let's get moving and put that truth together for "
"ourselves…"
msgstr ""
"Me cansé de hablar. Vamos a movernos y armar esa verdad por nosotros mismos…"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-
#. TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
