msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Our conference was at a retreat by a lake.  We all got the emergency "
"broadcast on our cells, but I was the only one to read between the lines and"
" see it for what it was: large scale bio-terrorism.  I wasn't about to stay "
"and find out who of my coworkers was a sleeper agent.  Although I'd bet "
"fifty bucks it was Lee.  Anyway, I stole the coordinator's pickup and headed"
" straight for my shelter."
msgstr ""
"Nuestra conferencia era en un lugar retirado, junto a un lago. Todos "
"recibimos el mensaje de emergencia en nuestros celulares, pero yo fui el "
"único que leyó entre líneas: bioterrorismo a gran escala. No me iba a quedar"
" para ver quién era un espía durmiente. Pero apuesto que era Lee. De todas "
"maneras, me robé la camioneta del coordinador y me fui a mi refugio."

