#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
msgid ""
"You said you could tell me more about the shelter if I wanted.  How did "
"these things get built?"
msgstr ""
"Dijiste que me podías contar más sobre el refugio si quería. ¿Cómo se "
"construyeron esos refugios?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
msgid "You sure do."
msgstr "Seguro que sí."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
msgid ""
"You think that's funny?!  Some of us watched the warning signs for years.  "
"All the news, all the violence and the secret plots…  Now the dead are "
"walking, reality itself is tearing apart, and you're making jokes like "
"that?!"
msgstr ""
"¡¿Te parece gracioso?! Algunos de nosotros observamos las señales durante "
"años. Todas las noticias, la violencia y las conspiraciones secretas… Ahora "
"los muertos andan caminando, la realidad misma se está rompiendo y ¡¿vos te "
"ponés a hacer chistes con eso?!"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
msgid ""
"You wouldn't keep ALL your tricks and secrets from me, though, would you?  "
"After everything we've been through?"
msgstr ""
"¿No me ocultarías TODOS tus trucos y secretos, no? ¿Después de todo lo que "
"pasamos juntos?"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-
#. TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"You're not really a good liar.  I built that thing like a fortress.  No one "
"would just break into it."
msgstr ""
"No mentís muy bien que digamos. Yo construí esa cosa como una fortaleza. "
"Nadie podría entrar así nomás."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-
#. TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
