msgctxt "u:f"
msgid ""
"No dice.  You asked me to come along.  This is what you get.  If you don't "
"like it, I'll take my fee and go back to the center.  Ain't hard to find "
"contracts."
msgstr ""
"Ni en pedo. Vos me pediste venir con vos. Esto es lo que te llevaste. Si no "
"te gusta, me vuelvo al centro. No es tan difícil que te contraten."

