msgid "Fair enough, thanks.  <done_conversation_section>"
msgstr "Me parece bien, gracias. <done_conversation_section>"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-
