msgid "Did you find them, <name_g>?"
msgstr "¿Los encontraste, <name_g>?"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-
#. TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/Lighthouse_Family/NPC_lighthouse_man.json
msgctxt "u:n"
msgid "Did you find them, <name_g>?"
msgstr "¿Los encontraste, <name_g>?"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Lighthouse"
#: data/json/npcs/Lighthouse_Family/NPC_lighthouse_man.json
msgid "First we need to find a transport to get there."
msgstr "Lo primero que necesitamos es un transporte para llegar ahí."

#. ~ Name suffix of a male NPC
#. ~ Name of an NPC class
#: data/json/npcs/Lighthouse_Family/NPC_lighthouse_man.json
msgid "Fisherman"
msgstr "Pescador"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/Lighthouse_Family/NPC_lighthouse_man.json
msgid "Fisherman's boat"
msgstr "El bote del pescador"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/Lighthouse_Family/NPC_lighthouse_man.json
msgid "Fisherman's family"
msgstr "La familia del pescador"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/Lighthouse_Family/NPC_lighthouse_man.json
msgid "Fixing lighthouse"
msgstr "Arreglar el faro"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/Lighthouse_Family/NPC_lighthouse_man.json
msgid "Good news, <name_g>.  One survivor sailed to us recently."
msgstr ""
"Buenas noticias, <name_g>. Un superviviente vino navegando hacia nosotros "
"hace poco."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Lighthouse"
#: data/json/npcs/Lighthouse_Family/NPC_lighthouse_man.json
msgid "Good.  I'll be right behind you."
msgstr "Bien. Te sigo."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "House cleaning"
#: data/json/npcs/Lighthouse_Family/NPC_lighthouse_man.json
msgid "Great, <very> great.  All that remains is to wash all the floors…"
msgstr "Genial, <very> genial. Ahora queda lavar todos los pisos…"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "House cleaning"
#: data/json/npcs/Lighthouse_Family/NPC_lighthouse_man.json
msgid ""
"Great.  Let's do it together.  I'll be right behind you.  We will clean "
"floor by floor.  If you decide that the floor is clean, tell me about it, "
"and we will move on to the next, and so on to the very top."
msgstr ""
"Genial. Vamos a hacerlo juntos. Voy atrás tuyo. Lo vamos a limpiar piso por "
"piso. Si decidís que el piso ya está limpio, decímelo y vamos a seguir con "
"el siguiente, así hasta la punta."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/Lighthouse_Family/NPC_lighthouse_man.json
msgid "Has anyone come recently?"
msgstr "¿Vino alguien recientemente?"

#. ~ Description of mission "Fisherman's boat"
#: data/json/npcs/Lighthouse_Family/NPC_lighthouse_man.json
msgid "Help Mikhail make a boat.  Bring 250 nails."
msgstr "Ayudar a Mikhail a hacer un bote. Conseguir 250 clavos."

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/Lighthouse_Family/NPC_lighthouse_man.json
msgid "House cleaning"
msgstr "Limpiar la casa"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/Lighthouse_Family/NPC_lighthouse_man.json
msgid "How are you doing?"
msgstr "¿Cómo estás?"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Fisherman's family"
#: data/json/npcs/Lighthouse_Family/NPC_lighthouse_man.json
msgid ""
"I don't even know how to thank you, <name_g>.  I am in eternal debt to you."
msgstr "Ya no sé cómo agradecerte, <name_g>. Estoy en deuda eterna con vos."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Fixing lighthouse"
#: data/json/npcs/Lighthouse_Family/NPC_lighthouse_man.json
msgid ""
"I knew you wouldn't refuse!  But there is one problem: I have no idea how to"
" fix it.  Maybe if you met someone who have experience in electrical "
"engineering, we can figure out how to start this old junk."
msgstr ""
"¡Sabía que me ibas a decir que sí! Pero hay un problema: no tengo ni idea de"
" cómo arreglarlo. Tal vez si encontraras a alguien que tenga experiencia en "
"ingeniería eléctrica, podríamos encontrar la manera de hacer funcionar a "
"esta vieja chatarra."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/Lighthouse_Family/NPC_lighthouse_man.json
msgid ""
"I'm just a simple man from a simple family.  Before <the_cataclysm> I had a "
"fishing boat, and I went to sea on it, to catch fish and other marine life."
"  This is how my grandfather lived, my father lived, and I began to live "
"like that.  I had a large family, 7 children, but not many survived, only my"
" wife and daughter remained…"
msgstr ""
"Solamente soy un hombre simple que viene de una familia simple. Antes del "
"<the_cataclysm> tenía un bote pesquero para atrapar pescados y otros "
"animales marinos. Así vivió mi abuelo, así vivió mi padre y yo comencé mi "
"vida así. Tenía una familia grande, 7 hijos, pero no sobrevivieron muchos, "
"solamente mi esposa y mi hija…"

#. ~ Job description of "No class" NPC class
#. ~ Job description of "Fisherman" NPC class
#: data/json/npcs/Lighthouse_Family/NPC_lighthouse_man.json
#: data/json/npcs/classes.json
msgid "I'm just wandering."
msgstr "Solo estoy dando vueltas."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/Lighthouse_Family/NPC_lighthouse_man.json
msgid "I'm sorry, I failed you… I couldn't bring them alive…"
msgstr "Lamento haberte fallado… No pude traerlas con vida…"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/Lighthouse_Family/NPC_lighthouse_man.json
msgid "I'm sorry, I failed you… I couldn't bring your daughter alive…"
msgstr "Lamento haberte fallado… No pude traer a tu hija viva…"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/Lighthouse_Family/NPC_lighthouse_man.json
msgid "I'm sorry, I failed you… I couldn't bring your wife alive…"
msgstr "Lamento haberte fallado… No pude traer a tu esposa viva…"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Fixing lighthouse"
#: data/json/npcs/Lighthouse_Family/NPC_lighthouse_man.json
msgid ""
"I'm sure that not all burned in flames of <the_cataclysm> and you can find "
"someone suitable."
msgstr ""
"Estoy seguro que no todos se quemaron en las llamas del <the_cataclysm> y "
"vas a poder encontrar alguien adecuado."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/Lighthouse_Family/NPC_lighthouse_man.json
msgid "Is it safe, my <name_g>?"
msgstr "¿Es seguro, <name_g>?"

#. ~ Description of mission "Lighthouse"
#: data/json/npcs/Lighthouse_Family/NPC_lighthouse_man.json
msgid "Lead Mikhail to lighthouse."
msgstr "Llevar a Mikhail al faro."

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/Lighthouse_Family/NPC_lighthouse_man.json
msgid "Lighthouse"
msgstr "Faro"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<its_safe>"
#. ~ NPC complaint when the danger level drops from significant to very low,
#. so things are 'safe'
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/Lighthouse_Family/NPC_lighthouse_man.json
#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags.json
msgid "Looks like that's over."
msgstr "Parece que eso ya terminó."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Lighthouse"
#: data/json/npcs/Lighthouse_Family/NPC_lighthouse_man.json
msgid "Looks nice, <name_g>.  Now I need to clean it from <zombies> somehow…"
msgstr ""
"Se ve bien, <name_g>. Ahora necesitamos limpiarlo de los <zombies> de alguna"
" manera…"

#. ~ Unique name of a male NPC
#: data/json/npcs/Lighthouse_Family/NPC_lighthouse_man.json
msgid "Mikhail Frolov"
msgstr "Mikhail Frolov"

#. ~ Description of mission "Fisherman's family"
#: data/json/npcs/Lighthouse_Family/NPC_lighthouse_man.json
msgid "Mikhail asked you to bring back his family."
msgstr "Mikhail te pidió que traigas a su familia."

#. ~ Description of mission "Fixing lighthouse"
#: data/json/npcs/Lighthouse_Family/NPC_lighthouse_man.json
msgid ""
"Mikhail asked you to find someone, who have enough expertise to fix the "
"mechanism of lighthouse."
msgstr ""
"Mikhail te pidió que consigas a alguien que pueda arreglar el mecanismo del "
"faro."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Fixing lighthouse"
#: data/json/npcs/Lighthouse_Family/NPC_lighthouse_man.json
msgid ""
"My family is here, we have food, water, boat and a roof over our heads, all "
"thanks to you, <name_g>.  Now, I also want to help other survivors.  Here's "
"what I thought: if I can get this old lighthouse up and running, other "
"survivors will see its light from afar.  If they see it, they will think "
"that there are living people here, and will try to get here.  Can you help "
"me fix it?"
msgstr ""
"Mi familia está acá, tenemos comida, agua, un bote y un techo, todo gracias "
"a vos, <name_g>. Ahora también quiero ayudar a otros sobrevivientes. Pensé "
"en esto: si puedo hacer que este faro funcione, otros sobrevivientes van a "
"poder ver la luz desde lejos. Si la ven, van a pensar que hay gente viviendo"
" acá y van a intentar venir. ¿Me podrás ayudar a arreglarlo?"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/Lighthouse_Family/NPC_lighthouse_man.json
msgid ""
"Nobody came, <name_g>.  I'm beginning to doubt that anyone else has survived"
" besides us…"
msgstr ""
"No vino nadie, <name_g>. Estoy empezando a dudar que alguien más haya podido"
" sobrevivir…"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/Lighthouse_Family/NPC_lighthouse_man.json
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_MISSION.json
msgid "Not yet."
msgstr "Todavía no."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/Lighthouse_Family/NPC_lighthouse_man.json
msgid "Nothing, really."
msgstr "Nada, en realidad."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Fisherman's family"
#: data/json/npcs/Lighthouse_Family/NPC_lighthouse_man.json
msgid "Please be very careful.  I don't want to lose them…"
msgstr "Por favor, tené cuidado. No quiero perderlos…"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Fisherman's boat"
#: data/json/npcs/Lighthouse_Family/NPC_lighthouse_man.json
msgid ""
"Please, if you can, don't disassemble furniture here.  It can still be "
"useful."
msgstr ""
"Por favor, si podés evitarlo no desarmés los muebles de acá. Todavía pueden "
"servir."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "House cleaning"
#: data/json/npcs/Lighthouse_Family/NPC_lighthouse_man.json
msgid ""
"So, we found the lighthouse.  Now, I need to clean it.  Want to help me with"
" it?"
msgstr ""
"Bueno, encontramos el faro. Ahora tengo que limpiarlo. ¿Me querés ayudar?"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Fixing lighthouse"
#: data/json/npcs/Lighthouse_Family/NPC_lighthouse_man.json
msgid "Splendid, <name_g>!  We can only wait now…"
msgstr "¡Espléndido, <name_g>! Ahora queda esperar…"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Fisherman's boat"
#: data/json/npcs/Lighthouse_Family/NPC_lighthouse_man.json
msgid ""
"Thank you, <name_g>.  I need only 250 nails.  I'll find the planks, the rest"
" of the tools too, but the main problem is the nails.  Too much for one "
"boat, but I want to have resources in reserve, just in case."
msgstr ""
"Gracias, <name_g>. Necesito 250 clavos. Yo consigo las tablas y el resto de "
"las herramientas también, pero el problema son los clavos. Demasiado para un"
" solo bote, pero quiero tener los recursos de reserva, por si acaso."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Fisherman's boat"
#: data/json/npcs/Lighthouse_Family/NPC_lighthouse_man.json
msgid ""
"The building has been cleared of <zombies>, my family is here, everything is"
" going very well.  It remains only to provide ourselves with food, transport"
" and we can not worry about the future.  You helped me and my family so "
"much, can you help us with something else?  I need a boat for fishing, or "
"just to explore the area.  Can you help me make a boat?"
msgstr ""
"El edificio ha sido limpiado de <zombies>, mi familia ya está aca, todo anda"
" muy bien. Solo queda proveernos de comida, transporte y ya nos podemos "
"despreocupar del futuro. Me ayudaste mucho a mí y a mi familia, ¿nos podés "
"ayudar con algo más? Necesito un bote para poder pescar o para explorar el "
"área. ¿Me podrás ayudar a construir uno?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/Lighthouse_Family/NPC_lighthouse_man.json
msgid "We did it.  All safe."
msgstr "Lo logramos. Todos seguros."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Lighthouse"
#: data/json/npcs/Lighthouse_Family/NPC_lighthouse_man.json
msgid "We finally reached it."
msgstr "Por fin llegamos."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Fisherman's family"
#: data/json/npcs/Lighthouse_Family/NPC_lighthouse_man.json
msgid ""
"We found the lighthouse and cleared it of <zombies>.  Now, I need to bring "
"my family here.  May I ask you for a favor?  Since you bring me here, can "
"you go back, find my family and bring them here?"
msgstr ""
"Encontramos el faro y ya sacamos a los <zombies>. Ahora necesito traer a mi "
"familia acá. ¿Te puedo pedir el favor? Ya que me trajiste hasta acá, "
"¿podrías volver, encontrar a mi familia y traerla?"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Lighthouse"
#: data/json/npcs/Lighthouse_Family/NPC_lighthouse_man.json
msgid ""
"We've been wandering around the state with my family for a long time since "
"<the_cataclysm>, and I realized that the safest hideout is the island.  I "
"left my family in a shelter, and went to explore the area, looking for some "
"island nearby, in a lake or in the ocean.  And you know, I found a sea map "
"marked with navigational beacons near here.  If you want, you can help me "
"get to one of these and take a good look at it."
msgstr ""
"Hemos estado dando vueltas por el estado con mi familia por mucho tiempo "
"desde <the_cataclysm>, y me di cuenta que el escondite más seguro es la "
"isla. Dejé a mi familia en un refugio y me fui a explorar el área, buscando "
"alguna isla cercana en un lago o en el océano. Y como ya sabés, encontré un "
"mapa del mar marcado con unas señales de navegación cerca de acá. Si querés,"
" me podés ayudar a llegar a uno de esos faros para investigarlo."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Fixing lighthouse"
#: data/json/npcs/Lighthouse_Family/NPC_lighthouse_man.json
msgid "Well, have you fixed it?"
msgstr "Bueno, ¿lo arreglaste?"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Lighthouse"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "House cleaning"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Fisherman's family"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Fisherman's boat"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Fixing lighthouse"
#: data/json/npcs/Lighthouse_Family/NPC_lighthouse_man.json
msgid "Well, it's your choice."
msgstr "Bueno, es tu decisión."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/Lighthouse_Family/NPC_lighthouse_man.json
msgid "Yes.  First floor is clear."
msgstr "Sí. La planta baja está limpia."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/Lighthouse_Family/NPC_lighthouse_man.json
msgid "Yes.  Fourth floor is clear."
msgstr "Sí, el cuarto piso está limpio."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/Lighthouse_Family/NPC_lighthouse_man.json
msgid "Yes.  Ground floor is clear."
msgstr "Sí, la planta baja está limpia."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/Lighthouse_Family/NPC_lighthouse_man.json
msgid "Yes.  Second floor is clear."
msgstr "Sí, el segundo piso está limpio."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/Lighthouse_Family/NPC_lighthouse_man.json
msgid "Yes.  Third floor is clear."
msgstr "Sí, el tercer piso está limpio."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/Lighthouse_Family/NPC_lighthouse_man.json
msgid "Yes.  Top floor is clear."
msgstr "Sí, el último piso está limpio."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Fisherman's family"
#: data/json/npcs/Lighthouse_Family/NPC_lighthouse_man.json
msgid ""
"You are my savior!  I'll take a look around here for a while, prepare "
"everything here for their arrival."
msgstr ""
"¡Sos mi héroe! Yo voy a investigar un poco por acá, preparando todo para "
"cuando vengan."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/Lighthouse_Family/NPC_lighthouse_man.json
msgid ""
"You know, <very> good.  It is cozy here, there is a lot of space, and most "
"importantly, it's safe.  We even started considering this place as our new "
"home.  By the way, while I was fishing, a bottle with a piece of paper came "
"to the shore of our island.  Here, take a look.\", he gave you a piece of "
"paper, something was written on it: '0030045-0030045-35321700', with "
"something similar to lightning scribbled nearby.  \"I wonder what it could "
"mean…"
msgstr ""
"Ya sabés, <very> bien. Es cómo este lugar, hay mucho espacio y lo más "
"importante es que es seguro. Incluso empezamos a considerar este lugar como "
"nuestro nuevo hogar. Ah, cierto, mientras estaba pescando encontré una "
"botella con un papel en la orilla de nuestra isla. Tomá, mirala\", -te da un"
" papel con algo escrito: '0030045-0030045-35321700', con algo similar a "
"rayos garabateados-. Me pregunto qué significará…"

#. ~ Unique name of a female NPC
#: data/json/npcs/Lighthouse_Family/NPC_lighthouse_woman.json
msgid "Heather Frolova"
msgstr "Heather Frolova"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/Lighthouse_Family/NPC_lighthouse_woman.json
msgid ""
"I don't have much to tell, sorry.  I'm busy with tiding this place, making "
"it our new home.  You should talk to my husband, he doesn't look busy right "
"now.  Or always…"
msgstr ""
"No tengo mucho para decir, perdón. Estoy ocupada arreglando el lugar para "
"convertirlo en nuestro nuevo hogar. Deberías hablar con mi marido, no está "
"muy ocupado ahora. O nunca…"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/Lighthouse_Family/NPC_lighthouse_woman.json
msgid "I'm scared.  Where is my husband?"
msgstr "Tengo miedo. ¿Dónde está mi marido?"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/Lighthouse_Family/NPC_lighthouse_woman.json
msgid "Protect fisherman's wife"
msgstr "Proteger esposa del pescador"

#. ~ Description of mission "Protect fisherman's wife"
#: data/json/npcs/Lighthouse_Family/NPC_lighthouse_woman.json
msgid "She looks like a nice woman.  Maybe you should not let her die?"
msgstr "Parece una buena mujer. ¿Tal vez deberías intentar que no se muera?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/Lighthouse_Family/TALK_fix_lighthouse.json
msgid "Can you repair the mechanism of the lighthouse?"
msgstr "¿Podés arreglar el mecanismo del faro?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/Lighthouse_Family/TALK_fix_lighthouse.json
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_missions.json
msgid "Good."
msgstr "Bien."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/Lighthouse_Family/TALK_fix_lighthouse.json
msgid "Hmm, looks <shitty>.  I'll do my best."
msgstr "Hmm, está medio hecho <shitty>. Voy a hacer lo mejor que pueda."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/Lighthouse_Family/TALK_fix_lighthouse.json
msgid "I did, actually.  Why are you asking?"
msgstr "Sí, es verdad. ¿Por qué me preguntás?"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/Lighthouse_Family/TALK_fix_lighthouse.json
msgid "I'm still working, boss."
msgstr "Todavía estoy trabajando, jefe."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/Lighthouse_Family/TALK_fix_lighthouse.json
msgid "Start working."
msgstr "Empezar a trabajar."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/Lighthouse_Family/TALK_fix_lighthouse.json
msgid ""
"Sure thing, boss.  Take me there and in a few days it will be like new."
msgstr "Seguro, jefe. Llevame y en unos días lo voy a dejar como nuevo."

#. ~ Affirmative response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/Lighthouse_Family/TALK_fix_lighthouse.json
msgid "Thanks for wasting my time, <name_b>.  <end_talking>"
msgstr "Gracias por hacerme perder el tiempo, <name_b>. <end_talking>"

#. ~ Negative response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/Lighthouse_Family/TALK_fix_lighthouse.json
msgid "We're done here.  <end_talking>"
msgstr "Ya terminamos acá. <end_talking>"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/Lighthouse_Family/TALK_fix_lighthouse.json
msgid "We're here.  Ready to start?"
msgstr "Llegamos. ¿Listo para empezar?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/Lighthouse_Family/TALK_fix_lighthouse.json
msgid "You said that you have experience in electrical engineering…"
msgstr "Dijiste que tenías experiencia en ingeniería eléctrica…"

