msgid "Why don't you go somewhere else?"
msgstr "¿Por qué no te vas a otro lugar?"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_CITY_COP.json
msgid ""
"Yeah, there are some like me that have holed up around town.  We do some "
"trading… and then sometimes a stranger wanders through thinking they'll find"
" something better here than they left behind."
msgstr ""
"Sí, hay otros como yo que se han escondido por el pueblo. Nos intercambiamos"
" cosas… y a veces un extraño pasa creyendo que acá va a encontrar algo mejor"
" que de donde se fue."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_CITY_COP.json
msgid "You've seen other survivors?"
msgstr "¿Viste a otros sobrevivientes?"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_CYBORG_1.json
msgid "*buzz* Great!  So what happens now?"
msgstr "*buzz* ¡Genial! Así que, ¿ahora qué?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_CYBORG_1.json
msgid ""
"Big fucking deal.  Do what I say or I'll shove that chip back where it "
"belongs."
msgstr ""
"¿Y a mí qué? Hacé lo que te digo o te voy a meter otra vez el chip donde "
"pertenece."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_CYBORG_1.json
msgid "Come with me.  We can help each other out."
msgstr "Vení conmigo. Nos podemos ayudar entre nosotros."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_CYBORG_1.json
msgid "Follow me and do my bidding, then."
msgstr "Seguime y obedecé mis órdenes, entonces."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_CYBORG_1.json
msgid ""
"For all you know, I did.  I'm being nice for now.  You'd better hope that it"
" lasts."
msgstr ""
"Hasta donde vos sabés, lo hice. Estoy siendo bueno por ahora. Te conviene "
"desear que siga así."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_CYBORG_1.json
msgid "Forget it.  Enjoy your freedom."
msgstr "Olvidate. Que disfrutes de tu libertad."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_CYBORG_1.json
msgid "Get out of my sight."
msgstr "No te quiero ver más."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_CYBORG_1.json
msgid "Hey.  Let's chat for a second."
msgstr "Hey. Vamos a conversar un minuto."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_CYBORG_1.json
msgid ""
"I wouldn't have pulled your chip out if I didn't want you to think for "
"yourself."
msgstr "No te habría sacado el chip si no quisiera que pienses por vos mismo."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_CYBORG_1.json
msgid "I'm sorry!  I shouldn't have said that!"
msgstr "¡Lo lamento! ¡No tendría que haber dicho eso!"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
