msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I'm a lot better now, I've been hunkering down here.  Something came by in "
"the night screaming and crying, sounded just like that woman.  Maybe a "
"ghost, I don't know.  It's good to have company again.  You're not a ghost, "
"right?  On second thought, don't tell me if you are, I probably don't want "
"to know."
msgstr ""
"Ahora ya estoy mejor, ya me acomodé acá. Algo vino por la noche gritando y "
"llorando, sonaba como una mujer. Tal vez era un fantasma, no sé. Está bueno "
"estar acompañado otra vez. ¿Vos no sos un fantasma, no? Pensandolo bien, no "
"me digas si lo sos, prefiero no saberlo."

