#: data/json/npcs/TALK_SURVIVOR_CHEF.json
msgid "How are you alive?"
msgstr "¿Cómo sobreviviste?"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-
#. TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_SURVIVOR_CHEF.json
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I ran to the back of the kitchen and hid as best I could.  People outside "
"were screaming and I could hear them running.  Suddenly I heard more glass "
"shatter and something skitter out of the restaurant.  I waited a moment and "
"then went and checked the dining area.  Both the stranger and the thing were"
" gone.  People were running in the streets, some even had guns so I locked "
"all the doors and blocked the windows with what I could and barricaded "
"myself in here."
msgstr ""
"Corrí de vuelta a la cocina y me escondí lo mejor que pude. La gente afuera "
"estaba gritando y los podía escuchar como corrían. De repente, escuché más "
"vidrio roto y algo que se escabullía del restorán. Esperé un momento y "
"después salí para ver el comedor. Tanto el curioso como la cosa no estaban "
"más. La gente corría por las calles, algunos hasta tenían armas así que "
"cerré todas las puertas y tapé las ventanas con lo que podía, y me encerré "
"acá."

