msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Some lunatic covered in a film of goo, black as oil, had fallen through one "
"of the large glass windows.  There were glass shards stuck in its head and "
"neck.  I thought the poor guy, girl-thing-whatever was dead.  People began "
"to crowd around it, some were taking pictures."
msgstr ""
"Algún lunático cubierto de una película viscosa, negra como el petróleo, "
"había caído por una de las ventanas grandes. Había pedazos de vidrio "
"clavados en su cabeza y cuello. Pensé que el pobre tipo o tipa o coso lo que"
" sea estaba muerto. La gente empezó a juntarse a su alrededor, algunos "
"sacaban fotos."

