#: data/json/npcs/TALK_SURVIVOR_CHEF.json
msgid "What'd you do?"
msgstr "¿Y qué hiciste?"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-
#. TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_SURVIVOR_CHEF.json
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Yeah, it was awhile before it was quiet again.  I heard all kinds of sounds:"
" explosions, jets flying by, helicopters, screaming, and rapid gunfire.  I "
"swear I even heard what sounded like a freaking tank drive by at one time!  "
"I've been hiding here since."
msgstr ""
"Sí, pasó bastante tiempo hasta que todo se calmó. Escuché toda clase de "
"sonidos: explosiones, aviones, helicópteros, gritos y disparos. ¡Te juro que"
" hasta una vez escuché lo que parecía un tanque pasando! Me estuve "
"escondiendo desde entonces."

