"\n"
" We have received your order and will begin processing it immediately.\n"
" 1x Jet Injector, RX12 by Rivtech\n"
"\n"
" You will receive an additional email when your order has shipped.\n"
" Thank you for shopping BIG SCIENCE SUPPLY DEPOT!\n"
"\n"
" Please do not reply to this message as your reply will be routed to an unmonitored inbox.\n"
" Questions?  Contact customer service xxx-xxx-xxxx."
msgstr ""
"DE: Suministros Big Science\n"
" PARA: Kristi Gordee, SVP de Operaciones\n"
" RE: Gracias por su pedido\n"
"\n"
" Buenas tardes, KRISTI GORDEE,\n"
"\n"
" Hemos recibido su pedido y será procesado inmediatamente.\n"
" 1x Inyector de Presión, RX12 de Rivtech\n"
"\n"
" Recibirá un email adicional cuando su orden haya sido despachada.\n"
" ¡Gracias por confiar en SUMINISTROS SUPPLY DEPOT!\n"
"\n"
" Por favor, no responda este mensaje ya que su respuesta será enviada a una casilla no monitoreada.\n"
" ¿Preguntas? Contacte nuestro servicio al consumidor al xxx-xxx-xxxx."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/computers/TALK_NURSING_HOME.json
msgid ""
"FROM: Bryan Rooters, Reception Manager\n"
" TO: Joe Shert, Receptionist\n"
" RE: Performance Eval\n"
"\n"
" Hi Joe.\n"
" Your 90-day performance evaluation is due.  Please plan to meet with me in my office on Tuesday.\n"
" Thanks."
msgstr ""
"DE: Bryan Rooters, Gerente de Recepción\n"
" PARA: Joe Shert, Recepcionista\n"
" RE: Eval de Desempeño\n"
"\n"
" Hola Joe.\n"
" Tu evaluación de desempeño de los 90 días concluyó. Por favor, vení a mi oficina el martes.\n"
" Gracias."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/computers/TALK_NURSING_HOME.json
msgid ""
"FROM: Bryan Rooters, Reception Manager\n"
" TO: Receptionists\n"
" RE: Housekeeping\n"
"\n"
" Hi team,\n"
" Please be aware that the decision has been made to let go some of the housekeeping staff.\n"
" This decision was made by management to ensure that our operation can run as smoothly and efficiently as possible by passing on these cost savings to the residents.\n"
" To keep up with our high standards of elder care, I will be assigning some additional small tasks to you in the near future.\n"
" As you know, here at Shady Hills we value each and every employee and see this as an excellent opportunity to grow, learn, and provide for the Shady Hills family.\n"
" Please let me know if you have any questions.\n"
" Thanks."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/computers/TALK_NURSING_HOME.json
msgid ""
"FROM: Connie Malackey, Receptionist\n"
" TO: Joe Shert, Receptionist\n"
" RE: Ghosts!?\n"
"\n"
" Joe!  After we heard those weird noises the other night, I talked to some of the nurses.\n"
" We aren't the only ones!  Everyone has heard weird noises coming from the walls.\n"
" Do you think this place is haunted!?"
msgstr ""
"DE: Connie Malackey, Recepcionista\n"
" PARA: Joe Shert, Recepcionista\n"
" RE: Fantasmas!?\n"
"\n"
" Joe! Cuando escuchamos esos ruidos raros la otra noche hablé con algunas de las enfermeras.\n"
" No somos los únicos! Todos escucharon ruidos raros saliendo de las paredes.\n"
" A ver si este lugar está embrujado!?"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/computers/TALK_NURSING_HOME.json
msgid ""
"FROM: Connie Malackey, Receptionist\n"
" TO: Joe Shert, Receptionist\n"
" RE: Mrs.  Palmero\n"
"\n"
" Hi Joe.\n"
" So - you know how Mrs.  Palmero has been acting weird and constantly talking about baking cookies?\n"
" I was talking to one of the nurses and they said that Mrs.  Palmero was prescribed this new medicine?\n"
" It's this weird powder stuff.  Apparently the nurses aren't even qualified to give it to her - she needs a special doctor to come in every day!\n"
" Crazy, right?  I wish all I had to worry about was baking cookies…"
msgstr ""
"DE: Connie Malackey, Recepcionista\n"
" PARA: Joe Shert, Recepcionista\n"
" RE: Sra. Palmero\n"
"\n"
" Hola Joe.\n"
" Viste que la sra. Palmero se estuvo comportando de manera extraña y hablaba constantemente de cocinar galletitas?\n"
" Estaba hablando con una de las enfermeras y me dijo que a la sra. Palmero le prescribieron un medicamento nuevo?\n"
" Es un polvo raro. Aparentemente, las enfermeras no están calificadas para dárselo - ¡necesita que un médico especialista venga todos los días!\n"
" Raro, no? Espero que las galletitas sean lo único en que tenga que preocuparme…"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/computers/TALK_NURSING_HOME.json
msgid ""
"FROM: Joe Shert, Receptionist\n"
" TO: Bryan Rooters, Reception Manager\n"
" RE: Housekeeping\n"
"\n"
" Hi Mr. Rooters, with all due respect I feel that I may have been assigned more of these tasks than the other Receptionists.\n"
" Jim said he hasn't had to do any cleaning in two weeks, yet I have been on cleaning duty 3 times.\n"
" To be clear, I certainly do not mind the extra work!  I just want to ensure you're aware in case there is a computer glitch.\n"
" Thank you and have a great day!"
msgstr ""
"DE: Joe Shert, Recepcionista\n"
" PARA: Bryan Rooters, Gerente de Recepción\n"
" RE: Servicio de Limpieza\n"
"\n"
" Hola, Sr. Rooters, con respeto quiero decirle que siento que me han asignado más de estas tareas que al resto de los recepcionistas.\n"
" Jim dijo que no tuvo que hacer ninguna tarea de limpieza en dos semanas, y sin embargo yo he estado en turno de limpieza 3 veces.\n"
" Para ser claro, ¡no me molesta el trabajo extra! Solo quiero asegurarme que usted está al tanto por si hay algún error con la computadora.\n"
" ¡Gracias y que tenga un buen día!"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/computers/TALK_NURSING_HOME.json
msgid ""
"FROM: Joe Shert, Receptionist\n"
" TO: Bryan Rooters, Reception Manager\n"
" RE: Performance Evaluation\n"
"\n"
" Hi Mr. Rooters, I look forward to seeing you Tuesday for my evaluation.  I've been working really hard to show that I am Shady Hills material!"
msgstr ""
"DE: Joe Shert, Recepcionista\n"
" PARA: Bryan Rooters, Gerente de Recepción\n"
" RE: Evaluación de Desempeño\n"
"\n"
" Hola, Sr. Rooters, espero con ganas verlo el martes para mi evaluación. ¡He estado trabajando mucho para demostrar que puedo trabajar en Shady Hills!"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/computers/TALK_NURSING_HOME.json
msgid ""
"FROM: Kristi Gordee, SVP Operations\n"
" TO: Bryan Rooters, Reception Manager\n"
" RE: Connie Malackey\n"
"\n"
" Bryan,\n"
" Connie has been asking a lot of weird questions about 'Ghosts' and other such nonsense.\n"
" This could look bad for us.  To make it worse, she is hanging out with Joe Shert a lot.\n"
" Shut it down."
msgstr ""
"DE: Kristi Gordee, SVP de Operaciones\n"
" PARA: Bryan Rooters, Gerente de Recepción\n"
" RE: Connie Malackey\n"
"\n"
" Bryan,\n"
" Connie estuvo preguntando muchas cosas raras acerca de 'Fantasmas' y otros sinsentidos.\n"
" Esto podría hacernos quedar mal. Y para hacerlo peor, ella pasa mucho tiempo con Joe Shert.\n"
" Terminá con esto."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/computers/TALK_NURSING_HOME.json
msgid ""
"FROM: Kristi Gordee, SVP Operations\n"
" TO: Bryan Rooters, Reception Manager\n"
" RE: Do Your Job\n"
"\n"
" Bryan,\n"
" Do you not conduct thorough background checks and reviews on new hires?  Joe is related to the Mayor of Springfield.  His 90 day New Employee evaluation is coming up.  Do your job."
msgstr ""
"DE: Kristi Gordee, SVP de Operaciones\n"
" PARA: Bryan Rooters, Gerente de Recepción\n"
" RE: Hacé Tu Trabajo\n"
"\n"
" Bryan,\n"
" ¿No chequeaste el historial y las revisiones de las nuevas contrataciones? Joe es pariente del intendente de Springfield. Se acerca su evaluación de 90 días de Empleado Nuevo. Hacé tu trabajo."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/computers/TALK_NURSING_HOME.json
msgid ""
"FROM: Kristi Gordee, SVP Operations\n"
" TO: Peter St. Travers, SVP Research & Development\n"
" RE: Budget\n"
"\n"
" Peter,\n"
" You need to find a way to reverse what you did ASAP.\n"
" What exactly do you expect me to do to get us out of this?\n"
" The police are investigating us now for foul play."
msgstr ""
"DE: Kristi Gordee, SVP de Operaciones\n"
" PARA: Peter St. Travers, SVP de Investigación y Desarrollo\n"
" RE: Presupuesto\n"
"\n"
" Peter,\n"
" Tenés que encontrar una manera de revertir lo que hiciste lo antes posible.\n"
" ¿Qué esperás que haga yo para sacarnos es esto?\n"
" La policía nos está investigando buscando algo raro."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/computers/TALK_NURSING_HOME.json
msgid ""
"FROM: Kristi Gordee, SVP Operations\n"
" TO: Peter St. Travers, SVP Research & Development\n"
" RE: Shepherds\n"
"\n"
" Peter,\n"
" Leah Shepherds keeps sending me emails, and we just received the papers for yet another lawsuit.\n"
" I don't know what you're thinking but this one is going to be really difficult and could cost us.\n"
" The Board is going to be furious."
msgstr ""
"DE: Kristi Gordee, SVP de Operaciones\n"
" Para: Peter St. Travers, SVP de Investigación y Desarrollo\n"
" RE: Shepherds\n"
"\n"
" Peter,\n"
" Leah Shepherds me sigue mandando mails y acabamos de recibir los papeles de otra demanda judicial.\n"
" No sé qué pensás acerca de esto pero esta va a ser muy difícil y nos puede llegar a costar.\n"
" El Directorio se va a poner furioso."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/computers/TALK_NURSING_HOME.json
msgid ""
"FROM: Leah Shepherds\n"
" TO: Kristi Gordee, SVP Operations\n"
" RE: I am going to sue you\n"
"\n"
" I don't know what kind of sick game your sham of a home is playing, but I am getting to the bottom of it.\n"
" I've hired a lawyer and we are going to sue you.\n"
" I should never have left grandpa in your care.\n"
" How does a PERSON go missing from a NURSING HOME!?  I have pictures of how dirty and disgusting that place is.\n"
" You should be ashamed!"
msgstr ""
"DE: Leah Shepherds\n"
" PARA: Kristi Gordee, SVP de Operaciones\n"
" RE: Los voy a demandar\n"
"\n"
" No sé qué clase de juego sucio están jugando en ese hogar vergonzoso pero voy a llegar hasta el fondo del tema.\n"
" Contraté un abogado y los vamos a demandar.\n"
" Nunca debería haber dejado a mi abuelo al cuidado de ustedes.\n"
" ¿¡Cómo se puede perder una PERSONA en una HOGAR DE ANCIANOS!? Tengo fotos de lo sucio y desagradable que es ese lugar.\n"
" ¡Deberían tener vergüenza!"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/computers/TALK_NURSING_HOME.json
msgid ""
"FROM: Peter St. Travers, SVP Research & Development\n"
" TO: Kristi Gordee, SVP Operations\n"
" RE: Budget\n"
"\n"
" Hi KRISTI GORDEE,\n"
"\n"
" Kristi, please see attached for my budget proposal.\n"
" We need more jet injectors.\n"
"  I am on the verge of a breakthrough - you need to run interference on this Shepherds issue.\n"
" - Peter"
msgstr ""
"DE: Peter St. Travers, SVP de Investigación y Desarrollo\n"
" PARA: Kristi Gordee, SVP de Operaciones\n"
" RE: Presupuesto\n"
"\n"
" Buenos días, KRISTI GORDEE,\n"
"\n"
" Kristi, por favor revisá nuestra propuesta adjunta de presupuesto.\n"
" Necesitamos más inyectores de presión.\n"
" Estoy a punto de hacer un descubrimiento - tenés que realizar una interferencia en eso de Shepherds.\n"
" - Peter"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/computers/TALK_NURSING_HOME.json
msgid ""
"FROM: Unknown Sender\n"
" TO: Peter St. Travers, SVP Research & Development\n"
" RE: Results\n"
"\n"
" Looking forward to your report at the next meeting.\n"
" I put a lot on the line for you, don't disappoint me, Peter.\n"
" Get me results."
msgstr ""
"DE: Desconocido\n"
" PARA: Peter St. Travers, SVP de Investigación y Desarrollo\n"
" RE: Resultados\n"
"\n"
" Espero con ansias tu reporte en la próxima reunión.\n"
" Arriesgué mucho por vos, no me decepcionés, Peter.\n"
" Quiero resultados."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/computers/TALK_NURSING_HOME.json
msgid ""
"FROM: Vincent Fuels, Researcher\n"
" TO: Peter St. Travers, SVP Research & Development\n"
" RE: This is bad!\n"
"\n"
" While you were gone last night, the old man started to wake up and become cranky.\n"
" We had to give him another dose of that elephant tranquilizer!\n"
" I think he might actually be strong enough to break out of his cell now.\n"
" We really need to do something before he kills someone!\n"
" I know this experiment meant a lot to you, but it isn't worth the risk anymore!"
msgstr ""
"DE: Vincent Fuels, Investigador\n"
" TO: Peter St. Travers, SVP de Investigación y Desarrollo\n"
" RE: Estamos complicados!\n"
"\n"
" Cuando habías salido anoche, el viejo empezó a despertarse y se puso de mal humor.\n"
" ¡Le tuvimos que dar otra dosis del tranquilizante de elefantes!\n"
" Creo que en realidad es lo suficientemente fuerte como para escaparse de su celda ahora.\n"
" ¡Tenemos que hacer algo antes de que mate a alguien!\n"
" ¡Ya sé que este experimento significa mucho para vos pero ya no vale la pena el riesgo!"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/computers/TALK_NURSING_HOME.json
msgid ""
"FROM: Will Higgins, VP Information Technology\n"
" TO: Peter St. Travers, SVP Research & Development\n"
" RE: Security\n"
"\n"
" Hello sir,\n"
" I understand your concerns about security.  Rest assured, myself and my team take this very seriously.  I assure you that high-level encryption protects all of our systems.\n"
" Nobody will be able to access any of our PCs without use of the owner's fingerprint authentication, even in the event that the main power supply is cut.\n"
" Nobody unauthorized will ever be able to read our emails or documents."
msgstr ""
"DE: Will Higgins, VP Información Tecnológica\n"
" PARA: Peter St. Travers, SVP de Investigación y Desarrollo\n"
" RE: Seguridad\n"
"\n"
" Buenos días, señor,\n"
" Entiendo sus preocupaciones por la seguridad. Quédese tranquilo, mi equipo y yo tomamos esto de una manera muy seria. Le aseguro que la encriptación de alto nivel protege todos nuestros sistemas.\n"
" Nadie podrá acceder a ninguna de nuestras PC sin utilizar la autenticación por huella digital, incluso llegado el caso de que el sistema eléctrico esté cortado.\n"
" Nadie que no esté autorizado podrá nunca leer nuestros correos ni documentos."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/computers/TALK_NURSING_HOME.json
msgid "JAMES NEONDORTHALL; RECEPTIONIST"
msgstr "JAMES NEONDORTHALL; RECEPCIONISTA"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/computers/TALK_NURSING_HOME.json
msgid "JOSEPH SHERT; RECEPTIONIST"
msgstr "JOSEPH SHERT; RECEPCIONISTA"

