"\n"
"  Gracias por ser miembro de CAMPEONATO DE BINGO ONLINE! Hoy tenemos una entrevista con nuestro último campeón, WINIFRED SMITH! Hacé click en el enlace para escuchar su increíble historia!"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/computers/TALK_RET_COMM.json
msgid ""
"FROM: Jamie Forest, Community Resident, Unit A02\n"
"\n"
"  RE: Survivor's Club!?\n"
"\n"
"  Hey there!  Thanks for your interest in our club.  We are really excited to have you!  I'll have to come check out your panic room sometime!  A few of us are going to check out the cave in the park if you want to join us.  Officially, it's supposed to be off limits, but what are they going to do about it?  I heard it even connects to the sewers, maybe if the world really goes to hell like they're all thinking, we can make use of it!  I'm kidding, I don't believe that crap."
msgstr ""
"DE: Jamie Forest, Residente de la Comunidad, Unidad A02\n"
"\n"
"  RE: Club de Sobrevivientes!?\n"
"\n"
"  ¡Hola! Gracias por tu interés en nuestro club. ¡Estamos muy emocionados de recibirlos! ¡Voy a tener que ir a mirar su habitación del pánico en algún momento! Algunos de nosotros vamos a ir a la cueva del parque si quieren venir. Oficialmente, está fuera de los límites ¿pero qué van a hacer al respecto? Escuché que se conecta con las cloacas, tal vez si todo se va al diablo como piensan, ¡podemos usarla! Es un chiste, no creo en todas esas mentiras."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/computers/TALK_RET_COMM.json
msgid ""
"FROM: Jamie Forest, Community Resident, Unit A02\n"
"  TO: Shady Hills Corporation, Service Portal\n"
"  RE: Seriously!?\n"
"\n"
" My son just told me he keeps receiving advertisements in the mail for a nursing home.  He told me that your company runs it!  Are you trying to get rid of me!?  You're sick!  I demand you have your CEO call me!"
msgstr ""
"DE: Jamie Forest, Residente Comunitario, Unidad A02\n"
"  PARA: Compañía Shady Hills, Portal de Servicio\n"
"  RE: De verdad!?\n"
"\n"
" Mi hijo me acaba de decir que sigue recibiendo publicidades en el mail para un hogar de ancianos. ¡Me dijo que su compañía es la dueña! Están intentando sacarme de encima!? Son asquerosos! Exijo que me llame su CEO!"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/computers/TALK_RET_COMM.json
msgid ""
"FROM: Larry Landborn, Unit B11\n"
"  TO: Shady Hills Corporation, Service Portal\n"
"  RE: Noise complaint\n"
"\n"
"  Hello.  I am once again requesting your help with my neighbor in B10.  There are loud sounds from all times of day.  She claims her grandkids are visiting but the noises have been non-stop for weeks!"
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/computers/TALK_RET_COMM.json
msgid ""
"FROM: Randolph VanBuren, Shady Hills Community Manager\n"
"\n"
"  RE: Security Gate\n"
"\n"
"  Greetings everyone in our fine community.  I wanted to give you an update on Shady Hills' official stance on the security and safety of our esteemed residents.  We are doing everything in our power to keep you safe from harm.  We understand the news has been frightening lately with talk of violence in the streets.  Rest assured you are safe inside of our neighborhood.  Out of an abundance of caution we are installing a new front gate to the entrance of the neighborhood.  This gate will keep back even the most violent of criminals.  Should you have any questions or concerns, please contact our service portal.\n"
"\n"
"  Thank you for your trust in Shady Hills,\n"
" Randolph VanBuren"
msgstr ""
"DE: Randolph VanBuren, Community Manager de Shady Hills\n"
"\n"
"  RE: Verja de Seguridad\n"
"\n"
"  Saludos a todos en nuestra linda comunidad. QUería darles una actualización sobre la postura oficial de Shady Hills sobre la seguridad y bienestar de nuestros queridos residentes. Estamos haciendo todo lo que está a nuestro alcance para mantenerlos a salvo. Entendemos que las noticias han sido aterradoras últimamente con la violencia de las calles. Quédense tranquilos con la seguridad adentro de nuestro vecindarioPara no escatimar en cuidados, instalaremos una verja nueva en la entrada del vecindario. Esta verja mantendrá a raya hasta a los criminales más violentos. Si tienen alguna pregunta o inquietud, por favor, contáctense con nuestro portal de servicio.\n"
"\n"
"  Gracias por su confianza en Shady Hills,\n"
" Randolph VanBuren"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/computers/TALK_RET_COMM.json
msgid ""
"FROM: Sandra Shells, Unit B06\n"
"  TO: Shady Hills Corporation, Service Portal\n"
"  RE: Horrible smell\n"
"\n"
"  There's a bad smell coming from unit B07.  Please look into it.  Thanks."
msgstr ""
"DE: Sandra Shells, Unidad B06\n"
"  PARA: Compañía Shady Hills, Portal de Servicio\n"
"  RE: Olor horrible\n"
"\n"
"  Hay mal olor saliendo de la unidad B07. Por favor, revisen eso. Gracias."

