"I worked on a ranch not too fah from here 'fore it all went down.  I'd love "
"ta get back ta what I did - taking care of horses, cows, all sorts of "
"animals, makin' sure the fields stay safe an' all that.  But now?  I dunno, "
"man.  Just tryin' ta survive, I suppose.  Hopefully, tha world will get back"
" togetha' one day and I can put mah skills ta use doin' what I like."
msgstr ""
"Trabajaba en un rancho cerca de acá antes de que todo se viniera abajo. Me "
"encantaría poder volver a lo que hacía antes - cuidar caballos, vacas, toda "
"clase de animales, fijarme que los campos fueran seguros y todo eso. ¿Pero "
"ahora? No sé, che. Intentando sobrevivir, supongo. Con suerte, el mundo va a"
" recuperarse un día y voy a poder usar mis habilidades haciendo lo que me "
"gusta."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Friendly.json
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_scavenger.json
msgid "I'll think about it."
msgstr "Voy a pensarlo."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Friendly.json
msgid "Is it a good idea to trust a stranger like me this easily?"
msgstr "¿Es buena idea confiar en un extraño como yo así de fácil?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Friendly.json
#: data/json/npcs/militia/GM_Militia_Merchant.json
msgid "Is there something I can do for you?"
msgstr "¿Hay algo que pueda hacer por vos?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Friendly.json
msgid "Just a survivor, looking around.  What are you doing here?"
msgstr "Solo soy un sobreviviente más, mirando. ¿Qué estás haciendo acá?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Friendly.json
msgid "Let's hope it will."
msgstr "Esperemos que así sea."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Friendly.json
msgid "Okay then."
msgstr "Dale, entonces."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Friendly.json
msgid "On a second thought, let me think about it a bit more"
msgstr "Pensandolo bien, dejame que lo reflexione un poco más."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Friendly.json
msgid "Sounds like a good idea - want to join me, then?"
msgstr "Parece una buena idea - ¿querés acompañarme, entonces?"

#. ~ Name suffix of an NPC
#. ~ A rural holdout survivor trying to stay safe
#. ~ A rural holdout survivor completely unwilling to talk
#. ~ A rural holdout survivor that gave up on life
#. ~ A rural holdout survivor willing to trade items
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Friendly.json
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Hostile.json
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Nihilist.json
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Trader.json
msgid "Survivor cowboy"
msgstr "Vaquero sobreviviente"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Friendly.json
msgid ""
"Wha', nevah been ta Boston 'ave ya?  Hope you're not 'avin a hahd time "
"keepin' up with me, but if ya get used ta it, wicked good fun, let me tell "
"ya."
msgstr ""
"¿Qué, nunca estuviste en Boston, no? Espero que no se te haga complicao ir a"
" mi ritmo, pero si te acostumbrás, la vamos a pasar bien, te digo."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Friendly.json
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Trader.json
msgid "What did you before all this?"
msgstr "¿Qué hacías antes de todo esto?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Friendly.json
msgid "What's with the accent?"
msgstr "¿Y ese acento?"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Friendly.json
msgid ""
"Wicked.  Been around the old road long enough ta know how ta handle myself "
"in a pinch.  Knew my way around a gun ever since my da taught me when I was "
"a kid, so ya don't have ta worry about me doing my part."
msgstr ""
"Muy bueno, che. Estuve lo suficiente en el viejo camino como para saber "
"manejarme en quilombos. Sé qué hacer con un arma desde que mi viejo me "
"enseñó de pibe, así que quedate tranquilo que voy a hacer lo mío."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Hostile.json
msgid "Alright, I'm leaving."
msgstr "Está bien, me voy."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Hostile.json
msgid "Alright, alright, I'm going."
msgstr "Está bien, está bien, me voy."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Hostile.json
msgid ""
"Did you just fucking threaten me?!  This is your last chance to piss off or "
"I swear I will end you!"
msgstr ""
"¡¿Me acabás de amenazar, pelotudo?! ¡Te doy la última oportunidad para rajar"
" o te voy a hacer mierda!"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Hostile.json
msgid "Does private property even exist anymore?"
msgstr "¿Todavía sigue existiendo la propiedad privada?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Hostile.json
msgid "Don't threaten me or you will regret it."
msgstr "No me amenacés porque te vas a arrepentir."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Hostile.json
msgid ""
"For the last goddamn time, leave or I will defend myself!  I will kill you!"
msgstr "¡Pero la reputa madre, andate o mi voy a defender! ¡Te voy a matar!"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Hostile.json
msgid ""
"Hey!  Stop right there!  This here is private property!  Not one step "
"closer, you got it?!"
msgstr ""
"¡Hey! ¡Pará ahí! ¡Esto es propiedad privada! ¡Ni un paso más, ¿escuchaste?!"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Hostile.json
msgid "I just want to talk."
msgstr "Solamente quiero conversar."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Hostile.json
msgid "I really just want to talk - I mean no harm."
msgstr "Solamente quiero hablar - no quiero hacer nada malo."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Hostile.json
msgid "I said stay away!  Don't get any closer or I swear I will kill you."
msgstr "¡Te dije que no te acerqués! Un paso más y te juro que te mato."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Hostile.json
msgid "I'd like to see you try."
msgstr "Me gustaría verte intentarlo."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Hostile.json
msgid "It does on my property!  Now blow off!"
msgstr "¡En mi propiedad, sí! ¡Y ahora tomátelas!"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Hostile.json
msgid "Okay, I'll leave."
msgstr "Okay, ya me fui."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Hostile.json
msgid "Whoa, calm down, no reason to get heated."
msgstr "Basta, calmate, no hay razón para calentarse."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Hostile.json
msgid "Yeah that's right!  And don't bother me again, you hear?!"
msgstr "¡Sí, eso es correcto! ¡Y no me vuelvas a molestar, ¿escuchaste?!"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Hostile.json
msgid "You better calm down right now."
msgstr "¡Si no te calmás, te perjudicás vos!"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Nihilist.json
msgid "Alright.  Goodbye."
msgstr "Está bien. Chau."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Nihilist.json
msgid "Alright.  Take care."
msgstr "Está bien. Cuidate."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Nihilist.json
msgid ""
"For how long?  You've seen what's out there.  If we survive today, we'll die"
" the day after.  Or the day after that.  And if we live beyond that, we'll "
"just see everyone we care about die.  All of them.  Might as well get it "
"over with."
msgstr ""
"¿Por cuánto tiempo? Ya viste cómo es la cosa ahí afuera. Si sobrevivimos "
"hoy, vamos a morir al día siguiente. O el día después. Y si seguimos vivos "
"más que eso, vamos a ver morir a todos los seres queridos. Todos. Tal vez "
"sea mejor rendirse ahora."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Nihilist.json
msgid "Good.  Take care."
msgstr "Bien. Cuidate."

#. ~ Success message in teleportation in effect in EoC "EOC_SWIRLING_VORTEX"
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Nihilist.json
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Corrie_Kaja_Dosia.json
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Jane_Schulz.json
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Maria_Serrano.json
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Sonia_Greene.json
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Zachary_Montes.json data/json/traps.json
msgid "How did you get here?"
msgstr "¿Cómo llegaste hasta acá?"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-
#. TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Nihilist.json
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid "I didn't leave the town alone.  I arrived here alone."
msgstr "No me fui del pueblo solo. Pero llegué acá solo."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-
#. TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Nihilist.json
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid "I didn't leave the town alone.  I arrived here alone."
msgstr "No me fui del pueblo solo. Pero llegué acá solo."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-
#. TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Nihilist.json
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid "I didn't leave the town alone.  I arrived here alone."
msgstr "No me fui del pueblo solo. Pero llegué acá solo."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Nihilist.json
msgid "I dunno.  Waiting.  Seeing if something happens I guess."
msgstr "No lo sé. Esperando. Viendo si pasa algo, qué sé yo."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-
#. TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Nihilist.json
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid "I told you to just leave me alone."
msgstr "Te dije que me dejaras en paz."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-
#. TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Nihilist.json
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid "I told you to just leave me alone."
msgstr "Te dije que me dejaras en paz."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-
#. TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Nihilist.json
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid "I told you to just leave me alone."
msgstr "Te dije que me dejaras en paz."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Nihilist.json
msgid ""
"I'm sorry for your loss.  But you still can't give up.  You have a lot to "
"live for!"
msgstr ""
"Lo lamento por tu pérdida. Pero no te des por vencido. ¡Tenés muchas cosas "
"por las que vivir!"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Nihilist.json
msgid "I'm sure your loved one would want you to live on for them."
msgstr ""
"Estoy seguro que tu ser querido hubiera querido que sigas viviendo por "
"ellos."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Nihilist.json
msgid "It will.  Let's get going."
msgstr "Así será. Vamos yendo."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Nihilist.json
msgid "I… I mean… huh.  I guess."
msgstr "Eh… quiero decir… eh. Supongo."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Nihilist.json
msgid "Just leave me alone."
msgstr "Dejame solo."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-
#. TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Nihilist.json
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Lived in a nearby town.  Normal life.  9 to 5 job.  When it all happened, we"
" ran away to find some safety.  But there's no safety anymore, is there?"
msgstr ""
"Vivía en un pueblo cercano. Vida normal. Con trabajo de 9 a 5. Cuando pasó "
"todo, salimos corriendo a un lugar seguro. Pero ya no hay lugares seguros, "
"¿no?"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-
#. TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Nihilist.json
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"Lived in a nearby town.  Normal life.  9 to 5 job.  When it all happened, we"
" ran away to find some safety.  But there's no safety anymore, is there?"
msgstr ""
"Vivía en un pueblo cercano. Vida normal. Con trabajo de 9 a 5. Cuando pasó "
"todo, salimos corriendo a un lugar seguro. Pero ya no hay lugares seguros, "
"¿no?"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-
#. TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Nihilist.json
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"Lived in a nearby town.  Normal life.  9 to 5 job.  When it all happened, we"
" ran away to find some safety.  But there's no safety anymore, is there?"
msgstr ""
"Vivía en un pueblo cercano. Vida normal. Con trabajo de 9 a 5. Cuando pasó "
"todo, salimos corriendo a un lugar seguro. Pero ya no hay lugares seguros, "
"¿no?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Nihilist.json
msgid "No one gets out alive.  Always been that way.  So we keep going."
msgstr "Nadie sale vivo. Siempre ha sido así. Así que seguimos adelante."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Nihilist.json
msgid "Oh.  Hey there."
msgstr "Ah. ¿Qué tal?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Nihilist.json
msgid "On a second thought, wait here a while."
msgstr "Pensándolo bien, quedate acá un tiempo."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Nihilist.json
msgid "Right.  Okay."
msgstr "Bien. Okay."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Nihilist.json
msgid "So shouldn't you be more concerned?  Trying to survive?"
msgstr "¿Y no tendrías que estar más preocupado? ¿Intentando sobrevivir?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Nihilist.json
msgid "So you're just going to give up?"
msgstr "¿Así que te vas a dar por vencido?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Nihilist.json
msgid "That's a start."
msgstr "Es un comienzo."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Nihilist.json
msgid "Thought I heard someone.  What are you doing here?"
msgstr "Me pareció escuchar algo. ¿Qué hacés acá?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Nihilist.json
msgid "Wait, 'we'?"
msgstr "Esperá, ¿'nosotros'?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Nihilist.json
msgid "We all lost someone.  No reason to sit down and die."
msgstr "Todos perdimos a alguien. No es razón para sentarse a morir."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Nihilist.json
msgid "Would you like to come with me?"
msgstr "¿Te gustaría venir conmigo?"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Nihilist.json
msgid "Yeah.  I do."
msgstr "Sí, Ya sé."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Nihilist.json
msgid "Yeah.  I think I will."
msgstr "Sí. Creo que sí."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Nihilist.json
msgid "You can't let yourself be consumed by grief.  It will get better."
msgstr "No dejés que te consuma el dolor. Esto va a mejorar."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Nihilist.json
msgid "You do realize there is an apocalypse going on, right?"
msgstr "¿Te das cuenta que está el apocalipsis en curso, no?"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Trader.json
msgid ""
"Ah, not much really.  Passing through, trying to make a living by trading "
"with folk.  If you're interested, I got a lot of good things on sale, "
"stranger."
msgstr ""
"Ah, no mucho, la verdad. Pasando, intentando ganarme la vida intercambiando "
"cosas con la gente. Si estás interesado, tengo muchas cosas buenas en venta,"
" extraño."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Obtain a Remington 870 Express shotgun"
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Trader.json
msgid "Any news on that Remington?"
msgstr "¿Alguna novedad de la Remington?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Trader.json
msgid "Fair enough.  Goodbye."
msgstr "De acuerdo. Adiós."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Obtain a Remington 870 Express shotgun"
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Trader.json
msgid ""
"Fantastic!  I'll try and get it to the buyer, if he's still alive.  If not, "
"well, still a good gun to sell.  Now, how would you like to be compensated?"
msgstr ""
"¡Fantástico! Voy a intentar comunicarme con el comprador si está vivo "
"todavía. Si no, bueno, sigue siendo una buena arma para vender. Ahora, ¿cómo"
" te gustaría ser recompensado?"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Obtain a Remington 870 Express shotgun"
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Trader.json
msgid ""
"Great!  Let me know when you get it, and I'll try to get in touch with him."
msgstr ""
"¡Genial Avisame cuando la tengas, y voy a intentar contactarme con él."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Trader.json
msgid ""
"Hah, real cute.  Seem the End times didn't take your sense of humor, eh, "
"stranger?"
msgstr ""
"Ja, qué lindo. Parece que los Tiempos finales no te quitaron el sentido del "
"humor, ¿eh, extraño?"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Trader.json
msgid "Hey!  Who goes there?"
msgstr "¡Hey! ¿Quién anda ahí?"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Obtain a Remington 870 Express shotgun"
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Trader.json
msgid "How did you even get this option to display the hell."
msgstr "Cómo hiciste para que aparezca esta opción, puta madre."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Trader.json
msgid ""
"I am a ghost.  I died here 37 years ago, yet I cannot depart this mortal "
"realm."
msgstr ""
"Soy un fantasma. Morí hace 37 años acá y todavía no puedo dejar este reino "
"de mortales."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Trader.json
msgid "I have my moments.  So what are you doing here?"
msgstr "Tengo momentos y momentos. ¿Vos qué estás haciendo acá?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Trader.json
msgid "I'm you, from the future.  I've come to warn you."
msgstr "Soy vos, del futuro. Vine a advertirte."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Trader.json
msgid "If you think so."
msgstr "Si te parece."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Trader.json
msgid "Is there something I can help you with?"
msgstr "¿Hay algo en lo que te pueda ayudar?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Trader.json
msgid "Just another survivor.  What are you doing here?"
msgstr "Solo otro sobreviviente más. ¿Qué estás haciendo acá?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Trader.json
msgid "Not a bad way to live."
msgstr "No es una mala manera de vivir."

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Trader.json
msgid "Obtain a Remington 870 Express shotgun"
msgstr "Conseguir una escopeta Remington 870 Express"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Trader.json
msgid "Speaking of which, I'd like to see your wares."
msgstr "Hablando de eso, mostrame qué tenés para vender."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Obtain a Remington 870 Express shotgun"
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Trader.json
msgid "Suit yourself.  Ain't a rush."
msgstr "Como quieras. No hay apuro."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Obtain a Remington 870 Express shotgun"
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Trader.json
msgid "Then where is it?"
msgstr "Entonces, ¿qué va a ser?"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Obtain a Remington 870 Express shotgun"
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Trader.json
msgid ""
"Well, a gun store is a solid bet, but the model is common enough.  Maybe you"
" can find one in a police station, or a store with hunting gear."
msgstr ""
"Bueno, en una armería es casi seguro, el modelo es bastante común. Tal vez "
"puedas encontrar una en una comisaría o en un negocio de equipo para caza."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Obtain a Remington 870 Express shotgun"
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Trader.json
msgid "Well, now that you mention it…"
msgstr "Bueno, ahora que lo mencionás…"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Trader.json
msgid ""
"Worked as a salesman - high end farming equipment.  Now I know, it may not "
"sound that fancy, but you'd be shocked at how pricy those machines can get."
"  I was lucky enough to be on a fairly remote farm when everything went to "
"shit.  In a way, being a salesman saved me and the experience from the job "
"might allow me to make a living in the apocalypse, bartering for gear and "
"trinkets, so I got that going for me, I suppose."
msgstr ""
"Trabajaba como vendedor - equipamiento de alta tecnología para granjas. "
"Ahora ya sé, pueden no sonar tan sofisticadas, pero te sorprendería saber lo"
" caras que son esas máquinas. Tuve suerte de estar en una granja bastante "
"alejada cuando todo se fue a la mierda. De alguna manera, ser un vendedor me"
" salvó y la experiencia de mi trabajo me permite ganarme la vida en el "
"apocalipsis, comprando y vendiendo equipamiento y chucherías, así que estoy "
"haciendo eso, supongo."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Trader.json
msgid "You do?  Let me take a look."
msgstr "¿Ah, sí? A ver, mostrame."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Obtain a Remington 870 Express shotgun"
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Trader.json
msgid ""
"You see, some time ago, I ran into this guy who offered me a substantial "
"payment in exchange for a Remington 870 Express.  I asked if he'd like "
"another weapon, since nowadays, any gun will do, but for some reason, he's "
"dead set on that particular model.  If you could obtain one for me, well, "
"I'd be quite grateful."
msgstr ""
"Mirá, hace un tiempo me encontré con un tipo que me ofreció un pago "
"importante a cambio de una Remington 870 Express. Le pregunté si quería otra"
" arma ya que, en estos días, cualquier arma sirve pero por alguna razón "
"estaba empecinado en ese modelo en particular. Si podrías conseguirme una, "
"bueno, te estaría muy agradecido."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Trader.json
msgid ""
"You seem like a decent sort, but I'm not really looking for company right "
"now.  Think I'm better off on my own."
msgstr ""
"Parecés bastante decente, pero no estoy buscando compañía en este momento. "
"Creo que voy a seguir por mi cuenta."

#. ~ Name suffix of an NPC
#. ~ A rural holdout survivor living in a barn or a forest or something, all
#. by themselves.  At some point this NPC should get special dialogue.
#. ~ A member of the Gray Moose Militia, trying to safe in their isolated
#. location
#. ~ A survivor who sometimes visits the refugee center.
#. ~ Name of an NPC class
#. ~ A wandering survivor, a pretty tough and capable dude.  Represents an NPC
#. version of a person much like the player.
#. ~ A random scavenger visiting the refugee center to check it out, just like
#. you.
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/rural.json
#: data/json/npcs/militia/GM_Militia_Merchant.json
#: data/json/npcs/random_encounters/john_bailey.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_visiting_scavenger.json
msgid "Survivor"
msgstr "Superviviente"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid ""
"&There's a person reclined on the sofa here.  They're very tall, with their "
"legs reaching to the other armrest, and they're wearing a set of dubious-"
"looking military gear.  They raise a hand in greeting.  \"Placeholder "
"text.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Active Noise Control"
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid "*frowns at you.  \"I've been with you this whole time, dude.  C'mon."
msgstr "*te frunce el ceño. \"Estuve con vos todo este tiempo, loco. Dale."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid ""
"*goes quiet.  They chew their lip, looking off towards a point in space."
msgstr ""
"*se queda callado. Se muerde el labio, mirando a la distancia un punto en el"
" espacio."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid ""
"*smiles at you, genuine and warm.  \"It feels nice to tell it.  You're "
"welcome.\""
msgstr ""
"*te sonríe, de manera cálida y genuina. \"Se siente bien contarlo. De "
"nada.\""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid ""
"*stares at a point at the wall, thinking.  Their wedding ring glints on "
"their left hand."
msgstr ""
"*mira fijo un punto en la pared, pensando. Su anillo de casamiento destella "
"en su mano izquierda."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid "*waits expectantly."
msgstr "*espera con ansiedad."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid ""
"A while later, I made it here.  The gate was open, so I just walked right "
"in.  I tried the intercom, but nobody answered, which I'm sure you had "
"happen to you, too.  Then I realize: this building is super reinforced, "
"unlocked, and seems abandoned now.  Why don't I just stay here?  So I set up"
" my stuff in this here lobby and I spend the night there.  Then I try the "
"intercom again."
msgstr ""
"Un tiempo después, llegué hasta acá. La puerta estaba abierta así que me "
"metí. Intenté el intercomunicador pero no me respondió nadie, que seguro que"
" te pasó a vos también. Después me di cuenta: este edificio está muy "
"reforzado, abierto y ahora parece abandonado. ¿Por qué no me quedo acá? Así "
"que dejé mis cosas en el hall y pasé la noche acá. Después, volví a probar "
"con el intercomunicador."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid "About the gold you wanted…"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid "About those jobs…"
msgstr "Hablando de esos laburos…"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid "Active Noise Control"
msgstr "Activar Control de Ruido"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid "Actually, I don't think I have time for that, sorry."
msgstr "En realidad, no creo tener tiempo para eso, perdón."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid "Actually, I have some places to be right now.  Good to meet you."
msgstr "En realidad, tengo que ir a otro lugar ahora. Un gusto conocerte."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Active Noise Control"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Return to Hub 01"
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid "Alright, let's be off.  You don't mind taking point, right?"
msgstr "Bueno, vamos yendo. ¿No te molesta ir al frente, no?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid "And *now* the rest is history."
msgstr "Y *ahora sí* el resto es historia."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid "And the rest is history."
msgstr "Y el resto es historia."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid "Anything on your mind?"
msgstr "¿En qué estás pensando?"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid ""
"But like, I was a park ranger.  I wasn't exactly making six figures, and you"
" know how bad rent was.  I couldn't buy a ton of canned food, but what I "
"*could* do is can things myself.  Not in tin cans, but in jars; the old way."
"  So every paycheck, I'd use a little bit to buy one or two big glass jars, "
"and on the weekends I'd spend a few hours filling them up with food and "
"sealing them.  I started brushing up at the range too.  Proud gun owner, "
"baby."
msgstr ""
"Pero, digo, era guardabosques. No estaba ganando mucho que digamos y ya "
"sabemos lo difícil que es alquilar. No me podía comprar mucha comida "
"enlatada pero lo que *podía* hacer es enlatar las cosas yo mismo. Pero no en"
" latas de estaño si no en frascos, a la manera antigua. Así que cada vez que"
" cobraba, usaba una parte para comprar uno o dos frascos grandes de vidrios "
"y los fines de semana me pasaba unas horas llenándolos con comida y "
"sellándolos. Empecé a practicar tiro también. Orgulloso portador de arma, "
"amigo."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid "But what?"
msgstr "Pero ¿qué?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid "Computer network?"
msgstr "¿Red de computadoras?"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid "Cool."
msgstr "Copado."

#. ~ Unique name of an NPC
#. ~ Appears in the the surface of Hub 01 as an external mercenary.
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid "Cranberry Foster"
msgstr "Cranberry Foster"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid "Did they answer that time?"
msgstr "¿Y esa vez te contestaron?"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid "Did you want something?"
msgstr "¿Querías algo?"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid ""
"Dude, I wish.  It sounds like there's different people on the mic at "
"different times, but all of them give me the same spiel: nobody's allowed in"
" right now.  I guess I shouldn't raise a fuss about it, honestly.  All being"
" considered, this compound is pretty safe, and the couch ain't so bad."
msgstr ""
"Chabón, eso me gustaría. Parece que hay distintas personas con el micrófono "
"en diferentes momentos pero todas dan el mismo discurso: no se permite que "
"ingrese nadie ahora. Supongo que no tengo que armar quilombo con eso, "
"honestamente. Considerando todo lo que pasa, este recinto es bastante seguro"
" y el sillón no está tan mal."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid ""
"Exchanging my money for goods and services.  Just as the founding fathers "
"intended."
msgstr ""
"Cambiando mi plata por bienes y servicios. Justo como lo querían nuestros "
"próceres."

#. ~ Job description of "Hub Mercenary" NPC class
#. ~ Job description of "Mercenary" NPC class
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_scavenger_mercenary.json
msgid "Fighting for the all-mighty dollar."
msgstr "Luchando por el poderoso caballero Don Dinero."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid "Good to have some company."
msgstr "Es bueno tener un poco de compañía."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid "Got some gold for me?"
msgstr "¿Me trajiste algo de oro?"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid "Have something to say?"
msgstr "¿Tenés algo para decir?"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
