#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/ROBOFAC_SURFACE_FREEMERCHANT.json
msgid ""
"We have been supplying this lab here with food from a few hunting and "
"farming communities nearby.  The roads are tough and dangerous, but it makes"
" good money, and beats scavenging the cities for scraps."
msgstr ""
"Hemos estado trayendo suministros a este laboratorio, comida de cacerías y "
"granjas cercanas. Los caminos están complicados, peligrosos, pero se hace "
"bastante plata, y es mejor que andar cartoneando en las ciudades."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/ROBOFAC_SURFACE_FREEMERCHANT.json
msgid "Welcome…"
msgstr "Bienvenido…"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/ROBOFAC_SURFACE_FREEMERCHANT.json
