msgid "I appreciate it."
msgstr "Lo aprecio. "

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Writers' Will"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "I appreciate it.  I'll get to work on my manuscript."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find cactus seeds"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"I appreciate that, here's your money.  Parts of the cactus, such as the "
"fruit, are edible.  I'll have to ask Simon if he can experiment with some of"
" them."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "End The Nightmare"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "I can still hear it, crying out in the night."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Writers' Will II"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "I can understand that.  The offer's available if you reconsider."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Writers' Will"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "I can understand that.  The offer's still available if you reconsider."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Get some oxycodone"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"I can understand your hesitation <granny_name_g>.  I wouldn't worry about it"
" too much."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Store Up Your Grain"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"I can't thank you enough, here's the pay for it.  Here in a while, we'll "
"have a spot to put all of our food."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Writers' Will II"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "I do appreciate it."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Prickled Meals"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"I don't have any butcher knives in here.  It's difficult to cut anything "
"hard without it.  It's good to have one, even though I won't use it that "
"often.  Could you get me one?"
msgstr ""
"No tengo ningún cuchillo de carnicero acá. Es difícil cortar algo duro sin "
"uno de esos. Está bueno tener uno, incluso aunque no lo necesite muy "
"seguido. ¿Me podrás conseguir uno?"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Prickled Meals"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "I guess I have to cut them with my steak knife."
msgstr "Supongo que voy a tener que cortarlos con mi cuchillo para carne."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Obtain a guitar string"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "I guess I'll just skip that note."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Remnants of Civilization"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "I have a job for you…"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Renewable Energy"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "I have a plan…"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Trophy Hunt I"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"I have the location for an alien crash site.  I want you to investigate and "
"bring me anything you'd find interesting."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Relic Recovery"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "I know most cathedrals keep small relics, that's a good place to look."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Picky Meals"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"I know this doesn't sound important, but I am running low on salt.  We don't"
" just need it as a seasoning, it's also vital for food preservation.  Could "
"you find about 20 pounds of salt for me?"
msgstr ""
"Ya sé que no suena muy importante, pero me estoy quedando sin sal. No "
"solamente la necesitamos para condimentar, también es vital para la "
"conservación de comida. ¿Podrías conseguirme unos 10 kilos de sal?"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Water Pump Construction"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "I need a mechanical pump to finish construction."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Obtain a guitar string"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "I need a new guitar string."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Picky Meals"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "I need a supply of salt."
msgstr "Necesito suministro de sal."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Well Construction"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "I need eight pipes to start construction."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Chicken Coop Construction"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "I need nails to build a chicken coop"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Pickled Meals"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "I need several glass jars."
msgstr "Necesito varios frascos de vidrio."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Prickled Meals"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "I need something sharper."
msgstr "Necesito algo más afilado."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Trophy Hunt I"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Trophy Hunt II"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Trophy Hunt III"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Relic Recovery"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Bible Belt"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "I need your help…"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Picky Meals"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"I really appreciate your help.  Don't worry, you won't leave empty-handed."
msgstr ""
"Realmente aprecio tu ayuda. No te preocupes, no te vas a ir con las manos "
"vacías."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find cactus seeds"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "I suppose more local fauna could work."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Pebble Pusher"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Out Of This World Cures"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"I understand that it seems formidable, but there is a good deal of money for"
" you."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Missing Persons"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"I want to take a look at some of the missing posters for any links.  If you "
"could get me twenty-five of them, I could start my analysis.  Make sure to "
"get posters for adults, I don't think any children could provide links."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Spinning Wheels"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"I want to try making my own cloth, it's getting harder to find the "
"quantities I need.  I'll buy an electric spinning wheel if you can find one,"
" it'd vastly expedite the process."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Get some oxycodone"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"I want you to have these few things of mine, I won't be needing them "
"anymore.  I think I'll take a walk in the woods, get some fresh air for "
"these old bones…"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Trophy Hunt III"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "I wish you the best of luck, may God guide your path."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Well Construction"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "I wish you the best, pal.  I appreciate it."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Missing Persons"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"I wonder what the link could be.  Too much information?  Government "
"conspiracy?  Aliens?  I'll have to find out."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Digital Revolution"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "I'd check an electronics store for one."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Mathematical Measures"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "I'd check one of the local schools for a USB stick with it."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Store Up Your Grain"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "I'd like to have better food storage."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Canning Startup"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "I'd like to have some cans to store food in."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Busy While Working"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "I'd like to read some mystery novels."
msgstr "Me gustaría leer unas novelas de misterio."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find a copy of The Modern Trapper"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "I'd like to read some trapping guides."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Canning Startup"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"I'd look anywhere there's food waste or scrap piles.  We can wash out the "
"cans when we get them."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Busy While Working"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find a copy of The Modern Trapper"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "I'd loot libraries and bookstores."
msgstr "Yo buscaría en bibliotecas y librerías."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "The Honeymooners"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"I'd mean so much to the both of us, and there's a lot of money involved."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Planning Planers"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "I'd poke around any industrial sites for some."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find cactus seeds"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "I'd try a gardening store or a home supply store would have some."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Out Of This World Cures"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"I'd wear a hazmat suit while I'm in there.  Those spores are absolutely "
"nasty for your health, if my observations of <zombies> nearby are any "
"indication."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Plumbing Maintenance"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Planning Planers"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Preservation of Sustenance"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "I'll find someone else, then."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Out Of This World Cures"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"I'll have to be careful with this thing, thanks for getting it for me.  "
"Let's see what this can do…"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "The Honeymooners"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "I'll have to look for them myself…"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Relic Recovery"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Bible Belt"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "I'll have to make my own, I guess…"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Planning Planers"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"I'm looking to construct some fortifications around the church, should any "
"of Satan's devils decide to run amok.  We have most of the material needed "
"for such an undertaking, but processing our raw lumber is taking far too "
"long.  I've heard a planer could do such in a fraction of the time; I'll pay"
" for two of them."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "End The Nightmare"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "I'm not gonna go and fix this <swear> mess."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Retrieve Thorazine"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"I'm running out of antipsychotics, and Arturo is starting to see things "
"again.  I'd pay for seventy-five antipsychotic pills, and be eternally "
"grateful."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Cotton Conundrum"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"I'm starting to run low on cloth for my sewing.  I think three hundred cloth"
" patches should hold me for a while; I'll pay you for them if you get me "
"some."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Out Of This World Cures"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"I'm wanting to experiment with some of the more…  otherworldly fauna that "
"have appeared recently.  I saw these pink berries inside a fungal "
"infestation the other day before I burned it with a Molotov.  If you could "
"get me one, I can pay you with a discount on my medicine."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find cactus seeds"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"I'm wanting to try growing some new plants.  I've never tried growing "
"cactus; if you could find some seeds for me, I'd pay you."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Digital Revolution"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"I've assembled quite a collection of evidence in my research, and I want an "
"easier way to organize it.  If you could get me one of those e-ink tablets, "
"I could scan all my documents into an easily-preserved digital format.  "
"There's some money for you, too."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Store Up Your Grain"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"I've been drawing up some plans to expand our food storage around here.  Now"
" that we won't starve to death anytime soon, our old crates just aren't "
"cutting it, so we're going to build a small warehouse to store everything, "
"and I've gathered a crew to build it.  We've got most of the materials "
"covered, but we don't have enough sheet metal to make the shelves.  If you "
"could get us about 5,000 pounds of the stuff, I'll pay you handsomely with "
"what we have.  How does that sound?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Relic Recovery"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"I've been looking to spruce up this place with some iconography, and a small"
" relic would do just that.  It'd help tremendously with morale around here, "
"so I need you to find one for me."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Writers' Will II"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"I've been writing for a bit, and I've used up my pencils.  If you could get "
"me thirty more, I'll give you some money."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Finding Files"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"I've decided to broaden my horizons with my research, now I need more "
"general documents for examination, get the big picture.  If you could get me"
" two hundred files, on anything, I'll pay you for them."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Natural Chemistry"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"I've decided to start making more concentrated remedies for more serious "
"cases, but I don't have a way of refining any herbs to that degree.  I'd pay"
" for a chemistry set."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Get some oxycodone"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"I've got an idea to solve my problem.  I'll pay you if you can find seven "
"oxycodone pills for me; the ones they used to prescribe after a surgery."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Fishy Business"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"I've had a craving for fish recently.  Could you find three cans of tuna for"
" me?  I'll pay you for them."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Mathematical Measures"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"I've started working on a small project of mine which requires a great deal "
"of computational input.  A piece of MatheMAX software would be a great help."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Trophy Hunt III"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"If I were you, I'd bring a gun and a butcher knife.  I don't think bug spray"
" work anymore."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Store Up Your Grain"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "If you can find a steel mill, I'd look there."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Investigate the Center"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "If you see this, it's a bug."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "Investigate the Center"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Trophy Hunt III"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"It feels like I'm doing this for revenge.  I have one last mission for you."
"  Ever seen those ginormous bee hives?  Well, I can tell you where the "
"closest one is.  Just kill off one stray bee, harvest its stinger and bring "
"it to me."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Spinning Wheels"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "It'd really help me in getting your stuff to you faster."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Relic Recovery"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Bible Belt"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "It'd really help us…"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Water Pump Construction"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"It's less like a well, and more like a covered pit currently.  I'll need you"
" to find a mechanical pump, one that will make this <swear> thing work."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Pickled Meals"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "It's not a big deal, it isn't that urgent."
msgstr "No es gran cosa, no es tan urgente."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Picky Meals"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "It's okay, I can do without them.  Just let me know if you reconsider."
msgstr "Está bien, no es tan importante. Pero avisame si te arrepentís."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Chicken Coop Construction"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "Its a simple job."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Canning Startup"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find a copy of The Modern Trapper"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Store Up Your Grain"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "Just bring it to me when you have it."
msgstr "Traémelos cuando los tengas."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Busy While Working"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "Just bring them to me when you have it."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Pickled Meals"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "Just let me know if you change your mind."
msgstr "Haceme saber si cambiás de idea."

#. ~ Description of mission "Purging Heresy"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "Kill some bandits for Helena Misinter."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mission "End The Nightmare"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "End The Nightmare"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "Kill whatever's keeping Zachary up at night."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Water Pump Construction"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "Managed to find that pump?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Trophy Hunt II"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "Managed to succeed, survivor?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "Mathematical Measures"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Bible Belt"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "May God bless you, <name_g>."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Bible Belt"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "May God bless you."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Plumbing Maintenance"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Planning Planers"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "May God protect you."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Preservation of Sustenance"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "May the Lord bless you."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "Missing Persons"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Water Pump Construction"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"Much obliged, survivor.  Thanks to you, we don't need to worry about where "
"our water's gonna come from.  Here, take this as a token of our gratitude."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Obtain a guitar string"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "Music shops should have some."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "Natural Chemistry"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Busy While Working"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Canning Startup"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "Nevermind then.  I hope you'll change your mind."
msgstr "Entonces no importa. Espero que cambies de idea."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Trophy Hunt II"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"Nice catch!  Friend, you've proven yourself to be an extraordinary survivor."
"  Maybe there's still hope for humanity.  I'll take that egg, thank you very"
" much.  Here's your reward and some bullets for your effort."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Renewable Energy"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "No electricity for us then."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Canning Startup"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"Now that we have some canning pots from Helena, we can start storing "
"foodstuffs more easily around here.  Recycling our old tin cans is great and"
" all, but if we get a big influx of new foods, then we can't properly store "
"it all.  As such, if you could find about 100 more empty tin cans for me, "
"I'd really appreciate it."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Chicken Coop Construction"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"Now that we've got a steady supply of water, I've been thinking about "
"raising some livestock.  I'm starting with some chickens I found on a farm "
"the other day, but I don't have a coop for them.  If you can get me 150 "
"nails, I can start building one."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Well Construction"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"Now that's some enthusiasm, pal.  Ever since our water supply shut off, "
"we've been using the nearby river for most of our water needs.  Who knows "
"how many bloated corpses have decayed in that.  I want to construct a well, "
"but I'm missing some building materials - eight pipes to be exact."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Radio-active"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"Now we can get in touch with a lot more people, see what's out there.  Thank"
" you, <name_g>."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "Obtain a guitar string"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Finding Files"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"Office buildings, police stations, any high-profile place should have what "
"we want."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Retrieve the fertility supplements"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"Oh thank you!  Darryl will be so happy to hear about this!  Take there for "
"your payment, it must've been hard for you."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "End The Nightmare"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"Oh thank you!  Now I can finally get a nights sleep.  Here, I've got some "
"icons saved up, I want you to have them."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Renewable Energy"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"Okay, great.  We're gonna create a charger and a generator all in one.  "
"Here's the battle plan.  Zack could create the framework, you'll get me a "
"solar array or four solar panels.  The rest I can craft or repurpose from "
"the bus.  Helena's promised us a reward if this thing lives up to her "
"standards."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "The Honeymooners"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"Olwen and I have been dating for a while now, and I was planning on asking "
"her to marry me.  I never got the chance to buy our rings before "
"<the_cataclysm>, but I think I'll surprise her with some in a few days.  If "
"you could get me two of them, I'll pay a fair price: $250 in icons."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Obtain a guitar string"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"One of my guitar strings busted from where I smacked a zombie.  If you could"
" get me a piano wire, I can fix my guitar."
msgstr ""

