#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Purging Heresy"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "Righteous judgement shall come!"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Investigate the Center"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "See who's over there."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Writers' Will"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"Since <the_cataclysm> happened, I've had a surprising amount of free time.  "
"I want to start writing, but there's very little paper around here.  For the"
" time being, eight hundred sheets should do; I'll pay if you can get it for "
"me."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find a copy of The Modern Trapper"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"Since we've got all the stuff to store away food, I figure that it's time we"
" get some more.  I've been talking it over with Russell, and I think setting"
" out animal traps is a good way to go.  The problem is, nobody here knows "
"how to do it.  I've heard that The Modern Trapper is a good place to start, "
"so if you could get me a copy, I'd really appreciate it."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find a copy of The Modern Trapper"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "So, have you found it?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Busy While Working"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "So, have you found the books?"
msgstr "¿Y? ¿Encontraste los libros?"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Canning Startup"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "So, have you found the cans?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Dinner for Two"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "Someone's house might have one."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Busy While Working"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"Sometimes it gets a little bit boring up here, and I like to read something "
"to take my mind off of things.  Problem is, I've run out of books.  I've "
"been wanting to read some mystery novels as of late, so could you get me "
"three of them?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Store Up Your Grain"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "Sorry, I had to find someone else since you didn't come through."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "Spinning Wheels"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "Store Up Your Grain"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Water Pump Construction"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Chicken Coop Construction"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "Take care of yourself out there."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Prickled Meals"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "Thank you for accepting.  I can't cut anything with this dull knife."
msgstr ""
"Gracias por aceptar. No puedo cortar nada con este cuchillo desafilado."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Pickled Meals"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"Thank you for your help.  Here's your reward.  I have one more task to do."
msgstr ""
"Gracias por tu ayuda. Acá está tu recompensa. Tengo otra tarea para "
"ofrecerte."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Writers' Will II"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"Thank you so much!  I'll get back to work on my manuscript, I should have it"
" ready in a month or so."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Obtain a guitar string"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "Thank you so much!  This should last for a while."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Get some oxycodone"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"Thank you, <granny_name_g>.  I'm glad the youngsters still help the elderly."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Relic Recovery"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "Thank you, <name_g>.  Take these for your trouble."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Digital Revolution"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Missing Persons"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Finding Files"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "Thank you, <name_g>.  The truth is ever closer!"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Cotton Conundrum"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "Thank you, <name_g>.  This should do me for a while."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Fishy Business"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "Thank you, here's your payment."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find a copy of The Modern Trapper"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "Thank you, me and Russell will start studying it soon."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Canning Startup"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"Thank you, now we won't have to worry about running out of food in the "
"winter."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Retrieve Thorazine"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "Thank you.  Arturo will be happy to get these."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Fungus Among Us"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"Thank you.  I don't like killing people, but this time we had too.  Here, "
"take this; its some of our internal money that we've started using.  You "
"know those religious pamphlets shaped like bills people would leave?  These "
"are some of those, couldn't stand 'em myself."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Chicken Coop Construction"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"Thank you.  I should have some eggs in a week, once I finish the coop.  Come"
" back and buy some!"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Remnants of Civilization"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "Thank you.  Maybe you people aren't so bad after all."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Busy While Working"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"Thank you.  This will keep me busy for a while.  Please take this as a token"
" of my gratitude."
msgstr ""
"Gracias. Esto me va a tener entretenido por un tiempo. Por favor, aceptá "
"esto como una muestra de mi gratitud."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Preservation of Sustenance"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"Thank you.  You're welcome to some of our first batch, if you're interested."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "The Honeymooners"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "Thanks <name_g>, I'm counting on you."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Pickled Meals"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"Thanks for accepting this task.  It'll take a load off my shoulders.  I "
"finally won't have to worry about this problem anymore."
msgstr ""
"Gracias por aceptar esta tarea. Me sacás un peso de encima. Finalmente no "
"tendré que preocuparme por este problema."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Dinner for Two"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Natural Chemistry"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Pebble Pusher"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Out Of This World Cures"
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
#: data/json/npcs/scrap_trader/scrap_trader.json
msgid "Thanks, <name_g>."
msgstr "Gracias, <name_g>."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Trophy Hunt II"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "Thanks, make sure you're ready for whatever beast is waiting for you."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Writers' Will"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "Thanks, you'll be the first to see my writing."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Obtain a guitar string"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "Thanks.  I'll give you a performance when you get back with it."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Fungus Among Us"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "That fungus is going to kill us all if it isn't stopped."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Trophy Hunt I"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Trophy Hunt II"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "That's all right.  Not everyone is cut out for this."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Dinner for Two"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Fishy Business"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Natural Chemistry"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Pebble Pusher"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Out Of This World Cures"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Digital Revolution"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Missing Persons"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Finding Files"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Mathematical Measures"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Radio-active"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Cotton Conundrum"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Spinning Wheels"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "That's too bad…"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "The Honeymooners"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Renewable Energy"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"The best place to look is probably on rooftops.  You'll need a wrench, and "
"maybe a stepladder to get up and down safely."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Renewable Energy"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"The great work is now complete.  Are you good with words, by the way?  I was"
" thinking, maybe you should be the one to negotiate with Helena.  But "
"whatever you do, don't accept their icons.  Our work is worth a lot more "
"than their valueless currency."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Retrieve Thorazine"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "The storage room of a pharmacy should have them."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Missing Persons"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"There should be plenty on poster-boards around town.  A police station "
"should have a lot."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Picky Meals"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"There's a lot of places to look.  They are common in house kitchens, "
"restaurants or grocery stores."
msgstr ""
"Hay muchos lugares para buscar. Es común que haya en las cocinas de las "
"casas, restoranes y almacenes."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Fungus Among Us"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"There's a weird fungus that started to invade ever since <the_cataclysm>, "
"and several individuals in strange robes are cultivating it.  I've seen what"
" it can do, so I need you to execute them and destroy all traces of these "
"strange mushrooms."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Retrieve the fertility supplements"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "They should be near the counter, or on a shelf."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Radio-active"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "This could give us a prosperous future, <name_g>."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Spinning Wheels"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "This is wonderful!  I'll really be able to put the pedal to the metal!"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Retrieve the fertility supplements"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "This means so much to me."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Trophy Hunt III"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "This passion of mine may just be getting to me…"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Investigate the Center"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"This should be very useful to us.  Now we can truly begin our march of "
"righteousness."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Finding Files"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"This should occupy my work for a while.  Thanks <name_g>, we'll discover the"
" truth one of these days."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Pickled Meals"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"This task is bit more serious.  I don't have enough jars to preserve "
"perishables for the future, and we can't just store everything in salt.  We "
"could do our own canning if we had some more glass jars.  I could get by "
"with 5 for now."
msgstr ""
"Esta tarea es un poco más seria. No tengo los suficientes frascos para "
"preservar la comida perecedera, y no podemos almacenar todo en sal. "
"Podríamos hacer nuestras propias conservas si tuviéramos más frascos de "
"vidrio. Con 5 ya estaríamos bien, por ahora."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Mathematical Measures"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid "This'll be quite useful in the future.  Thank you, <name_g>."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Retrieve the fertility supplements"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
msgid ""
"To be honest, I'm not alright.  Have you met Darryl?  He's my husband, and "
"we had a go at getting a baby recently.  The thing is, its not happening.  "
"Now that we're in a safe spot, on our feet again, I want to try.  I'm trying"
" to find some fertility supplements.  I ordered some before <the_cataclysm>,"
" but I never got to pick them up.  If you'd go over and get them for me, I'd"
" pay you."
msgstr ""

