msgid ""
"*leans casually against the brick wall of the shelter.  \"Hello again, "
"gorgeous\""
msgstr ""
"*se apoya informalmente contra la pared de ladrillos de un refugio. \"Hola "
"de nuevo, hermosa\""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-
