msgctxt "u:m"
msgid "Always good to see you, friend."
msgstr "Siempre es bueno verte, amigo."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-
#. TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgctxt "u:n"
msgid "Always good to see you, friend."
msgstr "Siempre es bueno verte, amigo."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid ""
"Amazing!  My lucky day.  Let's see here.  What can I offer… I can scrounge "
"up some merch bucks for, say, five joints or joints-worth of the good stuff."
msgstr ""
"¡Genial! Mi día de suerte. Vamos a ver. Qué te puedo ofrecer… Puedo juntar "
"unos mercs por, digamos, cinco porros o para armarlos de buena calidad."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid "Anything you buying or selling, by chance?"
msgstr ""
"¿Algo que tengas para vender o que quieras comprar, por una de esas "
"casualidades?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid "Boring.  I'm going to go destroy something."
msgstr "Un embole. Voy a ir a romper algo."

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid "Bring an acoustic guitar"
msgstr "Traer una guitarra acústica"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid "Can you play heavy metal on an acoustic guitar?"
msgstr "¿Podés tocar heavy metal en una guitarra acústica?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid "Cheers!"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid "Cheers!  Later."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid "Couldn't hurt."
msgstr "Mal no va a hacer."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-
#. TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgctxt "u:f"
msgid ""
"Daym.  You're probably the best dancer I've ever had the honor of meeting.  "
"Well done.  Well done indeed."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-
#. TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid ""
"Daym.  You're probably the best dancer I've ever had the honor of meeting.  "
"Well done.  Well done indeed."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-
#. TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgctxt "u:n"
msgid ""
"Daym.  You're probably the best dancer I've ever had the honor of meeting.  "
"Well done.  Well done indeed."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid "Do you know any tunes good to dance to?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Unique name of a male NPC
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid "Draco Dune"
msgstr "Draco Dune"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Bring an acoustic guitar"
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid "Great!  We'll be makin' music in no time!"
msgstr "¡Genial! ¡Vamos a empezar con la música en vivo en cualquier momento!"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Bring an acoustic guitar"
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid ""
"Hell yeah, bud!  You just made a lot of people really happy!  In thanks, "
"I'll have enough cash to offer you more recompense for our little dealings."
msgstr ""
"¡Una buena, viejo! ¡Acabás de hacer feliz a mucha gente! En agradecimiento, "
"tengo suficiente plata para ofrecerte en recompensa por nuestros pequeños "
"acuerdos."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid ""
"Hey, don't get all serious on me all of a sudden.  It helps me relax.  "
"Lubricates my joints.  Eases the pain, ya know?  Makes every day a bit more "
"bearable."
msgstr ""
"Hey, no te pongas tan serio así de repente. Me ayuda a relajarme. Lubrica "
"mis articulaciones. Alivia el dolor, ¿sabías? Hace que cada día sea un "
"poquito más llevadero."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid "Hi Draco, nice to meet you.  I gotta go though."
msgstr "Hola, Draco, encantado de conocerte. Pero me tengo que ir."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid "Hi Draco, nice to see you too.  I gotta go though."
msgstr "Hola, Draco, qué bueno verte. Pero me tengo que ir."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid "Hi again, Draco, nice to see you too."
msgstr "Hola otra vez, Draco, qué bueno verte."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid "Hi, Draco, how are you doing?"
msgstr "Hola, Draco, ¿cómo estás?"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Bring an acoustic guitar"
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid "How's my guitar comin', friend?"
msgstr "¿Y? ¿Cómo va lo de mi guitarra, amigo?"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Bring an acoustic guitar"
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid "Huh.  This… is something, isn't it."
msgstr "Mh. Esto… es algo, ¿no?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid "I can help."
msgstr "Puedo ayudarte."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid "I could be persuaded."
msgstr "Puedo ser convencido."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid "I don't need to hear amateur-hour karaoke around here.  Goodbye."
msgstr "No necesito escuchar la hora karaoke amateur por acá. Chau."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid "I fight stuff."
msgstr "Lucho con cosas."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Bring an acoustic guitar"
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid ""
"I just want a functional acoustic guitar.  Preferably one that hasn't been "
"used to cave in any zombie skulls."
msgstr ""
"Solamente quiero una guitarra acústica que funcione. Preferiblemente, una "
"que no haya sido usada para romperle la cabeza a un zombi."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid "I think I would've done the same.  Nobody around here has a guitar?"
msgstr "Creo que yo hubiera hecho lo mismo. ¿Acá nadie tiene una guitarra?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid "I want to see it all."
msgstr "Quiero verlo todo."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid "I'll consider it.  Thanks for the tunes."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid "I'll tell you what type I am."
msgstr "Te voy a decir que clase soy."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid "I'm not comfortable with where this is going."
msgstr "No me siento cómodo con la dirección de esta conversación."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid "I'm not doing this."
msgstr "No voy a participar de esto."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid "I'm not your drug dealer, buddy."
msgstr "No soy tu dealer, chabón."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid "I've been thinking about that deal you mentioned."
msgstr "Estuve pensando en eso que me mencionaste."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid "It's called dub-step and I like it.  Goodbye, old man."
msgstr "Se llama dub-step y a mí me gusta. Chau, vejestorio."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid "Just a sec, got something I need to do first."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid "Leaving."
msgstr "Irme."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid "Let me ask you something.  What type are you?"
msgstr "Dejame preguntarte algo. ¿Qué clase sos?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid "Let's talk about getting you that guitar."
msgstr "Vamos a hablar de cómo conseguirte esa guitarra."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid "Man, just imagine what I could do with a new guitar."
msgstr "Chabón, imaginate lo que podría hacer con una guitarra nueva."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid "Maybe I could help with something?"
msgstr "¿Tal vez pueda ayudar en algo?"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid ""
"Me too!  For now, anyway, that's not really possible for me.  I mean, I "
"guess you know better than me about that.  Man, I used to travel all around."
"  Saw halfa the States with my guitar on my back.  Now, though, well, I "
"think I'll stay inside til this all flies over."
msgstr ""
"¡Yo también! Por ahora, igual, no puedo hacer eso. Quiero decir, supongo que"
" sabés más que yo acerca de eso. Che, antes viajaba por todas partes. Vi la "
"mitad del país con mi guitarra en la espalda. Pero ahora, bueno, creo que me"
" voy a quedar adentro hasta que esto termine."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid ""
"Me too!  I did stand-up comedy at a club once.  Well, outside a club anyway."
"  You know what'd be funny?  Next time one of those stupid ferals starts "
"running around chasing after a squirrel or something, if I had me a guitar I"
" could play the Benny Hill tune and get everybody crackin' up.  Places needs"
" some laughter badly."
msgstr ""
"¡Yo también! Hice stand-up en un boliche una vez. Bueno, afuera del boliche,"
" en realidad. ¿Sabés qué sería gracioso? La próxima vez que esos estúpidos "
"salvajes empiecen a correr persiguiendo a una ardilla o algo, si tuviera una"
" guitarra podría tocar el tema de Benny Hill y todos se cagarían de risa. El"
" lugar necesita mucho unas risas."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid ""
"Me too!  Times are hard for folks and that's no laughing matter.  People "
"need some normality in these times.  Some reminders of how things used to "
"be.  I think a sing-along or two could do folks good."
msgstr ""
"¡Yo también! Los tiempos son difíciles para los chicos y no es joda. La "
"gente necesita un poco de normalidad por estos días. Algo que les recuerde "
"cómo eran las cosas antes. Creo que una o dos canciones les va a hacer bien."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid ""
"Me too!  You can understand how folks be wantin' some liveliness in these "
"times.  Some music sure would help with that.  Damn, I miss it.  All I hear "
"is those MP3 players with their tin-can drum machines and whiny vocals.  "
"Help me find a guitar and we'll really get this place smokin'!"
msgstr ""
"¡Yo también! Podés entender que los chicos acá quieren un poco de jolgorio "
"en estos momentos. Un poco de música seguro que vendría bien. Puta madre, la"
" extraño. Ahora lo único que escucho son esos reproductores de MP3 con esas "
"baterías electrónicas de lata y voces quejosas. ¡Ayudame a encontrar una "
"guitarra así le ponemos onda a este lugar!"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid ""
"Me too.  It's fight a stay afloat in these times.  Some music would lift all"
" spirits, though, don't you think?"
msgstr ""
"Yo también. Es una lucha mantenerse a flote a veces. Pero un poco de música "
"levantaría el ánimo, ¿no te parece?"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid ""
"Nice to meet you too.  What brings you to these parts?  Got any stories to "
"share?  Happy ones, hopefully… we've had our fill of sadness around here."
msgstr ""
"El gusto es mío. ¿Qué te trae por acá? ¿Tenés alguna historia para "
"compartir? Historias felices, en lo posible… ya estamos bastante completos "
"con tristeza por acá."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid "Nice to meet you, Draco."
msgstr "Un gusto conocerte, Draco."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid "No more indeed."
msgstr "Es verdad, ya no."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid "No problem, Draco."
msgstr "No hay drama, Draco."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Bring an acoustic guitar"
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid "No worries.  They don't grow from trees, but we have time."
msgstr "No hay drama. No crecen en los árboles, pero tenemos tiempo."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid "No, not playing this game."
msgstr "No, no voy a jugar ese juego."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid "Nope, sorry."
msgstr "Nada, no."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid ""
"Not in the mood to dance, huh?  Or perhaps you should try wearing something "
"less encumbering.  You know, if you want to."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid "Oh my oh my.  That was impressive!  Sweet moves!"
msgstr ""

