#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Bring an acoustic guitar"
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid "Oh well.  I understand your reluctance… I guess."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid ""
"Oh wow.  I didn't even know the human body could move like that.  I don't "
"know what to say.  That was amazing!"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid "Oh yeah, some people've been growing it in their basements."
msgstr "Ah, sí, vi algunos cultivos en sótanos."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid ""
"Oh you don't have time for all that, do you?  Well, I'll give you the short "
"version.  I've gotten kinda tired of it in the telling.  Frankly, it's not "
"as heroic, not as inspiring, not as tragic, and certainly not as funny as "
"some of the tales around here.  But it's mine, ya know?  I'm a musician.  "
"Guitar's my baby.  You like folk and the blues, friend?  Well, that was my "
"bag and I sure could please my own ear with em, anyway.  Folks who's bein' "
"generous might also say it pleased theirs.  Problem is, I seem to be between"
" guitars right now, you know?  Temporarily guitar-light, if you get my "
"saying.  Problem is, in the run for my life, I had to use old Jasmine as a "
"bit of a billy club.  Had to curb some rowdy dudes on my way here.  It was "
"her or me, you understand?  You wouldn't begrudge a man breakin' his "
"instrument to save his life, would ya?"
msgstr ""
"Oh, no tenés tiempo para todo eso, eh. Bueno, te voy a contar la versión "
"corta. Ya un poco que me cansé de contarla. Hablando en serio, no es ni tan "
"heroica, ni tan inspiradora, ni tan trágica, ni tan graciosa como algunas de"
" las historias de por acá. Pero es mía, ¿entendés? Soy música. La guitarra "
"es mi criatura. ¿Te gusta el folk y el blues, amigo? Bueno, eso era lo mío y"
" podía darme placer en mis propios oídos. Algunos amigos generosos dirían "
"que también les daba placer a ellos. El problema es que parece que estoy "
"entre guitarras en este momento, ¿entendés? Un poco liviano de guitarra "
"estoy, si entendés lo que te quiero decir. El problema es que, cuando corría"
" por mi vida, tuve que usar a la vieja Jasmine como un garrote. Tuve que "
"contener a algunos chabones molestos cuando venía para acá. Era ella o yo, "
"¿entendés? Nadie envidiaría a un hombre que tiene que romper su instrumento "
"para salvar su vida, ¿no?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid "Oh, alright.  I'll be back later with the goods."
msgstr "Oh, bueno. Después vuelvo con algo."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid "Oh.  Uh, sure."
msgstr "Ah. Eh, seguro."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid "On second thought, maybe later."
msgstr "Pensándolo mejor, por ahí después."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid ""
"Right, of course I knew that!  There's tons of the stuff out there for the "
"taking."
msgstr ""
"¡Sí, obvio que sabía! Hay bocha de esa cosa ahí para el que la agarre."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid ""
"Say, I don't mean to get you in any trouble or nothing, if any folks still "
"care about that, but you haven't seen any green around town, have ya?"
msgstr ""
"Mirá, no quiero meterte en otro quilombo ni nada por el estilo, si a alguno "
"le importa eso todavía, pero ¿no viste algún fasulingui por el pueblo?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid "See you around, Draco."
msgstr "Nos vemos, Draco."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid "So then, what type are you?"
msgstr "Entonces, ¿qué clase sos vos?"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-
#. TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
