msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid "Sure."
msgstr "Seguro."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid "Thanks, Later."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid "That'd be awesome."
msgstr "Eso estaría genial."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid "The 'doesn't have time for this' type."
msgstr "La clase 'no tengo tiempo para esta gilada'."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid "The 'just getting by' type."
msgstr "La clase 'llevándola'."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid "The serious type."
msgstr "La clase seria."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid "The zany type."
msgstr "La clase chiflada."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid "Uhh, what do you mean?"
msgstr "Eh... ¿a qué te referís?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid "WHAT."
msgstr "QUÉ."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid ""
"Well now, good to see another new face!  Welcome to the center, friend, I'm "
"Draco."
msgstr ""
"Ahora sí, ¡qué bueno ver una cara nueva! Bienvenido al centro, amigo, me "
"llamo Draco."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid ""
"Well now, my friend-o!  You just asked a mighty fine question.  Folks have "
"been missing the little things in life.  New shoes, new cellphones, can't "
"exactly go shopping, or, well, I guess you sorta can, if you mind the broken"
" glass.  I left my wallet in an outdoorsman's store when I 'bought' this "
"warmer coat.  Figured that's kinda it, you know?  It didn't matter anymore."
"  I don't think my insurance's going to pay out for any health care I get "
"now.  I did what you see in the movies though, I rolled a joint with a "
"hundred dollar bill.  Ended up coughing and rerolling it in regular paper "
"though.  Was too harsh.  Just letting you know in case you get the smart "
"idea of trying it."
msgstr ""
"¡Bueno, mi amigazo! Acabás de hacer una pregunta muy, muy buena. Los chicos "
"se están perdiendo las pequeñas cosas de la vida. Zapatillas nuevas, "
"celulares nuevos, no pueden ir de compras, o, bueno, más o menos sí, si no "
"te importa el vidrio roto. Dejé mi billetera en un negocio para amantes de "
"la naturaleza cuando 'compré' esta camperita. Me parece que es así, ¿viste? "
"Ya no importaba. No creo que mi prepaga me vaya a pagar la atención médica "
"que recibo ahora. Hice lo que aprendimos de las películas, me armé un porro "
"con un billete de cien dólares. Terminé tosiendo y volviéndolo a armar en un"
" papel común. Era demasiado áspero. Te digo por si se te ocurre hacer lo "
"mismo."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid "Well then, I'll leave you here where it's safe."
msgstr "Bien entonces, te voy a dejar acá que es seguro."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Bring an acoustic guitar"
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid ""
"Well, I'll let you in on a little secret.  Guitars COULD be found at a music"
" store.  Let that one sink in a bit."
msgstr ""
"Bueno, te cuento un pequeño secreto. Las guitarras PODRÍAN encontrarse en un"
" local de instrumentos. Pensá en eso un ratito."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid "Well, let me know when you have.  I'm not going anywhere."
msgstr "Bueno, avisame cuando tengas. Voy a estar por acá."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid ""
"Well, look at you.  Asking after random folks like some sort of shepherd!  "
"No, don't take offense now… I mean it well.  We could use more folks askin' "
"after other folks.  I figure it makes the world go round, now, more than "
"ever.  I'm well, friend, considering I have both of my legs and much of my "
"health left to me.  A bit of pain in the back, but can't really complain "
"much if that's the worst of it, right?  You look like you've had a story of "
"your own to tell, just getting here.  I'm writing it in my imagination right"
" now.  Fought through countless hordes, run ragged, chased at every turn, "
"yeah, no thank-you any more of that for me!"
msgstr ""
"Bueno, mirate. ¡Preguntándole a cualquiera como si fueras una clase de "
"pastor! No, no te ofendas… te lo digo bien. Nos vendrían bien personas que "
"andan preguntándole por otras personas. Supongo que es lo que hace funcionar"
" al mundo, ahora más que nunca. Yo estoy bien, amigo, considerando que tengo"
" las dos piernas y algo de mi salud ya se fue. Un poco de dolor en la "
"espalda pero no me puedo quejar mucho si eso es lo peor, ¿no? Vos parecés "
"tener una historia propia para contar, por llegar hasta acá. Estoy "
"escribiendo en mi mente en este momento. Peleó a través de innumerables "
"hordas, dejado por muerto, perseguido en cada esquina, sí, ¡no, gracias, yo "
"eso no lo quiero!"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid "What about you, how're you doing?"
msgstr "¿Y vos? ¿Cómo estás?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid "What about you, what's your story?"
msgstr "¿Y vos? ¿Cuál es tu historia?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid "What?"
msgstr "¿Qué?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid "Where would we be without music?"
msgstr "¿Dónde estaríamos si no fuera por la música?"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-
#. TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgctxt "u:f"
msgid ""
"Where you say you're from again?  You're not as worldly as you look.  I'm "
"talking about weed.  Marijuana.  Wondered if you've happened upon any."
msgstr ""
"¿De dónde me dijiste que eras? No tenés tanta calle como parece. Estoy "
"hablando del porro. Marihuana. Me pregunto si habrás encontrado un poco."

