msgctxt "u:m"
msgid ""
"Where you say you're from again?  You're not as worldly as you look.  I'm "
"talking about weed.  Marijuana.  Wondered if you've happened upon any."
msgstr ""
"¿De dónde me dijiste que eras? No tenés tanta calle como parece. Estoy "
"hablando del porro. Marihuana. Me pregunto si habrás encontrado un poco."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-
