"\"Holy shit, what are the odds?  OK, stand back and hold on.\"  Jenny begins"
" peppering you with questions, which you answer to the best of your ability."
"  She seems quite satisfied.  \"Well, I can't thank you enough,\" she smiles"
" after a few minutes.  \"You probably just saved me weeks of reinventing the"
" wheel.  Here, it's not much but it's all I've got.\"  She hands you a "
"bundle of the local currency."
msgstr ""
"\"A la mierda, ¿qué probabilidades había? OK, correte y esperá.\" Jenny te "
"empieza a acribillar con preguntas, que contestás de la mejor manera que "
"podés. Ella parece estar satisfecha. \"Bueno, no te voy a poder agradecer "
"tanto,\" sonríe después de unos minutos. \"Probablemente, ma hayas ahorrado "
"semanas de reinventar la rueda. Mirá, no es mucho pero es lo que tengo, "
"tomá.\" Te da un atado de billetes de la moneda que usan."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Jenny_Forcette.json
msgid ""
"\"I'm puttering around, I always have stuff on the go.\"  Jenny rubs the "
"bridge of her nose briefly, blinking fatigue from her eyes.  \"Gotta keep "
"busy, keep my mind off stuff, you know?\""
msgstr ""
"\"Estoy paveando, siempre ando de acá para allá.\" Jenny se frota la nariz "
"por un momento, parpadeando con fatiga. \"Tengo que mantener la cabeza "
"ocupada, ¿viste?\""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Jenny_Forcette.json
msgid ""
"\"Me?  I trained at MIT in mechanical engineering, I worked for a long time "
"as senior engineer at Marduk Thermal in Rhode Island.  It was a good job, "
"but I landed my dream gig at Boston Dynamics and moved up north to start "
"there.\"  She tips back her head and lets out a long, wistful sigh.  \"I had"
" just finished my orientation and was going to start work when the riots "
"started.  Just my damn luck.\""
msgstr ""
"\"¿Yo? Estudié en el MIT ingeniería mecánica, trabajó mucho tiempo como "
"ingeniera jefe en Marduk Thermal en Rhode Island. Era un buen trabajo pero "
"lo mejor que tuve fue el laburo en Boston Dynamics y me mudé al norte para "
"trabajar ahí.\" Inclina la cabeza hacia atrás y lanza un suspiro largo y "
"nostálgico. \"Justo había terminado mi orientación y estaba por empezar a "
"trabajar cuando comenzaron los disturbios. Mala pata."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Jenny_Forcette.json
msgid ""
"&\"I'm sorry, I don't have the time to teach someone who can't pull their "
"weight, I just don't.\"  She gives you a look of genuine regret, then "
"shrugs."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Jenny_Forcette.json
msgid ""
"*grins and tugs at her shirt, an uncharacteristically crisp white T-shirt "
"sporting a brightly colored penguin holding a slide rule, and a rainbow "
"slogan reading 'sudo build it the way I told you to'.  \"Ha!  You must not "
"know many engineers, hey?  I guess there's more to me than engineering, but "
"most of my hobbies come back to it one way or the other.  It's not that I "
"live for my work, doing engineering for a heating company wasn't some great "
"dream, but when I got home I'd putter with the projects I wanted to do "
"instead of the ones they made me do.  You know?  And of course, I had my "
"friends and things, we'd go out or hang out and play board games and stuff."
"  Maybe some day I'll get a board game group started up here, although "
"there's nothing wrong with the card games we've got now.  Plus I don't think"
" Zombicide would hold the same interest for me as it used to.\""
msgstr ""
"*sonríe y tura de su remera, una remera extrañamente blanca e impecable con "
"un pingüino de color brillante sosteniendo una regla de cálculo, y una frase"
" con los colores del arcoíris que dice 'sudo construilo de la manera que yo "
"te digo'. \"¡Ja! No debés conocer muchos ingenieros, ¿no? Supongo que tengo "
"más cosas que la ingeniería pero la mayoría de mis hobbies vuelven ahí de "
"una manera u otra. No es que viva para mi trabajo, hacer ingeniería para una"
" empresa de calefacción no es el gran sueño pero cuando volvía a mi casa me "
"metía en los proyectos que quería hacer en lugar de esos que me hacían "
"hacer. ¿Sabés? Y, claro, tenía amigos y cosas, salíamos y jugábamos juegos "
"de mesa y esas cosas. Tal vez algún día arme un grupo de juegos de mesa acá,"
" aunque no hay nada de malo con las cartas que tenemos. Además, no creo que "
"Zombicide me guste tanto ahora como antes.\""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Jenny_Forcette.json
msgid ""
"*is a thin woman in her early thirties, with the sort of pale, freckled skin"
" that looks like it would burn if she thought too hard about the sun.  Her "
"clothes and bearing suggest she might once have been carefully put-together,"
" but she now has the harried look of someone with too many worries and too "
"little sleep.  She looks up from a laptop and smiles as you approach.  \"Hi "
"there.  Haven't see you around here before.  I'm Jenny, Jenny Forcette.\""
msgstr ""
"*es una mujer delgada en su años treinta, con la piel pálida y con pecas que"
" parece que se podría quemar si pensara mucho en el sol. Su ropa y modales "
"sugieren que alguna vez las hubiera combinado cuidadosamente pero ahora "
"tiene la apariencia de alguien agobiado con muchas preocupaciones y poco "
"descanso. Levanta la vista de su notebook y sonríe cuando te acercás. "
"\"Hola. No te vi por acá antes. Soy Jenny, Jenny Forcette.\""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Jenny_Forcette.json
msgid ""
"*looks up from her computer and gives you a quick, thin smile.  \"Hello "
"again.\""
msgstr ""
"*levanta la vista de su computadora y te sonríe levemente. \"Hola, de "
"nuevo.\""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Jenny_Forcette.json
msgid ""
"*scrunches her face in thought for a moment.  \"There was a whole world out "
"there of weird board games for ultra nerdy people.  Lots of that stuff never"
" really reached mainstream.  One of the hardest parts of evacuating for me "
"was leaving my garage full of esoteric crowdfunded games I've never "
"played.\""
msgstr ""
"*arruga la cara como pensando por un momento. \"Había un mundo entero de "
"juegos de mesa raros para personas muy nerds. Muchos de esos nunca llegaron "
"a volverse populares. Una de las cosas más difíciles de la evacuación para "
"mí fue dejar mi garage lleno de juegos esotéricos que nunca pude jugar.\""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Jenny_Forcette.json
msgid ""
"*shrugs, looking distant.  \"I don't really like to talk about that time "
"much.  None of us do.  Short story is that I made it to one of the "
"evacuation shelters and got loaded onto a bus.  It was supposed to go to "
"some sort of FEMA support camp, but there was a roadblock on the way there."
"  A few people just jumped out and ran for the military for protection.  "
"They… it… it was bad.  The driver managed to get us turned around and booked"
" it, and I guess they didn't chase us.  She took us back to one of the "
"shelters and we found the address for this place.  Only a few of us decided "
"to risk it, the rest stayed at the shelter to try their luck a different "
"way.  I still wonder how they did.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Jenny_Forcette.json
msgid ""
"*tips the lid of her laptop closed and looks up.  \"Nice to see you again.\""
msgstr "*cierra la tapa de su notebook y te mira. \"Qué bueno verte otra vez.\""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Jenny_Forcette.json
msgid "Actually, I'd better get going.  Let's do this later."
msgstr "En realidad, mejor me voy. Hagamos esto después."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find a gunsmithing textbook"
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Jenny_Forcette.json
msgid "Any luck looking for that gunsmithing text?"
msgstr "¿Tuviste suerte buscando el texto sobre fabricación de armas?"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find an electric motor"
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Jenny_Forcette.json
msgid "Any sign of a motor I can use?"
msgstr "¿Alguna señal de un motor que pueda usar?"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Bring back a 60 L metal tank"
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Jenny_Forcette.json
msgid "Any sign of a tank I can use?"
msgstr "¿Alguna señal de un tanque que pueda usar?"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find reference material about air rifles for
#. Jenny."
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Jenny_Forcette.json
msgid "Any sign of an air rifle book I can use?"
msgstr "¿Algún dato de un libro sobre rifles de aire que me pueda servir?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Jenny_Forcette.json
msgid "Are you free to teach me anything today?"
msgstr "¿Tenés tiempo para enseñarme algo hoy?"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find an electric motor"
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Jenny_Forcette.json
msgid ""
"Before I get anything going, I'm going to need to set up a compressor.  I "
"have a lot of the stuff for that, but I need a large tank for air, and a "
"good sized electric motor - about 10 kg or so.  I'm also going to need a 60 "
"liter tank, after that."
msgstr ""
"Antes de que pueda empezar con algo, voy a necesitar el compresor. Tengo "
"muchas cosas para eso, pero necesito un tanque grande para el aire, y un "
"motor eléctrico de buen tamaño - unos 10kg o por ahí. También voy a "
"necesitar un tanque de 60 litros, después de lo otro."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Jenny_Forcette.json
msgid ""
"Boris and Stan are married, I guess.  They kinda keep to themselves, they "
"seem a bit standoffish if you ask me.  Garry is Stan's brother, I think, but"
" I'm not totally sure.  He seems nice enough, but he's a man of few words.  "
"I can't get a good bead on them.  I've learned not to pry too much though."
msgstr ""
"Boris y Stan están casados, creo. Medio como que son reservados, parecen "
"poco amigables, si me preguntás a mí. Garry es el hermano de Stan, creo, "
"pero no estoy muy seguro. Parece buena gente pero es un hombre de pocas "
"palabras. No puedo sacarle la ficha. Aprendí a no meterme mucho."

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Jenny_Forcette.json
msgid "Bring back a 60 L metal tank"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Jenny_Forcette.json
msgid "Can you tell me about Fatima?"
msgstr "¿Me podés contar algo de Fátima?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Jenny_Forcette.json
msgid "Can you tell me about the Borichenkos?"
msgstr "¿Me podés contar algo de los Borichenko?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Jenny_Forcette.json
msgid "Can you tell me about the Free Merchants?"
msgstr "¿Me podés contar sobre los Mercaderes Libres?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Jenny_Forcette.json
msgid "Can you tell me about the Singhs?"
msgstr "¿Me podés contar algo de los Singh?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Jenny_Forcette.json
msgid "Can you tell me about the others?"
msgstr "¿Me podés contar algo de los otros?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Jenny_Forcette.json
msgid "Can you tell me anything about the other refugees here?"
msgstr "¿Me podés contar algo sobre los otros refugiados que hay acá?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Jenny_Forcette.json
msgid "Do you mean stuff like D&D?"
msgstr "¿Te referís a cosas como D&D?"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Jenny_Forcette.json
msgid ""
"Fatima's a sweety, but she's a total dork.  I know, I know, it's backwards "
"for the engineer to call the heavy-duty mechanic a nerd, but hey.  I call it"
" like it is.  She and I have been doing some odd jobs around the upstairs "
"here, fixing up old machinery and things."
msgstr ""
"Fátima es un amor pero es muy nerd. Ya sé, ya sé, es al revés, es raro que "
"el ingeniero le diga al mecánico que es un nerd, pero hey, yo digo lo que "
"es. Ella y yo hemos estado haciendo trabajos raros cerca de las escaleras "
"ahí, arreglando máquinas viejas y coso."

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Jenny_Forcette.json
msgid "Find a gunsmithing textbook"
msgstr "Encontrar un manual sobre fabricación de armas"

#. ~ Description of mission "Find a gunsmithing textbook"
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Jenny_Forcette.json
msgid ""
"Find a gunsmithing textbook for Jenny.  <color_yellow>A book with "
"'Gunsmithing' and/or 'Firearm Design' in its name</color> will do."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Jenny_Forcette.json
msgid "Find an electric motor"
msgstr "Conseguir un motor eléctrico"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Jenny_Forcette.json
msgid "Find reference material about air rifles for Jenny."
msgstr "Conseguir material de referencia sobre rifles de aire para Jenny."

#. ~ Description of mission "Find reference material about air rifles for
#. Jenny."
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Jenny_Forcette.json
msgid ""
"Find reference material about air rifles.  <color_yellow>A book that has "
"'Pneumatic' in its name</color> could be the thing she wants."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Jenny_Forcette.json
msgid "Fine.  What were you saying?"
msgstr "Bueno. ¿Qué estabas diciendo?"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find reference material about air rifles for
#. Jenny."
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Jenny_Forcette.json
msgid "Great!  Bring it to me if you find one."
msgstr "¡Buenísimo! Traémelo si encontrás algo."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find an electric motor"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Bring back a 60 L metal tank"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find a gunsmithing textbook"
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Jenny_Forcette.json
msgid "Great!  Bring it to me when you find one."
msgstr "¡Buenísimo! Traémelo cuando lo encontrés."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Jenny_Forcette.json
msgid ""
"Ha!  I wonder how long that's going to be one of our go-to small talk "
"questions.  It's perfect, isn't it?  Doesn't make you talk about the worst "
"stuff but stays on theme for what's on everyone's mind.  Okay, I'll bite.  "
"Have you heard any of the really wild stories?  Giant monsters the size of "
"skyscrapers kicking over tanks and stuff, during the worst days?  I think "
"somehow our planet got moved into another dimension, probably some kind of "
"experimental process gone wrong.  During transit, some of those things came "
"across, but they left when we arrived wherever we are now.  The rules are "
"different here, and maybe we're superimposed with whatever version of Earth "
"was here to start with, and that's why we hear about aliens and other "
"unbelievable stuff out there along with the zombies.\"  She grins.  \"And "
"before you say that's implausible, bear in mind that *the dead walk now*, so"
" plausibility is off the table."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Jenny_Forcette.json
msgid "Have you ever thought about going back for them?"
msgstr "¿Alguna vez pensaste en recuperarlos?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Jenny_Forcette.json
msgid "Have you ever thought about going back for your board games?"
msgstr "¿Alguna vez pensaste ir a buscar tus juegos de mesa?"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Bring back a 60 L metal tank"
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Jenny_Forcette.json
msgid ""
"Hey, this is perfect, \"tanks\" a bunch.  Okay, I'm sorry for that.  Anyway,"
" now that I've got the parts, I might be able to build a proof of concept.  "
"First I gotta get this thing up and running, and argue with the bean "
"counters about letting me draw power to run it.  Oh right, and here's some "
"merch, thanks for the help!"
msgstr ""
"Hey, esto es perfecto, muchas tanquius. Bueno, ahora tengo las partes, ya "
"podría construir una prueba de concepto. Primero tengo que hacer que esto "
"funcione, y discutir con los que manejan los porotos para que me dejen usar "
"energía para hacerlo andar. Ah, cierto, tomá unos mercs, ¡gracias por la "
"ayuda!"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Jenny_Forcette.json
msgid "Hi, Jenny.  What are you up to these days?"
msgstr "Hola, Jenny. ¿Qué andás haciendo estos días?"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find reference material about air rifles for
#. Jenny."
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Jenny_Forcette.json
msgid ""
"Honestly I don't even have a search engine to find the name of a good book."
"  It's the air compression part I need to know about, gun books won't help "
"much."
msgstr ""
"Honestamente, ni siquiera tengo un motor de búsqueda para encontrar el "
"nombre de un buen libro. Es la parte de la compresión de aire la que "
"necesito saber, los libros sobre armas no me van a ayudar."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Jenny_Forcette.json
msgid "How did you make it here during the chaos?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Jenny_Forcette.json
msgid "How's everything going with that defense system?"
msgstr "¿Cómo anda todo con el sistema de defensa?"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Bring back a 60 L metal tank"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find a gunsmithing textbook"
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Jenny_Forcette.json
msgid ""
"Huh.  This isn't going to work like I thought.  Back to the drawing board I "
"guess."
msgstr ""
"Ah. Esto no va a funcionar como lo pensé. De vuelta al pizarrón, supongo."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Jenny_Forcette.json
msgid ""
"Huh.\"  She purses her lips and looks at you reluctantly.  \"I guess I can "
"teach you a bit, but you'd have to be like, my on-the-job apprentice and "
"help me get stuff done.  It'll cost you a bit depending on what you want to "
"learn.  Do you know anything about electronics, computers, or mechanics "
"already?\""
msgstr ""
"Ah.\" Frunce los labios y te mira de mala gana. \"Supongo que te puedo "
"enseñar un poco pero tenés que ser algo así como mi aprendiz y ayudarme a "
"hacer cosas. Te va a costar un poco dependiendo de lo que quieras aprender. "
"¿Sabés algo de electrónica, informática o mecánica?\""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Bring back a 60 L metal tank"
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Jenny_Forcette.json
msgid ""
"I can get started building the compressor, but I need a large metal tank to "
"store compressed air centrally.  About 60 liters should do…"
msgstr ""
"Puedo empezar a construir el compresor, pero necesito un tanque grande de "
"metal para almacenar el aire comprimido. De unos 60 litros debería andar "
"bien…"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find a gunsmithing textbook"
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Jenny_Forcette.json
msgid ""
"I hate to admit it, but my first few tests haven't gone well.  I think I "
"know what's wrong, but I need more information."
msgstr ""
"Odio tener que admitirlo pero mis primeras pruebas no salieron bien. Creo "
"que ya sé lo que está mal pero necesito más información."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find a gunsmithing textbook"
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Jenny_Forcette.json
msgid ""
"I need a good quality reference book on gunsmithing.  This isn't my area of "
"expertise, and I don't want to blow anybody up."
msgstr ""
"Necesito un texto de referencia de buena calidad sobre fabricación de armas."
" No es mi área de experiencia y no quiero hacer explotar a nadie."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Jenny_Forcette.json
msgid ""
"I really can't get a bead on them.  They never really talk to anyone outside"
" of their little family group, they just sit in their own spot and speak "
"Punjabi.  They always seem nice, and they do their share, they just don't "
"have any social connection."
msgstr ""
"No puedo sacarles la ficha. Nunca hablan con nadie por fuera de su grupo "
"familiar, se sientan en su lugar y hablan panyabí. Siempre me pareció buena "
"gente y hacen su parte, solamente que no tienen esa conexión social."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Jenny_Forcette.json
msgid ""
"I recently came into possession of this mold for making high-caliber air "
"rifle bullets.  I'm kinda working on a design that would use them to protect"
" the base.  Got a long way to go, though.  If you happen to see anything in "
"your travels about high-powered air rifles, it would help a lot."
msgstr ""
"Hace poco conseguí este molde para hacer balas de alto calibre para rifle de"
" aire comprimido. Medio que estoy trabajando en un diseño que las usará para"
" proteger nuestra base. Me falta mucho, igual. Si te llegás a encontrar algo"
" relacionado con rifles de aire de alta potencia, me ayudaría mucho."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Jenny_Forcette.json
msgid ""
"If I see anything, I'll let you know.  Can you tell me more about your "
"project?"
msgstr ""
"Si encuentro algo, te aviso. ¿Me podés contar algo más de tu proyecto?"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find reference material about air rifles for
#. Jenny."
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Jenny_Forcette.json
msgid ""
"If you happen to see anything in your travels about high-powered air rifles,"
" it would help a lot."
msgstr ""
"Si te llegás a encontrar algo relacionado con rifles de aire de alta "
"potencia, me ayudaría mucho."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Jenny_Forcette.json
msgid "Is there some way I can help you get the stuff you need?"
msgstr "¿Te puedo ayudar de alguna forma para conseguir lo que necesitás?"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Bring back a 60 L metal tank"
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Jenny_Forcette.json
msgid ""
"It needs to be a good strong tank, like a big propane tank or something… you"
" could look at fuel storage tanks and things, as long as they're durable "
"enough.  Heck, if you get some sheet metal you could probably even weld a "
"good one together."
msgstr ""
"Tiene que ser un tanque bien fuerte, como uno de propano o algo así… podés "
"fijarte los tanques de combustible, siempre que sean resistentes. Carajo, si"
" conseguís láminas de metal probablemente puedas soldarlas y hacer uno."

#. ~ Unique name of a female NPC
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Jenny_Forcette.json
msgid "Jenny Forcette"
msgstr "Jenny Forcette"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Jenny_Forcette.json
msgid "Just say the word, teach."
msgstr "Decime, enseñá."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Jenny_Forcette.json
msgid ""
"Living here?  Yeah, I guess I live here now.  It's… it's weird.  We're "
"crowded into this tiny space, I don't know these people, but we're sharing "
"bathrooms and we've all been through the same stuff.  It's not great.  At "
"night we can hear the <zombies> outside, and we all just lie there awake, "
"thinking the same things but too scared to talk about it."
msgstr ""
" ¿Viviendo acá? Sí, supongo que vivo acá ahora. Es… raro. Somos demasiados "
"para tan poco espacio, no conozco a esta gente pero estamos compartiendo los"
" baños y todos pasamos por lo mismo. No es lo mejor. A la noche podemos "
"escuchar los <zombies> afuera, y nos quedamos tirados ahí, despiertos, "
"pensando en las mismas cosas pero demasiado asustados como para hablar sobre"
" eso."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Jenny_Forcette.json
msgid "Nice meeting you.  I'd best get going, though."
msgstr "Un gusto conocerte. Pero me tengo que ir."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Jenny_Forcette.json
msgid "Nice meeting you.  What are you doing on that computer?"
msgstr "Un gusto conocerte. ¿Qué estás haciendo en esa computadora?"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Jenny_Forcette.json
msgid ""
"No, mainly because my whole neighborhood burnt to the ground.  Some scouts "
"went by a while ago.  Nothing there for me but melted plastic miniatures and"
" thousands of hours of gameplay I'll never have."
msgstr ""
"No, más que nada porque todo mi barrio se incendió. Algunos exploradores "
"fueron hace un tiempo. No encontraron nada más que miniaturas de plástico "
"derretidas y miles de horas de juego que nunca voy a tener."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Bring back a 60 L metal tank"
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Jenny_Forcette.json
msgid ""
"Now that I've got that motor, I can get my compressor mostly built.  I will "
"need a tank though."
msgstr ""
"Ahora que tengo el motor, casi tengo el compresor entero. Aunque todavía "
"necesito un tanque."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find reference material about air rifles for
#. Jenny."
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Jenny_Forcette.json
msgid "Oh well.  Thanks anyway."
msgstr "Uh, bueno. Gracias, igual."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find an electric motor"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Bring back a 60 L metal tank"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find a gunsmithing textbook"
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Jenny_Forcette.json
msgid "Oh well.  Thanks for offering anyway."
msgstr "Oh, bueno. Gracias por ofrecerte igual."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find a gunsmithing textbook"
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Jenny_Forcette.json
msgid ""
"Oh yeah.  Ooooh yeah.  Now we're cookin' with gas.  Here's a bit more merch,"
" you beautiful gofer maniac."
msgstr ""
"Ah, sí. Aaahhh, sí. Ahora sí, che. Acá tenés unos mercs más, hermoso cadete "
"maníaco."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Jenny_Forcette.json
msgid "Sorry Jenny, I can't stay to chat."
msgstr "Lo lamento, Jenny, no me puedo quedar a charlar."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Jenny_Forcette.json
msgid "Sorry about your luck.  What were you saying before?"
msgstr "Lamento tu mala suerte. ¿Qué estabas diciendo antes?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Jenny_Forcette.json
msgid "Tell me a bit about your background."
msgstr "Contame un poco sobre tu historia."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Jenny_Forcette.json
msgid "Tell me more about your project."
msgstr "Contame más sobre tu proyecto."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find reference material about air rifles for
#. Jenny."
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Jenny_Forcette.json
msgid ""
"That's exactly what I need!  Here, I saved a few merch for you, I hope this "
"helps cover your troubles."
msgstr ""
"¡Es exactamente lo que necesito! Mirá, guardé unos mercs para vos, espero "
"que te ayude a cubrir tus problemas."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find an electric motor"
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Jenny_Forcette.json
msgid ""
"That's exactly what I need!  Want to talk about that tank now?  I saved a "
"few merch for you, by the way."
msgstr ""
"¡Es exactamente lo que necesito! ¿Te cuento del tanque ahora? Ahorré unos "
"mercs para vos, ahora que me acuerdo."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Jenny_Forcette.json
msgid "That's impressive, but there must be more to you than just your job."
msgstr "Eso es impresionante pero debe haber más para vos que tu trabajo."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Jenny_Forcette.json
msgid ""
"They run this place, and they don't run a charity.  We get paid for working "
"around the place, maintaining it, what have you, and we trade cash for food."
"  The thing is, supply and demand and all… there's a lot more cash than food"
" around.  It's easier to buy a laptop than a piece of beef jerky, and "
"there's no sign of that getting better.  The balance is way off right now, a"
" hard day of work barely gets you enough to fill your belly.  I shouldn't "
"bitch too much though.  I don't know much better way to run it, although "
"rumor is that the folks living downstairs have it a lot easier than we do.  "
"I try not to think too much on that."
msgstr ""
"Ellos manejan este lugar y no es una organización benéfica. Nos pagan por "
"trabajar por acá, mantenerlo, lo que te imagines, y intercambiamos plata por"
" comida. La cosa es que, oferta y demanda y todo… hay mucha más plata que "
"comida por acá. Es más fácil comprarse una notebook que un pedazo de carne, "
"y no parece que vaya a mejorar. El balance está muy para la derecha ahora, "
"un día duro de trabajo apenas si te da algo como para llenar la panza. "
"Igual, no tendría que quejarme tanto. No conozco otra manera mejor de "
"manejarlo, aunque hay rumores de que los que están abajo la tienen mucho más"
" fácil que nosotros. Trato de no pensar mucho en eso."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-
#. TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Jenny_Forcette.json
msgctxt "u:f"
msgid ""
"Things are coming along.  I have a lot of studying to do before I know how "
"to fix my design issues, but the book you brought definitely has everything "
"I need.  Now that I've got some progress to show, administration is much "
"more willing to help me get the parts I need.  You've been a great gofer, "
"but I can probably handle the rest on my own.  Check back in a week or two!"
msgstr ""
"Las cosas van bien. Tengo muchas cosas que estudiar antes de saber cómo "
"arreglar mis problemas de diseño, pero el libro que trajiste tiene "
"definitivamente lo que necesito. Ahora que tengo progreso para mostrar, la "
"administración está mucho más dispuesta a ayudarme a conseguir las partes "
"que necesito. Fuiste un gran cadete pero probablemente pueda hacer el resto "
"yo. ¡Preguntame en una semana o dos!"

