#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find a gunsmithing textbook"
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Jenny_Forcette.json
msgid ""
"This is a bit of a tricky one.  A college library would be a good start, and"
" I imagine maybe military bases have that kind of thing?  I'm not entirely "
"sure."
msgstr ""
"Este puede ser un poco difícil. En una biblioteca universitaria podrías "
"empezar, y supongo que en las bases militares tal vez ¿tengan esa clase de "
"cosas? No estoy muy seguro."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find an electric motor"
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Jenny_Forcette.json
msgid ""
"Try a basic hybrid car, or maybe farm equipment that uses an electric motor."
"  The kind on a bike would be too small, and the kind on those fancy Edison "
"sports cars is going to be too big."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Jenny_Forcette.json
msgid "Um, you know what?  Nevermind.  What were you saying?"
msgstr "Um, ¿sabés qué? Olvidate. ¿Qué estabas diciendo?"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Jenny_Forcette.json
msgid ""
"Vanessa… well, she's nice, I guess.  I gotta say, she kinda drives me nuts, "
"but we're in this together so I try not to be too harsh.  Uyen and Rhyzaea "
"both seem to want to run the show here, but I try to stay out of those "
"politics and just focus on building stuff.  I don't see much good coming of "
"it.  Alonso is fine, he's clearly interested in me, and also in every other "
"single person here.  Not my thing, in a group this small.  John is a walking"
" stereotype, I imagine there must be more depth to him, but I haven't seen "
"it yet."
msgstr ""
"Vanessa… bueno, es buena gente, creo. Tengo que decir que medio que me "
"vuelve loca, pero estamos en esto juntos así que intento no ponerme mal. "
"Uyen y Rhyzaea parecen querer manejar las cosas acá, pero intento mantenerme"
" afuera de esas cosas políticas y me concentro en construir cosas. No creo "
"que termine en nada bueno eso. Alonso está bien, claramente está interesado "
"en mí y también en cada una de las personas solteras que hay. No me interesa"
" en un grupo tan pequeño. John es un estereotipo con patas, me imagino que "
"debe tener alguna profundidad su personalidad, pero yo no la he visto."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Jenny_Forcette.json
msgid ""
"Well, Dana lost her baby right after <the_cataclysm>, in a bus rollover.  "
"She was lucky to make it out alive.  She and Pedro had one of the rougher "
"trips here, I guess.  We just kinda click as friends, I'm grateful there's "
"someone else here I can really get along with.  Her husband, Pedro, is still"
" pretty shell-shocked.  He doesn't talk much.  I like him though, when he "
"opens up he's just hilarious.  Draco is just a cantankerous old fart who "
"hasn't actually got old yet, give him twenty years and he'll be there.  I "
"like grumpy people.  We also have pretty similar taste in music.  Aleesha's "
"a sweet kid, and we've all kind of adopted her, but she seems to hang out "
"with me and Dana the most.  She's a great artist, and she's full of crazy "
"ideas.  I guess I like her because of all of us, she seems to have the most "
"hope that there's a future to be had."
msgstr ""
"Bueno, Dana perdió a su bebé justo después del <the_cataclysm>, cuando volcó"
" el colectivo en el que iba. Tuvo suerte de salir ella viva. Con Pedro "
"tuvieron uno de los viajes más difíciles hasta acá, supongo. Nos hicimos "
"amigos, estoy agradecido de que haya alguien acá con quien me pueda llevar "
"bien. Su marido, Pedro, todavía está bastante conmocionado. No habla mucho. "
"Me cae bien, igual, cuando se suelta es muy gracioso. Draco es un vejestorio"
" cascarrabias que todavía no se hizo viejo en realidad, pero en veinte años "
"va a estar ahí. Me cae bien la gente caracúlica. Aparte tenemos un gusto "
"similar en música. Aleesha es un amor y todos más o menos que la adoptamos, "
"pero ella pasa más tiempo conmigo y con Dana. Es una gran artista y está "
"llena de ideas locas. Creo que me cae bien porque de todos nosotros, ella "
"parece ser la que más esperanza tiene en que habrá un futuro."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Jenny_Forcette.json
msgid ""
"Well, of course I played the mandatory amount of dice based RPGs necessary "
"to graduate my engineering program,\" she grins.  \"They're fun, something "
"like that would be nice around here, but I'm not that kind of storyteller "
"and I don't think anyone else here is nerdy enough for it.\"  Jenny tips her"
" head a bit.  \"It's nice that you're asking but don't worry about me, I've "
"got recreation.\""
msgstr ""
"Bueno, por supuesto que jugué la cantidad obligatoria de JDR basados en "
"dados necesaria para graduarme en mi diplomatura en ingeniería,\" sonríe. "
"\"Son divertidos, algo así vendría bien ahora pero no soy esa clase de "
"narrador y no creo que haya otra persona acá tan nerd para eso.\" Jenny "
"inclina un poco su cabeza. \"Es lindo que preguntes pero no te preocupes por"
" mí, tengo mi manera de recrearme.\""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Jenny_Forcette.json
msgid ""
"Well, there's a bunch of us.  We're starting to form a bit of a community.  "
"Fatima and I work together a fair bit, and I've been hanging out with Dana, "
"Draco, and Aleesha quite a lot.  I don't know the Borichenko bunch, the "
"Singhs, Vanessa, Uyen, or Rhyzaea quite as well, but we've talked.  What did"
" you want to know?"
msgstr ""
"Bueno, somos bastantes. Estamos empezando a formar una especie de comunidad."
" Fátima y yo trabajamos juntas un tiempo y estuvimos saliendo con Dana, "
"Draco y Aleesha varias veces. No conozco mucho a los Borichenko, los Singh, "
"Vanessa, Uyen ni Rhyzaea, pero alguna vez conversamos. ¿Qué querías saber?"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Jenny_Forcette.json
msgid ""
"Well, these things are a standard .30 caliber.  They should be compatible "
"with any similar rifle barrel.  It would be pretty easy to repurpose some "
"rifle parts into large air weapons that we could use without relying on "
"gunpowder, and without so much noise.  I'm still drawing up an actual design"
" though, I have a bunch of features I want.  Ask me again in a couple weeks "
"and I'll give you some more info."
msgstr ""
"Bueno, estas cosas son de calibre estándar .30. Deberían ser compatibles con"
" cualquier cañón de rifle similar. Es fácil adaptar algunas partes de rifle "
"para armas de aire más grandes que podríamos usar sin depender de la "
"pólvora, y sin hacer tanto ruido. Todavía estoy dibujando el diseño mismo, "
"hay varias cosas que quiero ponerle. Preguntame en un par de semanas y te "
"voy a dar más información."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Jenny_Forcette.json
msgid "What are you working on?"
msgstr "¿En qué estás trabajando?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Jenny_Forcette.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Uyen_Tran.json
msgid "What do you think happened to the world?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Jenny_Forcette.json
msgid "What has made you friends with Dana, Draco, and Aleesha?"
msgstr "¿Cómo te hiciste amiga de Dana, Draco y Aleesha?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Jenny_Forcette.json
msgid "What kind of board games do you play?"
msgstr "¿Qué clase de juegos de mesa jugás?"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find an electric motor"
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Jenny_Forcette.json
msgid ""
"Yeah, if you want to risk your neck out there and bring me what I need, I'm "
"not gonna say no.  I can't, like, pay you or anything though, you know that "
"right?"
msgstr ""
"Sí, si querés arriesgar tu pellejo, andá y traeme lo que necesito, no me voy"
" a negar. No puedo, o sea, pagarte o algo así, ¿ya sabés eso, no?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Jenny_Forcette.json
msgid "You must know some great stuff.  Can you teach me anything?"
msgstr "Debés saber mucho. ¿Me podés enseñar algunas cosas?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Jenny_Forcette.json
msgid "[INT 10] No, but I'm a fast learner."
msgstr "[INT 10] No pero aprendo rápido."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Jenny_Forcette.json
msgid "[SKILL 2] I'm not a total noob."
msgstr "[HABILIDAD 2] No soy un novato total."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Jenny_Forcette.json
msgid "[SKILL <2] No, that's why I want you to teach me."
msgstr "[HABILIDAD <2] No, por eso quiero que me enseñes."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_John_Clemens.json
msgid ""
"*looks at you like you're in need of special help.  \"Just what I said.  I'm"
" settled down here for a spell, then goin' back on the road with my "
"sixgun.\""
msgstr ""
"*te mira como si necesitaras ayuda especial. \"Lo que dije. Estoy "
"establecido acá por un maleficio, después vuelvo al camino con mi seis "
"tiros.\""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-
