msgctxt "u:f"
msgid ""
"*is a well-kept middle aged woman with dark hair tied back in a long braid."
"  She looks surprised as you approach.  \"Ah!  You are new.  I'm sorry, I'm "
"Mangalpreet.\""
msgstr ""
"*es una mujer de mediana edad en buen estado con el pelo negro atado en una "
"trenza larga. Parece sorprendida cuando te ve acercarte. \"¡Ah! Sos nuevo. "
"Perdón, soy Mangalpreet.\""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-
#. TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
