msgid ""
"Sorry, no.  That's too much to ask from me.  I was back there when it went "
"wrong."
msgstr ""
"Perdoname, no. Es pedirme demasiado. Estuve ahí cuando todo se puso feo."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-
