#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/shared_dialogue.json
msgid "That's a big ask, for sure.  Okay, I'll see what I can do."
msgstr "Eso es pedir mucho, eso sí. Bueno, voy a ver qué puedo hacer."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/shared_dialogue.json
msgid ""
"This is for Boris?  Yeah, Boris is has been through a lot, I'll do it for "
"him."
msgstr ""
"¿Esto es para Boris? Sí, Boris ha sufrido muchas cosas, lo voy a hacer para "
"él."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/shared_dialogue.json
msgid ""
"You won't get much luck asking those of us who were back there I'm afraid.  "
"Sorry."
msgstr ""
"Lamentablemente, no vas a tener mucha suerte preguntándonos a los que "
"estuvimos ahí. Lo lamento."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_broker.json
msgid ""
"All three are easy to locally produce in significant quantities and are non-"
"perishable.  We have a local farmer or two and a few hunter types that have "
"been making attempts to provide us with the nutritious supplies.  We do "
"always need more suppliers though.  This stuff is rather cheap in bulk, so I"
" can pay a premium for any you have on you.  Canned food and other edibles "
"are handled by the merchant in the front in trade."
msgstr ""
"Los tres son fáciles de producir en cantidades significativas y no son "
"perecederos. Tenemos un granjero o dos y algunos cazadores que han estado "
"intentando proveernos con suministros nutritivos. Igual, siempre necesitamos"
" más proveedores. Esto es bastante barato a granel, así que te puedo pagar "
"con un extra por lo que tengas. La comida enlatada y otros comestibles son "
"manejados por el mercader del frente."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_broker.json
msgid "Are you able to buy some canning supplies?"
msgstr "¿Podés comprar suministros para enlatados?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_broker.json
msgid "Are you looking to buy anything else?"
msgstr "¿Querés comprar algo más?"

#. ~ Name suffix of an NPC
#. ~ Appears in the refugee center as a bulk trader.  Promotes production of
#. nonperishable food.
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_broker.json
msgid "Broker"
msgstr "Comerciante"

#. ~ Description of mission "In a Pickle Pt. 2"
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_broker.json
msgid ""
"Deliver 50 large three-liter jars in exchange for <reward_count:FMCNote> "
"certified notes."
msgstr ""
"Entregar 50 frascos grandes de tres litros a cambio de "
"<reward_count:FMCNote> Bonos Certificados."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_broker.json
msgid "Do you know about those beggars in the lobby?"
msgstr "¿Viste esos mendigos en la entrada?"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_broker.json
msgid ""
"Even once we got things sorted out, there weren't enough beds for everyone, "
"and definitely not enough supplies.  These are harsh times.  We're doing "
"what we can for those folks… at least they've got shelter."
msgstr ""
"Incluso después de que ordenamos las cosas, no había camas para todos y "
"mucho menos provisiones. Son tiempos complicados. Estamos haciendo lo que "
"podemos por esa gente… por lo menos tienen donde refugiarse."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_broker.json
msgid "Excellent.  What've you brought us?"
msgstr "Excelente. ¿Qué nos trajiste?"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "In a Pickle Pt. 2"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "In a Pickle"
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_broker.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/Smokes/free_merchant_shopkeep_missions.json
msgid "Grocery stores, house kitchens, there's plenty of places to look."
msgstr ""
"En los almacenes, las cocinas de las casas, hay muchos lugares donde "
"buscarlos."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "In a Pickle Pt. 2"
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_broker.json
msgid "I do have some work for you."
msgstr "Tengo un trabajo para vos."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-
#. TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_broker.json
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I oversee the food stocks for the center.  There was significant looting "
"during the panic when we first arrived so most of our food was carried away."
"  I manage what we have left and do everything I can to increase our "
"supplies.  We've got a few growing sources of fresh meats and vegetables, so"
" I prioritize non-perishable food, such as cornmeal, jerky, and fruit wine."
msgstr ""
"Superviso la provisión de comida para el centro. Hubo un saqueo importante "
"durante el pánico cuando llegamos, así que la mayoría de la comida "
"desapareció. Administré lo que nos quedó e hice lo que pude para incrementar"
" nuestros suministros. Tenemos algunas fuentes de carne y verduras frescas "
"así que priorizo la comida no perecedera, como la harina de maíz, el charqui"
" y el vino frutal."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-
#. TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
