msgstr "Sos nuevo acá, ¿quién carajo te metió en esta mierda?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_guard_generic.json
msgid "<end_talking_bye>"
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_guard_generic.json
msgid "Good evening.  Welcome to our safe zone."
msgstr "Buenas noches. Bienvenido a nuestra zona segura."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_guard_generic.json
msgid "Gotta earn my keep."
msgstr "Tengo que ganarme la vida."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_guard_generic.json
msgid "Heard anything about an helicopter crash?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_guard_generic.json
msgid "Hello.  Welcome to our safe zone."
msgstr "Hola. Bienvenido a nuestra zona segura."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_guard_generic.json
msgid "How did you get saddled with guard duty?"
msgstr "¿Cómo te resulta la tarea de guardia?"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_guard_generic.json
msgid ""
"I didn't see it myself but I heard the rumors about it, apparently it "
"crashed somewhere nearby but I haven't seen any smoke or corpse."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_guard_generic.json
msgid ""
"I don't have a lot of free time for that sort of thing.  Maybe talk to the "
"shopkeep, they know more about scheduling and stuff."
msgstr ""
"No tengo mucho tiempo libre para esa clase de cosas. Tal vez si hablás con "
"el que atiende el negocio, ellos saben acerca de los horarios y esas cosas."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_guard_generic.json
msgid "I dunno, I wasn't there but I overheard some guy talking about it."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_guard_generic.json
msgid ""
"I'd rather stand around looking threatening than scrub gore out of the "
"tiles."
msgstr ""
"Prefiero quedarme parado buscando amenazas antes que limpiar tripas de las "
"baldosas."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-
#. TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_guard_generic.json
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I've seen my share of zombies, I'm one of the ones that's ready to take em "
"on.  Nothing more."
msgstr ""
"Vi bastantes zombis, soy uno de los que están preparados para enfrentarlos. "
"Nada más."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-
#. TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_guard_generic.json
