#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_woodcutter2.json
msgid "I've got to go…"
msgstr "Me tengo que ir…"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_crop_overseer.json
msgid ""
"350 merch should be enough to cover the purchase and the labor to plow it."
msgstr ""
"350 mercs debería ser suficiente para cubrir el gasto de la compra y el "
"arado."

#. ~ Player message in an effect
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_crop_overseer.json
msgid ""
"<npc_name> jots your name down on a ledger and yells out to nearby laborers "
"to begin plowing your new field."
msgstr ""
"<npc_name> anota tu nombre en un libro de contabilidad y le grita a los "
"trabajadores cercanos que empiecen a arar tu nuevo campo."

#. ~ Player message in an effect
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_crop_overseer.json
msgid ""
"After counting your money, <npc_name> directs a nearby laborer to begin "
"constructing a fence around your plot…"
msgstr ""
"Después de contar tu plata, <npc_name> se dirige a un trabajador cercano "
"para empezar a construir la valla alrededor de tu terreno…"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_crop_overseer.json
msgid "Can you build a fence around my field?"
msgstr "¿Podés construir una valla alrededor de mi campo?"

#. ~ Name suffix of an NPC
#. ~ Flavor
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_crop_overseer.json
msgid "Crop Overseer"
msgstr "Supervisor de Cosecha"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_crop_overseer.json
msgid "I don't have that much right now.  Maybe later."
msgstr "No tengo tanta plata ahora. Tal vez después."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_crop_overseer.json
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
msgid "I figured you might be looking for some help…"
msgstr "Me supuse que estarías buscando ayuda…"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_crop_overseer.json
msgid "I hope you are here to do business."
msgstr "Espero que hayas venido para hacer negocios."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_crop_overseer.json
msgid "I'd like to discuss my field…"
msgstr "Me gustaría discutir mi campo…"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_crop_overseer.json
msgid "I'd like to harvest some plants…"
msgstr "Me gustaría cosechar algunas plantas…"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_crop_overseer.json
msgid "I'd like to plant some seeds…"
msgstr "Me gustaría plantar algunas semillas…"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_crop_overseer.json
msgid "I'm a bit short right now.  Maybe later."
msgstr "Estoy un poco escaso en este momento. Tal vez después."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_crop_overseer.json
msgid "I'm interested in investing in agriculture…"
msgstr "Estoy interesado en invertir en la agricultura…"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_crop_overseer.json
msgid "I'm interested.  How much is it going to cost?"
msgstr "Estoy interesado. ¿Cuánto me va a costar?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_crop_overseer.json
msgid "I'm looking to expand my field…"
msgstr "Quiero expandir mi campo…"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_crop_overseer.json
msgid ""
"My job is to manage our outpost's agricultural production.  I'm constantly "
"searching for trade partners and investors to increase our capacity.  If you"
" are interested, I typically have tasks that I need assistance with."
msgstr ""
"Mi trabajo es administrar la producción agrícola del puesto. Estoy "
"constantemente buscando comerciantes e inversores para incrementar nuestra "
"capacidad. Si estás interesado, yo comúnmente tengo tareas en las que "
"necesito ayuda."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_crop_overseer.json
msgid ""
"Sure, we could build a sturdy picket fence around it that will keep most "
"wildlife from nibbling at your crops.  Your crop yields will increase "
"slightly as well."
msgstr ""
"Sí, podemos construir una cerca de madera resistente alrededor para evitar "
"que la mayoría de los animales silvestres te picoteen los cultivos. Con esto"
" aumentarás un poco tus cosechas también."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_crop_overseer.json
msgid "Tell me more about this field."
msgstr "Contame un poco más sobre ese campo."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_crop_overseer.json
msgid ""
"There's a field on the other side of the house that isn't being used for "
"anything right now.  We're willing to let you purchase it for your own "
"agricultural enterprises if you're interested."
msgstr ""
"Hay un campo en el otro lado de la casa que no se está usando para nada en "
"estos momentos. Estamos dispuestos a dejarte comprarlo para tu propio "
"emprendimiento agrícola si estás interesado."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_crop_overseer.json
msgid ""
"We can plow some more land around your field to give you room for more "
"plants.  Any existing plants or items in the way will be destroyed.  It'll "
"only cost 100 merch to expand.  Still interested?"
msgstr ""
"Podemos arar un poco más de terreno alrededor de tu campo y hacerte espacio "
"para más plantas. Las plantas u objetos que haya ahí van a ser destruidos. "
"Te va a costar solamente 100 mercs. ¿Te interesa?"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_crop_overseer.json
msgid ""
"We'll have to divert a decent amount of lumber from our other projects for "
"the fence, but we can get it done for 200 merch."
msgstr ""
"Vamos a tener que desviar una cantidad importante de madera de nuestros "
"otros proyectos para la valla pero lo podemos hacer por 200 mercs."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_crop_overseer.json
msgid ""
"We'll have to divert a decent amount of lumber from our other projects for "
"the fence, but we can get it done for 300 merch."
msgstr ""
"Vamos a tener que desviar una cantidad importante de madera de nuestros "
"otros proyectos para la valla pero lo podemos hacer por 300 mercs."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_crop_overseer.json
msgid ""
"We'll help plow the land and put up a sign to let everybody know it's yours."
"  Once it's plowed, you can hire some workers to plant or harvest the crops "
"for a small fee of course.  Oh, and if you're growing anything we have a "
"demand for, we'll gladly take it off your hands after the harvest."
msgstr ""
"Te vamos a ayudar a arar la tierra y poner un cartel para que todos sepan "
"que es tuyo. Una vez que está arado, podés contratar algunos trabajadores "
"para plantar o cosechar por un precio bajo, claro. Ah, y si estás cultivando"
" algo de lo que tenemos mucha demanda, con gusto te lo compraremos después "
"de la cosecha."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_crop_overseer.json
msgid ""
"We'll plant the field with your choice of crop if you are willing to finance"
" it.  When the crop is ready to harvest, you can have us liquidate it or "
"harvest it for you.  Planting will cost 1 merch per plot."
msgstr ""
"Vamos a plantar el campo con el cultivo que elijar si querés financiarlo. "
"Cuando el cultivo esté listo para cosechar, podés pedirnos que la vendamos o"
" la cosechemos por vos. Plantar te va a costar 1 merc por parcela."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_crop_overseer.json
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
msgid "What do you need done?"
msgstr "¿Hay algo que sea necesario hacer?"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_crop_overseer.json
msgid ""
"You can either have us liquidate the crop and give you the cash or pay us to"
" harvest it for you.  Harvesting will cost 1 merch per plot."
msgstr ""
"Podés pedirnos que vendamos la cosecha y te demos la plata o podés pagarnos "
"para cosecharla para vos. Cosechar te va a costar un 1 merc por parcela."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_crop_overseer.json
msgid "[1 merch / plot] I'd like to harvest the field."
msgstr "[1 merc / parcela] Me gustaría cosechar el campo."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_crop_overseer.json
msgid "[1 merch / plot] I'd like to plant some seeds."
msgstr "[1 merc / parcela] Me gustaría plantar algunas semillas."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_crop_overseer.json
msgid "[100 merch] Yeah, let's do it."
msgstr "[100 mercs] Sí, dale"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_crop_overseer.json
msgid "[200 merch] Alright, build me a fence."
msgstr "[200 mercs] Bueno, dale, hagan la valla."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_crop_overseer.json
msgid "[200 merch] Yeah, let's do it."
msgstr "[200 mercs] Sí, dale."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_crop_overseer.json
msgid "[300 merch] Alright, build me a fence."
msgstr "[300 mercs] Bueno, dale, hagan la valla."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_crop_overseer.json
msgid "[350 merch] Seems like a fair price.  I'll take it."
msgstr "[350 mercs] Parece un precio razonable. Acepto."

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_doctor.json
msgid "A Crutch to Lean on"
msgstr "Una Muleta para Apoyarse"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_doctor.json
msgid "Anesthetic for the Doctor"
msgstr "Anestesia para el Médico"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Anesthetic for the Doctor"
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_doctor.json
msgid "Any progress on getting some anesthetic or parts?"
msgstr "¿Pudiste conseguir algo de anestesia?"

#. ~ Description of mission "Anesthetic for the Doctor"
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_doctor.json
msgid ""
"Bring the doctor 3000 units of anesthetic.  Ask around the commune for "
"assistance in building an anesthetic machine."
msgstr ""
"Traerle al médico 3000 unidades de anestesia. Preguntá en la comunidad para "
"conseguir ayudar para construir una máquina de anestesia."

#. ~ Description of mission "Find 5 Pairs of Medical Gloves"
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_doctor.json
msgid "Bring the doctor 5 pairs of medical gloves."
msgstr "Traerle al médico 5 pares de guantes médicos."

#. ~ Description of mission "A Crutch to Lean on"
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_doctor.json
msgid "Bring the doctor some crutches."
msgstr "Traerle al médico unas muletas."

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_doctor.json
msgid "Collect Office Supplies"
msgstr "Recolectar Suministros de Oficina"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_doctor.json
msgid "Could you help me with some bionics?"
msgstr "¿Me podés ayudar con unos biónicos?"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "A Crutch to Lean on"
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_doctor.json
msgid "Do you have the crutches?"
msgstr "¿Tenés las muletas?"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find 5 Pairs of Medical Gloves"
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_doctor.json
msgid "Do you have the medical gloves?"
msgstr "¿Conseguiste los guantes médicos?"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_doctor.json
msgid "Find 5 Pairs of Medical Gloves"
msgstr "Conseguir 5 Pares de Guantes Médicos"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Collect Office Supplies"
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_doctor.json
msgid "Have you found the supplies yet?"
msgstr "¿Ya conseguiste los suministros?"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find 5 Pairs of Medical Gloves"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find 10 Syringes"
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_doctor.json
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
msgid "Hospitals or clinics might have a few sitting around."
msgstr "Los hospitales y las clínicas pueden tener algunas por ahí."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Anesthetic for the Doctor"
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_doctor.json
msgid "Hospitals or clinics might have some.  Labs could have some as well."
msgstr ""
"Puede haber en los hospitales y en las clínicas. Y en los laboratorios "
"también podrías encontrar."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_doctor.json
msgid "I can't right now, I have other matters to attend to."
msgstr "No puedo en este momento, tengo otras cosas que atender."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_doctor.json
msgid ""
"I could only find one real crutch, but if you match it with this wooden one,"
" that's just as good, right?."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_doctor.json
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
msgid "I could use your medical assistance."
msgstr "Me vendría bien tu ayuda médica."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_doctor.json
msgid ""
"I couldn't find any crutches, but I've got these handmade ones.  Will they "
"work?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_doctor.json
msgid "I need help removing an implant…"
msgstr "Necesito ayuda para quitar un implante…"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_doctor.json
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
msgid "I need medical attention."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Anesthetic for the Doctor"
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_doctor.json
msgid ""
"I want to make sure we are setup to handle any major surgeries that come our"
" way, but pain management is going to be an issue.  For longer surgeries, "
"we're going to need some anesthetic.  Can you bring me 3000 units to start?"
"  We're also going to need an anesthetic machine to deliver it.  Maybe some "
"people around the commune can help with that?"
msgstr ""
"Me quiero asegurar que estemos preparados para cualquier cirugía mayor que "
"podría venir y el control del dolor va a ser un problema. Para cirugías más "
"largas vamos a necesitar anestesia. ¿Me podrás conseguir 3000 unidades como "
"para empezar? También vamos a necesitar una máquina de anestesia para "
"suministrarla. Tal vez haya gente de la comunidad que pueda ayudar con eso."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_doctor.json
msgid "I was wondering if you could install a cybernetic implant…"
msgstr "Me preguntaba si podrías instalar un implante cibernético…"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_doctor.json
msgid "I'll see what I can find."
msgstr "Voy a ver qué puedo encontrar."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "A Crutch to Lean on"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find 5 Pairs of Medical Gloves"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Anesthetic for the Doctor"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find 12 Car Batteries"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Gather 5 Backpacks"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find a copy of Homebrewer's Bible"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Gather 80lb (10000 units) of Sugar"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Collect 30 Glass Sheets"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Collect 100 Aspirin"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Collect 3 Hotplates"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Collect 200 Multivitamin Pills"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Make 4 Charcoal Purifiers"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find a Chemistry Set"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find 10 Filter Masks"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find 4 Pairs of Rubber Gloves"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find 2 Scalpels"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Advanced Emergency Care"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find 10 Syringes"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Make 6 Fire-Hardened Wooden Spears"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Make 5 Headlamps"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Make 3 Suits of Leather Armor"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Make 12 Molotov Cocktails"
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_doctor.json
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_scavenger.json
msgid "I'm counting on you."
msgstr "Cuento con vos."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_doctor.json
msgid ""
"I'm running out of office supplies.  I know… of all the things to need at a "
"time like this!  I just need to be able to keep track of and organize "
"medical records so that I can focus on helping people.  Ten binders and a "
"ream of paper should tide me over until some shipments come in."
msgstr ""
"Me estoy quedando sin suministros para la oficina. Ya sé… ¡entre todo lo que"
" necesitamos en un momento como este! Necesito poder controlar y organizar "
"los registros médicos para poder enfocarme en curar a la gente. Diez "
"carpetas y una resma de hojas deberían sacarme del apuro hasta que llegue la"
" próxima carga."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_doctor.json
msgid "I'm sorry, I don't have time to help you at the moment."
msgstr "Lo lamento, no tengo tiempo para ayudarte en este momento."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_doctor.json
msgid "Is there anything else I can help with?"
msgstr "¿Hay algo más que pueda hacer para ayudarte?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_doctor.json
msgid "Maybe I could help you with something?"
msgstr "¿Tal vez te pueda ayudar con algo?"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "A Crutch to Lean on"
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_doctor.json
msgid ""
"One of the laborers injured their foot pretty badly and I don't want them "
"walking on it for a few days at least.  Do you think you could find a pair "
"of crutches?"
msgstr ""
"Uno de los trabajadores se lastimé el pie bastante mal y no quiero que lo "
"apoye por unos días. ¿Podrás conseguirnos un par de muletas?"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-
#. TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_doctor.json
msgctxt "u:f"
msgid "Take it easy now.  Wouldn't want you coming back here too soon."
msgstr "Relajate ahora. No quiero que vuelvas demasiado rápido."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-
#. TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
