#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
msgid "I'd look through a few basic chemistry books to find a simple recipe."
msgstr ""
"Yo buscaría en los libros de química básica para encontrar una receta común."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find 25 Blankets"
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
msgid ""
"I'd start with looting hotels or you could sew them together… but that would"
" be a last resort."
msgstr ""
"Yo empezaría por buscar en hoteles o también podés coserlas… pero eso sería "
"como último recurso."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
msgid "I'll keep an eye out."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
msgid "I'll tell them that, but they seemed good for a bit of hard labor."
msgstr "Les voy a decir, pero parece que no les importará el trabajo duro."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find 12 Car Batteries"
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
msgid "I'm impressed with your abilities."
msgstr "Estoy impresionado con tus habilidades."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find 2 Two-Way Radios"
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
msgid "I'm sure the scavengers will find these useful."
msgstr "Estoy seguro de que a los cartoneros les van a venir bien. "

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Gather 150 Units of Bleach"
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
msgid "I'm sure you can find bleach in most homes…"
msgstr "Seguro que podés conseguir lavandina en la mayoría de las casas…"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Gather 30lb (3888 units) of Salt"
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
msgid ""
"I'm sure you've noticed the new workers that have started trickling in.  The"
" Free Merchant council is demanding that we immediately begin projects to "
"become self-sufficient due to limited supplies.  We are going to need to "
"rapidly setup an agricultural industry before winter and starvation catches "
"us unprepared and unsupported.  In order to get a half dozen shovels and a "
"couple of bags of seeds, we are going to have to trade for it.  I've already"
" got the deal lined up, but the only thing they are willing to trade it for "
"is salt.  I negotiated them down from 50 lbs to 30… we were hoping you might"
" have access to a source."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
msgid ""
"I'm the engineer in charge of turning this place into a working camp.  This "
"is going to be an uphill battle, we used most of our initial supplies "
"getting here and boarding up the windows.  I've got a huge list of tasks "
"that need to get done, so if you could help us keep supplied I'd appreciate "
"it.  If you have material to drop off you can just back your vehicle into "
"here and dump it on the ground, we'll sort it."
msgstr ""
"Soy el ingeniero a cargo de convertir este lugar en un campo de trabajo. "
"Esta va a ser una batalla cuesta arriba, usamos la mayoría de nuestros "
"suministros iniciales para llegar hasta acá y cubrir las ventanas. Tengo una"
" enorme lista de tareas que necesitamos realizar así que si querés ayudar a "
"mantenernos suministrados, te lo voy a agradecer. Si tenés materiales para "
"dejar podés entrar tu vehículo acá y dejar todo en el suelo, nosotros lo "
"acomodamos."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Gather 30lb (3888 units) of Salt"
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
msgid ""
"If you can find a source of salt water you should be able to boil it down.  "
"Alternatively, you can go into the cities and search restaurants."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Gather 150 Units of Bleach"
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
msgid ""
"If you can't find a large supply I'd recommend checking hospitals or "
"research labs."
msgstr ""
"Si no podés encontrar un suministro grande, te recomiendo buscar en "
"hospitales o laboratorios de investigación."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Gather 75 Rocks"
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
msgid ""
"If you take a shovel to a pile of rubble, you should be able to pull out "
"structural grade rocks."
msgstr ""
"Si usás una pala en una pila de escombros, deberías poder sacar piedra de "
"grado estructural."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
msgid "Is this about bootstrapping the trade relating to the bar?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Gather 5 Backpacks"
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
msgid "It may be easier to make them if you can't find a school or something."
msgstr ""
"Puede ser más fácil hacerlas si no podés encontrar una escuela o algo así."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Gather 80lb (10000 units) of Sugar"
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
msgid ""
"Just flipping through the book, I can tell that one ingredient in most of "
"the alcoholic drinks that we don't have a large supply of is sugar.  What "
"alcohol we have been able to loot isn't going to last us long, so starting "
"our first large batch is a priority.  Could you bring in 80 lbs of sugar?  "
"That should last us until we can start producing our own supply."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Gather 75 Rocks"
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
msgid "Mining would always be an option if you had the resources."
msgstr "Hacer una mina siempre es una opción si tenés los recursos."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
msgid "Morning ma'am, how can I help you?"
msgstr "Buenos días, señora, ¿la puedo ayudar en algo?"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find 2 Two-Way Radios"
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
msgid ""
"Organizing the scavenging missions is difficult enough without "
"communication."
msgstr ""
"Organizar las misiones de cartoneo es bastante difícil sin comunicación."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Gather 75 Rocks"
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
msgid ""
"Our current assessment for survivability has increased significantly thanks "
"to your efforts.  The next priority issue is securing a cleaner water "
"source.  Drinking from the pond on the back end of the ranch has led to an "
"outbreak of dysentery.  We need to improve the sanitary conditions in the "
"camp as quickly as possible.  To do so, the first step is to dig a well and "
"construct stone fireplaces in the barn for the migrants to boil water.  We "
"are going to need at least 75 rocks from you if we hope to accomplish the "
"task before we all get sick.  After we have them installed, you will have "
"free access to them, guaranteed."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Cut 200 planks"
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
msgid ""
"Our first project is to enclose the barn so that new refugees have a safe "
"place to sleep.  Before we can begin serious improvements, we need lumber to"
" work with.  Enclosing the four barn entrances will take nearly 400 planks… "
"if you could provide half of that, we should be able to take care of the "
"other half and construction.  If you don't have a truck, I'd make finding "
"one your first priority."
msgstr ""
"Nuestro primer proyecto es cerrar el granero para que los nuevos refugiados "
"tengan un lugar seguro para dormir. Antes de que podamos realizar mejoras "
"necesitamos madera. Cerrar las cuatro entradas del granero nos va a llevar "
"cerca de 400 tablas de madera… si nos podés conseguir la mitad de eso "
"podríamos encargarnos de la otra mitad y de la construcción. Y te diría que "
"consigas un camión, si no tenés."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Gather 1500 Nails"
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
msgid ""
"Our supply of nails has been depleted.  I'm going to have to ask you to get "
"us a few more boxes.  Hardware stores should have a few if they haven't been"
" looted.  I suppose you may be able to find handfuls of them in building "
"rubble.  We'd need 2500 to have enough that we won't be sending you back out"
" too soon."
msgstr ""
"Nuestra provisión de clavos se ha agotado. Voy a tener que pedirte que nos "
"consigas unas cajas más. Las ferreterías deben tener si todavía no han sido "
"saqueadas. Supongo que podrías conseguir algunos puñados en los escombros de"
" los edificios. Vamos a necesitar 2500 para tener suficientes y no tener que"
" mandarte pronto a buscar más."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Gather 50 Pipes"
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
msgid ""
"Pipes are used in numerous metal constructions.  Smashing abandoned "
"furniture may provide the material we need."
msgstr ""
"Los caños son usados en muchas construcciones metálicas. Destruir muebles "
"abandonados pueden proveerte del material que necesitamos."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Gather 2 Electric Motors"
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
msgid ""
"Power for the motors will be provided by a salvaged truck battery, you need "
"not bring additional mechanical components."
msgstr ""
"La energía para los motores será provista por una batería de camión "
"recuperada, no necesitás traer ningún componente mecánico adicional."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Gather 30lb (3888 units) of Salt"
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
msgid ""
"Salt is key to preserving meat and other perishables… without any excess "
"food it wouldn't do us much good now, but I imagine we'll need to send you "
"out to get more in the future."
msgstr ""
"La sal es clave para preservar la carne y otros alimentos… como no tenemos "
"exceso de comida, ahora no nos sirve de mucho pero me imagino que vamos a "
"necesitar mandarte a buscar más en un futuro."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
msgid "Thanks anyway."
msgstr "Gracias, igual."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
msgid ""
"The merchant at the Refugee Center sent me to get a prospectus from you."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Cut 200 planks"
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
msgid ""
"The more men we can bring to the camp, the quicker improvements can be made."
msgstr ""
"Cuantos más hombres podamos traer al campamento, más rápido podemos realizar"
" las mejoras."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find 2 Arc Welders"
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
msgid ""
"The only place I've seen them is garages, but I imagine you could find them "
"in some stores."
msgstr ""
"El único lugar donde las vi es en los talleres mecánicos pero me imagino que"
" las podés encontrar en algunos negocios."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Gather 5 Backpacks"
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
msgid ""
"The volunteers for the scavenging teams will need to be issued some basic "
"equipment.  When the boss sets up shop in the junk shed, you should ask him "
"what else he needs for his teams.  In the meantime, we can provide a few "
"backpacks to get them started.  Could you find five backpacks to give to the"
" initial team?"
msgstr ""
"Los voluntarios para los equipos de cartoneo necesitan que se les otorgue el"
" equipamiento básico. Cuando el jefe establezca el negocio de objetos "
"usados, deberías preguntarle qué otra cosa va a necesitar. Mientras, podemos"
" proveer algunas mochilas para que comiencen. ¿Podrías conseguir cinco para "
"darle al primer equipo?"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find 2 Arc Welders"
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
msgid ""
"The work you have done has swayed the leaders at the refugee center to send "
"someone out to assist with our medical needs.  The next step is for us to "
"get a sort of chop-shop setup so that we can begin using scrap metal to "
"build fortifications and equipment.  We are going to need a pair of arc "
"welders for our mechanics to use."
msgstr ""
"El trabajo que has realizado ha merecido que los líderes del centro de "
"refugiados envíen alguien a asistirnos con nuestras necesidades médicas. El "
"próximo paso es conseguir una especie de desarmadero así podemos empezar a "
"usar pedazos de metal para construir fortificaciones y equipamiento. "
"Necesitaremos un par de soldadoras de arco para nuestros mecánicos."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Gather 80lb (10000 units) of Sugar"
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
msgid ""
"There is a large group of thirsty individuals in our outpost that are truly "
"thankful for your work."
msgstr ""
"Hay un grupo grande de personas sedientas en nuestro puesto que están "
"realmente agradecidos por tu trabajo."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Gather 30 Bottles (120 units) of Liquid
#. Fertilizer"
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
msgid "This really should make the first winter easier to survive."
msgstr "Esto va a hacer el primer invierno más fácil de sobrevivir."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Gather 50 Pipes"
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
msgid ""
"To fabricate the well's hand pump and construct components for several other"
" projects, we are going to need to find or fabricate a number of steel "
"pipes.  Plumbing is a distant possibility for now, but some form of "
"irrigation will eventually become desirable.  You could assist us with "
"procuring 50 steel pipes, if you so have the chance."
msgstr ""
"Para fabricar la manivela del pozo de agua y construir los componentes para "
"varios proyectos más, necesitamos encontrar o fabricar una cantidad de caños"
" de acero. Las tuberías son una posibilidad distante por ahora pero "
"eventualmente vamos a necesitar alguna forma de irrigación. Nos podrías "
"ayudar consiguiéndonos 50 caños de acero, si tenés la posibilidad."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
msgid "Understood.  Back to business."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Gather 30lb (3888 units) of Salt"
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
msgid "We are going to begin preparing our fields immediately."
msgstr "Vamos a comenzar a preparar nuestros campos inmediatamente."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find 12 Car Batteries"
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
msgid ""
"We have the basic equipment that we need, but without a functioning power "
"grid, we are forced to rely on the readily available vehicle batteries.  "
"This is going to be a chore, but I'll need twelve car batteries to swap "
"between charging and powering our equipment.  The good news is that they "
"don't need to be charged; we can take care of that."
msgstr ""
"Tenemos el equipo básico que necesitamos pero sin una red eléctrica "
"funcionando estamos forzados a depender de las baterías de vehículos "
"disponibles. Esto va a ser un embole conseguir pero necesito doce baterías "
"de auto para cargar o alimentar nuestro equipamiento. La buena noticia es "
"que no necesitan estar cargadas, podemos encargarnos de eso."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Collect 30 Glass Sheets"
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
msgid ""
"We'll begin planting our first seeds as soon as we can get these installed."
msgstr ""
"Vamos a empezar a plantar nuestras primeras semillas tan pronto como podamos"
" instalar esto. "

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Gather 36 bandages"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Gather 6 bottles (60 units) of antiseptic"
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
msgid "We'll do our best to make them last…"
msgstr "Haremos lo posible para hacerlos rendir…"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
msgid ""
"We're still in early stages of getting set up, but we're not overly flush "
"for hands, that's for sure.  If they're willing to put in a hard day's work,"
" we can get them busy."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Gather 6 bottles (60 units) of antiseptic"
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
msgid ""
"We've started planning a medical clinic, but we are going to need a lot more"
" supplies if we hope to warrant sending one of the few people with medical "
"experience from the refugee center to our outpost.  I know first aid "
"equipment is rare, but they have all the basic supplies that I'm uncertain "
"of.  If you could bring in 6 bottles of antiseptic, I'm sure we could "
"supplement them to make theirs last a bit longer."
msgstr ""
"Hemos comenzado a planificar la clínica médica pero vamos a necesitar muchos"
" más suministros si esperamos garantizar que alguna de las pocas personas "
"con experiencia médica del centro de refugiados venga a nuestro puesto. Sé "
"que los equipos de primeros auxilios son escasos pero tienen todos los "
"suministros básicos que conozco. Si pudieras traer 6 botellas de "
"antiséptico, seguro que podemos suplementarlos para hacerlos durar un poco "
"más."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Gather 36 bandages"
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
msgid ""
"We've started planning a medical clinic, but we are going to need a lot more"
" supplies if we hope to warrant sending one of the few people with medical "
"experience from the refugee center to our outpost.  I know first aid "
"equipment is rare, but they have all the basic supplies that I'm uncertain "
"of.  If you could bring in thirty-six bandages I'm sure we could supplement "
"them to make theirs last a bit longer."
msgstr ""
"Hemos comenzado a planificar la clínica médica pero vamos a necesitar muchos"
" más suministros si esperamos garantizar que alguna de las pocas personas "
"con experiencia médica del centro de refugiados venga a nuestro puesto. Sé "
"que los equipos de primeros auxilios son escasos pero tienen todos los "
"suministros básicos que conozco. Si pudieras traer treinta y seis vendas, "
"seguro que podemos suplementarlos para hacerlos durar un poco más."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Gather 30 Bottles (120 units) of Liquid
#. Fertilizer"
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
msgid ""
"Well, our first crop will be planted shortly, but I'm starting to suspect "
"that our profit margin is going to be much smaller than we expect.  With "
"limited seed for our original crop, our next course of action is to increase"
" the soil's fertility.  Is there any way you could find or produce a basic "
"liquid fertilizer for us?  We'd need at least 120 units or 30 full bottles "
"to make a significant improvement in our output."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
msgid "What's your job here?"
msgstr "¿Cuál es tu ocupación acá?"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find 25 Blankets"
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
msgid ""
"With the barn entrances enclosed, the refugees moving in there should feel "
"safer, but the weather can be bitter here.  We're going to need to build "
"makeshift beds in the stalls to ward off disease and frostbite.  We can take"
" care of the frames, but will need your help looting blankets.  We'd need 25"
" blankets to provide the most basic sleeping accommodations."
msgstr ""
"Con las entradas del granero cerradas, los refugiados que se muden adentro "
"deberían sentirse seguros pero el clima puede ser complicado acá. Vamos a "
"necesitar construir unas camas improvisadas en los puestos para evitar las "
"enfermedades y el congelamiento. Podemos encargarnos de las estructuras pero"
" necesitamos tu ayuda para conseguir frazadas. Necesitamos 25 frazadas para "
"tener lo más básico para dormir."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Gather 2 Electric Motors"
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
msgid ""
"With the well's completion, we are rapidly closing the sustainability gap.  "
"In order to expand from here, we will need massive quantities of lumber to "
"construct fortifications and new buildings.  We have already begun work on a"
" manually operated sawmill, but we will need two electric motors to control "
"the actual blades.  We were hoping you might be able to secure the motors "
"for us."
msgstr ""
"Con el pozo de agua hecho vamos acercándonos a la sustentabilidad. Para "
"poder expandirnos más, vamos a necesitar cantidades enormes de madera para "
"construir fortificaciones y edificios nuevos. Ya hemos comenzado a trabajar "
"en un aserradero de operación manual pero necesitamos dos motores eléctricos"
" para controlar las cuchillas. Pensábamos que tal vez vos puedas "
"conseguirnos los motores."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find 2 Arc Welders"
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
msgid "With two, we should be able to repair one if it breaks."
msgstr "Con dos, vamos a poder reparar una si se rompe."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
msgid ""
"Ya, that representative from the Old Guard asked the two of us to come out "
"here and begin fortifying this place as a refugee camp.  I'm not sure how "
"fast he expects the two of us to get setup, but we were assured additional "
"men were coming out here to assist us. "
msgstr ""
"Sí, ese representante de la Vieja Guardia nos pidió a los dos que vengamos "
"acá y empecemos a fortificar el lugar para que sea un campamento de "
"refugiados. No estoy seguro de qué tan rápido espera que nosotros dos "
"establezcamos todo pero nos aseguraron que vendrían más hombres a ayudarnos."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
msgid "You mean setting up the doctor's office?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Gather 80lb (10000 units) of Sugar"
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
msgid ""
"You might get lucky finding it, but you could always boil it out of fruit if"
" you are familiar with the process.  Or go into the cities and look in "
"restaurants and bakeries."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find 2 Two-Way Radios"
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
msgid ""
"You should be able to find them in electronics stores or at a police "
"station."
msgstr ""
"Deberías poder encontrarlas en negocios de electrónica o en la comisaría."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
msgid ""
"You've done a lot for the ranch, by generally helping the community with "
"both wellness and trade.  As the project lead, I want to make sure these "
"efforts don't go unnoticed."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find 25 Blankets"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Gather 1500 Nails"
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
msgid "Your assistance is always appreciated."
msgstr "Tu ayuda es siempre apreciada."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
msgid ""
"we're still in early stages of getting set up, but we're not overly flush "
"for hands, that's for sure.  I don't think we'd turn many people away, of "
"course, but besides strong hands and willing labor, we could really use "
"someone who could cook.  I can't tell you what it'd do for morale.  You "
"could try asking some of the people staying on the surface in the refugee "
"center maybe, I don't think they were part of most of the original "
"discussions about the ranch."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_generic.json
msgid "Afraid not.  Maybe somebody else could help."
msgstr "Lamentablemente, no. Tal vez te pueda ayudar otra persona."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-
#. TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_generic.json
msgctxt "u:f"
msgid "Have you asked the scavenger boss if they'd have anything?"
msgstr "¿Le preguntaste al jefe de los cartoneros si tienen algo?"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-
#. TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_generic.json
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid "Have you asked the scavenger boss if they'd have anything?"
msgstr "¿Le preguntaste al jefe de los cartoneros si tienen algo?"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-
#. TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_generic.json
msgctxt "u:n"
msgid "Have you asked the scavenger boss if they'd have anything?"
msgstr "¿Le preguntaste al jefe de los cartoneros si tienen algo?"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_generic.json
msgid "I don't know what I could offer."
msgstr "No sé qué te puedo ofrecer."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_generic.json
msgid "Maybe the scrapper would have some spare parts?"
msgstr "¿Tal vez el chatarrero pueda tener algunas partes?"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_generic.json
msgid "Unfortunately, I don't have anything that can help."
msgstr "Lamentablemente, no tengo nada que pueda ayudar."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Collect 100 Aspirin"
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
msgid "Aspirin is pretty common in homes and convenience stores."
msgstr "Las aspirinas son bastante comunes en las casas y en los almacenes."

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
msgid "Collect 100 Aspirin"
msgstr "Recolectar 100 Aspirinas"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
msgid "Collect 200 Multivitamin Pills"
msgstr "Recolectar 200 Pastillas de Multivitaminas"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
msgid "Collect 3 Hotplates"
msgstr "Recolectar 3 Anafes Eléctricos"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Make 4 Charcoal Purifiers"
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
msgid ""
"Despite my recommendations, we continue to have travelers come in with "
"illnesses that I've been able to trace back to contaminated drinking water."
"  When boiling water isn't an option, they need some form of charcoal water "
"filter that they can use.  If you could build me four charcoal water "
"filters, I'll distribute them to groups as they pass through."
msgstr ""
"A pesar de mis recomendaciones, continuamos recibiendo viajeros con "
"enfermedades originadas en el consumo de agua contaminada, según pude "
"averiguar. Cuando no está la opción de hervirla, se necesita algún "
"purificador de agua a carbón que se pueda usar. Si me pudieras construir "
"cuatro purificadores de agua a carbón, yo voy a distribuirlos entre los "
"grupos."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Collect 200 Multivitamin Pills"
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
msgid ""
"Disease is spreading rapidly due to poor nutrition and there is little that "
"I can do about it.  With food being scarce, people are willing to survive on"
" whatever they can.  I need to start supplementing the outpost's diet with "
"vitamins to prevent potential deaths indirectly attributable to nutrition.  "
"I know it is a lot, but if you could bring me 200 multivitamin pills, I'd be"
" able to treat the most vulnerable before they spread anything to the rest "
"of us."
msgstr ""
"La enfermedad se está extendiendo rápidamente debido a la pobre nutrición y "
"ahí no hay mucho que yo pueda hacer. Con la escasez de comida la gente "
"intenta sobrevivir como puede. Necesito empezar a suplementar la dieta con "
"vitaminas para prevenir potenciales muertes que puedan ser atribuidas "
"indirectamente a la nutrición. Sé que es un montón pero si pudieras traerme "
"200 pastillas de multivitaminas, podría tratar a los más vulnerables antes "
"de que contagien al resto."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Advanced Emergency Care"
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
msgid "Do you have the Guide to Advanced Emergency Care?"
msgstr "¿Ya conseguiste la Guía del Cuidado Médico Avanzado?"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Collect 100 Aspirin"
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
msgid "Do you have the aspirin?"
msgstr "¿Ya conseguiste las aspirinas?"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Make 4 Charcoal Purifiers"
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
msgid "Do you have the charcoal water filters?"
msgstr "¿Ya tenés los purificadores de agua a carbón?"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find a Chemistry Set"
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
msgid "Do you have the chemistry set?"
msgstr "¿Ya conseguiste el equipo de química?"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find 10 Syringes"
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
msgid "Do you have the empty syringes?"
msgstr "¿Ya conseguiste las jeringas vacías?"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find 10 Filter Masks"
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
msgid "Do you have the filter masks?"
msgstr "¿Ya tenés los barbijos?"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Collect 3 Hotplates"
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
msgid "Do you have the hotplates?"
msgstr "¿Ya conseguiste los anafes eléctricos?"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find 4 Pairs of Rubber Gloves"
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
msgid "Do you have the rubber gloves?"
msgstr "¿Ya conseguiste los guantes de goma?"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find 2 Scalpels"
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
msgid "Do you have the scalpels?"
msgstr "¿Ya conseguiste los escalpelos?"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Collect 200 Multivitamin Pills"
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
msgid "Do you have the vitamins?"
msgstr "¿Ya conseguiste las vitaminas?"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
msgid "Find 10 Filter Masks"
msgstr "Conseguir 10 Barbijos"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
msgid "Find 10 Syringes"
msgstr "Conseguir 10 Jeringas"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
msgid "Find 2 Scalpels"
msgstr "Conseguir 2 Escalpelos"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
msgid "Find 4 Pairs of Rubber Gloves"
msgstr "Conseguir 4 Pares de Guantes de Goma"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
msgid "Find Advanced Emergency Care"
msgstr "Conseguir Guía de Cuidado Médico Avanzado"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
msgid "Find a Chemistry Set"
msgstr "Conseguir Equipo de Química"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Advanced Emergency Care"
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
msgid ""
"Have you heard of a book called the 'Guide to Advanced Emergency Care?'  I "
"really need a copy.  The doctor is requesting a lot of supplies that I'm not"
" familiar with, but I believe I could make if I could get a copy of the "
"book."
msgstr ""
"¿Escuchaste acerca de un libro llamado 'Guía de Cuidado Médico Avanzado'? La"
" verdad es que necesito uno de esos. El médico está pidiendo muchos "
"suministros que no conozco pero creo que puedo hacerlos si consigo ese "
"libro."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find 2 Scalpels"
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
msgid "Hospitals and crafting stores should have a few."
msgstr ""
"Los hospitales o los negocios de manualidades o artesanías deben tener "
"varios."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
msgid "How can I help you?"
msgstr "¿En qué te puedo ayudar?"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
msgid ""
"I can take a look at you if you like.  I'm not a doctor, but I know my way "
"around a clinic.  The cost is nine merch."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find 2 Scalpels"
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
msgid ""
"I heard that we may have a physician on his way here.  The workers have "
"already begun expanding the clinic, but I need you to locate a pair of "
"scalpels to use in surgery when he arrives.  I'm sure you should be able to "
"find them in a hospital or craft shop."
msgstr ""
"Escuché que podría estar viniendo un médico para acá. Los trabajadores ya "
"comenzaron a ampliar la clínica pero necesito que me consigas un par de "
"escalpelos para usar en cirugías cuando él llegue. Estoy seguro que los vas "
"a encontrar en hospitales o en negocios de manualidades o artesanías."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
msgid "I should be fine."
msgstr "Voy a estar bien."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
msgid ""
"I was a practicing nurse, so I've taken over the medical responsibilities of"
" the outpost till we can locate a physician."
msgstr ""
"Antes era un/a enfermero/a practicante así que tomé las responsabilidades "
"médicas del puesto hasta que podamos conseguir un médico."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Collect 3 Hotplates"
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
msgid ""
"I was given a few bottles of bleach when I arrived, but I need a number of "
"hotplates to actually sterilize equipment.  I'm sure you can find them in "
"any old house or appliance store.  Three should be enough for now."
msgstr ""
"Me dieron unas botellas de lavandina cuando llegué pero necesito una "
"cantidad de anafes eléctricos para poder esterilizar equipamiento. Estoy "
"seguro de que podés encontrarlos en cualquier casa vieja o negocios de "
"electrodomésticos. Con tres vamos a andar bien."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
msgid ""
"I'm willing to pay a premium for medical supplies that you might be able to "
"scavenge up.  I also have a few miscellaneous jobs from time to time."
msgstr ""
"Estoy dispuesto a pagar un extra por los suministros médicos que puedas ser "
"capaz de conseguir. También tengo algunos trabajos variados de vez en "
"cuando."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find a Chemistry Set"
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
msgid ""
"I've been working on producing some of our own medical supplies, but I'm "
"going to need a chemistry set to get everything that I need in order.  Is "
"there any way you could go through one of the school chemistry labs and "
"steal me a chemistry set?"
msgstr ""
"Estuve trabajando en la producción de algunos suministros médicos propios "
"pero voy a necesitar un equipo de química para poner todo lo que necesito en"
" orden. ¿Hay alguna forma de que puedas ir a los laboratorios de las "
"escuelas y me consigas un equipo de química?"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Collect 100 Aspirin"
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
msgid ""
"I've got a handful of bandages and a few first aid kits to work with at the "
"moment… in other words I'm completely unable to treat most serious medical "
"emergencies.  I'm supposed to have priority on any medical supplies that the"
" scavengers bring in, but I imagine the black market for the stuff will "
"prevent me from ever seeing it.  I could use your help getting me 100 "
"aspirin pills to start with."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Collect 3 Hotplates"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Collect 200 Multivitamin Pills"
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
msgid "It should be a fairly common item.  Don't know what else to say."
msgstr "Debería ser un objeto bastante común. No sé qué otra cosa decirte."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Advanced Emergency Care"
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
msgid "Libraries are the only place I'd think to look."
msgstr "Las bibliotecas son el único lugar en el que me imagino que hay."

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
msgid "Make 4 Charcoal Purifiers"
msgstr "Hacer 4 Purif. de Agua a Carbón"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
msgid "Not now."
msgstr "Ahora no."

#. ~ Name suffix of a female NPC
#. ~ Mission source for clinic.  Provides medical attention.
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
msgid "Nurse"
msgstr "Enfermero"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
msgid "That's the best I can do on short notice."
msgstr "Eso es lo mejor que puedo hacer con poco tiempo."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find 4 Pairs of Rubber Gloves"
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
msgid ""
"The bodily fluids that I often have to clean up and the caustic chemicals I "
"deal with have done a number on my current pair of gloves.  Could you find "
"me four pairs of heavy rubber gloves?  That should be enough that I can task"
" a few laborers with cleanup details in the event of an outbreak."
msgstr ""
"Los fluidos corporales que a menudo tengo que limpiar y los químicos "
"cáusticos que uso han mermado mi cantidad de guantes. ¿Podrías conseguirme "
"cuatro pares de guantes de goma resistente? Eso debería ser suficiente para "
"asignarle tareas de higiene a algunos trabajadores en el caso de un brote."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find 10 Filter Masks"
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
msgid ""
"The number of airway infections that I've encountered in the past week has "
"depleted my supply of masks.  Could you find me 10 filter masks?  I tend to "
"only distribute them in severe cases, so I'll be sure to make them last."
msgstr ""
"El número de infecciones de transmisión aérea que encontré la semana pasada "
"me dejó sin barbijos. ¿Podrías conseguirme 10? Solo los distribuyo en casos "
"severos así que me voy a asegurar de que rindan."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find 10 Syringes"
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
msgid ""
"We are starting to isolate a few natural antibiotic serums, but we don't "
"have the supplies to administer the cocktails.  I need you to bring me 10 "
"empty syringes to use.  I'll take care of cleaning them to prevent "
"transferring infections."
msgstr ""
"Estamos comenzando a aislar algunos sueros antibióticos naturales pero no "
"tenemos los suministros para administrar los cocteles. Necesito que me "
"traigas 10 jeringas vacías para usar. Yo me encargo de limpiarlas para "
"prevenir la transmisión de infecciones."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Collect 100 Aspirin"
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
msgid "We'll go through this pretty quickly, but it does help."
msgstr "Vamos a gastar esto bastante rápido pero nos viene bien."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
msgid "What kind of jobs do you have for me?"
msgstr "¿Qué tipo de trabajo tienen para mí?"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Make 4 Charcoal Purifiers"
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
msgid ""
"With some basic survival and crafting skills, you should be able to make "
"them with little effort."
msgstr ""
"Con alguna habilidad básica en supervivencia y fabricación, deberías poder "
"construirlos sin mucho esfuerzo."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find 10 Filter Masks"
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
msgid "You may be able to make one if you had the right guide."
msgstr "Los podés fabricar si tenés la guía correcta."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find a Chemistry Set"
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
msgid ""
"You might be able to find one in a pharmacy if you can't find a school."
msgstr ""
"Deberías poder conseguirlo en una farmacia si no encontrás una escuela."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find 4 Pairs of Rubber Gloves"
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
msgid "You should be able to find them in cleaning closets."
msgstr "Deberías poder encontrarlos en los armarios de limpieza."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Make 12 Molotov Cocktails"
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_scavenger.json
msgid ""
"Alcohol or kerosene is probably easier to refine rather than find in large "
"quantities."
msgstr ""
"El alcohol o el querosén son probablemente más fáciles de refinar que de "
"encontrar en grandes cantidades."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_scavenger.json
msgid "Alright, thanks."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_scavenger.json
msgid "Any lucky find?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_scavenger.json
msgid ""
"Are you interested in the scavenging runs or one of the other tasks that I "
"might have for you?"
msgstr ""
"¿Estás interesado en las salidas a cartonear o alguna de las otras tareas "
"que puedo tener para vos?"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Make 3 Suits of Leather Armor"
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_scavenger.json
msgid ""
"Cutting up some leather clothes would probably be easier than trying to tan "
"fresh hides."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Make 12 Molotov Cocktails"
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_scavenger.json
msgid "Do you have the Molotov cocktails?"
msgstr "¿Ya tenés los cócteles molotov?"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Make 5 Headlamps"
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_scavenger.json
msgid "Do you have the headlamps?"
msgstr "¿Ya conseguiste las linternas frontales?"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Make 3 Suits of Leather Armor"
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_scavenger.json
msgid "Do you have the leather armor?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Make 6 Fire-Hardened Wooden Spears"
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_scavenger.json
msgid "Do you have the wooden spears?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Make 6 Fire-Hardened Wooden Spears"
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_scavenger.json
msgid ""
"I can usually use additional survival gear to kit out the new recruits.  The"
" most basic weapon that everyone gets is a fire-hardened wooden spear… "
"They're not the best weapons, but we need people who are used to making do."
"  Could you make me a half dozen of them?  I may need more later, but that "
"should help the first few teams."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-
#. TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_scavenger.json
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I organize scavenging runs to bring in supplies that we can't produce "
"ourselves.  I try and provide incentives to get migrants to join one of the "
"teams… it's dangerous work, but keeps our outpost alive.  Selling anything "
"we can't use helps keep us afloat with the traders.  If you wanted to drop "
"off a companion or two to assist in one of the runs, I'd appreciate it."
msgstr ""
"Organizo las salidas a cartonear para traer suministros que no podemos "
"producir nosotros mismos. Intento proveer incentivos para atraer inmigrantes"
" a que se unan a los equipos… es un trabajo riesgoso pero nos mantiene "
"vivos. Vender lo que no podemos usar nos ayuda a mantenernos a flote con los"
" comerciantes. Si querés dejar un compañero o dos para que nos ayude en una "
"salida, te lo voy a agradecer."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-
#. TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
