"teams… it's dangerous work, but keeps our outpost alive.  Selling anything "
"we can't use helps keep us afloat with the traders.  If you wanted to drop "
"off a companion or two to assist in one of the runs, I'd appreciate it."
msgstr ""
"Organizo las salidas a cartonear para traer suministros que no podemos "
"producir nosotros mismos. Intento proveer incentivos para atraer inmigrantes"
" a que se unan a los equipos… es un trabajo riesgoso pero nos mantiene "
"vivos. Vender lo que no podemos usar nos ayuda a mantenernos a flote con los"
" comerciantes. Si querés dejar un compañero o dos para que nos ayude en una "
"salida, te lo voy a agradecer."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_scavenger.json
msgid "Let's see what you've managed to find."
msgstr "Vamos a ver qué conseguiste."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Make 3 Suits of Leather Armor"
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_scavenger.json
msgid ""
"Lightweight gear that can easily be repaired is in high demand.  Could you "
"make us some suits of leather armor?  The life expectancy of my scavengers "
"would drastically increase if you did."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_scavenger.json
msgid "Make 12 Molotov Cocktails"
msgstr "Hacer 12 Cócteles Molotov"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_scavenger.json
msgid "Make 3 Suits of Leather Armor"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_scavenger.json
msgid "Make 5 Headlamps"
msgstr "Hacer 5 Linternas Frontales"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_scavenger.json
msgid "Make 6 Fire-Hardened Wooden Spears"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Make 5 Headlamps"
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_scavenger.json
msgid ""
"Night is the ideal time for my team to go on raids, but they are going to "
"need better light sources to speed up their missions.  Could you craft a set"
" of five headlamps for them?  Keeping both hands free greatly helps during "
"combat."
msgstr ""
"La noche es el momento ideal para que mi equipo salga de incursión pero va a"
" necesitar mejores fuentes de luz para acelerar las misiones. ¿Podrías "
"fabricar un equipo de cinco linternas frontales para ellos? Tener las dos "
"manos libres ayuda mucho durante el combate."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_scavenger.json
msgid "No, thanks."
msgstr "No, gracias."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_scavenger.json
msgid ""
"Nope, current run hasn't returned yet.  Come back in <interval>.  You might "
"find something you like."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_scavenger.json
msgid "Not right now."
msgstr "En este momento, no."

#. ~ Name suffix of an NPC
#. ~ Mission source, shopkeep
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_scavenger.json
msgid "Scavenger Boss"
msgstr "Jefe Cartonero"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_scavenger.json
msgid "Tell me more about the scavenging runs."
msgstr "Contame más de las salidas para cartonear."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Make 6 Fire-Hardened Wooden Spears"
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_scavenger.json
msgid ""
"They're pretty easy to make.  You can knock down young trees for long "
"sticks, then you just need a knife and a fire to dry the tip."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_scavenger.json
msgid ""
"We don't have any of the parts needed right now, but we could send out a "
"scavenging party to a hospital if you have anyone willing to go."
msgstr ""
"No tenemos ninguna de las partes necesarias en este momento pero podemos "
"mandar un grupo de cartoneros al hospital si conseguís a alguien que quiera "
"ir."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_scavenger.json
msgid "Welcome to the junk shop."
msgstr "Bienvenido al negocio de objetos usados."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_scavenger.json
msgid "What kind of tasks do you have for me?"
msgstr "¿Qué tipo de tareas tienen para mí?"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Make 12 Molotov Cocktails"
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_scavenger.json
msgid ""
"When outnumbered or forced to pull back, my scavengers have been taught to "
"throw Molotov cocktails to keep monsters from chasing them.  We go through "
"one or two on every mission, so we can always use a few more.  Would you be "
"willing to make us a dozen?  I'm willing to pay you what I can for your "
"assistance."
msgstr ""
"Por ser superados en cantidad o forzados a retroceder, mis cartoneros saben "
"tirar cócteles molotov para evitar que los monstruos los persigan. Usamos "
"una o dos por cada misión así que siempre necesitamos más. ¿Serías tan "
"amable de hacernos una docena? Te voy a pagar lo que pueda por tu ayuda."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Make 5 Headlamps"
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_scavenger.json
msgid "You should be able to make them with the most basic of skills."
msgstr "Deberías poder hacerlas solo con tus habilidades más básicas."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_scrapper.json
msgid "An angle grinder and a hacksaw?  I'll see what I can do."
msgstr ""
"¿Una amoladora angular y una sierra de arco para metal? Voy a ver qué puedo "
"hacer."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_scrapper.json
msgid "Don't mind me."
msgstr "No me prestes atención."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Tools for Scrap"
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_scrapper.json
msgid "Have you found the tools yet?"
msgstr "¿Ya conseguiste las herramientas?"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-
