#. ~ Snippet in category "<follower_mutiny>"
#. ~ NPC shout when the NPC is leaving your_followers because the NPC hates
#. you due to abuse.  Always followed by 'adios, motherfucker!'  Could use
#. more variety.
#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags.json
