msgstr ""
"Un programa militar secreto intentó convertirte en el francotirador "
"perfecto. Tus biónicos, equipo y amplio entrenamiento de campo te permiten "
"derribar objetivos desde distancias inverosímiles, incluso después de "
"semanas de total aislamiento en territorio enemigo."

#. ~ Description of profession "Military Veteran" for female
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"After being discharged from the armed forces, you were sent to a veterans' "
"hospital for treatment.  Just when you thought you'd overcome your traumas "
"and readjusted to civilian life, the world has come to an end and your worst"
" nightmare has become a reality: life in an endless battlefield."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of profession "Military Veteran" for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"After being discharged from the armed forces, you were sent to a veterans' "
"hospital for treatment.  Just when you thought you'd overcome your traumas "
"and readjusted to civilian life, the world has come to an end and your worst"
" nightmare has become a reality: life in an endless battlefield."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of profession "Punk Rock Girl" for female
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"All those wicked songs about the apocalypse have come to life.  Brutal!  Now"
" that the system is dead, it's time to party among the bones of the world!"
msgstr ""
"Todas esas canciones geniales acerca del apocalipsis han cobrado vida. "
"¡Brutal! Ahora que ha muerto el sistema, ¡es momento de bailar entre los "
"huesos del mundo!"

#. ~ Description of profession "Punk Rock Dude" for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"All those wicked songs about the apocalypse have come to life.  Brutal!  Now"
" that the system is dead, it's time to party among the bones of the world!"
msgstr ""
"Todas esas canciones geniales acerca del apocalipsis han cobrado vida. "
"¡Brutal! Ahora que ha muerto el sistema, ¡es momento de bailar entre los "
"huesos del mundo!"

#. ~ Description of profession "Clown" for female
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"All you ever wanted was to make people laugh.  Dropping out of school and "
"performing at kids' parties was a dream come true until the world ended.  "
"There are precious few balloon animals in your future now."
msgstr ""
"Todo lo que siempre quisiste es que la gente se riera. Dejar la escuela para"
" actuar en las fiestas de los chicos era tu sueño hecho realidad, hasta que "
"el mundo se terminó. Ahora, en tu futuro habrá pocos de esos preciosos "
"globos con formas de animales."

#. ~ Description of profession "Clown" for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"All you ever wanted was to make people laugh.  Dropping out of school and "
