"adecuadamente entrenado y preparado para sobrevivir la brutal arremetida del"
" apocalipsis. Desafortunadamente, la línea de comando se rompió; tu única "
"misión ahora es permanecer vivo."

#. ~ Description of profession "Hobo" for female
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"At some point in your life, you slipped through the cracks and became "
"homeless.  You don't have much to your name, but you've learned a thing or "
"two about what it takes to survive."
msgstr ""

