#. ~ Description of profession "Hardened Scavenger" for female
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"One of the lucky few who escaped the Cataclysm, you made a life for yourself"
" amidst the ruins of civilization.  Whether through force, guile, or luck, "
"you've obtained the best gear you could find."
msgstr ""
"Fuiste una de los pocas afortunadas en escapar del Cataclismo. Hiciste tu "
"vida entre de las ruinas de la civilización. Ya sea por la fuerza, la "
"astucia o la suerte, has conseguido el mejor equipamiento que podías "
"encontrar."

