#. ~ Description of profession "National Guardsman" for female
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"The government activated your National Guard unit to deal with the growing "
"epidemics.  Despite your best efforts, you were unable to form up before all"
" communications ceased and you found yourself alone amongst the dead."
msgstr ""
"El gobierno activó tu unidad de la Guardia Nacional para ocuparte de las "
"epidemias crecientes. A pesar de tus mejores esfuerzos, no pudieron reunirse"
" antes de que todas las comunicaciones se cortaran y quedaste sola entre los"
" muertos."

#. ~ Description of profession "National Guardsman" for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"The government activated your National Guard unit to deal with the growing "
"epidemics.  Despite your best efforts, you were unable to form up before all"
" communications ceased and you found yourself alone amongst the dead."
msgstr ""
"El gobierno activó tu unidad de la Guardia Nacional para ocuparte de las "
"epidemias crecientes. A pesar de tus mejores esfuerzos, no pudieron reunirse"
" antes de que todas las comunicaciones se cortaran y quedaste solo entre los"
" muertos."

#. ~ Description of profession "Lawyer" for female
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"The jury were in the palm of your hand, but after the defendant tried to eat"
" your brain, you were forced to flee the courtroom in disgrace.  Now nobody "
"seems to care about your objections."
msgstr ""
"Tenías al jurado en la palma de tu mano, pero después de que el acusado "
"intentó comerte el cerebro, te viste forzada a escapar de la corte con "
"deshonra. Ahora, a nadie parecen importarle tus objeciones."

#. ~ Description of profession "Lawyer" for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
