msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of profession "Ballroom Dancer" for female
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Things got a little weird on your way to your weekly dance class.  Zombies "
"don't seem to know how to dance, but you're not about to let them step on "
"your toes."
msgstr ""
"Las cosas se pusieron un poco extrañas cuando ibas a tu clase semanal de "
"danza. Los zombis no parecen saber cómo bailar, pero no los vas a dejar que "
"te pisen los pies."

#. ~ Description of profession "Ballroom Dancer" for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
