#. ~ Description of profession "Bio-Operator" for female
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You are the result of one of the military's last research programs: a "
"prototype cyborg soldier.  The wars they expected you to fight have become "
"obsolete, but war never changes."
msgstr ""
"Sos el resultado de uno de los últimos programas de investigación militar: "
"un prototipo de ciborg soldado. Las guerras que esperaban que vos luches ya "
"quedaron obsoletas, pero la guerra nunca cambia."

