"darle otro uso a tu fiel bate. ¡Home run!"

#. ~ Description of profession "Rat Princess" for female
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You probably needed psychiatric help instead of a prison sentence.  At least"
" your loyal subjects have agreed to hold the line as you make your daring "
"escape."
msgstr ""
"Probablemente, necesitabas ayuda psiquiátrica en lugar de una pena de "
"cárcel. Por lo menos, tus leales sujetos han aceptado a sostener la línea "
"hasta que puedas hacer tu osado escape."

#. ~ Description of profession "Rat Prince" for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You probably needed psychiatric help instead of a prison sentence.  At least"
" your loyal subjects have agreed to hold the line as you make your daring "
"escape."
msgstr ""
"Probablemente, necesitabas ayuda psiquiátrica en lugar de una pena de "
"cárcel. Por lo menos, tus leales sujetos han aceptado a sostener la línea "
"hasta que puedas hacer tu osado escape."

#. ~ Description of profession "Blacksmith" for female
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You ran into trouble coming out of class at your community college's "
"metalsmithing program, but despite the havoc you've managed to keep ahold of"
" some of the equipment you were carrying."
msgstr ""
"Te enfrentaste al problema saliendo de clase de trabajos del metal de la "
"escuela de formación profesional, pero a pesar del caos lograste quedarte "
"con algo del equipamiento que estabas llevando."

#. ~ Description of profession "Blacksmith" for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
