"Digging a root cellar will allow us to preserve any small game that we trap."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of recipe crafting
#. "faction_base_fire_lookout_tower_water_well"
#. ~ Description of recipe crafting "faction_base_lightindustry_00_water_well"
#. ~ Description of recipe crafting "faction_base_lightindustry_10_water_well"
#: data/json/recipes/basecamps/base/fbmc_fire_lookout_tower/recipe_modular_fire_lookout_tower_common.json
