#: data/json/recipes/basecamps/base/fbmc_lightindustry/recipe_modular_lightindustry_10.json
msgid ""
"Digging a well will give us easy access to water and allow us to send out "
"combat patrols or scouts."
msgstr ""
"Cavar un pozo de agua nos permitirá tener acceso fácil al líquido y enviar "
"patrullas de combate o de exploración."

