#. ~ Description of recipe crafting "faction_base_modular_hub_trench_east"
#: data/json/recipes/basecamps/base/recipe_modular_hub/version_1/recipe_modular_field_defenses.json
msgid ""
"Digging a trench along the east edge of the camp would provide some defense "
"and generate building materials.  We'll need to run the trench the length of"
" the camp if we don't have solid buildings all along the east side."
msgstr ""
"Cavar una trinchera por la frontera este del campamento nos brindará algo de"
" defensa y nos dará materiales de construcción. Vamos a necesitar que la "
"trinchera tenga el largo del campamento si no tenemos edificios sólidos por "
"el costado este."

#. ~ Description of recipe crafting "faction_base_modular_hub_trench_north"
#: data/json/recipes/basecamps/base/recipe_modular_hub/version_1/recipe_modular_field_defenses.json
