msgstr "Es un dibujo hecho con aerosol de un ángel con alas hechas de lianas."

#. ~ Snippet in category "general_graffiti_snippets"
#. ~ This graffiti is generally assumed to come from before the Cataclysm
#: data/json/snippets/graffiti.json
msgid ""
"This is a spraypainted mural of a giant mushroom with people praying at its "
