msgstr ""
"Es un mural hecho con aerosol de un hongo gigante con personas rezando en la"
" base."

#. ~ Snippet in category "general_graffiti_snippets"
#. ~ This graffiti is generally assumed to come from before the Cataclysm
#: data/json/snippets/graffiti.json
msgid ""
"This is a spraypainting of an anatomically unlikely woman wearing very "
