#. ~ Snippet in category "log_psych"
#. ~ Long-form session logs and reports, uses EOC popup
#: data/json/snippets/lab.json
msgid ""
"\"It's always a different dream, but always kind of the same.  I stand in a hallway and knock on a door for a joke, but I can't turn and run when the doorknob starts turning.  I stand up mockingly in class while the teacher's back is turned, but can't seem to sit back down as they turn back to look at me.   I dive into the beautiful, clear ocean, but freeze in place just below the surface as something rises from below to meet me.\"\n"
"\n"
"\"Do you feel any guilt about the work you do here, Jason?\"\n"
"\n"
"\"You know I'm not allowed to talk about any specifics.\"\n"
"\n"
"\"Of course, but I haven't asked what you're doing, I asked how you feel about it.\"\n"
"\n"
"\"I don't feel like we're doing anything wrong here.  On the contrary, I think leaving the work undone would be a thing to feel guilty about.  The untapped potential, the understanding we're building… it will change how we think of the world.  That has to be a good thing, right?\"\n"
"\n"
"\"And yet, in your dreams you feel like a kid caught with their hands in the cookie jar.\"\n"
"\n"
"\"I'd rather we drop this line of discussion, Doctor.\"\n"
"\n"
"\"Naturally, Jason.  Or would \"Chief Investigator\" make you feel more in control?\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "log_sec"
#. ~ Long-form interrogation transcripts, surveillance logs
#: data/json/snippets/lab.json
msgid ""
"\"Please state your name and ID for the record.\"\n"
"\n"
"\"Dr. Maria Catarina Gonzales, S-7531.\"\n"
"\n"
"\"Thank you, Doctor.  You know why we're here, don't you?  Please tell us about your previous project supervisor.\"\n"
"\n"
"\"Ruslan was…\"\n"
"\n"
"\"Ruslan?\"\n"
"\n"
"\"I'm sorry, Dr. Lavochkin was extremely enthusiastic about our research when I arrived in the facility.  That enthusiasm had a way of dragging people with him, you know?  We wanted to see our subjects as he did, full of wonder and untapped potential.\"\n"
"\n"
"\"Did he ever tell you what it was that you were working on?\"\n"
"\n"
"\"Not really, no.  We were to \"characterize the effects of need-to-knowium on a wide range of living subjects\" was his little joke, back when he made jokes.\"\n"
"\n"
"\"When did that change?\"\n"
"\n"
"\"He became a lot more distant when we began testing PE050 and PE150, the intravenous formulation.  He sent us back to the pods way before he left the lab, and he started muttering about \"preparing the world\" for something under his breath.  That coincided with him requisitioning more… exotic test subjects.\"\n"
"\n"
"\"How did he rationalize those?\"\n"
"\n"
"\"He could be very convincing, and we were happy to see that spark again.  You want to hear about the centipedes, right?  L.coeculus are parthenogenetic and completely lack social behavior, making them a reasonable long-term subjects for PE050's \"societal predisposition\" effects, as we liked to call it.\"\n"
"\n"
"\"Do you still consider that decision \"reasonable\"?\"\n"
"\n"
"\"Not in the light of what happened, I suppose.  But your people kicking in the observation room's door and starting shooting wasn't the most reasonable course of action either, if we're being honest.\"\n"
"\n"
"\"We're not here to review the actions of Security on that day.  Did he ever mention anywhere he could be hiding?\"\n"
"\n"
"\"We weren't close, so no he didn't share the location of his secret treehouse.  With those things in tow he shouldn't be too hard to find though -- just follow the song of the centipedes.\"\n"
"\n"
"\"Thank you for the advice, Doctor.  I am to inform you that you are restricted to your residential pod until the review of your involvement in the incident is concluded.  You are expected to finish any remaining reports in the meantime, but your workstation will be isolated from the facility network otherwise.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Por favor, enuncie su nombre e identificación para el registro.\"\n"
"\n"
"\"Dra. María Catarina Gonzales, S-7531.\"\n"
"\n"
"\"Gracias, Doctora. ¿Ya sabe por qué estamos acá, no? Por favor, cuéntenos sober su anterior supervisor de proyecto.\"\n"
"\n"
"\"Ruslan estaba…\"\n"
"\n"
"\"¿Ruslan?\"\n"
"\n"
"\"Perdón, el Dr. Lavochkin estaba extremadamente entusiasmado con nuestra investigación cuando yo llegué a las instalaciones. Ese entusiasmo podía arrastrar a las personas, ¿se entiende? Queríamos ver a nuestros sujetos como los veía él, llenos de maravillas y potencial sin utilizar.\"\n"
"\n"
"\"¿Alguna vez les dijo qué era en lo que estaban trabajando?\"\n"
"\n"
"\"No, la verdad que no. Teníamos que \"caracterizar los efectos del necesario-saberium en un amplio rango de sujetos vivos\", era su chiste, antes, cuando todavía hacía chistes.\"\n"
"\n"
"\"¿Y cuándo cambió eso?\"\n"
"\n"
"\"Se volvió más distante cuando empezamos a probar PE050 y PE150, la fórmula intravenosa. Nos mandó de vuelta a los receptáculos mucho antes de que él se fuera del laboratorio, y empezó a murmurar en voz baja acerca de \"preparar al mundo\" para algo. Eso coincidió con sus pedidos de sujetos de prueba más… exóticos.\"\n"
"\n"
"\"¿Cómo racionalizaba eso?\"\n"
"\n"
"\"Podía ser muy convincente y estábamos felices de ver su chispa otra vez. ¿Quieren saber acerca de los ciempiés, ¿no?L.coeculus son partenogénicos y carecen completamente de comportamiento social, lo que los hace sujetos más razonables a largo plazo para los efectos de \"predisposición social\" de PE050, como les decíamos.\"\n"
"\n"
"\"¿Todavía considera que esa decisión fue \"razonable\"?\"\n"
"\n"
"\"A la luz de lo que pasó, no, supongo. Pero que ustedes derribaran la puerta de la habitación de observación y empezaran a disparar tampoco fue el curso de acción más razonable, si somos honestos.\"\n"
"\n"
"\"No estamos acá para revisar las acciones de Seguridad ese día. ¿Alguna vez mencionó algún lugar en que se pudiera esconder?\"\n"
"\n"
"\"No éramos tan cercanos, así que no nos dijo la ubicación de su casa secreta en el árbol. Pero si se llevó esas cosas, no debería ser tan difícil de encontrar -- solamente tienen que seguir la canción de los ciempiés.\"\n"
"\n"
"\"Gracias por su consejo, doctora. Debo informarle que queda restringida a su receptáculo habitacional hasta que la revisión de su involucramiento en el incidente esté concluida. Durante ese tiempo, esperamos que termine cualquier informe que falte pero su estación de trabajo quedará aislada de las instalaciones.\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "log_sec"
#. ~ Long-form interrogation transcripts, surveillance logs
#: data/json/snippets/lab.json
msgid ""
"\"Please state your name for the record.\"\n"
"\n"
"\"Fuck off.\"\n"
"\n"
"\"You are in possession of a fake driver's license issued to one Jonathan Smith, which is the alias you applied for employment with in our facility.  We will find out your real name in time, but I'll refer to you as Mr. Smith for this interview.  Is that acceptable, Mr. Smith?\"\n"
"\n"
"\"Fuck off.  I want to talk to my lawyer.\"\n"
"\n"
"\"You don't have a lawyer.\"\n"
"\n"
"\"I know my rights, shithead.  You won't get a word out of me before I talk to my lawyer.\"\n"
"\n"
"\"You seem to be confused about your situation, Mr. Smith.  As far as the world is concerned you stopped existing the moment you entered this facility, and as far as we are concerned you stopped having rights as soon as you tried to access areas above your provisional clearance.  Let me present your options going forward:  You continue withholding information from us and you will suffer a meticulously-documented accident leaving no doubt to your demise even though no body will ever be found.  Or you cooperate fully and without hesitation, in which case you will get to see the sky again and act like nothing has happened.  Am I understood?\"\n"
"\n"
"\"…yes.\"\n"
"\n"
"\"Please state your name for the record.\"\n"
"\n"
"\"M-my name is Thomas Wright.  I'm a, uh, a freelance journalist.\"\n"
"\n"
"\"What were you trying to accomplish in this facility, Mr. Wright?\"\n"
"\n"
"\"There was th-this guy offering good money for some pictures from the inside of this place.\"\n"
"\n"
"\"I don't suppose this man told you his name?\"\n"
"\n"
"\"No, no… He just handed me the application forms and the license, paid quarter up front, and said to bring the pictures to the same spot in a week's time.\"\n"
"\n"
"\"What did he say to expect here?\"\n"
"\n"
"\"This place is… look, you can't expect people not to talk about it, right?  You can't just put up a warehouse of a shipping company nobody's heard of practically overnight and act like it was always here.  He said you guys were a, uh, top secret prison for political prisoners.\"\n"
"\n"
"\"That explains your attempts to clumsily pick the first closed door you came across.  How did your employer contact you?\"\n"
"\n"
"\"A friend of a friend gave him my number, at least according to him.  If you haven't noticed in here times are tough, so I couldn't really afford to be picky about work even before he started throwing cash around.\"\n"
"\n"
"\"Very well.  While we verify that account my colleagues here will take you through a tour of our facility:  You will take photographs with your \"hidden\" camera when and where they instruct you to.  You will submit these pictures for review and remain in our custody until we can be certain of your compliance.  You will be released and at the appointed time you will hand over the pictures to your employer.  You will not mention this conversation to them, or to anybody outside of this room.  You will enjoy your well-earned payment, far away from this facility.  Am I understood?\"\n"
"\n"
"\"Yes, sir, I can do that.\"\n"
"\n"
"\"Excellent, Mr. Wright.  I look forward to never seeing you again.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Por favor, enuncie su nombre e identificación para el registro.\"\n"
"\n"
"\"No me hinchés las bolas.\"\n"
"\n"
"\"Está en posesión de una licencia de conducir falsa de Jonathan Smith, que es el alias que eligió para el empleo en nuestras instalaciones. Vamos a averiguar su verdadero nombre en algún momento pero le diré Sr. Smith durante esta entrevista. ¿Le parece aceptable, Sr. Smith?\"\n"
"\n"
"\"No me hinchés las bolas. Quiero hablar con mi abogado.\"\n"
"\n"
"\"No tiene abogado.\"\n"
"\n"
"\"Conozco mis derechos, forro. No vas a escuchar una palabra mía hasta que no haya hablado con mi abogado.\"\n"
"\n"
"\"Parece confundido con su situación, Sr. Smith. Por lo que al mundo respecta, usted dejó de existir en el momento en que entro en estas instalaciones, y por lo que a nosotros respecta, usted dejó de tener derechos tan pronto como intentó ingresar a áreas para las cuales no estaba habilitado. Déjeme presentarle las opciones que tiene: Si nos continúa ocultando información sufrirá un accidente meticulosamente documentado no dejando duda alguna de su muerte aunque jamás se encuentre el cadáver. O si coopera totalmente y sin duda alguna, en ese caso verá el cielo nuevamente y actuará como si nada hubiera sucedido. ¿Se entiende?\"\n"
"\n"
"\"…sí.\"\n"
"\n"
"\"Por favor, enuncie su nombre e identificación para el registro.\"\n"
"\n"
"\"M-mi nombre es Thomas Wright. Soy, eh, periodista freelance.\"\n"
"\n"
"\"¿Qué estaba intentando hacer en estas instalaciones, Sr. Wright?\"\n"
"\n"
"\"Un-un tipo ofrecía plata por algunas fotos de adentro de este lugar.\"\n"
"\n"
"\"¿Supongo que este hombre no le dijo su nombre?\"\n"
"\n"
"\"No, no… Solamente me dio los formularios y la licencia, me pagó una cuarta parte por adelantado y dijo que le llevara las fotos al mismo lugar en una semana.\"\n"
"\n"
"\"¿Qué le dijo que podía esperar ver acá?\"\n"
"\n"
"\"Este lugar está… mirá, no podés esperar que la gente no hable de esto, ¿viste? No podés poner un depósito de una compañía de transporte que nadie conoce de la noche a la mañana y actuar como si siempre hubiera estado acá. Él me dijo que ustedes eran, eh, una cárcel secreta para presos políticos.\"\n"
"\n"
"\"Eso explica sus torpes intentos de abrir la primera puerta cerrada que encontró. ¿Cómo se contacto su empleador con usted?\"\n"
"\n"
"\"Un amigo de un amigo le dio mi número, por lo menos eso me dijo. Si no te diste cuenta, está complicada la cosa así que no podía darme el lujo de andar eligiendo qué trabajo agarrar incluso antes de que todo se empezara a desmoronar.\"\n"
"\n"
"\"Muy bien. Mientras verificamos esa cuenta mis colegas lo llevarán por nuestras instalaciones: Tomará fotografías con su cámara \"oculta\" cuando y donde ellos le indiquen. Entregará las fotos para revisarlas y quedará bajo nuestra custodia hasta que podamos asegurarnos de su cooperación. Será liberado y en el momento acordado le entregará las fotos a su empleador. No le mencionará esta conversación a él ni a ninguna persona fuera de esta habitación. Disfrutará de su pago bien ganado, muy lejos de estas instalaciones. ¿Entiende?\"\n"
"\n"
"\"Sí, señor, puedo hacer eso.\"\n"
"\n"
"\"Excelente, Sr. Wright. Espero con ansias no volver a verlo nunca más.\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "log_psych"
#. ~ Long-form session logs and reports, uses EOC popup
#: data/json/snippets/lab.json
msgid ""
"\"We are seen.  It's not long until we will be touched.\"\n"
"\n"
"\"Touched by what, exactly?\"\n"
"\n"
"\"Touched.  Chewed.  Tasted.  Digested.  Processed.  Excreted.\"\n"
"\n"
"\"Ramin, focus, please.  What is doing all that?  Or rather, what do you feel will be doing those things?\"\n"
"\n"
"\"It's big.  Bigger than the Sun.  Smaller than an atom.\"\n"
"\n"
"\"And what does this large small thing want, beyond touching us?\"\n"
"\n"
"\"It just is.  It needs no reason.  It needs only to exist.  It needs only to expand.\"\n"
"\n"
"\"Do you want to talk about Immersion 132R?\"\n"
"\n"
"\"There's nothing to talk about.  I wasn't there.  It didn't touch me.  I didn't look.  It didn't look back.  It didn't smile with a million rotten worlds in its mouth.\"\n"
"\n"
"\"Have you been taking your medication?\"\n"
"\n"
"\"Like they would help.  I tried, Doc, I really did.  But the truth is, I like having these thoughts.  They give me a certainty, and I am thankful for knowing how it will all end.  That we all belong to something, and nothing can take us from it now.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Nos han visto. No falta mucho para que nos toquen\".\n"
"\n"
"\"¿Tocados por qué, exactamente?\"\n"
"\n"
"\"Tocados. Masticado. Probado. Digerido. Procesado. Excretado\".\n"
"\n"
"\"Ramin, concéntrate, por favor. ¿Qué está haciendo todo eso? O más bien, ¿qué sientes que va a hacer esas cosas?\"\n"
"\n"
"\"Es grande. Más grande que el Sol. Más pequeño que un átomo\".\n"
"\n"
"\"¿Y qué quiere esta pequeña gran cosa, más allá de tocarnos?\"\n"
"\n"
"\"Simplemente es. No necesita ninguna razón. Sólo necesita existir. Sólo necesita expandirse\".\n"
"\n"
"\"¿Quieres hablar de la Inmersión 132R?\"\n"
"\n"
"\"No hay nada que hablar. Yo no estaba allí. No me tocó. No miré. No miró hacia atrás. No sonrió con un millón de mundos podridos en la boca\".\n"
"\n"
"\"¿Has estado tomando tu medicación?\"\n"
"\n"
"\"Como si fueran a ayudar. Lo he intentado, Doctor, de verdad. Pero la verdad es que me gusta tener estos pensamientos. Me dan certidumbre, y agradezco saber cómo terminará todo. Que todos pertenecemos a algo, y que nada puede apartarnos de ello ahora\"."

