#. ~ Snippet in category "years_old_news"
#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
msgid ""
"'MIRACLE DRUG' FACES UPHILL BATTLE.  It's called naloxone, and doctors are "
"betting this unassuming bottle of nasal spray could turn the tide in the war"
" against the opioid epidemic.  Tens of thousands of people are estimated to "
"die every year due to accidental overdose.  Naloxone promises to change all "
"of that.  Just one puff, and in seconds, opioids like fentanyl, oxycodone, "
"and heroin are literally jostled out of the opioid receptors and blocked "
"from re-entry.  But while it could save lives, some question whether making "
"it available over the counter might encourage drug abuse.  \"They want to "
"sell this stuff to children.  That's basically telling them, hey, you can do"
" all the drugs you want, and there aren't going to be any consequences.  "
"Well maybe there should be consequences.\"  This from Merrimack mayoral "
"candidate Todd Hagel, whose campaign has been built on a zero tolerance "
"attitude toward drugs and those who use them…"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "newest_news"
#. ~ Around April 15/16
#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
msgid ""
"A BRIDGE TOO FAR.  In a statement Monday, the Department of Defense detailed"
" its plans to deploy strategic minefields on key bridge crossings, in order "
"to quarantine high-hostility regions of rioting.  \"Military personnel will "
"be on-site to assist any refugees fleeing the blackout zones.  We urge "
"citizens to comply with all military directives and avoid quarantined areas "
"whenever possible until order can be restored.\""
msgstr ""
"UN PUENTE MUY LEJANO. En una declaración del lunes, el Departamento de "
"Defensa detalló sus planes para establecer campos minados estratégicos en "
"puentes claves, en orden de mantener en cuarentena las regiones con "
"disturbios de alta hostilidad. \"El personal militar estará asistiendo en el"
" lugar a cualquier refugiado que esté huyendo de las zonas bloqueadas. "
"Instamos a los ciudadanos a obedecer todas las directivas militares y evitar"
" las áreas en cuarentena cuando sea posible hasta que pueda restaurarse el "
"orden.\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "many_years_old_news"
#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
msgid ""
"A role-playing game and board game company was raided by secret service and "
"documents seized due to alleged cybersecurity concerns.  An outcry among the"
" fans of \"Cryptid Conspiracies: The Role-Playing Game,\" touted as the most"
" realistic and researched look at modern conspiracy theory, has been met "
"with no response at this time."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "many_years_old_news"
#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
msgid ""
"ALIENS AMONG US!  Janine Galfrizowich, of Martha's Vineyard, wrote in to our"
" Paranormal Investigation Staff with this cryptic gem.  \"They're always "
"watching, always watching from the shadows.  Stealing my avocados and "
"watching!  They took my neighbor and made him into one of them!\"  Our "
"journalists are trying to track Mrs Galfrizowich down, but it is clear "
"enough that this ties into the well known Avocado Conspiracy (see issue 24, "
"volume 7)."
msgstr ""
"¡HAY EXTRATERRESTRES ENTRE NOSOTROS! Janine Galfrizowich, del Viñedo de "
"Martha, nos escribió al Equipo de Investigación Paranormal esta joya "
"enigmática. \"Siempre nos están observando, siempre observando desde las "
"sombras. ¡Robándose mis paltas y observando! ¡Se llevaron a mi vecino y lo "
"convirtieron en uno de ellos!\" Nuestros periodistas están intentando "
"rastrear a la señora Galfrizowich pero es bastante claro que esto está "
"relacionado con la bien conocida Conspiración de la Palta (ver publicación "
"24, volumen 7)."

#. ~ Snippet in category "months_old_news"
#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
msgid ""
"ASIAN AGENTS RESPONSIBLE FOR \"MONSTER\" ATTACKS.  Sources have confirmed "
"with photographic evidence that the rise in 'monster' sightings and attacks "
"recently is the work of hostile Eastern agents believed to originate in "
"either China or North Korea.  The government has refused to respond to "
"evidence provided by our investigative journalist team proving that "
"hallucinogenic gases and puppets were used to spawn the widely circulated "
"social media phenomenon."
msgstr ""
"AGENTES ASIÁTICOS RESPONSABLES POR LOS ATAQUES DE \"MONSTRUOS\". Fuentes han"
" confirmado con evidencia fotográfica el ascenso de avistamientos de "
"'monstruos' y ataques recientes, son debido al trabajo de agentes orientales"
" hostiles que se creen se iniciaron en China o en Corea del Norte. El "
"gobierno se negó a responder a la evidencia brindada por nuestro equipo de "
"periodistas de investigación que prueba que los gases alucinógenos y "
"marionetas fueron usados para generar el fenómeno que circula tanto por las "
"redes sociales."

#. ~ Snippet in category "one_year_old_news"
#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
msgid ""
"BIGGER BEES.  State biologists are unable to explain the emergence of bees "
"that are two and three times normal size.  Authorities say that bees larger "
"than golf balls are being reported across the state.  As of this time, there"
" have been no reports of increased aggression or other behavioral changes in"
" the oversized insects.  \"I'm glad to see the resurgence in the bee "
"population,\" said Dr. Melissus \"Mel\" Versed, an entomologist at Tufts "
"University.  He added, \"while Anthophila this large are unprecedented in "
"New England, there is nothing particularly harmful about the phenomena.  "
"Think of the honey yields!\""
msgstr ""
"ABEJAS MÁS GRANDES. Biólogos estatales no pudieron explicar la emergencia de"
" abejas que son dos o tres veces más grandes del tamaño normal. Las "
"autoridades dicen que se han reportado abejas más grandes que pelotas de "
"golf por todo el país. Al día de hoy, no han habido informes de una "
"agresividad incrementada u otros cambios de conducta en los insectos "
"sobredimensionados. \"Me alegra ver la resurgimiento de la población de "
"abejas,\" dijo el Dr. Melissus \"Mel\" Versed, un entomologista de la "
"Universidad Tufts. Agregó, \"aunque los antófilos de este tamaño no tienen "
"precedentes en New England, el fenómeno no tiene nada particularmente "
"peligroso. ¡Piensen en las cosechas de miel!\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "months_old_news"
#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
msgid ""
"BUNKERS OF THE RICH AND FAMOUS.  Forget the backwater \"Last Man on Earth\" "
"shelter you helped your buddy pour the foundations for.  We got a look "
"inside the private bunker of James Hawthorne himself!  Ever wonder what it "
"would feel like to weather a disaster in style?  Wonder no more."
msgstr ""
"BÚNKERS PARA LOS RICOS Y FAMOSOS. Olvidate de aquel alejado refugio \"Last "
"Man on Earth\" que ayudaste a construir. ¡Pudimos ver el interior del búnker"
" privado de James Hawthorne! ¿Alguna vez te preguntaste cómo sería soportar "
"un desastre con estilo? Acá lo podés ver."

#. ~ Snippet in category "many_years_old_news"
#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
msgid ""
"CELEBRATED PHYSICIST GOES MISSING.  Dr. Amy Takatoshi, a celebrated quantum "
"physicist at MIT dubbed by some as \"the next Hawking\" has gone missing "
"shortly before a press conference that was expected to be the announcement "
"of her newest research results, rumored to be in the field of teleportation."
msgstr ""
"DESAPARECE CONOCIDA FÍSICA. La Dra. Amy Takatoshi, una conocida física "
"cuántica de MIT, llamada por algunos \"la próxima Hawking\", ha desaparecido"
" poco antes de una conferencia de prensa que se esperaba sea el anuncio de "
"los resultados de su nuevo experimento, del que se decía estar en el campo "
"de la teletransportación."

#. ~ Snippet in category "weeks_old_news"
#. ~ Around the start of April
#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
msgid ""
"CHINESE SOLDIERS SPOTTED AMIDST RIOTERS.  Concerns that Chinese influence is"
" behind the riots sweeping North America were corroborated today by reports "
"of the appearance of PRC soldiers amongst the rioters in San Diego and San "
"Francisco, apparently unaffected by the otherwise uncontrolled frenzy of "
"violence.  The government continues to deny the truth."
msgstr ""
"SOLDADOS CHINOS DIVISADOS EN LOS DISTURBIOS. Las preocupaciones de que la "
"influencia china está detrás de los disturbios que inundan Norte América "
"fueron corroborados hoy por los informes de la aparición de soldados de "
"China entre los alborotadores en San Diego y San Francisco, aparentemente "
"sin viéndose afectados por el, de otra manera, descontrolado frenesí de "
"violencia. El gobierna continúa negando la verdad."

#. ~ Snippet in category "newest_news"
#. ~ Around April 15/16
#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
msgid ""
"CHINESE VICTORY AT HAND.  Emperor Tsang Gu Yen of Grand China arrived in "
"full state in Burlington, Vermont today to issue his proclamation that "
"America, like all countries of Earth, now belongs to the New Grand Chinese "
"Empire.  Freedom has fallen.  Rebel against his forces while you still can!"
msgstr ""
"VICTORIA CHINA A MANO. El emperador Tsang Gu Yen de la Gran China llegó hoy "
"oficialmente a Burlington, Vermont para proclamar que Estados Unidos, como "
"todos los países de la Tierra, ahora el pertenecen al Nuevo Gran Imperio "
"Chino. La libertad ha caído. ¡Rebélense contra estas fuerzas mientras "
"puedan!"

#. ~ Snippet in category "weeks_old_news"
#. ~ Around the start of April
#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
msgid ""
"COPS IN CRISIS.  Law enforcement officials report increasing numbers of "
"officers are calling in sick, have resigned, or are just not showing up to "
"duty.  A lack of sufficient personnel exacerbates the dangers police on-duty"
" face.  In some cases officers are refusing to respond to dispatches in "
"areas with high levels of violence.  A spokesperson for the Worcester County"
" Sheriff's Office confirmed \"It is no longer feasible for us to jeopardize "
"officer lives in some circumstances.  Instead we can continue to rely upon "
"our state-of-the-art AI-powered robotic units.\""
msgstr ""
"POLICÍAS EN CRISIS. Los oficiales de las fuerzas de la ley informan un "
"incremento en la cantidad de agentes reportándose enfermos, que han sido "
"reasignados o que simplemente no se presentan a trabajar. La falta de "
"personal suficiente exacerba los peligros que enfrentan los policías en "
"servicio. En algunos casos, los agentes se niegan a responder a despliegues "
"en áreas con altos niveles de violencia. Un vocero de la Oficina del Sheriff"
" del Condado de Worcester confirmó que \"Ya no es viable que pongamos en "
"riesgo la vida de los agentes en ciertas circunstancias. En su lugar, "
"podemos continuar dependiendo en nuestras unidades robóticas con IA de "
"última generación.\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "many_years_old_news"
#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
msgid ""
"DISASTER IN THE SARITANIA MINES  A copper mine west of Saritania, a small "
"town in Vermont, collapsed Wednesday, killing an estimated thirty miners in "
"the disaster.  Local officials could not be reached for comment, despite the"
" mine being Saritania's primary industry.  An anonymous but credible source "
"did contact our offices, claiming that the Saritania Mine was in fact an "
"underground military facility, and that the disaster was a cover-up for a "
"failed experiment.  These allegations were not addressed by officials."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "weeks_old_news"
#. ~ Around the start of April
#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
msgid ""
"DISTURBING VIDEO SHOWS PSYCHOTIC RIOTERS.  We've all known something was "
"really wrong for a while.  A new, extremely disturbing video has been making"
" the social media rounds in a shocking way.  It depicts a young woman amidst"
" the riots violently and fatally attacking a girl that appears to be her own"
" small daughter.  To many, this is the last straw that confirms a dreadful "
"suspicion: these riots are not the result of some social unrest, but "
"represent a complete breakdown of rationality."
msgstr ""
"UN PERTURBADOR VIDEO MUESTRA ALBOROTADORES PSICÓTICOS. Todos sabemos de hace"
" tiempo que algo anduvo mal. Un perturbador nuevo video ha estado dando "
"vueltas por las redes sociales de manera impactante. Se ve a una joven mujer"
" entre los disturbios atacando violentamente y matando a una chica que "
"parece ser su propia hija. Para muchos, esa fue la última gota que confirma "
"una sospecha terrible: estos disturbios no son el resultado de algún "
"malestar social, si no que representan un colapso total de la racionalidad."

#. ~ Snippet in category "years_old_news"
#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
msgid ""
"DRIVING ON A WING AND A PRAYER: A New England man has proven it is possible "
"to create a new car from scrap parts using almost nothing but duct tape.  "
"When asked why he had done it, his answer was \"Well, I didn't have a "
"welder.\""
msgstr ""
"MANEJANDO CON ALAMBRE Y AYUDA DIVINA: Un hombre de New England ha probado "
"que es posible crear un auto desde cero usando casi solamente cinta "
"adhesiva. Cuando se le preguntó por qué lo había hecho, su respuesta fue "
"\"Bueno, no tenía soldadora.\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "one_year_old_news"
#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"DRUG USE ON THE RISE: Recent statistic suggest drug use in New England has "
"climbed more than 20% in the last two years.  \"People are scared for their "
"jobs, their country, even their life… of course some will turn to drugs,\" "
"said an expert."
msgstr ""
"ELEVADO CONSUMO DE DROGAS: Estadísticas recientes sugieren que el uso de "
"drogas en New England ha crecido más del 20% en los últimos dos años. \"La "
"gente está asustada de sus trabajos, su país, incluso su vida… claro que "
"algunos van a recurrir a las drogas,\" dijo un experto."

#. ~ Snippet in category "months_old_news"
#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
msgid ""
"ECONOMIC RIOTING SPREADS TO UNITED STATES.  Global economic riots, started "
"in Africa and South America, have spread to the continental United States.  "
"More than thirty riots were reported over the weekend, primarily in poorer "
"regions of the Midwest and South.  \"I don't think this is related to what "
"happened in Carlhaven or Banksley,\" a spokesperson from the National Guard "
"said in response to media inquiry.  \"Those were isolated incidents, while "
"this is very clearly a coordinated social media effort.\"  Police and the "
"National Guard are containing riots as they crop up.  President Oswald, in a"
" speech on Sunday evening, reminded Americans of our solidarity.  \"Enemies "
"perch at our every border, watching for signs of weakness.  Now is not the "
"time to shoot ourselves in the feet.\""
msgstr ""
"DISTURBIOS ECONÓMICOS SE ESPARCEN POR ESTADOS UNIDOS. Los disturbios "
"económicos globales, que empezaron en África y América del Sur, se han "
"esparcido por Estados Unidos. Más de treinta disturbios fueron reportados "
"durante el fin de semana, principalmente en las zonas más pobres del medio "
"oeste y del sur. \"No creo que esto esté relacionado con lo que pasó en "
"Carlhaven o Banksley,\" dijo un vocero de la Guardia Nacional en respuesta a"
" una pregunta de los periodistas. \"Esos fueron incidentes aislados, "
"mientras este fue claramente un esfuerzo coordinado desde las redes "
"sociales.\" La policía y la Guardia Nacional están conteniendo los "
"disturbios a medida que aparecen. El presidente Oswald, en el discurso del "
"domingo a la noche, le recordó a los estadounidenses sobre nuestra "
"solidaridad. \"Los enemigos se posan en cada una de nuestras fronteras, "
"esperando ver signos de debilidad. Ahora no es el momento de pegarnos tiros "
"en los pies.\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "newest_news"
#. ~ Around April 15/16
#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
msgid ""
"EDITOR SAYS \"DESTROY THE DEAD\".  Recognizable dead left lying in the "
"street may be dangerous!  If you kill a hostile, smash or butcher with a "
"knife until unrecognizable!  These aren't rioters, they're *undead*.  The "
"government has been lying to us all along.  This will be our last issue."
msgstr ""
"EDITOR DICE \"DESTRUYAN A LOS MUERTOS\". ¡Los muertos reconocibles que "
"quedan tirados en la calle pueden ser peligrosos! ¡Si matás a un hostil, "
"destrozalo o carnealo con un cuchillo hasta dejarlo desfigurado! Estos no "
"son alborotadores, son *muertos vivos*. El gobierno nos ha estado mintiendo "
"a todos. Esta será nuestra última edición."

#. ~ Snippet in category "months_old_news"
#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
msgid ""
"EDITORIAL: AI IS GETTING AHEAD OF US.  I saw the new article on unmanned "
"robots with the rest of you, and I have to say I'm not as excited as I am "
"worried.  Even the scientists describing these robots say they don't fully "
"understand how this deep learning stuff works, and now we're putting it in "
"cars?  There are some semi-autonomous AI robots even working in prisons now "
"to quell riots.  It's easy to see how this could get out of hand.  We've all"
" seen the movies."
msgstr ""
"EDITORIAL: LA INTELIGENCIA ARTIFICIAL YA ESTÁ MÁS AVANZADA QUE NOSOTROS. Vi "
"el nuevo artículo sobre robots sin tripulación como lo vimos todos, y tengo "
"que decir que no me entusiasma tanto si no más bien, me preocupa. Incluso "
"los científicos describiendo estos robots dicen que no comprenden "
"completamente cómo funciona esto del aprendizaje profundo, ¿y ahora se lo "
"estamos agregando a los autos? Hay algunos robots con IA semiautónoma, "
"incluso trabajando en cárceles para reprimir disturbios. Es fácil ver cómo "
"esto se nos puede ir de las manos. Ya lo vimos en las películas."

#. ~ Snippet in category "many_years_old_news"
#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
msgid ""
"EDITORIAL: ALIENS ARE BACK IN A BIG WAY  We've all seen that autopsy video "
"that's making the rounds.  I'm not going to say if I believe it's real or "
"not (I will say \"I want to believe\" though!) but regardless of the truth, "
"one thing is clear: the public mind is completely addicted to aliens in the "
"biggest way I've seen since ET was popular.  What's brought little green men"
" back into the public eye?  It's anyone's guess, but personally I think it's"
" a concerning sign that we're culturally digging in to a second Cold War."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "one_year_old_news"
#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
msgid ""
"EDITORIAL: DRUG USE SPIKE DUE TO ECONOMY.  It's no secret that President "
"Oswald's promises of a booming new tech economy have fallen flat on their "
"face.  Whether you're a Democrat or a Republican, we should all be ready to "
"march on Washington and let Oswald know how we feel about broken promises "
"and unemployment.  Instead, people are drowning their sorrows in drugs, as "
"usual, and nothing will change."
msgstr ""
"EDITORIAL: AUMENTO DEL CONSUMO DE DROGAS DEBIDO A LA ECONOMÍA. No es un "
"secreto que las promesas del presidente Oswald sobre una nueva economía "
"tecnológica han caído en el olvido. Ya seas demócrata o republicano, todos "
"deberíamos estar preparados para marchar a Washington y hacerle saber a "
"Osweald cómo nos hace sentir sus promesas incumplidas y el desempleo. Pero "
"en lugar de eso, la gente se está ahogando sus penas en las drogas, como "
"siempre, y nada cambiará."

#. ~ Snippet in category "months_old_news"
#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
msgid ""
"EDITORIAL: FORGET DRUGS OR FRIENDFACE, THESE ARE THE GAMER RIOTS.  I can't "
"believe how many idiots are wasting their time blaming social media or drugs"
" on the riots we're facing when the answer is obvious: this is the result of"
" letting our kids fall to the moral iniquity of video games.  Just last week"
" I saw my kid playing one of those stupid bleep-bloop games, all letters and"
" numbers and symbols.  When I asked him what he was doing it was absolutely "
"appalling.  Violence.  Cannibalism.  Humans as cattle.  Mermaid abuse.  "
"Yesterday, he was arrested for participating in the riots.  Coincidence?  "
"Pretty obviously not.  Our government is in the pocket of these video game "
"developers, and we're all paying the price."
msgstr ""
"EDITORIAL: OLVÍDENSE DE LAS DROGAS Y DE FRIENDFACE, ESTOS SON DISTURBIOS "
"GAMER. No puedo creer cuántos idiotas están gastando el tiempo en culpar a "
"las redes sociales o a las drogas de los disturbios que están sucediendo, "
"cuando la respuesta es obvia: este es el resultado de dejar que nuestros "
"hijos caigan en la inmoralidad de los videojuegos. La semana pasada vi a mi "
"hijo jugando con uno de esos jueguitos, todo letras y números y símbolos. "
"Cuando le pregunté qué estaba haciendo fue absolutamente espantoso. "
"Violencia. Canibalismo. Humanos como ganado. Abuso de sirenas. Ayer, fue "
"arrestado por participar de los disturbios. ¿Coincidencia? Bastante obvio "
"que no. Nuestro gobierno está rendido a estos desarrolladores de "
"videojuegos, y todos nosotros estamos pagando el precio."

#. ~ Snippet in category "one_year_old_news"
#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
msgid ""
"EDITORIAL: HOME CANNING NEEDS TO MAKE A COMEBACK.  With food security in "
"question after severe drought this year, I think it's clear we all need to "
"get out Grandma's old books, and learn how to can again.  Grocery stores "
"could be a bit empty this winter, and now is the time to make pickles and "
"preserves while the pickling's good.  In this issue, three of our editors "
"share their uplifting stories of rediscovering the joys of home canning."
msgstr ""
"EDITORIAL: LAS CONSERVAS CASERAS NECESITAN VOLVER. Con la seguridad "
"alimentaria en duda luego de la sequía severa de este año, creo que está "
"claro que todos necesitamos buscar los viejos libros de la abuela y aprender"
" cómo enlatar comida otra vez. Los almacenes pueden estar un poco vacíos "
"este invierno y ahora es el momento de hacer escabeches y conservas mientras"
" se pueda. A este respecto, tres de nuestros editores compartieron sus "
"historias inspiradores sobre el redescubrimiento del disfrute de hacer "
"conservas en casa."

#. ~ Snippet in category "many_years_old_news"
#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
msgid ""
"EDITORIAL: MORE HOMES NEED GUNS.  While visiting a friend recently, our "
"conversation turned to gun control, and I was shocked to learn that my close"
" friend didn't own a firearm.  In this day and age, not having a deadly "
"weapon in your home shows an appalling lack of personal safety, and I told "
"him so.  Weapons that can kill a man, or several men, in an instant - "
"sometimes even accidentally - are our only hope against other people armed "
"similarly.  I see a utopia of honest citizens keeping each other honest by "
"being armed to the teeth."
msgstr ""
"EDITORIAL: MÁS ARMAS PARA MÁS HOGARES. Mientras visitaba a un amigo hace "
"unos días, nuestra conversación derivó en el control de armas, y me "
"sorprendió saber que mi amigo cercano no poseía un arma de fuego. En esta "
"época, no tener un arma mortal en tu casa demuestra una terrible falta de "
"seguridad personal, y se lo dije. Las armas pueden matar a un hombre o a "
"varios hombres, en un instante - a veces incluso por accidente - son nuestra"
" única esperanza contra la otra gente armada de manera similar. Veo una "
"utopía de ciudadanos honestos manteniendo la honestidad entre ellos estando "
"armados hasta los dientes."

#. ~ Snippet in category "weeks_old_news"
#. ~ Around the start of April
#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
msgid ""
"EDITORIAL: MY MOM, THE RIOTER.  My mother was one of the first of the "
"rioters in Jacksonville.  I've been wondering for a long time how a retired "
"sixty-seven year old woman with a passion for day lilies and knitting wound "
"up allegedly beating a police officer to death and getting thrown in a "
"containment tank.  Last week, against all odds and at great personal risk, I"
" managed to get her released into my care.  I thought I could calm her down."
"  When they gave her to me, she was straitjacketed and masked, like Hannibal"
" Lecter.  When I got her home I tried to remove the bindings, and she almost"
" immediately tried to strangle me.  It was all I could do to tie her back up"
" and put her in the guest room.  She still eats and drinks when I give her "
"food, but I haven't seen her sleep.  I don't know what that thing is in "
"there, but it's not my mom.  I hope she comes back soon."
msgstr ""
"EDITORIAL: MI MAMÁ, LA ALBOROTADORA. Mi madre fue una de los primeros "
"alborotadores en Jacksonville. Me estuve preguntando por mucho tiempo cómo "
"una jubilada de sesenta y siete años con pasión por las flores y tejer, "
"terminó presuntamente golpeando a un oficial de policía hasta matarlo y "
"arrojada a un tanque de contención. La semana pasada, contra todos los "
"pronósticos y con mucho riesgo personal, logré hacer que la liberaran. Pensé"
" que iba a poder calmarla. Cuando me la entregaron, estaba con una camisa de"
" fuerza y con una máscara, como Hannibal Lecter. Cuando llegamos a casa, "
"intenté sacarle las ataduras y ella casi inmediatamente intentó "
"estrangularme. Fue todo lo que pude hacer, la volví a atar y la puse en una "
"habitación. Todavía sigue comiendo y tomando agua cuando le doy comida, pero"
" no la vi dormir. No sé qué cosa está ahí, pero no es mi mamá. Espero que "
"vuelva pronto."

#. ~ Snippet in category "one_year_old_news"
#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
msgid ""
"EDITORIAL: SOCIAL MEDIA HAS GOTTEN OUT OF HAND, AND GONE OUT OF COUNTRY.  We"
" can no longer trust what we read, and it's all because of social media.  "
"Although our newspaper takes painstaking efforts to source our data, our "
"colleagues have forgotten what it means to be a journalist, and widespread "
"falsehoods are repeated even by reputable publications as fact.  What is the"
" ultimate source of all this misinformation?  It's anyone's guess, but I "
"think we need look no further than our largest international trade partner "
"and rival, China."
msgstr ""
"EDITORIAL: LAS REDES SOCIALES SE HAN IDO DE LAS MANOS, Y DEL PAÍS. Ya no "
"podemos confiar en lo que leemos y eso se debe a las redes sociales. Aunque "
"nuestro diario realiza esfuerzos meticulosos para confirmar nuestra "
"información, nuestros colegas se han olvidado lo que significa ser un "
"periodista, y las falsedades generalizadas se repiten incluso en "
"publicaciones respetables como hechos. ¿Cuál es la máxima fuente de toda "
"esta desinformación? Nadie lo sabe pero yo creo que no necesitamos mirar "
"otro lado que nuestro socio y rival comercial internacional más grande, "
"China."

#. ~ Snippet in category "months_old_news"
#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
msgid ""
"EDITORIAL: THE CHINESE CONTROL OUR MEDIA.  No, I don't mean they're writing "
"the articles, but there's no doubt in my mind our social media, from "
"FriendFace to Twitfeed to Eddit, is now run by Chinese influencers.  The "
"real question is not IF they're doing it, but HOW they're using this "
"influence to affect American minds."
msgstr ""
"EDITORIAL: EL CONTROL CHINO DE NUESTROS MEDIOS. No, no quiero decir que "
"están escribiendo los artículos, pero no tengo dudas de que nuestras redes "
"sociales, desde FriendFace hasta Twitfeed y Eddit, ahora las manejan "
"influencers chinos. La verdadera pregunta no es SI lo están haciendo, si no "
"CÓMO las están usando esta influencia para afectar las mentes "
"estadounidenses."

#. ~ Snippet in category "one_year_old_news"
#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
msgid ""
"EDITORIAL: THE RISE OF THE RIGHT HAS BROUGHT US HERE.  As the wounded white "
"male ego becomes more and more of a self-stereotype, we see the cost of "
"allowing right-wing sentiment echoed all around us.  Through closet "
"capitulation to the demands of the most extremist right-wing groups, "
"President Oswald has made policies that allow foreign drugs to run rampant "
"through our nation.  Hiding under the guise of generally increased crime "
"rates, conservative extremists have taken over our cities, stalking the "
"streets at night and enacting vicious vigilante-style beatings on anyone "
"they deem different."
msgstr ""
"EDITORIAL: EL ASCENSO DE LA DERECHA NOS TRAJO ACÁ. Mientras el ego del macho"
" blanco se convierte más y más en su propio estereotipo, vemos el costo de "
"permitirle al sentimiento de derecha hacerse un eco a nuestro alrededor. A "
"causa de la capitulación secreta a las demandas de los grupos de derecha más"
" extrema, el presidente Oswald ha tomado políticas que permiten a drogas "
"extranjeras circular sin control por nuestra nación. Escondiéndose bajo la "
"excusa de los casos criminales crecientes, los extremistas conservadores se "
"han apropiado de nuestras ciudades, acechando las calles a la noche como "
"vigilantes y dando feroces golpizas a quien consideren diferente."

#. ~ Snippet in category "many_years_old_news"
#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
msgid ""
"EDITORIAL: THE UN SHOULD PUT ON ITS BIG-BOY PANTS  Driven by decreasing "
"regulation of radioactive materials in the US and China, the UN is pushing "
"hard again for nuclear disarmament.  What a tired old litany this has "
"become.  With deregulation, we've been able to slate three new green nuclear"
" reactors in the Eastern US alone, bringing greenhouse-gas free power to "
"millions of people.  Whatever happened to the UN's focus on global warming?"
"  This is a classic situation of the world painting the USA as villains no "
"matter what we do."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "one_year_old_news"
#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
msgid ""
"EDITORIAL: THIS IS WHERE 'ME TOO' ENDS UP.  It's been a while now since 'Me "
"Too' swept the message boards of our nation, but its repercussions are felt "
"every day.  Disconnected from our identities and our heritage by the "
"overwhelming urge to suppress the white male and hide his every achievement,"
" American citizens are turning to drugs and violence to find a place of "
"belonging.  The government swings its hefty blame-stick around, trying to "
"shine a light on the rise in crime and failing economy, but the answer is "
"obvious to anyone who simply looks: it is the loss of our racial and sexual "
"identity that's at the root.  Mark my words: within a year, there will be a "
"reckoning, and it won't be caused by the government or some outside power, "
"it will be from the broken heart of America."
msgstr ""
"EDITORIAL: ACÁ ES DONDE TERMINA EL 'ME TOO'. Ya ha pasado un tiempo desde "
"que el 'me too' ocupó los mensajes de la nación pero sus repercusiones "
"todavía se sienten hoy en día. Desconectado de nuestras identidades y "
"nuestra herencia por la necesidad abrumadora de contener al macho blanco y "
"esconder cada uno de sus logros, los ciudadanos estadounidenses están "
"volcándose a las drogas y la violencia para buscar un lugar de pertenencia. "
"El gobierno se va pasando el bastón de la culpa de un lado a otro, "
"intentando hacer brillar una luz sobre el incremento de crímenes y la caída "
"de la economía, pero la respuesta es obvia para cualquiera que esté "
"observando: es nuestra pérdida de identidad racial y sexual lo que está en "
"la raíz del problema. Recuerden mis palabras: en menos de un año, va a haber"
" un juzgamiento y no va a ser causado por el gobierno o por un poder "
"externo, saldrá del corazón roto de Estados Unidos."

#. ~ Snippet in category "months_old_news"
#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
msgid ""
"EVACS UNSTOCKED: TRUTH OR FICTION?  An unidentified government source has "
"suggested that the evacuation centers are unstocked, having \"already "
"accomplished the goal of calming the people\".  He later retracted the "
"comment and is unable to be contacted."
msgstr ""
"EVACUADOS DESABASTECIDOS: ¿REALIDAD O FICCIÓN? Una fuente del gobierno que "
"no se identificó ha sugerido que los centros de evacuación están "
"desabastecidos, luego de haber \"cumplido con el objetivo de calmar a la "
"gente\". Luego desmintió haberlo dicho y ahora no es posible contactarse con"
" él."

#. ~ Snippet in category "newest_news"
#. ~ Around April 15/16
#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
msgid ""
"EVACUATION ALERT.  The Federal government has announced a formal evacuation "
"of all major centers, to pre-designated FEMA emergency shelters.  "
"Spokesperson Linda Garrison stated, \"This is not expected to be a permanent"
" issue.  By evacuating to the shelters and camps FEMA set up for just such a"
" situation, we can clamp down on riots without hurting uninvolved people.\""
"  Garrison declined to comment on widespread allegations that the rioters "
"are under the influence of psychosis-inducing biological agents."
msgstr ""
"ALERTA DE EVACUACIÓN. El gobierno federal ha anunciado una evacuación formal"
" de todos los centros mayores, hacia los refugios de emergencia designados "
"de FEMA. La vocera Linda Garrison declaró, \"No se espera que esto sea un "
"estado permanente. Al evacuar hacia los refugios y campamentos FEMA por esta"
" situación, podemos restringir los disturbios sin lastimar a gente "
"inocente.\" Garrison declinó comentar sobre las alegaciones generalizadas "
"sobre que los alborotadores están bajo la influencia de agentes biológicos "
"que inducen la psicosis."

#. ~ Snippet in category "newest_news"
#. ~ Around April 15/16
#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
msgid ""
"EVACUATION ALERT: FEMA officials said today \"Do not try to defend your "
"property in towns.  Please retreat to your nearest evacuation center outside"
" town and await extraction to a safe facility.  Military officials require "
"non-hostile civilians to be removed from potential hot sites for ongoing "
"violence.  When the evacuation order is over, you will be able to return to "
"your homes.\""
msgstr ""
"ALERTA DE EVACUACIÓN: Oficiales de FEMA dijeron hoy \"No intenten defender "
"sus propiedades en los pueblos. Por favor, retírense a los centros de "
"evacuación más cercanos en los alrededores de las ciudades y esperen ahí la "
"extracción hacia un lugar seguro. Los oficiales militares deben retirar a "
"los civiles no hostiles de los lugares peligrosas con violencia creciente. "
"Cuando la orden de evacuación se termine, podrán regresar a sus hogares.\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "many_years_old_news"
#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
msgid ""
"FLYING SAUCER OVER ROSWELL?  July 8, 1947.  At noon today, the intelligence "
"office of the 509th Bombardment group at Roswell Army Air Field announced "
"that the field has come into possession of an unidentified aircraft, the "
"wreckage of which was recovered from a ranch field in Corona, New Mexico "
"following a brief engagement with American fighter craft.  Despite the "
"alarming nature of the incident, the army gives every assurance that this "
"was not some enemy invasion, but rather a case of justifiable wartime "
"paranoia over what turned out to be nothing more than an unmanned weather "
"balloon."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "many_years_old_news"
#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
msgid ""
"FORMER RCI DIVISION PURCHASED BY FOREIGN INVESTORS.  A former division of "
"Rivet and Crimp Industries, a major subcontractor for national defense "
"manufacturers, has recently been purchased by Taiwanese American tech "
"billionaire Henry Gau.  CEO of Formosa OptoTech, Gau is known for his close "
"relationship with Chinese suppliers and manufacturers. Branding the company "
"Rivtech, the company will focus on competing in the US Next Generation Squad"
" Weapons trial.  Rivet and Crimp Industries's former weapons manufactory "
"division is previously known for manufacturing a pump-action grenade "
"launcher entrant in the M32 Multiple Grenade Launcher Trial, embroiling RCI "
"and tech partner Javelin Systems in a bitter, expensive legal battle."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "many_years_old_news"
#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
msgid ""
"GENERAL PROMOTED ONBOARD OLD IRONSIDES  The USS Constitution was the site of"
" a promotion ceremony held by the Massachusetts National Guard at the "
"Charlestown Navy Yard.  Col. Ariel Dabrowski was promoted to the rank of "
"brigadier general in the Massachusetts National Guard in front of a crowd "
"massed on the deck of the historic ship.  General Carlsberg officiated the "
"promotion ceremony, and Maj. Gen. Michael Baker administered the oath of "
"office."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "weeks_old_news"
#. ~ Around the start of April
#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
msgid ""
"GENERAL SAYS AVOID BUNKERS: Even in riot affected areas, do not attempt to "
"flee to military bunkers or outposts!  Understaffed bunkers are defended by "
"automated turrets, which will shoot those without proper registration.  FEMA"
" has authorized use of emergency evacuation shelters for people seeking "
"refuge from riots."
msgstr ""
"GENERAL DICE QUE HAY EVITAR LOS BÚNKERS: Incluso en áreas afectadas por los "
"disturbios, ¡no intenten huir hacia los búnkers o puestos militares! Los "
"búnkers sin el personal suficiente son defendidos por torretas automatizadas"
" que le dispararán a quienes no tengan el registro apropiado. FEMA ha "
"autorizado el uso de refugios de evacuación de emergencia para las personas "
"que busquen resguardarse de los disturbios."

#. ~ Snippet in category "newest_news"
#. ~ Around April 15/16
#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
msgid ""
"GOVERNMENT FACILITIES BOMBED: In an apparent foreign attack (contradicting "
"earlier Department of Defense denials of the disaster being caused by "
"Chinese aggression) a coordinated bombing strike hit a wide number of US "
"governmental facilities simultaneously yesterday, as well as numerous "
"locations in isolate parts of the coastal United States.  A statement from "
"the Pentagon has been issued, stating the strikes were the result of Chinese"
" opportunism during the national crisis, and assured that action would be "
"taken in kind against the aggressors.  Allegations that these sites "
"contained top-secret government research facilities related to the disaster "
"have been vehemently denied."
msgstr ""
"BOMBAS EN INSTALACIONES GUBERNAMENTALES: En un aparente ataque extranjero "
"(contradiciendo las primeras negaciones del Departamento de Defensa sobre el"
" desastre causado por una agresión de China) un bombardeo coordinado cayó "
"sobre una gran cantidad de instalaciones gubernamentales de manera "
"simultánea en el día de ayer, así como también varios lugares en lugares "
"aislados de la costa de Estados Unidos. Una declaración del Pentágono ha "
"sido publicada, estableciendo que los ataques fueron resultado del "
"oportunismo chino durante una crisis nacional, y aseguran que tomarán acción"
" hacia los agresores en respuesta. Por su parte, han negado vehementemente "
"los alegatos de que esos sitios contenían instalaciones de investigación "
"secretas del gobierno relacionadas al desastre."

#. ~ Snippet in category "years_old_news"
#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
msgid ""
"GOVERNMENT SCIENCE BOOST: The government has drastically increased research "
"and development budgets after UN disarmament demands.  \"This not only keeps"
" money in our country, but maintains our lead on China and keeps us "
"defended\", President Oswald said.  \"This is a fight we can't afford to "
"lose.  We're not deaf to the concerns of our population: this is a blanket "
"increase, not just to military R&D spending but civilian as well.  We've "
"authorized the construction of seventy nine new private civilian research "
"facilities along the Eastern Seaboard alone!\""
msgstr ""
"ESTÍMULO DEL GOBIERNO A LA CIENCIA: El gobierno ha incrementado "
"drásticamente los presupuestos de investigación y desarrollo luego de las "
"demandas de desarme de la ONU. \"Esto no solamente hace que la plata se "
"quede en nuestro país si no que también sostiene nuestra ventaja sobre China"
" y nos mantiene protegidos\", dijo el presidente Oswald. \"Esta es una "
"batalla que no podemos darnos el lujo de perder. No estamos sordos a las "
"preocupaciones de nuestra población: este es un incremento amplio, no "
"solamente para investigación y desarrollo militar si no también civil. "
"¡Hemos autorizado la construcción de setenta y nueve nuevas instalaciones de"
" investigación civiles sobre la costa este!\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "weeks_old_news"
#. ~ Around the start of April
#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
msgid ""
"GOVERNMENT SPEAKS OUT ABOUT 'MIND CONTROL' RUMORS.  Amidst rumors that "
"nation- and world-wide riots are the result of a chemical mind control "
"agent, the NSA held a press conference today.  \"This is not mind control.  "
"These rioters are human beings, normal people, controlled only by feverish "
"violence at a level we've never seen before,\" said a flustered looking "
"representative.  \"Although in some places excessive force has been required"
" to deter rioters, we are treating them as the humans they are, not as some "
"faceless mind-controlled horde.  This is not science fiction, these are our "
"friends and family.\""
msgstr ""
"EL GOBIERNO HABLA SOBRE LOS RUMORES DE 'CONTROL MENTAL'. Entre los rumores "
"de que los disturbios de la nación, y del mundo entero, son el resultado de "
"un agente químico de control mental, la Agencia de Seguridad Nacional dió "
"hoy una conferencia de prensa. \"Esto no es control mental. Estos "
"alborotadores son seres humanos, gente normal, controlada solamente por una "
"violencia febril de un nivel nunca antes visto,\" dijo nervioso un portavoz."
" \"Aunque en algunos lugares se ha necesitado el uso de fuerza excesiva para"
" disuadir los disturbios, los tratamos como los humanos que son, no como una"
" horda sin rostro y controlada mentalmente. Esto no es ciencia ficción, "
"estos son nuestros amigos y familiares.\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "one_year_old_news"
#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
msgid ""
"GRAVE BUSINESS: Recent reports show a large spike in thefts from and "
"assaults on funeral homes in the last few weeks.  Described as highly "
"strange but not especially dangerous, Homeland Security is \"looking at the "
"connections now.\""
msgstr ""
"EL NEGOCIO DE LAS TUMBAS: Informes recientes muestran un gran incremento en "
"asaltos a casas fúnebres en las últimas semanas. Descrito como muy extraño "
"pero no especialmente peligroso, Seguridad Nacional está \"buscando en este "
"momento los vínculos.\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "weeks_old_news"
#. ~ Around the start of April
#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
msgid ""
"HELL ON EARTH?  Boston has been quarantined.  Prior to its complete "
"lockdown, our journalists received a concerning email from a colleague "
"within the city, describing horrendous and inhuman monsters walking the "
"streets amidst the rioters.  \"I don't know who started it, but we call it "
"Hastur.  After the horror novel.  The rioters fall in line behind it like "
"soldiers, living and dead.  Yeah, some of them are dead.  They're lying to "
"us, they've all been lying to us.\"  Our editor-in-chief demanded we keep "
"this article from you.  He has been deposed.  Rise up against the lies."
msgstr ""
"¿EL INFIERNO EN LA TIERRA? Boston ha entrado en cuarentena. Antes de su "
"cierre completo, nuestros periodistas recibieron un preocupante email de un "
"colega dentro de la ciudad, describiendo los monstruos horrendos e inhumanos"
" que están caminando por las calles entre los disturbios. \"No sé quién lo "
"inició pero lo llamamos Hastur. Por la novela de horror. Los alborotadores "
"caen en línea detrás de él como soldados, muertos y vivos. Sí, algunos de "
"ellos están muertos. Nos están mintiendo, todos nos estuvieron mintiendo.\" "
"Nuestro editor jefe nos pidió que mantengamos este artículo por vos. Ha sido"
" destituido. Sublévense contra las mentiras."

#. ~ Snippet in category "years_old_news"
#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
msgid ""
"HOME GROWN SCIENCE: Several governors & legislators from the New England "
"region discussed a new regional initiative today, which relaxed laws that "
"limit the distance a hazardous-material laboratory or factory can be from a "
"city.  \"This should keep our economy going strong for years to come, with "
"all the R&D facilities being established,\", one mayor remarked.  \"With all"
" the new money coming in, we've seen a huge uptick in highly educated people"
" moving into the area too.  It's been nice, our coffee shops in particular "
"are doing very well.\""
msgstr ""
"CIENCIA EN CASA: Varios gobernadores y legisladores de la región de New "
"England discutieron hoy una nueva iniciativa regional, que flexibiliza las "
"leyes que limitan la distancia en la que puede estar de la ciudad el "
"material peligroso de los laboratorios o las fábricas. \"Estoy mantendrá "
"nuestra economía fuerte para los años que vienen, con todos los centros de "
"investigación y desarrollo que están estableciéndose\", remarcó un "
"intendente. \"Con todos los nuevos ingresos, hemos visto un gran repunte en "
"la cantidad de gente con educación superior mudándose a este área. Ha sido "
"algo bueno, en particular a nuestras cafeterías les está yendo bien.\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "weeks_old_news"
#. ~ Around the start of April
#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
msgid ""
"IF YOU CAN'T BEAT 'EM.  Riots continue to rage unchecked across the country,"
" maybe the world.  Here in our newsroom we've taken a poll, and it's agreed:"
" if you can't beat 'em, join 'em.  This will be our last issue, we're going "
"out there to show the government exactly what we think of their limp-wristed"
" failures."
msgstr ""
"SI NO PUEDES VENCERLOS. Los disturbios continúan arrasando desenfrenadamente"
" por el país, tal vez por el mundo. Aquí en nuestra redacción hemos hecho "
"una encuesta, y está decidido: si no puedes vencerlos, únete a ellos. Esta "
"va a ser nuestra última edición, vamos a salir a mostrarle al gobierno lo "
"que pensamos exactamente de sus torpes errores."

#. ~ Snippet in category "months_old_news"
#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
msgid ""
"INCREASE IN \"MONSTER\" SIGHTINGS HAS EXPERTS BAFFLED.  A tenfold spike in "
"sightings of unexplained phenomena, particularly fantastic beasts and "
"monsters, has experts confused.  \"This could be related to the recent rise "
"in hallucinations,\" said Dr. Barb Coulson in an interview on web-based "
"debate show ContraPoints on Friday.  \"It's probably drugs,\" replied debate"
" partner Leanne Jefferson, a spokesperson from MADD.  \"You're both "
"idiots,\" moderator Natalie Wynn interjected.  \"The obvious answer is that "
"it's monsters walking the Earth, preparing to kill us all.\""
msgstr ""
"INCREMENTO EN AVISTAMIENTO DE \"MONSTRUOS\" DEJA PERPLEJOS A LOS EXPERTOS. "
"Diez veces más de avistamientos de fenómenos inexplicables, particularmente "
"bestias y monstruos fantásticos, tiene confundidos a los expertos. \"Esto "
"podría estar relacionado con el reciente incremento de las alucinaciones,\" "
"dijo la Dra. Barb Coulson en una entrevista durante el programa online de "
"debates ContraPoints el pasado viernes. \"Probablemente, sean las drogas,\" "
"respondió la compañera del debate Leanne Jefferson, una vocera de MADD. "
"\"Las dos son idiotas,\" intercedió la moderadora Natalie Wynn. \"La "
"respuesta obvia es que hay monstruos caminando por la Tierra, preparándose "
"para matarnos a todos.\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "weeks_old_news"
#. ~ Around the start of April
#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
msgid ""
"ISS MUTINIES, ABANDONS STATION.  Making their demands known through amateur "
"radio communications, all astronauts and cosmonauts aboard the International"
" Space Station have demanded that NASA and ROSCOSMOS allow them to rejoin "
"their families amidst the recent riots and instability.  Claims have been "
"made that the agencies have shut them out of most controls aboard the "
"station, endangering the lives of all aboard when they were unable to "
"respond to a near-miss with orbital debris.  NASA officials have continued "
"to make no public statements regarding the demands, or the unconfirmed "
"reports that the docked spacecraft have been launched, *without* aid from "
"ground control."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "one_year_old_news"
#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
msgid ""
"IT CAME FROM BEYOND.  [Pictured: Margaret Antwerp holds the fragment of "
"alien satellite that landed in her rose garden.]  It was a normal day for "
"Margaret.  Normal, that is, until a thundering crash in her front yard "
"nearly knocked her house over.  \"This damn thing fell right out of space, I"
" tell you,\" she told investigative journalists from our Paranormal "
"Investigations department.  \"It was glowing red hot, and it had burnt my "
"prize-winning roses to a crisp.\"  The US government and air force have "
"declined to comment, as usual."
msgstr ""
"VINO DEL MÁS ALLÁ. [Dibujo: Margaret Antwerp sostiene un fragmento de un "
"satélite extraterrestre que aterrizó entre sus rosas.] Era un día normal "
"para Margaret. Normal, hasta que un trueno se estrelló en su jardín "
"delantero, casi derrumbando su casa. \"Esta cosa infernal cayó del espacio, "
"te dijo,\" le dijo a los periodistas de investigación de nuestro "
"departamento de investigaciones paranormales. \"Estaba brillando "
"incandescente, y había quemado mis premiadas rosas.\" El gobierno de los "
"Estados Unidos y la fuerza aérea han negado hacer comentarios, como siempre."

#. ~ Snippet in category "one_year_old_news"
#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
msgid ""
"JAMES HAWTHORNE TWITTER FEUD.  Everyone's talking about the latest trending "
"news on Twitter.  \"Uncanny\" tech magnate and upcoming challenger to the "
"title of \"richest man in America\", James Hawthorne, had a protracted "
"Twitter battle with Minnesota Democratic senatorial candidate Lester "
"Namboney, starting over taxation laws, and running all the way down to grade"
" school insults.  Go to page 5 for the choicest tweets."
msgstr ""
"JAMES HAWTHORNE, PLEITO EN TWITTER. Todos están hablando de los últimos "
"trending topics de Twitter. El magnate tecnológico de \"Uncanny\" e "
"inminente contendiente al título de \"hombre más rico en Estados Unidos\", "
"James Hawthorne, tuvo una larga batalla en Twitter con el candidato "
"demócrata a senador por Minnesota Lester Namboney, empezando por leyes "
"impositivas y llegando hasta insultos de nivel escolar. Selección de tweets "
"en la página 5."

#. ~ Snippet in category "one_year_old_news"
#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
msgid ""
"LASERS - NEXT BIG THING?: Top defense researchers remarked during demonstration of a prototype today: \"We are still working on it, the laser weapon lacks power, but has a technically almost unlimited range,\" Colonel Sylver, a spokesperson for the military said.  Laser weapons have been used for years in large-scale platforms, especially as anti-ordnance weapons; this marks the first field use of human-sized energy weapons.\n"
"\n"
"\"There's no real advantage over conventional weaponry at this point,\" said analyst Mark Coza in an interview.  \"I think they're rolling them out mainly to intimidate China, and in the hopes that field testing leads to further improvements.\""
msgstr ""
"LÁSERS - ¿EL PRÓXIMO ÉXITO?: Los mejores investigadores en defensa, hoy durante la demostración de un prototipo,  remarcaron lo siguiente: \"Todavía estamos trabajando en esto, el arma láser no es muy potente pero técnicamente tiene un rango casi ilimitado,\" dijo el coronel Sulver, vocero militar. Las armas láser han sido utilizada por años en plataformas de gran escala, especialmente armas antiartillería; esto marcaría el primer uso de campo para armas de energía de tamaño humano.\n"
"\n"
"\"No hay una ventaja real sobre las armas convencionales en este momento,\" dijo el analista Mark Coza en una entrevista. \"Creo que las están presentando para intimidar a China, y con la esperanza de que las pruebas de campo conlleven mejoras futuras.\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "newest_news"
#. ~ Around April 15/16
#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
msgid ""
"LEAVE IT TO THE EXPERTS -- GENERAL: \"Do not attempt to deal with people "
"acting violent or unusual yourself.  If you see someone dangerous, report to"
" the nearest military or police blockade for assistance!  Even guns are to "
"be avoided: loud gunfire may attract more rioters than you have ammo!\""
msgstr ""
"DÉJENSELO A LOS EXPERTOS -- GENERAL: \"No intenten controlar a las personas "
"con conductas violentas o inusuales. ¡Si ves a alguien peligroso, reportalo "
"al bloqueo militar o policial más cercano! Incluso se deben evitar las "
"armas: ¡los disparos pueden atraer más alborotadores que cantidad de "
"munición que poseas!\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "weeks_old_news"
#. ~ Around the start of April
#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
msgid ""
"LETHAL FORCE DEPLOYED?  Police and military forces deny the use of lethal "
"force in riot control, but reports do not seem to corroborate their claims."
"  From videos of gunshot-riddled corpses to aberrant reports from some "
"military officials, it seems clear that at least in some areas, live fire "
"turrets with fully AI-driven threat recognition are being deployed to "
"bolster an overwhelmed military.  We reached Major Linda Pryce in "
"Montpelier, Vermont, for comment.  \"I don't ******* care what the orders "
"are, I have men and civilians that need protecting,\" she told our "
"reporters.  \"These rioters are worse than any insurgent I ever fought in "
"Afghanistan, and I will use whatever I can to keep them under control.\""
msgstr ""
"¿SE UTILIZÓ FUERZA LETAL? Las fuerzas de la policía y militares niegan la "
"utilización de fuerza letal en los controles de disturbios, pero los "
"informes no parecen corroborar sus declaraciones. Desde videos de cuerpos "
"acribillados por balas hasta informes aberrantes de algunos oficiales "
"militares, parece claro que por lo menos en algunos lugares, torretas de "
"munición viva con reconocimiento de amenazas controlado totalmente por "
"inteligencia artificial han sido desplegadas para brindar apoyo al ejército "
"ya agobiado. Nos contactamos con la comandante Linda Pryce en Montpelier, "
"Vermont. \"No me importa una ****** cuáles son las órdenes, tengo hombres y "
"civiles acá que necesitan protección,\" le dijo a nuestros periodistas. "
"\"Estos alborotadores son peores que cualquier otra insurgencia que luché en"
" Afganistán, y voy a usar lo que necesite para mantenerlos bajo control.\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "weeks_old_news"
#. ~ Around the start of April
#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
msgid ""
"LOCAL EVACUATION ORDERS.  FEMA has announced small-scale evacuations of "
"select centers where rioting is most intense.  \"This is a preventive "
"measure,\" Spokesperson Linda Garrison told our correspondent.  \"We expect "
"to have people home in a few days, but it's best we play it safe until "
"then.\""
msgstr ""
"ÓRDENES LOCALES DE EVACUACIÓN. FEMA anunció evacuaciones de escala pequeña "
"de centros elegidos donde los disturbios son más intensos. \"Esta es una "
"medida preventiva,\" le dijo la vocera Linda Garrison a nuestro "
"corresponsal. \"Esperamos tener a la gente en su casa en unos días, pero lo "
"mejor es tomar todas las precauciones posibles hasta entonces.\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "one_year_old_news"
#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
msgid ""
"MAN EATING FLOWERS?  Italian biologist Dr. Flavio Bianchi responded to an "
"ethics board denial of his work with an unusual announcement last Tuesday.  "
"\"I do not need your permission to do my work,\" stated Dr. Bianchi in a "
"letter to the University of Milan.  \"I will do my research in private, and "
"when I am done, you will rue the day you defied me.\"  Dr. Bianchi's work?  "
"Engineering Venus fly traps large enough to keep the local stray cat "
"population at bay.  His tenure with the university is reported to have been "
"suspended."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "one_year_old_news"
#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
msgid ""
"MENDING FENCES.  Growing international tensions have prompted President "
"Oswald to call for unprecedented funding increases for security "
"revitalization.  The president is calling for new \"precision micro\" "
"military installations to be built across the nation, with thousands to be "
"constructed in New England alone.  These come alongside similarly ambitious "
"budget increases for FEMA and scientific research.  A coalition of civil "
"rights orgs, neighborhood associations, and environmental advocates have "
"denounced the initiative."
msgstr ""
"ENMENDAR LAS OFENSAS. Las tensiones internacionales crecientes han provocado"
" al presidente Oswald a pedir un incremento sin precedente de fondos para la"
" revitalización de la seguridad. El presidente lo requiere para las nuevas "
"instalaciones militares \"precision micro\" que serán construidas por toda "
"la nación, de las cuales miles serán construidas solamente en New England. "
"Esto llega de la mano de incrementos igualmente ambiciosos del presupuesto "
"para FEMA e investigaciones científicas. Una coalición de organizaciones de "
"derechos civiles, asociaciones vecinales y defensores ambientalistas han "
"denunciado la iniciativa."

#. ~ Snippet in category "months_old_news"
#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
msgid ""
"MORE ORDAINED MINISTERS NEEDED.  Wedlock is down, but last minute nuptials, "
"elopements, vow-renewals and 'micromonies' have been on the rise, supposedly"
" in response to many of the recent events and uneasing developments as more "
"people are feeling less secure about dating in these troubled times, "
"therefore rushing to the altar in preparation for the worst, or to cross "
"items off the bucket list before it's too late.  As a result, the nation is "
"experiencing a shortage of marriage officiants.  Luckily, now more than "
"ever, since the beginning of the 21st century it's become increasingly "
"easier to become qualified to help couples of all kinds celebrate their "
"commitment to each other.  However, not enough people are rising to the "
"occasion."
msgstr ""
"SE NECESITAN ORDENAR MÁS MINISTROS. Los casamientos han bajado pero las "
"nupcias de último minuto, las huidas para casarse, la renovación de votos y "
"las microceremonias han aumentado, supuestamente, en respuesta a los eventos"
" y malestares recientes, ya que más gente se siente insegura de conocer "
"gente en estos tiempos turbulentos, por lo tanto, corren al altar "
"preparándose para lo peor, o solo para tachar pendientes de la lista de "
"cosas para hacer antes de que sea tarde. Como resultado, la nación está "
"experimentando una escasez de ministros para celebrar casamientos. Por "
"suerte, ahora más que nunca, desde el principio del siglo XXI se ha vuelto "
"cada vez más fácil calificarse para ayudar a las parejas de toda clase a "
"celebrar su compromiso. Sin embargo, no son suficientes para las "
"circunstancias."

#. ~ Snippet in category "one_year_old_news"
#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
msgid ""
"NEW LAB OPENS: The H.R. Bennett Research Facility has been officially opened"
" by the Department of Energy.  According to Deputy Secretary of Energy "
"Randall Balakrishnan, \"This facility is one of the most state-of-the-art in"
" the world.  With the opening of the H.R. Bennett research complex, New "
"England's future is looking brighter than ever.\""
msgstr ""
"ABRE NUEVO LABORATORIO: El Laboratorio Experimental H.R. Bennett ha sido "
"oficialmente inaugurado por el Departamento de Energía. Según el "
"Subsecretario de Energía Randall Balakrishnan, \"Esta instalación es una de "
"la más avanzadas del mundo. Con la inauguración del complejo de "
"investigación H.R. Bennett, el futuro de New England está más radiante que "
"nunca.\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "many_years_old_news"
#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
msgid ""
"NEW TYPE OF AI, OR CLEVER HOAX?  Rumors of a new type of generative AI have "
"been confounded by as yet uncomfirmed speculation that some texts appearing "
"online are apparently being unconsciously written by human beings who report"
" having no memory of doing so. \"It's like something is writing through me "
"without fully understanding human language,\" one online commenter said."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "months_old_news"
#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
msgid ""
"POLICE TO INVESTIGATE SHADY HILLS.  There will be a \"thorough "
"investigation\" into the Shady Hills nursing home, owned by Shady Hills "
"Corporation, said police Monday.  The announcement came following several "
"lawsuits launching against the home by family members of residents for "
"alleged elder abuse and neglect."
msgstr ""
"LA POLICÍA INVESTIGARÁ SHADY HILLS. Se llevará a cabo una \"investigación "
"minuciosa\" en el hogar de ancianos Shady Hills, propiedad de la Shady Hills"
" Corporation, según informó la policía el lunes pasado. El anuncio vino "
"luego de varias demandas judiciales en contra del hogar por parte de "
"familiares de los residentes que alegan abusos y negligencias."

#. ~ Snippet in category "many_years_old_news"
#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
msgid ""
"POPULAR 'ALIEN AUTOPSY' DEBUNKED  Following the explosively popular debut of"
" an alleged \"alien autopsy\" on network television last week, experts have "
"stepped forward to dismiss claims that the feature was anything more than a "
"publicity stunt.  Early observations that the \"alien\", a multi-legged pink"
" monster, was suspiciously similar to those dreamed up by horror author HP "
"Lovecraft were not sufficient to dissuade conspiracy theorists.  Fortunately"
" for the rest of us, our own investigation has revealed that the film was "
"nothing more than a promotional clip for a canceled film adaptation of "
"Lovecraft's The Whisperer in Darkness.  The FCC has announced that it is "
"opening its own investigation into the matter with the aim of determining "
"whether the network has gone too far for the sake of what it now claims was "
"purely entertainment."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "newest_news"
#. ~ Around April 15/16
#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
msgid ""
"PORTALS?  Reports of shimmering gateways opening around the US have been "
"corroborated by our own reporting staff.  One reporter witnessed a creature "
"the size of an apartment building taking a direct hit from an Apache "
"helicopter's weaponry and continuing to fight.  Government officials could "
"not be reached for comment, but a local pastor spoke to our reporter in the "
"field.  \"There can no longer be any doubt,\" she was quoted as saying.  "
"\"These are the end times.\""
msgstr ""
"¿PORTALES? Los informes sobre entradas brillantes abriéndose por los Estados"
" Unidos han sido corroborados por nuestro propio equipo periodístico. Un "
"periodista fue testigo de una criatura del tamaño de un edificio de "
"departamentos recibiendo disparos de un helicóptero Apache y continuando con"
" la pelea. Los oficiales del gobierno no han podido ser contactados para "
"realizar comentarios, pero una pastora local habló con nuestro corresponsal."
" \"Ya no queda duda alguna,\" fueron sus palabras. \"Este es el final de los"
" tiempos.\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "weeks_old_news"
#. ~ Around the start of April
#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
msgid ""
"PSYCHIC EMANATIONS?  A seemingly far-fetched theory about ongoing riots "
"sweeping the nation has been gaining traction after a leaked document about "
"experiments in magnetic control of brain-waves.  \"Two weeks ago, I'd have "
"told you this is ridiculous,\" said Dr. Andrew Morton, an epidemiologist and"
" our leading expert on the medical basis for the riots.  \"Now?  I'll "
"consider anything.  With the caveat that I don't think any of this is "
"possible, magnetic weaponry altering our brain waves and making people into "
"crazy violent psychopaths is more plausible than a lot of the theories "
"running around.  I certainly prefer this one to that 'zombies' suggestion "
"from a few days ago.\""
msgstr ""
"¿EMANACIONES PSÍQUICAS? Una teoría aparentemente inverosímil acerca de los "
"disturbios en curso que invaden la nación, ha estado ganando terreno luego "
"de la filtración de un documento acerca de experimentos con control "
"magnético de las ondas cerebrales. \"Hace dos semanas, te hubiera dicho que "
"eso es ridículo,\" dijo el Dr. Andrew Morton, un epidemiólogo y experto "
"sobre las bases médicas de los disturbios.. \"¿Ahora? Considero todo. Con la"
" advertencia de que no creo que nada de esto sea posible, las armas "
"magnéticas que alteran nuestras ondas cerebrales y vuelven psicópatas locos "
"y violentos a la gente, es más creíble que muchas de las teorías que andan "
"dando vueltas. Ciertamente, prefiero esta teoría a la sugerencia de 'zombis'"
" de hace unos días.\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "newest_news"
#. ~ Around April 15/16
#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
msgid ""
"PUBLIC SERVICE ANNOUNCEMENT: \"Aid Delayed\".  Fighting by the military at "
"the edge of the New England Disaster Area is expected to delay civilian "
"extraction.  Civilians will be forced to supply themselves over the next "
"weeks.  Sources indicate this problem is widespread in other major "
"population centers, but aggravated locally by the very high number of "
"bombing targets over the last two days."
msgstr ""
"ANUNCIO DE INTERÉS PÚBLICO: \"Ayuda demorada\". Pelear junto al ejército en "
"el límite del Área de Desastre de New England hará demorar la extracción de "
"los civiles. Los civiles se verán forzados a mantenerse por sí mismo por las"
" próximas semanas. Fuentes indican que este problema se da a lo largo de los"
" mayores centros poblacionales, pero están agravados localmente por el gran "
"número de objetivos de bombardeo durante los últimos días."

#. ~ Snippet in category "newest_news"
#. ~ Around April 15/16
#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
msgid ""
"PUBLIC SERVICE ANNOUNCEMENT: \"New England Cut Off\".  New England has been "
"quarantined for the safety of the rest of the USA.  No rescue attempts will "
"be funded; it is assumed there are no survivors in the area.  This follows "
"on the heels of the quarantining of large sections of the Midwest last "
"night.  Cellular and land-based communication grids have been blocked by "
"large numbers of people attempting to contact loved ones.  It is recommended"
" that civilians avoid use of these tools for all but the most urgent "
"messages."
msgstr ""
"ANUNCIO DE INTERÉS PÚBLICO: \"New England Desconectado\". New England ha "
"entrado en cuarentena por la seguridad del resto de Estados Unidos. No se "
"financiarán intentos de rescate; se asume que no hay sobrevivientes en el "
"área. Esto sigue el mismo camino de las cuarentenas en grandes lugares del "
"medio oeste de anoche. Las redes de  comunicación por celular o por tierra "
"han sido bloqueadas por un gran número de personas que intentan comunicarse "
"con sus familiares y amigos. Se recomienda que los civiles eviten el uso de "
"estas herramientas para cualquier otra cosa que no sean mensajes de suma "
"urgencia."

#. ~ Snippet in category "one_year_old_news"
#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
msgid ""
"READY FOR THE WORST.  In response to growing public concern about a "
"potential attack from China, President Oswald announced a major funding "
"initiative for the construction of FEMA-supported evacuation shelters near "
"major population sites.  \"These shelters will provide a much-needed near "
"safety points in an emergency,\" said a spokesperson for FEMA.  \"They're to"
" be equipped with a secure basement that can resist heavy bombardment, able "
"to fit hundreds of people, and equipped to survive gas and biological "
"attacks.  They have self-contained water and power, protective gear, and "
"communications equipment.  In short, they are public survivalist bunkers.  "
"We've very excited about this initiative.\""
msgstr ""
"PREPARADOS PARA LO PEOR. En respuesta a la preocupación pública creciente de"
" un potencial ataque de China, el presidente Oswald anunció un gran "
"inversión para la construcción de refugios de evacuación FEMA cerca de los "
"lugares de mayor población. \"Estos refugios nos brindarán lugares cercanos "
"y seguros de mucha necesidad durante una emergencia,\" dijo un vocero de "
"FEMA. \"Están equipados con un sótano seguro que puede resistir bombardeos, "
"capaz de albergar a cientos de personas, y equipado para sobrevivir ataques "
"de gas y biológicos. Tienen agua y electricidad autónomas, equipo de "
"protección y de comunicación. En resumen, son búnkers públicos de "
"supervivencia. Estamos muy entusiasmados con esta iniciativa.\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "many_years_old_news"
#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
msgid ""
"RESEARCH VESSEL RECOVERED WITH NO HANDS ON BOARD  United States Navy "
"Research Vessel Sally Ride went missing last week during what should of been"
" a routine mapping mission off the sea of Japan.  She sported a crew of 20 "
"and carried 24 research personnel, none of whom were recovered yesterday "
"when the vessel was found adrift off the coast of Argentina approximately "
"ten thousand miles away.  The Navy did not respond to requests for comment "
"on how this was possible, nor did it offer any speculation as to the fate of"
" those missing."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "weeks_old_news"
#. ~ Around the start of April
#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
msgid ""
"RHODE ISLAND DECLARES SECESSION!  In the midst of a nation-wide disaster, "
"the governor of Rhode Island has declared unilateral secession and war with "
"the government of the US.  \"My loyal Rhodians are withdrawing to Aquidneck "
"and Conanicut Islands,\" said governor Alex Ackerwith in a public "
"announcement this morning.  \"The US government has failed us.  Any attempt "
"by the US to intervene in our affairs will result in military action from "
"the Narragansett Government.  Frankly, I don't think they can get their shit"
" together enough to challenge us.\""
msgstr ""
"¡RHODE ISLAND DECLARA SECESIÓN! En el medio de un desastre nacional, el "
"gobernador de Rhode Island ha declarado unilateralmente la secesión y guerra"
" con el gobierno de los Estados Unidos. \"Mis leales rodislandeses se están "
"retirando hacia las islas Aquidneck y Conanicut,\" dijo el gobernador Alex "
"Ackerwith en un anuncio público esta mañana. \"El gobierno de los Estados "
"Unidos nos ha fallado. Cualquier intento de Estados Unidos de intervenir en "
"nuestros asuntos resultará en una acción militar del gobierno de "
"Narragansett. Francamente, no creo que puedan resolver sus problemas como "
"para desafiarnos.\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "many_years_old_news"
#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
msgid ""
"RHODE ISLAND RATBOY  For the third month in a row, embattled police in "
"Warwick, Rhode Island have been fielding calls about the so-called "
"\"ratboy\".  Callers report seeing this hunched, hairy figure at night, "
"rummaging through trash cans, squeezing in and out of storm drains, and even"
" attempting to gain entry to people's homes, though to date none of these "
"alleged encounters have resulted in any violence or further mischief.  "
"Authorities are calling the puzzling incidents a case of mass hysteria, and "
"remind residents to keep their doors locked and to call in any sightings of "
"unaccompanied children out on the street at odd hours."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "months_old_news"
#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
msgid ""
"RIOT IN BANKSLEY.  Irony was hot and dangerous in Banksley, Vermont today, "
"where a fight broke out in a local coffee shop, reportedly starting over a "
"dispute about the details of a similar riot in Carlhaven, Nebraska.  Within "
"an hour, the fight had expanded to engulf the local downtown core.  Danielle"
" Louiston, a server who fled the scene, was available for phone interview.  "
"\"It was like nothin' I've ever seen,\" describes Danielle.  \"One minute "
"it's a normal Friday morning, the next it's a bar brawl.  By the time I got "
"outta there, most of the restaurant was involved.  I got in my car and just "
"bolted home, then called the cops.  Turns out they're all in the fight!  The"
" secretary and I, we got hold of the military and finally they came in and "
"cleared things up.\"  Stabilizing the riots required the dispatch of three "
"National Guard units.  Casualty reports are, as yet, unavailable."
msgstr ""
"DISTURBIOS EN BANKSLEY. La ironía estuvo de moda hoy en Banksley, Vermont, "
"donde una pelea se inició en una cafetería, y por lo que se pudo saber, "
"comenzó con una disputa acerca de los detalles de un disturbio similar en "
"Carlhaven, Nebraska. En menos de una hora, la pelea se extendió hasta "
"envolver el centro de la ciudad. Danielle Louiston, una moza que escapó del "
"lugar, dio una entrevista telefónica. \"Nunca vi algo parecido,\" describe "
"Danielle. \"Un minuto era una mañana de viernes normal y al siguiente era "
"una pelea de bar. En el momento en que me fui, la mayor parte del restorán "
"estaba involucrada. Me subí al auto y me fui a mi casa, y llamé a la "
"policía. ¡Y resulta que ya estaban en la pelea! La secretaria y yo nos "
"comunicamos con el ejército y finalmente llegaron para poner orden.\" Para "
"estabilizar los disturbios, se necesitó desplegar tres unidades de la "
"Guardia Nacional. Por el momento, no se conocen los números de fallecidos."

#. ~ Snippet in category "newest_news"
#. ~ Around April 15/16
#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
msgid ""
"RIOTERS MUTATING?  Eyewitnesses from the New England Disaster Area have "
"claimed that the allegedly psychotic rioters are displaying inhuman "
"qualities.  \"I swear to God, one of them was the size of a tree!\", said "
"one panicked survivor.  There are also reports of afflicted individuals with"
" acidic or electric properties.  CDC officials could not be reached for "
"comment."
msgstr ""
"¿ESTÁN MUTANDO LOS ALBOROTADORES? Testigos visuales del área de catástrofe "
"de New England han declarado que los alborotadores psicóticos muestran "
"cualidades inhumanas. \"¡Juro por dios que uno de ellos era del tamaño de un"
" árbol!\", dijo un sobreviviente en pánico. También hay informes de "
"individuos que sufren alteraciones ácidas o eléctricas. Los oficiales del "
"CDC no pudieron ser contactados para que hagan comentarios al respecto."

#. ~ Snippet in category "months_old_news"
#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
msgid ""
"RIOTS CONTINUE IN SOUTH AMERICA, AFRICA.  Although reports are inconsistent,"
" it has been confirmed that widespread rioting in poverty-stricken regions "
"of Africa and South America, as well as some parts of Indonesia, Asia, the "
"Middle East, and Eastern Europe, have continued and only grown in severity."
"  \"It's obvious this is a social media effect,\" said political science "
"professor Dr. Ely Savage.  \"Economists have been saying for some time that "
"the current situation of developed nations forcing underdeveloped nations "
"into semi-slavery couldn't last, and now we're seeing the repercussions.\""
msgstr ""
"DISTURBIOS CONTINÚAN EN AMÉRICA DEL SUR Y ÁFRICA. Aunque los informes son "
"inconsistentes, ha sido confirmado que los disturbios generalizados en "
"regiones pobres de África y América del Sur, así como también en algunas "
"partes de Indonesia, Asia, Medio Oriente y Europa del este, han continuado y"
" siguen creciendo en severidad. \"Es obvio que es un efecto de las redes "
"sociales,\" dijo el profesor de ciencias políticas, Dr. Ely Savage. \"Los "
"economistas han estado diciendo por algún tiempo que la situación actual de "
"las naciones desarrolladas forzando a las naciones subdesarrolladas a una "
"semiesclavitud no podía durar, y ahora estamos viendo las repercusiones.\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "newest_news"
#. ~ Around April 15/16
#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
msgid ""
"RIOTS GROWING?  Communications with government forces have been muddled by a"
" large influx of aggressive armed individuals to nation-wide riots.  \"We "
"have this under control,\" says a local police chief.  \"We are authorizing "
"our forces to use lethal force on combative humans.  In the meantime, people"
" are advised to stay in their homes and avoid any contact with peacekeeping "
"forces to avoid friendly fire.\"  Riots are believed to be affecting cities "
"worldwide since at least three weeks ago."
msgstr ""
"¿DISTURBIOS EN CRECIMIENTO? Las comunicaciones con fuerzas gubernamentales "
"han confundido a un gran grupo de individuos agresivos y armados con "
"disturbios a nivel nacional. \"Tenemos esto bajo control,\" dijo el jefe de "
"la policía local. \"Estamos autorizando a nuestras fuerzas a utilizar fuerza"
" letal en humanos combativos. Mientras tanto, se le ha pedido a la gente que"
" se quede en sus casas para evitar cualquier contacto con las fuerzas para "
"mantener la paz, para evitar salir heridos.\" Se cree que los disturbios "
"afectan a las ciudades en todo el mundo desde hace por lo menos tres "
"semanas."

#. ~ Snippet in category "months_old_news"
#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
msgid ""
"SPIKE IN MENTAL HEALTH CONCERNS HAS EPIDEMIOLOGISTS WORRIED.  \"There's no doubt about it,\" said a spokesperson from Mount Sinai Hospital.  \"Hospitals over the US are overwhelmed with an increase in psychiatrically-related violent behavior such as explosivity and aggressive paranoia.  The most likely cause is a new street drug; we have yet to identify any commonality between the affected people.\"\n"
"\n"
"Dr. Andrew Morton, a Harvard epidemiologist, has a different opinion.  \"These people aren't drug users.  They're coming from all walks of life.  Sure, there's a predilection for people who already have some mental illness, but we're seeing perfectly normal people suddenly presenting with violent explosive behavior.  I think the most likely cause is infectious: no other pattern would fit this widespread an outbreak.\""
msgstr ""
"PICO EN AFECCIONES DE SALUD MENTAL PREOCUPA A LOS EPIDEMIÓLOGOS. \"No hay duda sobre ello,\" dijo un vocero del hospital Monte Sinaí. \"Los hospitales en Estados unidos están colapsados con el incremento en conducta psiquiátrica violenta, como la explosividad y la paranoia agresiva. La causa más probable es una nueva droga que anda circulando; todavía no pudimos identificar nada en común entre las personas afectadas.\"\n"
"\n"
"El Dr. Andrew Morton, un epidemiólogo de Harvard, tiene una opinión diferente. \"Estas personas no son consumidores de droga. Son de todas las clases sociales. Seguro, hay una predilección con la gente que ya tiene alguna enfermedad mental, pero estamos viendo personas completamente normales que súbitamente presentan una conducta violenta explosiva. Creo que la causa más probable es infecciosa: ningún otro patrón de conducto encajaría con una brote tan extendido.\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "many_years_old_news"
#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
msgid ""
"STUDENT MISSING: A high school student vanished yesterday evening in the "
"forest near Wayland.  The 17-year-old student Brett Dong went on a camping "
"trip with his friends, who called emergency services when they realized he "
"was no longer with them.  \"Brett said that he was gonna get some firewood "
"but he never came back,\" said his classmate, Jianxiang Wang.  The search is"
" underway, and authorities have provided a tip line, asking that anyone who "
"may have been in the area call in to report any suspicious sightings."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "weeks_old_news"
#. ~ Around the start of April
#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
msgid ""
"SUPERSOLDIER EXPERIMENTS GONE WRONG.  Recently leaked documents from an "
"inside source confirm that violent riots across the country are the result "
"of an accidentally released self-replicating supersoldier serum.  The serum "
"gives people unprecedented strength and durability, even regenerative "
"capacity, but also triggers violent outbursts.  Although the leak suggests "
"that the effect should wear off, it may take weeks or even months to reach a"
" stable state."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "months_old_news"
#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
msgid ""
"SUPPORT THE COUNTRIES THAT SUPPORT YOURS - PRESIDENT: Earlier today, in an "
"unexpected and unpopular decision, the president suggested the possible "
"institution of a peacetime draft in response to increasing Chinese "
"aggression towards Taiwan and the Philippines.  \"We must pray for the best "
"while preparing for the worst.  We cannot abandon key allies in the face of "
"Chinese bullying.\""
msgstr ""
"APOYÁ A LOS PAÍSES QUE APOYAN AL TUYO - PRESIDENTE: Hoy temprano, en una "
"decisión inesperada e impopular, el presidente sugirió la posible "
"institución de un tiempo de paz en respuesta a la creciente agresión china "
"contra Taiwán y Filipinas. \"Debemos rezar para que suceda lo mejor mientras"
" nos preparamos para lo peor. No podemos abandonar a aliados claves frente "
"al atropello chino.\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "weeks_old_news"
#. ~ Around the start of April
#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
msgid ""
"SURGEON GENERAL: DEAD ARE STAYING DEAD: \"Stories about the dead rising are "
"completely unfounded and medically impossible.\", the office of the surgeon "
"general said in a press conference today.  \"It's an obvious hoax by people "
"just looking for five minutes of fame, or to scare people in these uncertain"
" times.  After all, remember the clown thing a few years ago?\"  A critic "
"pointed to the increasingly widespread viral videos of rioters with clearly "
"fatal injuries rising to return to the rioting.  \"Within ten hours, someone"
" will have deep faked this video to make me look like a Star Wars "
"character,\" replied the spokesperson, \"and you're confused by a bit of "
"home grown CGI showing zombies?\""
msgstr ""
"DIRECTOR DE CIRUGÍA: LOS MUERTOS SE QUEDAN MUERTOS: \"Las historias acerca "
"de los muertos levantándose están completamente infundadas y son médicamente"
" imposibles.\", dice un comunicado de prensa de hoy de la oficina del "
"director de cirugía. \"Es un fraude obvio de gente que solo busca sus cinco "
"minutos de fama, o quiere asustar a las personas en estos tiempos inciertos."
" Después de todo, ¿recuerdan ese payaso de hace unos años?\" Un crítico le "
"señaló los videos ampliamente virales de alborotadores con heridas "
"claramente mortales que se levantan y vuelven al disturbio. \"En menos de "
"diez horas, alguien podrá hacer un deepfake para hacerme parecer como un "
"personaje de Star Wars,\" replicó el vocero, \"y ¿ustedes se dejan confundir"
" por unos zombis hechos con CGI hogareño?\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "years_old_news"
#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
msgid ""
"TECHWORLD NEWS: Toy company at the origin of the successful talking doll "
"rebrands and becomes Uncanny.  A spokesperson from the newly formed Uncanny "
"told the press, \"We think we can do more than just entertain.  We have new "
"plans, big plans, plans that will shape the very fabric of reality!\"  "
"Unconfirmed rumors suggest that Uncanny has already received large orders "
"from the government."
msgstr ""
"NOTICIAS TECNOLÓGICAS: La empresa de juguetes de la exitosa muñeca parlante "
"se renombra y se convierte en Uncanny. Un vocero de la flamante Uncanny le "
"dijo a la prensa, \"Creemos que podemos hacer más que solo entretenimiento. "
"¡Tenemos nuevos planes, grandes planes, planes que le darán forma a la tela "
"de la realidad!\" Rumores sin confirmar sugieren que Uncanny ya ha recibido "
"grandes pedidos por parte del gobierno."

#. ~ Snippet in category "one_year_old_news"
#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
msgid ""
"TECHWORLD NEWS: Uncanny unveils its new product - the Grocery Bot!  "
"Thousands of else-if statements, pre-recorded voice from professional "
"actors, what more does this adorable android hides under its smiling face?  "
"Our expert got the answer for you!"
msgstr ""
"NOTICIAS TECNOLÓGICAS: Uncanny presenta su nuevo producto - ¡el Almacénbot! "
"Miles de sentencias else-if, voces pregrabadas de actores profesionales, "
"¿qué más esconde este adorable androide bajo su rostro sonriente? ¡Nuestro "
"experto tiene la respuesta!"

#. ~ Snippet in category "one_year_old_news"
#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
msgid ""
"TELEPORTATION?  An unidentified source working in a major university "
"contacted multiple media outlets this week with a farfetched story that is "
"nonetheless corroborated by third-party physicists as \"shockingly "
"possible\".  This source, nicknamed \"Deep Space\", describes secret "
"government experimentation into teleportation, dating back to before 2008.  "
"\"When I read the tagline, I just scoffed,\" said Dr. Alice Feyn, a physics "
"professor at MIT.  \"Then I read on.  This is strongly reminiscent of Dr. "
"Takatoshi's lost work.  It feels bizarre to say it, but I think there's a "
"grain of truth to all of this.\"  Dr. Amy Takatoshi was a quantum physicist "
"who went missing, along with all records of her work, in July 2007."
msgstr ""
"¿TELETRANSPORTACIÓN? Una fuente no identificada que trabaja en una "
"universidad importante se contactó con varios medios de comunicación esta "
"semana para dar una historia inverosímil que es no obstante, corroborada por"
" físicos externos como \"asombrosamente posible\". Esta fuente, apodada "
"\"Deep Space\", describe la experimentación secreta del gobierno con la "
"teletransportación, con fecha de antes de 2008. \"Cuando leí el mensaje, "
"simplemente me burlé,\" dijo la Dra. Alice Feyn, una profesora de física en "
"MIT. \"Luego seguí leyendo. Esto es considerablemente similar al trabajo "
"perdido de la Dra. Takatoshi. Se siente extraño decirlo, pero creo que hay "
"un gramo de verdad en todo esto.\" La Dra. Amy Takatoshi era una física "
"cuántica que desapareció junto con todos los registros de su trabajo, en "
"julio de 2007."

#. ~ Snippet in category "years_old_news"
#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
msgid ""
"THE 'UNCANNY' SUCCESS STORY.  Everyone's talking about the meteoric rise of "
"tech startup \"Uncanny\" over the last few months.  From zero to household "
"name, the company leapt to the public eye with its, well, uncanny line of "
"talking toys.  Before we even knew what to expect, they were Wall Street's "
"new darling, with the fastest rise in manufacturing capacity of any company "
"in the last thirty years.  We spoke to James Hawthorne, America's newest "
"billionaire and the man behind the name on everyone's lips.  Interview on "
"page 3."
msgstr ""
"LA HISTORIA DE ÉXITO DE 'UNCANNY'. Todos están hablando del crecimiento "
"meteórico de la empresa de tecnología \"Uncanny\" estos últimos meses. De "
"cero a la fama, la compañía saltó al conocimiento público con su línea de "
"juguetes parlantes asombrosos, justamente. Antes de que supiéramos qué "
"esperar, ya era la preferida de Wall Street con el crecimiento más rápido en"
" capacidad de manufacturación en los últimos treinta años. Hablamos con "
"James Hawthorne, el nuevo billonario de Estados Unidos y el hombre detrás "
"del nombre en boca de todos. Entrevista en página 3."

#. ~ Snippet in category "many_years_old_news"
#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
msgid ""
"THE BATTLE OF LOS ANGELES  February 25, 1942.  Five deaths are now "
"attributed to the sudden appearance of what have been dubbed \"foo "
"fighters,\" in the skies over Los Angeles as terrified citizens, fearing a "
"followup to the unthinkable tragedy at Pearl Harbor, flew into a panic that "
"led to three fatal car accidents and two heart attacks; But it's not what we"
" fear, says Navy Secretary Frank Knox.  Despite the air raid alarm and "
"blackout order, and despite widely reported sightings of strange lights in "
"the western sky under fire from anti-air batteries, the Navy wishes to "
"assure the public that it was all a false alarm.  As for the identity of the"
" mysterious aircraft, early reports suggest they may have been nothing more "
"than weather balloons, blown off course and illuminated not by their own "
"lights, but merely reflecting those on the ground."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "newest_news"
#. ~ Around April 15/16
#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
msgid ""
"THE DEAD WALK.  Amidst the violence of the riots, we can no longer disregard"
" reports of fatally wounded rioters and police forces alike rising and "
"joining the ranks of rioters.  Government sources could not be reached to "
"confirm or deny these reports, but our own reporters confirm it with "
"photographic evidence shown below."
msgstr ""
"LOS MUERTOS CAMINAN. Entre la violencia de los disturbios, ya no podemos "
"ignorar los informes de los alborotadores y policías fatalmente heridos y "
"levantándose y uniéndose a las filas de alborotadores, por igual. Ninguna "
"fuente del gobierno pudo ser contactada para confirmar o negar estos "
"informes, pero nuestros propios corresponsales lo confirman con la evidencia"
" fotográfica que se muestra debajo."

#. ~ Snippet in category "many_years_old_news"
#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
msgid ""
"THE FACE BEHIND THE 'UNCANNY' MASK  Everyone knows about James Hawthorne, "
"projected to become America's newest and fastest rising billionaire by next "
"month as stock value in his tech startup, Uncanny, grows at unprecedented "
"speeds.  We decided to explore the names behind the rise you might not have "
"heard.  Dr. Marc Silverstein, an MIT-trained researcher formerly involved "
"with Leapfrog Industries, has been along for the ride the whole time, and "
"has come out nearly as wealthy as Hawthorne himself.  Though impressively "
"reclusive, we managed to snag some pretty interesting information about Dr. "
"S.  Could he be the real mind behind the rise?  How much does James depend "
"on his right-hand scientist?  Details on page 12."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "one_year_old_news"
#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
msgid ""
"THE FOREIGN DESIGNER DRUG THEY DON'T WANT YOU TO KNOW ABOUT?  Concerning "
"reports from a source in the Boston Police Department have hinted that there"
" is a new drug on the streets.  Move over, fentanyl: this is a new "
"substance, nicknamed Forbidden City.  While it has a lower fatal overdose "
"rate, Forbidden City is many times more addictive than heroin or "
"methamphetamines, and is making its way quickly around the streets."
msgstr ""
"¿EL DISEÑADOR EXTRANJERO DE DROGAS QUE NO QUIEREN QUE CONOZCAS? Unos "
"informes preocupantes de una fuente en el Departamento de Policía de Boston "
"han sugerido que hay una nueva droga en las calles. Correte, fentanyl: esta "
"es una nueva sustancia, apodada la Ciudad Prohibida. Aunque tiene un índice "
"de sobredosis letal bajo, Ciudad Prohibida es varias veces más adictiva que "
"la heroína y las anfetaminas, y se está abriendo espacio rápidamente por las"
" calles."

#. ~ Snippet in category "months_old_news"
#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
msgid ""
"THE MAN BEHIND THE RIOTS.  [Photograph: Interpol identification photograph "
"of Qiang Ye, taken in Maastricht airport in June, 2019.]  Our sources in the"
" UN have informed reporters that the investigative committee in charge of "
"the riots currently engulfing most of the world, nicknamed the \"FriendFace "
"Riots\" for the role of social media in spreading the violence, are the work"
" of a discredited Chinese hacker and alleged intelligence agent, Qiang Ye.  "
"Ye is wanted by Interpol for his involvement in a cyberterror attack on "
"Dutch banks in 2018 that led to billions of dollars of losses for European "
"banks.  The Chinese government has disavowed any connection to Ye since "
"2015.  \"One man, with an army of well-programmed bots at his control, could"
" certainly be behind this,\" said Dr. Ely Savage, a professor of political "
"science at Berkeley and our expert correspondent on the riots.  \"Social "
"media is very susceptible to this sort of influence.\""
msgstr ""
"EL HOMBRE DETRÁS DE LOS DISTURBIOS. [Foto: Fotografía de identificación de "
"Interpol de Qiang Ye, tomada en el aeropuerto Maastricht en junio de 2019.] "
"Nuestras fuentes en la ONU han informado a los periodistas que el comité de "
"investigación a cargo de los disturbios que están actualmente sucediendo en "
"casi todo el mundo, apodados \"Disturbios de FriendFace\" por el rol de la "
"red social en la difusión de la violencia, son obra del hacker chino y "
"supuesto agente de inteligencia, Qiang Ye. Ye es buscado por Interpol por su"
" participación en el ataque de ciberterrorismo a los bancos holandeses en "
"2018 que causó billones de dólares en pérdidas para los bancos europeos. El "
"gobierno de China ha negado cualquier conexión con Ye desde 2015. \"Un "
"hombre, controlando un ejército de bots bien programados, podría estar "
"ciertamente detrás de esto,\" dijo el Dr. Ely Savage, profesor de ciencias "
"políticas en Berkeley y nuestro experto en disturbios. \"Las redes sociales "
"son muy susceptibles a esta clase de influencia.\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "months_old_news"
#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
msgid ""
"THE SOLDIER OF THE FUTURE, AT LAST.  The military's latest powered infantry "
"exoskeleton has been released for widespread, non-testing use.  Although "
"numbers are still very limited, official sources say that within two years "
"every infantry unit will have access to two powered exoskeletons for heavy "
"operations.  Within five, light exoskeletons will be the standard issue "
"armor for US ground forces.  \"This is going to put our military so far "
"ahead of the rest of the world, it's like we have guns while they have "
"spears,\" General Alex Findlay said in a press release.  The new armor is "
"powered by a proprietary fuel cell developed by the military and hoped to be"
" ready for civilian distribution in the next few years."
msgstr ""
"EL SOLDADO DEL FUTURO, POR FIN. El último exoesqueleto alimentado de "
"infantería militar ha sido presentado para un uso amplio, sin testeo. Aunque"
" la cantidad todavía es muy limitada, las fuentes oficiales dicen que dentro"
" de dos años cada unidad de infantería tendrá acceso a dos exoesqueletos "
"para las operaciones más grandes. Dentro de cinco, los exoesqueletos ligeros"
" serán la armadura estándar de las fuerzas de tierra de los Estados Unidos. "
"\"Esto pondrá a nuestro ejército tan adelantado al resto del mundo que es "
"como si tuviéramos armas y ellos, lanzas,\" dijo el general Alex Findlay en "
"el parte de prensa. La nueva armadura está alimentada por una celda de "
"combustible exclusiva, desarrollada por el ejército y que se espera que esté"
" disponible para distribución civil en los próximos años."

#. ~ Snippet in category "weeks_old_news"
#. ~ Around the start of April
#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
msgid ""
"THEY FLY THE SKIES.  It spreads its wings and the sun blocks out.  It "
"strikes the helicopter from the sky with a simple wave of its claw.  It "
"rains spittle down on our faces and we dissolve.  They are coming.  They are"
" coming.  They are coming."
msgstr ""
"VUELAN POR LOS CIELOS. Despliega sus alas y el sol queda bloqueado. Destroza"
" al helicóptero en pleno vuelo con un simple movimiento de su garra. Hace "
"llover su baba sobre nuestras caras y nos disolvemos. Están viniendo. Están "
"viniendo. Están viniendo."

#. ~ Snippet in category "newest_news"
#. ~ Around April 15/16
#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
msgid ""
"THEY WALK OUR EARTH.  They are here.  They are here.  They are here.  They "
"are here.  They are here.  They are here."
msgstr ""
"CAMINAN POR NUESTRA TIERRA. Están acá. Están acá. Están acá. Están acá. "
"Están acá. Están acá."

#. ~ Snippet in category "newest_news"
#. ~ Around April 15/16
#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
msgid ""
"THEY'RE NOT RIOTS!  According to head officials at the Centers for Disease "
"Control, functional MRI studies of rioters have fit autopsy data that "
"suggests these people are under the influence of some sort of mind-altering "
"agent causing erratic, violent behavior.  A source inside the CDC, who did "
"not wish to be named, informed our reporter \"It's not just the rioters.  "
"They're the heaviest affected, but we scanned our own brains when we found "
"out.  It's everyone.  It's in me, and you.  It's in the government.  The "
"military.  God help us all.\""
msgstr ""
"¡NO SON DISTURBIOS! De acuerdo a los oficiales jefe en el Centro de Control "
"de Enfermedades, los estudios de resonancia magnética sobre los "
"alborotadores han sido adecuados a la información de las autopsias que "
"sugieren que estas personas están bajo la influencia de alguna clase de "
"agente alterador de la mente, que causa una conducta errática y violenta. "
"Una fuente dentro del CDC, que no quiso ser identificada, informó a nuestro "
"periodista que \"no es solo los alborotadores. Son los más afectados pero "
"escaneamos nuestros propios cerebros cuando nos enteramos. Está en todos. "
"Está en mí y en vos. Está en el gobierno. El ejército. Que dios nos ayude.\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "months_old_news"
#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
msgid ""
"TIME TRAVEL: TRUTH OR FICTION?  A collection of shocking photographs "
"depicting people and technology years before they should have existed!"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "months_old_news"
#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
msgid ""
"UFO CRASH: TRUTH OR FICTION?  One civilian account claims a shining disk "
"appeared in his field.  \"It kind of glowed, and I could see a strange gray "
"world through it.  Then a shambling hazy purple mushroom came through, "
"man.\""
msgstr ""
"OVNI ESTRELLADO: ¿REALIDAD O FICCIÓN? Un civil asegura que un disco "
"brillante apareció en su campo. \"Más o menos brillaba, y pude ver un mundo "
"raro y gris a través de él. Después, un hongo púrpura borroso y desordenado "
"salió de adentro, loco.\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "weeks_old_news"
#. ~ Around the start of April
#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
msgid ""
"UNCANNY VALLEY.  Faced with accusations of malfeasance in his AI designs, "
"James Hawthorne appears to have *disappeared*.  Hawthorne could not be "
"reached for comment by any major news centers, as questions and even "
"lawsuits about dangerous flaws in his widespread law enforcement AI packages"
" rise."
msgstr ""
"UNCANNY VALLEY. Enfrentando acusaciones de actividad ilícita en sus diseños "
"de IA, James Hawthorne parece haber *desaparecido*. Hawthorne no puedo ser "
"localizado para una entrevista por ninguno de las agencias de noticias más "
"importantes, dado que surgieron preguntas y demandas legales acerca de "
"fallas peligrosas en los equipos de IA para fuerzas de la ley."

#. ~ Snippet in category "one_year_old_news"
#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
msgid ""
"UNCANNY: SHADOWS IN PARADISE.  Uncanny, a tech development firm that has "
"gone from nothing to a household name throughout the United States in the "
"last two years, has been a hot topic since they entered the limelight.  We "
"all know about James Hawthorne and his charismatic combination of sarcastic "
"quipping and insightful observations.  Everyone has seen his tweets, and his"
" TED Talk went viral last year.  Behind the smokescreen, though, hides labor"
" practices that have left employees scarred and, in some cases, permanently "
"unable to work.  Did you know that Uncanny's Portland manufacturing site "
"tried unsuccessfully to unionize last month?  I bet you didn't.  Did you "
"know that four union organizers disappeared prior to the vote?  I bet you "
"didn't.  Are you wondering why none of this was reported?  So am I."
msgstr ""
"UNCANNY: SOMBRAS EN EL PARAÍSO. Uncanny, una empresa de desarrollo "
"tecnológico que fue de la nada a la fama por todo Estados Unidos en los "
"últimos dos años, ha estado en el candelero desde que llegaron al "
"conocimiento público. Todos conocemos a James Hawthorne y su combinación "
"carismática de ocurrencias sarcásticas y observaciones perspicaces. Todos "
"vieron sus tweets y su charla TED fue viral el año pasado. Detrás de la "
"cortina de humo, sin embargo, esconde prácticas laborales que han dejado a "
"los empleados traumados y, en algunos casos, incapaces de trabajar. ¿Sabías "
"que la fábrica de Portland de Uncanny intentó sindicalizarse sin conseguirlo"
" el mes pasado? Seguro que no sabías. ¿Sabías que cuatro sindicalistas "
"desaparecieron antes de la votación? Seguro que no sabías. ¿No te preguntás "
"por qué nadie informó estas cosas? Yo lo voy a hacer."

#. ~ Snippet in category "many_years_old_news"
#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
msgid ""
"US IGNORES UN DEMANDS  The US ambassador to the UN today turned down UN "
"requests to begin mutual nuclear disarmament of China, the US and North "
"Korea.  \"We have a right to defend ourselves,\" insisted the ambassador.  "
"\"We'll back down when they do\"."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "weeks_old_news"
#. ~ Around the start of April
#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
msgid ""
"VIOLENCE OUTBREAKS ARE UNIVERSAL.  Despite government efforts to claim the "
"situation is \"under control\", sources in the CDC have confirmed our own "
"investigative results: there are now major unchecked riots in every city in "
"the United States.  Similar reports are trickling in from countries across "
"the globe.  We recommend packing a bugout bag and heading to your cabin on "
"the lake, if you have one."
msgstr ""
"LOS BROTES DE VIOLENCIA SON UNIVERSALES. A pesar de los esfuerzos del "
"gobierno para declarar la situación \"bajo control\", fuentes en el CDC han "
"confirmado nuestros propios resultados de investigaciones: en este momento "
"hay disturbios desenfrenados en cada ciudad de los Estados Unidos. Informes "
"similares están llegando de distintos países del planeta. Recomendamos "
"armarse un bolso e irse a una cabaña en el lago, si es que tienen una."

#. ~ Snippet in category "months_old_news"
#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
msgid ""
"VIOLENT OUTBREAKS CAUSED BY DRUG CONTAMINATION: Reports of riots being a "
"social media effect were disputed today by NSA spokesperson Colonel Shawn "
"Singer.  \"These are isolated incidents.  There is no evidence of any social"
" media articles that are causing them, here or abroad.  The violence is "
"random and senseless.  We are currently investigating a promising theory "
"that a malicious contamination effect of the street drug methothexazole, "
"known as 'Forbidden City', is responsible.  Whatever the cause, the National"
" Guard has these riots very well contained.\""
msgstr ""
"BROTES DE VIOLENCIA CAUSADOS POR CONTAMINACIÓN CON DROGAS: Los informes de "
"disturbios como efecto de las redes sociales fueron negadas hoy por el "
"vocero de NSA, el coronel Shawn Singer. \"Son incidentes aislados. No hay "
"evidencia de ningún artículo en las redes sociales que los estén causando, "
"ni acá ni en otra parte del mundo. La violencia es aleatoria y sin sentido. "
"Estamos investigando actualmente una prometedora teoría sobre un efecto "
"malicioso de contaminación de la droga callejera metotexazol, conocida como "
"'Ciudad Prohibida', que podría ser responsable de los hechos. Sea cual fuere"
" la causa, la Guardia Nacional tiene bien contenidos estos disturbios.\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "weeks_old_news"
#. ~ Around the start of April
#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
msgid ""
"WATCH POWER ARMOR IN ACTION.  The National Guard deployed a recently-"
"commissioned unit of heavy riot control power armor exoskeletons to the "
"front lines of the riots in Waterville, Maine.  This state of the art armor "
"is able to repel almost any attack from a civilian rioter, and has been sent"
" forward alongside infantry armed with pepper bullets and sponge rounds to "
"contain rioters.  \"It's an uphill battle, but we've still got it "
"contained,\" said Lieutenant Shawn Bhatti from inside his full-enclosure "
"suit.  \"I can subdue a dozen rioters in this thing, and I've got a dozen "
"men and women with me.\"  Video of the power armor in action will be "
"streamed on our website."
msgstr ""
"VEAN LA ARMADURA ALIMENTADA EN ACCIÓN. La Guardia Nacional desplegó una "
"unidad contratada recientemente de exoesqueletos de armadura alimentada "
"antidisturbios en las líneas frontales de los disturbios en Waterville, "
"Maine. Esta armadura de última generación es capaz de repeler casi cualquier"
" ataque de un alborotador civil y ha sido enviada junto a infantería armada "
"con gas pimienta y balas de goma para contener los disturbios. \"Es una "
"batalla cuesta arriba pero todavía lo tenemos controlado,\" dijo el teniente"
" Shawn Bhatti desde su traje completamente cerrado. \"Puedo reprimir a una "
"decena de alborotadores con esta cosa, y tengo una decena de hombres y "
"mujeres conmigo.\" Imágenes de la armadura alimentada en acción serán "
"transmitidas desde nuestro sitio web."

#. ~ Snippet in category "one_year_old_news"
#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
msgid ""
"WHEN I DID MY TIME.  We spoke to Dan Huang, the Chinese-American author of the New York Times bestselling exposé \"When I Did my Time\", the story of his three years living with his extended family in China, immersed in what he describes as \"The ever-escalating anti-American propaganda of the East.\"\n"
"\n"
"\"It's a real threat,\" said Huang.  \"They are being taught to hate our freedom, and our technology.  Mark my words: there is going to be a reckoning, and we need to be ready.\""
msgstr ""
"CUANDO CUMPLÍ CONDENA. Hablamos con Dan Huang, el autor chino-estadounidense de una de las exclusivas más vendidas del New York Times, \"Cuando cumplí condena\", la historia de sus tres años viviendo con su familia extendida en China, inmerso en lo que él describe como \"La propaganda antiestadounidense siempre creciente del este.\"\n"
"\n"
"\"Es una verdadera amenaza,\" dijo Huang. \"Les están enseñando a odiar nuestra libertad y nuestra tecnología. Recuerden mis palabras: va a haber un revolución y necesitamos estar preparados.\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "weeks_old_news"
#. ~ Around the start of April
#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
msgid ""
"YOUR BUG-OUT BAG.  In this issue we focus on tips and tricks to packing your"
" bug-out bag.  Whether you're near an urban center or in a small town, if "
"you don't already have an emergency kit, you need one while supplies are "
"still available.  Don't be the one person caught without a lighter when you "
"need a fire!"
msgstr ""
"TU BOLSO PARA HUIR. En este capítulo nos concentramos en los consejos y "
"trucos para armar un bolso listo para salir huyendo. Ya sea que estés cerca "
"de un centro urbano o en un pequeño pueblo, si no tenés armado un kit de "
"emergencia, vas a necesitar armar uno mientras los recursos todavía lo hagan"
" posible. ¡No seas la persona que no tiene un encendedor cuando necesitás un"
" fuego!"

#. ~ Snippet in category "weeks_old_news"
#. ~ Around the start of April
#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
msgid ""
"ZOMBIE DRUG?  A controversial blogger suggested the recent riots are a "
"chemical attack by China in her latest podcast.  \"They're jealous of our "
"military superiority, so they teamed up with Haiti to put hoodoo drugs in "
"the water making people zombies!  You've all heard of Forbidden City, who "
"hasn't?  well, this is what they were testing, and now we're seeing it "
"everywhere!\""
msgstr ""
"¿DROGA ZOMBI? Un controversial blogger sugirió en su último podcast que los "
"disturbios recientes son un ataque químico de China. \"Están celosos de "
"nuestra superioridad militar así que se ¡juntaron en Haití para poner drogas"
" hoodoo en el agua y convertir a la gente en zombis! Todos escucharon hablar"
" de la Ciudad Prohibida, ¿o no? Bueno, esto es lo que están probando ¡y "
"ahora lo estamos viendo en todos lados!\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "newest_news"
#. ~ Around April 15/16
#: data/json/snippets/newspapers.json
msgid ""
"ZOMBIES!  Whether they're all the rioters, or just a few, it is now "
"undeniable: the dead walk among the living, adding to the ranks of the "
"psychos ripping our country apart from the inside.  Full photo evidence "
"inside."
msgstr ""
"¡ZOMBIS! Ya sea que sean todos los alborotadores o solamente algunos, ya no "
"se puede negar: los muertos caminan entre los vivos, uniéndose a las filas "
"de psicópatas destrozando nuestro país desde adentro. Incluimos evidencia "
"fotográfica."

#. ~ Snippet in category "nightmares"
#: data/json/snippets/nightmares.json
msgid ""
"In your dream, you are tied to a chair.  You hear a deep voice slowly recite"
" what torments await sinners in hell as you are slowly lowered into a dark "
"pit.  As your vision fades, a large metal hatch closes you into the "
"darkness."
msgstr ""
"En el sueño, estás atado a una silla. Escuchás una voz grave recitando "
"lentamente los tormentos que le esperan a los pecadores como vos, bajando "
"hacia un pozo oscuro. Cuando tu visión desaparece, una trampilla metálica "
"grande se cierra y te deja en la oscuridad."

#. ~ Snippet in category "nightmares"
#: data/json/snippets/nightmares.json
msgid ""
"In your dreams you feel as though you've learned something really, really "
"important.  You wake up in quiet distress, as you've already forgotten what "
"that something was."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "nightmares"
#: data/json/snippets/nightmares.json
msgid ""
"It's your first day at work!  Unfortunately, the bus had to take a three-"
"hour detour, so you show up extremely late.  As you walk into the office, "
"you suddenly realize you forgot to put your pants on.  Even worse, your "
"mother walks in behind you and starts berating you in front of all your co-"
"workers.  As the entire office laughs at you, you wake up from your "
"nightmare."
msgstr ""
"¡Es tu primer día de trabajo! Lamentablemente, el colectivo se tuvo que "
"desviar del recorrido así que llegaste muy tarde. Cuando entrabas en la "
"oficina, te diste cuenta que te olvidaste de ponerte los pantalones. Y peor,"
" tu vieja aparece atrás tuyo y empieza a retarte adelante de tus compañeros "
"de trabajo. Mientras toda la oficina se ríe de vos, te despertás de la "
"pesadilla."

#. ~ Snippet in category "nightmares"
#: data/json/snippets/nightmares.json
msgid ""
"You abruptly awake, relief washes over you as you were no longer naked in "
"the street, and the zombies weren't laughing at you."
msgstr ""
"Te despertás abruptamente con una sensación de alivio por no estar desnudo "
"en la calle y los zombis no se estaban riendo de vos."

#. ~ Snippet in category "nightmares"
#: data/json/snippets/nightmares.json
msgid ""
"You are in a meadow, unsure of how you got here.  The sun is shining, the "
"birds are singing, and children are playing; all is peaceful.  So why do the"
" hairs on your neck stand at attention?  Something is not quite right about "
"this peace.  You turn around, and the children have you surrounded.  The "
"faces of the children have vanished, replaced by a shark-like grin and beady"
" black eyes.  They reach out with their pale, claw-like hands.  However, you"
" cannot move, you cannot escape…"
msgstr ""
"Estás en una pradera, no estás seguro cómo llegaste hasta acá. El sol "
"brilla, los pajaritos cantan y los niños están jugando; todo en paz. Así que"
" no entendés por qué se te pararon los pelos del cuello. Algo no está bien "
"en esta paz. Te das vuelta y los chicos te rodearon. Sus caras "
"desaparecieron, fueron reemplazadas por una mueca similar a un tiburón y "
"ojos negros pequeños y brillantes. Te tratan de agarrar con sus manos como "
"garras pálidas. Sin embargo, no te podés mover, no podés escapar…"

#. ~ Snippet in category "nightmares"
#: data/json/snippets/nightmares.json
msgid ""
"You awaken feeling hollow; you dreamt of your friends and family, only to "
"realize your new reality is the nightmare."
msgstr ""
"Te despertás sintiéndote vacío; soñaste con tus amigos y familiares solo "
"para darte cuenta que tu nueva realidad es una pesadilla."

#. ~ Snippet in category "nightmares"
#: data/json/snippets/nightmares.json
msgid ""
"You awaken from a nightmare about an unseen predator slowly killing you."
msgstr ""
"Te despertás de una pesadilla en la que un depredador que no podías ver te "
"mataba lentamente."

#. ~ Snippet in category "nightmares"
#: data/json/snippets/nightmares.json
msgid ""
"You awaken from a nightmare about being a limbless zombie in a decrepit "
"building."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "nightmares"
#: data/json/snippets/nightmares.json
msgid ""
"You awaken from a nightmare about being eaten alive by something terrible."
msgstr ""
"Te despertás de una pesadilla en la que eras comido vivo por algo terrible."

#. ~ Snippet in category "nightmares"
#: data/json/snippets/nightmares.json
msgid ""
"You awaken from a nightmare about being eaten alive while your friends "
"applaud."
msgstr ""
"Te despertás de una pesadilla en la que eras comido vivo mientras tus amigos"
" aplaudían."

#. ~ Snippet in category "nightmares"
#: data/json/snippets/nightmares.json
msgid ""
"You awaken from a nightmare about being finally judged for your ill deeds."
msgstr ""
"Te despertás de una pesadilla en la que eras finalmente juzgado por todos "
"tus pecados."

#. ~ Snippet in category "nightmares"
#: data/json/snippets/nightmares.json
msgid ""
"You awaken from a nightmare about being forced to watch as your loved ones "
"are executed."
msgstr ""
"Te despertás de una pesadilla en la que eras forzado a mirar como eran "
"ejecutados tus seres queridos."

#. ~ Snippet in category "nightmares"
#: data/json/snippets/nightmares.json
msgid ""
"You awaken from a nightmare about being naked in an arctic tundra and "
"freezing to death."
msgstr ""
"Te despertás de una pesadilla en la que estabas desnudo en la tundra ártica "
"y muriéndote de frío."

#. ~ Snippet in category "nightmares"
#: data/json/snippets/nightmares.json
msgid ""
"You awaken from a nightmare about drowning in a pit of maggots - chewing and"
" biting your skin, filling your lungs."
msgstr ""
"Te despertás de una pesadilla en la que te ahogabas en un pozo de larvas - "
"que te masticaban y mordían la piel, llenándote los pulmones."

#. ~ Snippet in category "nightmares"
#: data/json/snippets/nightmares.json
msgid "You awaken from a nightmare about dying of thirst in a desert."
msgstr ""
"Te despertás de una pesadilla en la que te morías de sed en el desierto."

#. ~ Snippet in category "nightmares"
#: data/json/snippets/nightmares.json
msgid ""
"You awaken from a nightmare about falling into a lake with a cannonball tied"
" to your feet."
msgstr ""
"Te despertás de una pesadilla en la que caías a un lago con una bala de "
"cañón atada a tus pies."

#. ~ Snippet in category "nightmares"
#: data/json/snippets/nightmares.json
msgid ""
"You awaken from a nightmare about killing those you love with your bare "
"hands."
msgstr ""
"Te despertás de una pesadilla en la que matabas a tus seres queridos con tus"
" manos."

#. ~ Snippet in category "nightmares"
#: data/json/snippets/nightmares.json
msgid ""
"You awaken from a nightmare about slipping out of a plane, into a pitch "
"black sky."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "nightmares"
#: data/json/snippets/nightmares.json
msgid "You awaken from a nightmare about slowly going insane."
msgstr ""
"Te despertás de una pesadilla en la que te ibas volviendo loco lentamente."

#. ~ Snippet in category "nightmares"
#: data/json/snippets/nightmares.json
msgid "You awaken from a nightmare about suffocating in a small metal box."
msgstr ""
"Te despertás de una pesadilla en la que te sofocabas adentro de una pequeña "
"caja de metal."

#. ~ Snippet in category "nightmares"
#: data/json/snippets/nightmares.json
msgid ""
"You awaken from a nightmare about the Cataclysm happening over and over "
"again."
msgstr ""
"Te despertás de una pesadilla en la que el Cataclismo sucedía una y otra "
"vez."

#. ~ Snippet in category "nightmares"
#: data/json/snippets/nightmares.json
msgid ""
"You awaken from a nightmare about the Cataclysm not having happened and "
"being stuck in an office job."
msgstr ""
"Te despertás de una pesadilla en la que no había ningún Cataclismo y estabas"
" atrapado en un trabajo de oficina."

#. ~ Snippet in category "nightmares"
#: data/json/snippets/nightmares.json
msgid "You awaken from a nightmare about the deaths of your loved ones."
msgstr "Te despertás de una pesadilla sobre la muerte de tus seres queridos."

#. ~ Snippet in category "nightmares"
#: data/json/snippets/nightmares.json
msgid "You awaken from a nightmare about the end of the world."
msgstr "Te despertás de una pesadilla sobre el fin del mundo."

#. ~ Snippet in category "nightmares"
#: data/json/snippets/nightmares.json
msgid "You awaken from a nightmare about your loved ones stabbing you."
msgstr ""
"Te despertás de una pesadilla en la que tus seres queridos te apuñalaban."

#. ~ Snippet in category "nightmares"
#: data/json/snippets/nightmares.json
msgid ""
"You awaken from a nightmare.  Recent events had not come to pass, and you "
"were stuck in an office job."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "nightmares"
#: data/json/snippets/nightmares.json
msgid ""
"You awaken from a nightmare.  This wasn't the end of the world… all those "
"innocents you've murdered."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "nightmares"
#: data/json/snippets/nightmares.json
msgid ""
"You awaken in a cold sweat, relieved that you weren't being eaten alive by "
"evil Twinkies."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "nightmares"
#: data/json/snippets/nightmares.json
msgid ""
"You dream of flying.  You fly higher and higher until you are in outer "
"space.  You look back at Earth and see that it's cracked - something is "
"hatching and a thousand crimson eyes are fixated on you."
msgstr ""
"Soñás que volás. Volás cada vez más alto hasta que estás en el espacio "
"exterior. Mirás hacia la Tierra y ves que está rajada - algo está saliendo y"
" miles de ojos rojos te miran fijo."

#. ~ Snippet in category "nightmares"
#: data/json/snippets/nightmares.json
msgid ""
"You dream of running in an endless hallway.  You hear something gargantuan "
"chasing you with heavy breaths and wet squelching sounds.  You run until you"
" are out of breath and wake up feeling exhausted."
msgstr ""
"Soñás que estás corriendo por un pasillo infinito. Escuchás algo colosal "
"persiguiéndote de respiración fuerte y haciendo ruido de chapoteo. Corrés "
"hasta que te quedás sin aliento y te despertás exhausto."

#. ~ Snippet in category "nightmares"
#: data/json/snippets/nightmares.json
msgid ""
"You dream that you're leaning over a bathroom sink, trying to pull loose a "
"wisdom tooth that's been slicing up your gums.  You succeed in yanking it "
"out and it clatters into the sink - the tooth is six inches long, jagged and"
" serrated like the blade of a nasty dagger, with a crack in the enamel "
"giving way to pink tissue underneath.  The taste of blood still lingers in "
"your mouth for a moment even after you wake up."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "nightmares"
#: data/json/snippets/nightmares.json
msgid ""
"You feel as if you are being watched.  Several feet away from you are a pair"
" of burning yellow eyes.  A long, slimy appendage snakes its way towards "
"you, hauling you towards an abyssal pit of serrated teeth."
msgstr ""
"Sentís como si te estuvieran mirando. Varios metros más allá ves un par de "
"ojos amarillos llameantes. Un apéndice largo y baboso se mueve como una "
"serpiente hacia vos, llevándote hacia un pozo abismal de dientes."

#. ~ Snippet in category "nightmares"
#: data/json/snippets/nightmares.json
msgid ""
"You feel something gently embrace you as you sleep.  You open your eyes, but"
" it's too dark to see, you struggle to move, but it has your arms and legs "
"in a cocoon of darkness, it has stolen your mouth and you cannot scream.  It"
" starts to devour you whole, starting with your feet, unable to escape, and "
"unable to scream.  You take your last breaths.  It was just a dream."
msgstr ""
"Sentís que algo gentil te abraza mientras dormís. Abrís los ojos pero está "
"muy oscuro para ver, luchás para poder moverte pero tiene tus brazos y "
"piernas envueltos en oscuridad, te robó la boca y no podés gritar. Comienza "
"a devorarte completamente, primero los pies, incapaz de escapar, e incapaz "
"de gritar. Tomás tus últimas respiraciones. Fue solo un sueño."

#. ~ Snippet in category "nightmares"
#: data/json/snippets/nightmares.json
msgid ""
"You fitfully dreamed horrid, fleeting dreams for the past several days.  "
"Each time you plunged into slumber, you always ended up in the same place.  "
"You would be in one of the decrepit residential flats of an old burned-down "
"building.  The dream merely consisted of you heading to the bathroom to wash"
" your hair over the sink.  The problem was that you could feel someone "
"approaching in the distance.  Every night, footsteps appeared to be getting "
"closer.  Last week, you managed to see the door to your flat opening as you "
"headed for the bathroom.  Outside stood a man, cloaked in heavy shadow, his "
"breathing stifled.  Four days ago, he reached the living room.  Two days "
"ago, he stood right next to you as you entered the restroom.  His eyes were "
"dull and resembled cracked, foggy glass.  His hands clutched a rusty knife."
"  Yesterday, he followed you in.  Today, he stared unblinking as you washed "
"your hair.  Out of the corner of your eye as your cleaned yourself, you saw "
"him scribbling something on the wall with a thick, dark red liquid.  The "
"viscous trail of crimson shocked you awake.  It read: Tomorrow."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "nightmares"
#: data/json/snippets/nightmares.json
msgid ""
"You flee in a panic into a nearby school bathroom.  Mr. ____, he was chasing"
" you.  You had your doubts but now you were sure.  As you try your best to "
"calm your ragged breathing, you rush into an unlocked stall to hide.  The "
"proof was right here.  Every wall of the stall was covered in soulless eyes."
"  They were painted.  Except for one.  One of the eyes was hollow.  It was "
"used as a cover to hide a hole leading to the next-door stall.  Mr. ____ "
"would secretly spy on the students.  You had evidence of his misdemeanor.  "
"You frantically message your friends with the footage, asking them to "
"contact the authorities.  You tell them you are not in a position to call "
"them yourself.  Suddenly, you look up, and find Mr. ____ staring at you as "
"he climbs down from the locked stall door.  You wake up screaming, still "
"reeling from the nightmare."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "nightmares"
#: data/json/snippets/nightmares.json
msgid ""
"You have a long and vivid nightmare about living in an old, poorly "
"ventilated building with countless other people.  The air is humid and "
"stuffy, every room is brightly lit and the people are always yelling and "
"making noise.  You try to get some rest but you can't.  You try using the "
"restroom but it's too cramped.  It gets so unbearable that you feel sick, "
"and you find that you've gagged yourself awake."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "nightmares"
#: data/json/snippets/nightmares.json
msgid ""
"You have a strange dream about walking through a street from your childhood,"
" where every surface is the same shade of solid red.  You wake up startled "
"after noticing an equally red man down the street, moving quickly in your "
"direction."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "nightmares"
#: data/json/snippets/nightmares.json
msgid ""
"You hear a voice in the distance proclaiming that the Son of Man would soon "
"arrive.  It was the one we had all been waiting for, for so long.  You smile"
" in quiet rapture as angels start descending from Heaven.  Up above, seated "
"upon a golden throne, brighter than the Sun, and more mysterious than the "
"Moon, you see a blinding white light.  As you shed tears of infinite bliss, "
"you peer deeper into the luminous source out of curiosity, and see… horns?  "
"You are startled awake by the revelation."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "nightmares"
#: data/json/snippets/nightmares.json
msgid ""
"You open your eyes and find yourself in a school hallway.  It's high school."
"  Students are filing past one another to reach their respective classrooms."
"  You begin heading for your class as well, when you distinctly hear a soft "
"voice crying out for help.  Startled, you go into a half-sprint and rush to "
"where the noises are coming from.  You end up in front of one of the student"
" bathrooms.  The weeping seems to be echoing from the ladies' restroom, and "
"you brace yourself for the worst and barge in.  The abrupt silence catches "
"you off guard, and of the four stalls, one seems to be painted entirely "
"black.  You creep towards it and silently push ajar the entrance.  You find "
"with abject terror a naked baby blown to horrific proportions wailing out "
"his lungs.  The macabre dread deadens your heart as you realize.  This was "
"how you were birthed into this world."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "nightmares"
#: data/json/snippets/nightmares.json
msgid ""
"You open your eyes to a blinding light, surrounded by medical equipment, and"
" a group of panicking individuals dressed in blue scrubs.  They seem to be "
"doctors.  Your vision is blurry from the anesthesia, but one of them seems "
"to be holding a mass of flesh; it appears to be alive.  You glance down and "
"find your chest has been cut open.  The doctors start screaming as the mass "
"of flesh rips them apart.  You are next…"
msgstr ""
"Abrís los ojos y ves una luz cegadora, rodeado de equipamiento médico y un "
"grupo de individuos en pánico vestidos con ropa desechable azul. Parecen ser"
" médicos. Tu visión está borrosa por la anestesia pero uno parece estar "
"sosteniendo una masa de carne, que parece estar viva. Mirás hacia abajo y te"
" ves el pecho abierto. Los médicos empiezan a gritar cuando la masa de carne"
" los destroza. Sos el siguiente…"

#. ~ Snippet in category "nightmares"
#: data/json/snippets/nightmares.json
msgid ""
"You open your eyes, and you are not where you slept.  You have been strapped"
" to a chair in a dimly lit room with damp, rusty walls.  A clown covered in "
"blood splatters approaches you from behind, wielding a rusty drill, dancing "
"around you until he meets you face to face.  He toys with the trigger, "
"enjoying the sound.  You plead for him to let you go, he replies with this "
"maniacal laugh.  He inches the roaring drill towards your face, playing with"
" you, for you are his toy.  You can't help but to watch in horror as the "
"drill bit slowly inches its way towards your eye, unable to look away and "
"unable to close your eyes.  This is it."
msgstr ""
"Abrís los ojos y no estás donde estabas durmiendo. Estás atado a una silla "
"en una habitación poco iluminada con paredes húmedas y oxidadas. Un payaso "
"cubierto con manchas de sangre se te acerca desde atrás con un taladro "
"oxidado, bailando alrededor tuyo hasta que se te pone cara a cara. Juega con"
" el gatillo, disfrutando del sonido. Le suplicás que te deje ir, te responde"
" con una risa maniática. Mueve lentamente el taladro hacia tu cara, jugando "
"con vos porque sos su juguete. No podés evitar mirar el terror del taladro "
"acercándose lentamente hacia tu ojo, incapaz de mirar hacia otro lado o de "
"cerrar los ojos. Acá termina todo."

#. ~ Snippet in category "nightmares"
#: data/json/snippets/nightmares.json
msgid ""
"You regain consciousness and realize you are at the bottom of a deep pit.  "
"You can make out a bucket just opposite of you.  Within the bucket you find "
"a bottle of lotion."
msgstr ""
"Recobrás la consciencia y te das cuenta que estás en el fondo de un pozo "
"profundo. Podés ver un balde frente a vos. Dentro del balde hay una botella "
"con crema."

#. ~ Snippet in category "nightmares"
#: data/json/snippets/nightmares.json
msgid ""
"You try to get comfortable.  You hear a loud skittering sound but see "
"nothing.  The sound grows louder, and yet you see nothing.  Desperate, you "
"search for the source of the sound, you find nothing except for an itch in "
"your ear.  You reach to scratch it, causing hundreds of tiny spiders to "
"burst out, you find the source of the sound."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "nightmares"
#: data/json/snippets/nightmares.json
msgid "You wake up feeling that you lost something important."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "nightmares"
#: data/json/snippets/nightmares.json
msgid ""
"You're outside in a park, under a dark gray sky.  The air is thick, and "
"smells like earth.  You hear thunder crack above you, and it begins to rain."
"  As you look up, you realize with horror that it's raining spiders.  The "
"creatures land all over your body, and you try to cover your mouth and nose "
"but a few manage to slip through your hands.  You can feel the spiders "
"inside your lungs.  You try to scream, but your mouth is full of them.  "
"Tears stream down your face as you choke on millions of tiny black spiders."
"  You wake up gasping for air."
msgstr ""
"Estás en un parque, bajo un cielo gris oscuro. El aire está espeso y hay "
"olor a tierra. Escuchás un trueno arriba tuyo y empieza a llover. Cuando "
"mirás para arriba te das cuenta espantado que está lloviendo arañas. Las "
"criaturas caen sobre tu cuerpo, intentás cubrirte la boca y la nariz pero "
"algunas logran meterse entre tus manos. Podés sentir las arañas en tus "
"pulmones. Intentás gritar pero ya tenés la boca llena de arañas. Te caen "
"lágrimas por la cara y te ahogás por millones de pequeñas arañas negras. "
"Despertás intentando respirar."

#. ~ Snippet in category "npc_socialize"
#: data/json/snippets/npc_quips.json
msgid "Did you see the <weird_sky_thing> in the sky last night, too?"
msgstr "¿Viste el/a <weird_sky_thing> en el cielo anoche?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "npc_socialize"
#: data/json/snippets/npc_quips.json
msgid "Do you ever think about the ethics of killing <zombies>?"
msgstr "¿Alguna vez pensaste si es ético matar <zombies>?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "npc_socialize"
#: data/json/snippets/npc_quips.json
msgid "Do you ever think that we're in some kind of simulation?"
msgstr "¿Nunca pensaste que tal vez estemos en una clase de simulación?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "npc_socialize"
#: data/json/snippets/npc_quips.json
msgid ""
"Do you think living on a farm is dangerous because the roosters might "
"attract <zombies>?"
msgstr ""
"¿Te parece que sería peligroso vivir en una granja porque los gallos podrían"
" atraer <zombies>?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "npc_socialize"
#: data/json/snippets/npc_quips.json
msgid ""
"Don't tell anyone else, but sometimes I like to sleep holding my teddy bear."
msgstr ""
"No le digas a nadie pero a veces me gusta dormir agarrando mi osito de "
"peluche."

#. ~ Snippet in category "npc_socialize"
#: data/json/snippets/npc_quips.json
msgid "Geez, this is nothing like those Hollywood zombie films!"
msgstr ""
"¡Bue, esto no tiene nada que ver con las películas de zombis de Hollywood!"

#. ~ Snippet in category "npc_socialize"
#: data/json/snippets/npc_quips.json
msgid "I am SO glad I don't need to deal with taxes or debt anymore."
msgstr ""
"Me pone MUY contento ya no tener que preocuparme por impuestos ni deudas."

#. ~ Snippet in category "npc_socialize"
#: data/json/snippets/npc_quips.json
msgid ""
"I have dreamt of owning a house by the sea, but now I have nightmares of "
"what lurks beneath the waves."
msgstr ""
"He soñado con tener una casa al lado del mar pero ahora tengo pesadillas con"
" las cosas que acechan debajo de las olas."

#. ~ Snippet in category "npc_socialize"
#: data/json/snippets/npc_quips.json
msgid ""
"I liked walking through the forest, listening to the chirping of the birds "
"but now I am afraid that the birds might devour me."
msgstr ""
"Me gustaba caminar por el bosque, escuchar a los pajaritos pero ahora tengo "
"miedo que los pájaros me quieran comer."

#. ~ Snippet in category "npc_socialize"
#: data/json/snippets/npc_quips.json
msgid ""
"I still think about when the rioters and my neighbors tore each other to "
"shreds…"
msgstr ""
"Todavía pienso cuando los manifestantes y mis vecinos se hicieron pedazos "
"entre sí…"

#. ~ Snippet in category "npc_socialize"
#: data/json/snippets/npc_quips.json
msgid "I used to have a cat.  I really miss Mr. Cuddles…"
msgstr "Tenía un gato. Extraño mucho al Sr. Arrumaco…"

#. ~ Snippet in category "npc_socialize"
#: data/json/snippets/npc_quips.json
msgid "It's nice to know that the <zombies> don't feel pain."
msgstr "Es bueno saber que <zombies> no sienten dolor."

#. ~ Snippet in category "npc_socialize"
#: data/json/snippets/npc_quips.json
msgid ""
"My friends and I used to play cops-and-robbers, except with zombies.  Never "
"thought I'd be in it for real…"
msgstr ""
"Con mis amigos jugábamos a policías y ladrones pero con zombis. Nunca pensé "
"que iba a volverse real…"

#. ~ Snippet in category "npc_socialize"
#: data/json/snippets/npc_quips.json
msgid ""
"One day I greeted the mailman but his eyes were bloodshot and he "
"aggressively threw letters at me."
msgstr ""
"Un día saludé al cartero pero sus ojos estaban inyectados de sangre y me "
"tiró las cartas de manera agresiva."

#. ~ Snippet in category "npc_socialize"
#: data/json/snippets/npc_quips.json
msgid "So do you like cats or dogs?"
msgstr "¿Vos qué preferís, gatos o perros?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "npc_socialize"
#: data/json/snippets/npc_quips.json
msgid "So is it pronounced gif or gif?"
msgstr "¿Y se pronuncia gif o gif?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "npc_socialize"
#: data/json/snippets/npc_quips.json
msgid ""
"So you wet your toothbrush AFTER you apply toothpaste?  That's so weird."
msgstr ""
"¿Así que mojás el cepillo de dientes DESPUÉS de ponerle dentífrico? Eso es "
"raro."

#. ~ Snippet in category "npc_socialize"
#: data/json/snippets/npc_quips.json
msgid "Somehow, I don't think I'll be going back to my old job anytime soon…"
msgstr "Por alguna razón, no creo que vuelva pronto a mi antiguo trabajo…"

#. ~ Snippet in category "npc_socialize"
#: data/json/snippets/npc_quips.json
msgid "Sometimes I see weird shit in the sky at night."
msgstr "A veces veo cosas raras en el cielo a la noche."

#. ~ Snippet in category "npc_socialize"
#: data/json/snippets/npc_quips.json
msgid ""
"This is nothing compared to just two months ago.  Everything is getting "
"bigger and more dangerous with each day that passes."
msgstr ""
"Esto no es nada comparado con lo que era hace dos meses. Todos se está "
"haciendo más grande y más peligroso cada día que pasa."

#. ~ Snippet in category "npc_socialize"
#: data/json/snippets/npc_quips.json
msgid ""
"We both need to cheer up, so here is a joke: What do you call a sleepy car?"
"  Tired!"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "npc_socialize"
#: data/json/snippets/npc_quips.json
msgid ""
"What do you like to listen to?  Personally I'm into bass-heavy post-glam "
"speed polka."
msgstr ""
"¿Qué te gusta escuchar? A mí me gusta el ritmo polka post-glam con mucho "
"bajo."

#. ~ Snippet in category "npc_socialize"
#: data/json/snippets/npc_quips.json
msgid "What do you think the president is doing right now?"
msgstr "¿Y qué pensás que estará haciendo el presidente en este momento?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "npc_socialize"
#: data/json/snippets/npc_quips.json
msgid "Wherever we end up, at least we're still alive, right?"
msgstr "Sea donde sea que terminemos, por lo menos estamos vivo, ¿no?"

