"Live your life to the fullest, prove to yourself that you can survive this "
"new obstacle in the same way that you have survived the last."
msgstr ""
"Vivir tu vida en todo su esplendor, probarte que podés sobrevivir este nuevo"
" obstáculo de la misma manera que sobreviviste al anterior."

