#. ~ Description of mission "Survive your pursuer"
#: data/json/starting_missions.json
msgid ""
"Since the start of the Cataclysm, something has been hunting you "
"relentlessly.  You can fight it but never truly kill it.  It won't end until"
" you die."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mission "Kill your pursuer"
#: data/json/starting_missions.json
msgid ""
"Since the start of the Cataclysm, something has been hunting you "
"relentlessly.  You can outrun it but never truly escape it.  It won't end "
"until one of you dies."
msgstr ""
"Desde el comienzo del Cataclismo, algo te ha estado cazando sin "
"incansablemente. Podés superarlo en velocidad pero nunca vas a poder "
"escapar. No va a darse por vencido hasta que muera alguno de los dos."

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/starting_missions.json
msgid "Social butterfly"
msgstr "Persona sociable"

#. ~ Description of mission "Ready or Not"
#: data/json/starting_missions.json
msgid "Survive all day from the crazy inhabitants of the mansion."
msgstr "Sobrevivir todo el día a los locos habitantes de esta mansión."

