"A half-height cloth wall.  Keeps zombies outside the vehicle but allows "
"people to see over it."
msgstr ""
"Es media pared de tela. Mantiene a los zombis afuera del vehículo pero "
"permite que la gente vea por sobre ella."

#. ~ Description of vehicle part "counterweight"
#: data/json/vehicleparts/boards.json
