"A half-height metal wall.  Keeps zombies outside the vehicle but allows "
"people to see over it."
msgstr ""
"Es media pared de metal. Mantiene a los zombis afuera del vehículo pero "
"permite que la gente vea por sobre ella."

#. ~ Description of vehicle part "heavy-duty quarterpanel"
#: data/json/vehicleparts/boards.json
msgid ""
"A half-height strong metal wall.  Keeps zombies outside the vehicle but "
"allows people to see over it."
msgstr ""
"Es media pared fuerte  de metal. Mantiene a los zombis afuera del vehículo "
"pero permite que la gente vea por sobre ella."

#. ~ Description of vehicle part "extra light quarterpanel"
#: data/json/vehicleparts/boards.json
msgid ""
"A half-height thin metal wall.  Keeps zombies outside the vehicle but allows"
