#. ~ Description of vehicle part "foot pedals"
#: data/json/vehicleparts/manual.json
msgid ""
"A set of bicycle-style foot pedals attached to a crank.  If mounted on the "
"same tile as a seat, they allow you to use your stamina to produce engine "
"power, using your legs.  Provides more power the stronger you are."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of vehicle part "reins and tackle"
#: data/json/vehicleparts/manual.json
msgid ""
"A set of leather bindings to control a creature pulling a vehicle, such as a"
" cart."
msgstr ""
"Es un equipo de ataduras de cuero que se usan para controlar una criatura "
"que está tirando de un vehículo como puede ser un carro."

#. ~ Description of vehicle part "hand rims"
#: data/json/vehicleparts/manual.json
msgid ""
"A set of wheelchair-style hoop hand rims, often attached directly to the "
"wheels.  If mounted on the same tile as seat, they allow you to use your "
"stamina to produce engine power, using your arms.  Provides more power the "
"stronger you are."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Vehicle part name
#: data/json/vehicleparts/manual.json
msgid "foot pedals"
msgstr "pedales de pie"

#. ~ Vehicle part name
#: data/json/vehicleparts/manual.json
msgid "hand paddles"
msgstr "paletas de mano"

#. ~ Vehicle part name
#: data/json/vehicleparts/manual.json
msgid "hand rims"
msgstr "aros de ruedas"

#. ~ Vehicle part name
#: data/json/vehicleparts/manual.json
msgid "reins and tackle"
msgstr "riendas y aparejo"

#. ~ Description of vehicle part "inboard mirror"
#: data/json/vehicleparts/mirrors.json
msgid ""
"A small mirror, mounted inside the vehicle.  If you see the mirror, your "
"vision is expanded as though you were standing where the mirror is."
msgstr ""
"Es un pequeño espejo, puesto dentro del vehículo. Si ves el espejo, tu "
"visión estará incrementada como si estuvieras parado donde está el espejo."

#. ~ Description of vehicle part "wing mirror"
#: data/json/vehicleparts/mirrors.json
msgid ""
"A small mirror, mounted outside the vehicle.  If you see the mirror, your "
"vision is expanded as though you were standing where the mirror is."
msgstr ""
"Es un pequeño espejo, puesto fuera del vehículo. Si ves el espejo, tu visión"
" estará incrementada como si estuvieras parado donde está el espejo."

#. ~ Vehicle part name
#: data/json/vehicleparts/mirrors.json
msgid "inboard mirror"
msgstr "espejo retrovisor"

#. ~ Vehicle part name
#: data/json/vehicleparts/mirrors.json
msgid "wing mirror"
msgstr "espejo lateral"

