#. ~ Description of gun "C8 carbine"
#. ~ Description of "C8 carbine"
#: data/mods/classic_zombies/items/guns.json
msgid ""
"A carbine variant of the C7A1, recently introduced by the Canadian armed "
"forces.  Though accurate, small, and lightweight, it is infamous for its "
"unreliability when not properly maintained.  It is chambered in 5.56x45mm "
"and accepts STANAG magazines."
msgstr ""
"Es una carabina variante de la C7A1, recientemente presentado por las "
"fuerzas armadas de Canadá. Aunque es precisa, pequeña y liviana, se la "
"conoce por su falta de fiabilidad si no se la mantiene en buenas "
"condiciones. Tiene calibre 5.56x45mm y puede usar cargadores STANAG."

#. ~ Description of gun "Browning Hi-Power"
#. ~ Description of "Browning Hi-Power"
#: data/mods/classic_zombies/items/guns.json
msgid ""
"A licensed copy of the Browning Hi-Power, made by John Inglis and Company.  "
"Issued to officers and infantry in need of a weapon for confined spaces, "
"this is chambered in 9x19 Parabellum."
msgstr ""
"Es una copia con licencia de la Browning Hi-Power hecha por John Inglis and "
"Company. Usada por oficiales e infantería cuando necesitan un arma en "
"espacios cerrados, tiene calibre 9x19 Parabellum."

#. ~ Description of gun "C9"
#. ~ Description of "C9"
#: data/mods/classic_zombies/items/guns.json
msgid ""
"A mountable machine gun used by Canadian infantry, feeding from a belt or "
"STANAG magazines in a pinch.  Quite inaccurate and difficult to control, the"
" C9 is designed to fire many rounds very quickly."
msgstr ""
"Es una ametralladora montable utilizada por la infantería canadiense, "
"alimentada con una cinta o también pueden usarse cargadores STANAG. Bastante"
" poco precisa y difícil de controlar, la C9 está diseñada para disparar "
"rápidamente muchas balas."

#. ~ Description of variant "M1911A1" of gun "M1911A1"
#. ~ Description of variant "M1911A1" of item "M1911A1"
#: data/mods/classic_zombies/items/guns.json
msgid ""
"An update to the original M1911, featuring an extended tang on the grip "
"safety to prevent hammer bite as well as a shorter trigger for smaller "
"hands."
msgstr ""
"Es una actualización del M1911 original con una espiga extendida en el "
"seguro del mango para prevenir golpes del martillo y también un gatillo más "
"corto para manos pequeñas."

