#. ~ MOD name
#: data/mods/classic_zombies/modinfo.json
msgid "Dark Days of the Dead"
msgstr "Días Oscuros de los Muertos"

#. ~ Description of MOD "Dark Days of the Dead"
#: data/mods/classic_zombies/modinfo.json
msgid ""
"Turns the game into a classic Romero zombie game.  You must destroy the "
"brain.  Getting bitten is fatal.  However, zombies don't evolve, and when "
"they're down, they're down.  Removes the sci-fi and interdimensional aspects"
" of CDDA."
msgstr ""
"Convierte el juego en un clásico juego con zombis de Romero. Tenés que "
"destruirles el cerebro. Si te muerden, es fatal. Sin embargo, los zombis no "
"evolucionan y cuando caen, se quedan ahí. Saca los aspectos de ciencia "
"ficción e interdimensionales de CDDA."

#. ~ Message describing the effect of hitting the "leg_mangled" weakpoint
#: data/mods/classic_zombies/monsters/weakpoints.json
#, c-format
msgid "The %s is knocked down, and doesn't look like it can get back up!"
msgstr "¡El %s es derribado y no parece que pueda volverse a levantar!"

