#. ~ Description of effect type "Necrotic skin"
#: data/mods/deadly_bites/effects.json
msgid ""
"Your skin is pale and covered in gross sores.  It's like your skin is "
"rotting right off your body."
msgstr ""
"Tu piel está pálida y cubierta de unas llagas repugnantes. Es como si tu "
"piel se estuviera pudriendo en tu cuerpo."

#. ~ Description of effect type "Pallor"
#: data/mods/deadly_bites/effects.json
