#. ~ Description of "blacksmith repair kit"
#: data/mods/innawood/items/tool_workshop.json
msgid ""
"This is a set of tools to repair damaged metal tools and armor.  It uses "
"charcoal, contained in a small clay vessel, to heat the part and make it "
"easier to work."
msgstr ""
"Es un conjunto de herramientas para reparar herramientas y armaduras de "
"metal dañadas. Utiliza carbón vegetal, contenido en un pequeño recipiente de"
" arcilla, para calentar la parte y poder trabajarla con mayor facilidad."

