#. ~ Description of profession "Spear Hunter" for female
#: data/mods/innawood/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Ever since you were a child you loved hunting, and quickly developed a "
"talent for chasing down your prey with a spear.  Why, if the world ended, "
"there's nothing you'd want at your side more than your trusty spear.  So, "
"when it did, you made sure to bring it along."
msgstr ""
"Desde que eras chiquita te encantaba cazar y rápidamente desarrollaste "
"talento para perseguir tu presa con una lanza. Por eso, si el mundo "
"terminaba no había otra cosa que quisieras tener con vos más que tu fiel "
"lanza. Así que cuando sucedió, te aseguraste de tenerlo encima."

#. ~ Description of profession "Spear Hunter" for male
#: data/mods/innawood/professions.json
