msgid ""
"Using the earth and organic material to create durable, insulated adobe kept"
" your trade in high demand in your tribe.  Now alone, you only need to look "
"out for yourself."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of profession "Bricklayer" for male
#: data/mods/innawood/professions.json
