#: src/options.cpp:1870
msgid "Use key code input mode"
msgstr "Usar modo de ingreso keycode"

#: src/options.cpp:1871
msgid ""
"Use key code or symbol input on SDL.  Symbol is recommended for non-qwerty "
"layouts since currently the default keybindings for key code mode only "
"supports qwerty.  Key code is currently WIP and bypasses IMEs, caps lock, "
"and num lock."
msgstr ""
"Usar keycode o símbolos en SDL. Se recomienda símbolos para teclados que no "
"sean qwerty ya que los atajos de teclado para keycode solo es para qwerty. "
"Keycode es un WIP actualmente e ignora el método de entrada, el bloq mayús y"
" el bloq num."

#: src/options.cpp:1875
msgid "Key code"
msgstr "Keycode"

#: src/options.cpp:1878
msgid "Use pinyin in search"
msgstr ""

#: src/options.cpp:1879
msgid ""
"If true, pinyin (pronunciation of Chinese characters) can be used in "
"searching/filtering (may cause major slowdown when searching through too "
"many entries.)"
msgstr ""

#: src/options.cpp:1885
msgid "Force capital/modified letters in prompts"
msgstr "Forzar letras mayúsculas/modificadas en preguntas"

#: src/options.cpp:1886
msgid ""
"If true, prompts such as Y/N queries only accepts capital or modified "
"letters, while lower case and unmodified letters only snap the cursor to the"
" corresponding option."
msgstr ""
"Si está activado, las preguntas de S/N solo aceptan letras mayúsculas o "
"modificadas, mientras letras minúsculas o sin modificar solo resaltan la "
"opción correspondiente."

#: src/options.cpp:1891
msgid "Snap to target"
msgstr "Saltar a objetivo"

#: src/options.cpp:1892
msgid "If true, automatically follow the crosshair when firing/throwing."
msgstr ""
"Si está activado, muestra automáticamente la mira cuando disparás o lanzás "
"un objeto."

#: src/options.cpp:1896
msgid "Reaim after firing"
msgstr "Reapuntar después de disparar"

#: src/options.cpp:1897
msgid ""
"If true, after firing automatically aim again if targets are available."
msgstr ""
"Si está activado, después de disparar se vuelve a apuntar automáticamente si"
" hay objetivos disponibles."

