#~ msgid ""
#~ "Before everything went to hell Jay was talking about going to some gun show."
#~ "  There was a guy there who had managed to sneak some Russian gun into the "
#~ "US.  It was a massive deal for Jay, it was all he could talk about.  I know "
#~ "it's a long shot but maybe that guy was already at the gun show?  If you "
#~ "find the gun you can keep it, but it would mean a lot to Jay if he could "
#~ "take a look all he wanted was to pull it apart and put it back together."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Antes de que todo se convierta en un infierno, Jay hablaba de ir a un "
#~ "espectáculo de armas. Había un chabón que había metido algunas armas rusas "
#~ "en Estados Unidos. Era algo muy importante para Jay, solamente hablaba de "
#~ "eso. Sé que no hay muchas chances pero ¿tal vez el tipo ya estaba en el "
#~ "espectáculo? Si encontrás el arma te la podés quedar pero significaría mucho"
#~ " para Jay si solamente la pudiera ver, todo lo que quería era desarmarla y "
#~ "volverla a armar."

#~ msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
#~ msgid ""
#~ "Before the Cataclysm, you used to work for the Paranormal Investigation "
#~ "Department of the FBI.  You got used to jokes at your expense, as well as "
#~ "being constantly underfunded and disregarded by your superiors.  You were "
#~ "returning from yet another case with nothing but a bag of suspicious candies"
#~ " to show, when all hell broke loose.  Oh well, at least now you can be "
#~ "certain that everyone still alive will believe you that the truth is out "
#~ "there."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Antes del Cataclismo, trabajabas en el Departamento de Investigaciones "
#~ "Paranormales del FBI. Te acostumbraste a que se burlaran de vos, y también a"
#~ " estar subfinanciada e ignorada por tus superiores. Estabas volviendo de "
#~ "otro caso con nada más que una bolsa de caramelos sospechosos para mostrar, "
#~ "cuando se desató el infierno. Bueno, por lo menos ahora estás segura que "
#~ "todos los que sigan vivos van a creer que la verdad está ahí."

