#~ "You got this chunk of meat from the throat of the animal; it looks "
#~ "different?"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Sacaste este pedazo de carne de la garganta de un animal. ¿Parece distinto?"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "You grab the belt and it uncoils to become a flexible metal whip in your "
