#~ msgid ""
#~ "Your eyes struggle to open, and your muscles ache like you didn't sleep at "
#~ "all."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "A tus ojos les cuesta abrirse, y tus músculos te duelen como si no hubieras "
#~ "dormido nada."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Your face and jaws are a shorter version of those found on alligators.  They"
